window.AKK_TRANSMIGRATED_AS_THE_MALE_LEADS_VEGETATIVE_SISTER_IN_A_GAME_NOVEL_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_TRANSMIGRATED_AS_THE_MALE_LEADS_VEGETATIVE_SISTER_IN_A_GAME_NOVEL_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201: Everyone Works Together to Build Thorn City","paragraphs":["“Oh? Another one from Linjiang City?” the head of the Analysis Bureau asked in surprise.","The analyst was now in an awkward position. He said, “Not only is she from Linjiang City, she’s also a member of the Thorn Guild! She’s a relative of Rocket on a Wheelchair.”","The entire room fell silent once again.","Even the head of the Analysis Bureau was speechless.","As expected, great strength never came without a reason.","The relatives of powerful people were all powerful themselves.","Had the game already developed prestigious clans and powerful families so quickly?","...","Meanwhile.","The battle to defend Guguan Town had ended. The players from the Thorn Guild and Thorn Town all used Return Scrolls.","Feng Huimin issued an order.","All members of the Thorn Guild were required to hand over their Contribution Tokens.","“A small amount of contribution points can’t be exchanged for anything worthwhile. This time, by participating in a Primordial-level dungeon, we gained an additional 10 points to all attributes.","“There will be many more opportunities in the future!","“However, every low-level player in Thorn Town reached Level 20 today. This means that at midnight tomorrow, at least sixty thousand new players will apply to enter Thorn Town.","“Thorn Town is already operating beyond capacity, so recovering contribution points and purchasing Town Upgrade Blueprints to advance Thorn Town is our top priority.","“All guild members are requested to cooperate fully. Contributions for defending the town will be collected in the form of Guild Contribution Points.”","How could the members of the Thorn Guild refuse to cooperate?","They all began handing over their contributions.","Even players who could exchange them for attribute points chose not to do so. They were afraid that if someone reported them for acting selfishly, they would no longer be able to get along in the Thorn Guild.","As long as they stayed here, wouldn’t they have all the attribute points they needed in the future?","Moreover, after all the guild members submitted their contribution points, the other residents of Thorn Town also heard the news and came rushing over.","“If the Town Lord hadn’t brought me along, I could never have reached Level 20 in a single day and caught up with the second tier. I saved at least twenty days. I’m handing over these contribution points. I don’t need any money for them!”","“That’s right! We have no use for these contribution points anyway. Besides, we even got a Dark Gold-grade piece of equipment, which is worth far more than these lousy contribution points. Let me see who dares to be an ungrateful ingrate. Everyone, hand over your contribution points!”","“Lin Haowan, you’re not planning to keep all the contribution points for yourself, are you? The Town Lord even gave you benefits and let you guard a section of the walls. You can’t have your cake and eat it too!”","Lin Haowan jumped up angrily. “Do I look like that kind of person? I’ll have the guild members deliver all the contribution points to the entrance of the Thorn Guild right now!”","Countless players swarmed toward the entrance of the Thorn Guild and threw their Contribution Token plaques inside.","Feng Huimin watched the scene with satisfaction.","Capitalists had to stir people up in order to maximize their profits.","As the boss’s loyal lackey, she had to ensure that her boss gained the greatest possible benefit. Only then could she demonstrate her own value.","Of course, this was also because the boss possessed great prestige.","Even Chu Fu hadn’t expected Feng Huimin’s maneuver to be so terrifying.","Since they had attacked the Primordial-level dungeon from four different directions this time, Chu Fu hadn’t taken the contribution points from the players guarding the other walls.","There were roughly 1.8 billion contribution points on a single wall.","Now, however, everyone’s contributions combined amounted to a full 3.8 billion.","Not only had they failed to lose any, they had even gained an additional 200 million contribution points. It was highly suspicious that some unaffiliated players had secretly gone to seize the contribution points from the wall guarded by the War Spirit Guild.","Well, actually, she had also expanded the range of her attacks and secretly taken 100 million contribution points from the War Spirit Guild’s side. Otherwise, first place would not have belonged to her.","Just as Chu Fu was thinking about this, a large contribution appeared in the guild records.","[Guild Record: Who Are You Calling Blind submitted 120 million Contribution Tokens.]","[Guild Record: Rocket on a Wheelchair submitted 90 million Contribution Tokens.]","[Guild Record: Suture Saint submitted 70 million Contribution Tokens.]","[Guild Record: Shafu Liangu...]","Chu Fu was stunned.","“Why did you submit your contribution points too? Aren’t you going to use them to improve yourselves?”","Xie Lin said, “Isn’t this only natural? This was a guild event. Since everyone else is submitting their contributions, the senior members should submit theirs as well. Otherwise, wouldn’t that make us guilty of lining our own pockets?”","Shen Chi nodded too. “Actually, if you hadn’t issued the mission, we wouldn’t have been able to participate in the battle to defend Guguan Town. We’ve already absorbed the divine power, so we don’t need to exchange these contribution points this time. It’s better to submit them to the guild. Besides, the contribution points haven’t disappeared. They’ve simply become Guild Contribution Points. Everyone knows how valuable our guild’s contribution points are now.”","Feng Huimin pushed up her glasses and said, “Boss, don’t feel that this harms the team’s interests. This is simply a matter of unclear responsibility and ownership.","“This situation often appears in small and medium-sized enterprises, especially those founded by families or groups of friends.","“We can carry out an equity swap so that Thorn Town and the Thorn Guild become bound together again.”","Under Feng Huimin’s detailed professional analysis and manipulation, Chu Fu gave up 5% of Thorn Town’s shares in exchange for 20% of the Thorn Guild’s shares.","Jiao Jiao reduced her holdings the most, leaving her with only 10% of the guild. In exchange, however, she received 2% of Thorn Town.","The others also reduced their holdings to varying degrees, but all received at least 0.5% of the town’s shares.","This included Feng Huimin.","Feng Huimin had officially joined the ranks of the shareholders.","Her talent and class continued to grow, earning everyone’s recognition.","More importantly, her abilities were the most frightening part.","With only a little maneuvering, she could have a tremendous impact on the entire guild.","Chu Fu recognized her abilities and had never been stingy when it came to rewarding her.","Thus, Feng Huimin obtained 0.5% of the Thorn Guild and 0.5% of Thorn Town.","The guild now had six shareholders in total.","Afterward, Feng Huimin consolidated all the contribution points and gathered a total of 5.8 billion.","Aside from the fourteen Town Upgrade Blueprints exchanged by Chu Fu’s fixed team, she found trusted members of the guild to exchange for the remaining blueprints.","Chu Fu then issued a new mission in her capacity as Town Lord.","[Mission: United as One, Build Our Home!","Submit Town Upgrade Blueprints to build a new home and receive a generous gold reward!]","The system approved the mission.","Thus, fifty-eight Town Upgrade Blueprints were submitted. The gold coins distributed as rewards were then collected back.","A perfect closed loop.","With the blueprints in Chu Fu’s possession included, there were fifty-nine in total, and Thorn Town instantly tripled in size.","The next moment, it became a town measuring 8,000 by 8,000 meters.","It was only a tiny step away from becoming Thorn City.","Afterward, the Thorn Guild issued a large number of construction missions, keeping the plot-focused players and life-class players busy as well.","Just as Chu Fu was dealing with these matters, Li Weizheng’s communication device rang.","He was clearly a little troubled, but he still spoke up.","“Erm, Classmate Chu, the higher-ups have sent down some instructions. They’d like to borrow a batch of Dark Gold-grade equipment from you.”","Li Weizheng knew all too well how valuable this equipment was, and he found it rather difficult to bring up the request.","However, when Li Weizheng said this, Chu Fu narrowed her eyes, and a sly curve appeared at the corners of her lips.","They needed something from her?","That was wonderful!","She had just been wondering how to ask for ownership rights to land in the real world!"]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202: One Poison Person, One Gold Person, So What Kind of Person Am I","paragraphs":["Li Weizheng explained the situation they had analyzed, hoping to borrow a batch of Dark Gold–tier equipment and use a region about to face a town-defense battle as a test site.","That meant they needed seventeen thousand sets of Dark Gold–tier equipment.","Chu Fu did a rough calculation. The outskirts of Goblin City held ten thousand goblins, while another twenty thousand lived inside the city, producing thirty thousand sets of Dark Gold Goblin equipment in total.","During the first wave, the Thorn Guild had received fifteen thousand sets of equipment. During the second wave, it had received another twenty-two thousand.","The guild had since recruited another five thousand people, bringing its total membership to fifteen thousand.","That left twenty-two thousand surplus sets—so it really could lend them to Li Weizheng.","She said, “The higher-ups’ plan is sound, but Dark Gold–tier equipment is simply too expensive.”","Dark Gold–tier equipment was currently considered endgame gear for levels twenty to thirty, with each piece costing roughly five hundred to eight hundred gold coins.","And Li Weizheng had said “sets,” not “pieces.”","A set required at least eight pieces. Add the four accessories, not to mention the weapon—","Even calculating conservatively, with ten pieces per set, the total would come to eighty-five million gold coins.","Chu Fu had only charged Li Weizheng ten thousand gold coins for ownership of the Origin-tier dungeon.","Even then, Li Weizheng had to desperately make up the difference with real-world supplies.","As for supplies worth eighty-five million gold coins, Li Weizheng felt that would amount to nothing more than a bounced check. He was too embarrassed to even bring it up.","But then Chu Fu changed her tone.","“Still, I’m willing to support the country’s project. Consider it an investment. Once you take the Origin-tier dungeon, I want fifty percent of the profits from the Dark Gold equipment we lend you. That includes Diamond-tier equipment and materials—we get first priority to purchase them.","“We can provide twenty-two thousand sets of equipment.”","Li Weizheng was overjoyed.","“No problem! We can negotiate all of that. Absolutely no problem!”","“Good. I don’t really understand the details of profit-sharing, so I’ll have my secretary negotiate with you. I still have other things to take care of.”","“Of course, no problem.”","Li Weizheng hurriedly agreed.","Chu Fu ended the call and immediately contacted Feng Huimin.","“You go negotiate with them. The cooperation is only one part of it—while you’re there, ask for the land around Wangxi Manor. Ask for as much as possible.”","“Leave it to me, Boss.”","Feng Huimin immediately set off.","After half a day of negotiations, Feng Huimin quickly reached an agreement with Li Weizheng.","The Thorn Guild would provide twenty-two thousand sets of Dark Gold equipment, while the authorities would provide another three thousand sets, forming a dedicated force to conquer the Origin-tier dungeon.","After the dungeon was successfully conquered, the Thorn Guild would receive a share of the Diamond-tier materials and Dark Gold equipment.","Its share would be sixty-five percent.","The partnership would last four months. After that, they would decide whether to continue based on the circumstances.","After all, by then, the country might possess far more Dark Gold equipment and could potentially kick the Thorn Guild out.","However, with the snowball effect of accumulating resources, those twenty-two thousand sets of Dark Gold equipment might turn into who knew how many individual pieces.","Naturally, as Dark Gold equipment became more widespread, its value would fall. The Thorn Guild was taking on a considerable risk.","That was why the Thorn Guild demanded development rights to the Wangxi Scenic Area.","And it was not merely the land around Wangxi Manor.","It was the entire Wangxi Scenic Area, a suburban district occupying five percent of Linjiang City’s total area.","Even the mountains behind it were sold to the Thorn Guild.","The two sides signed an extremely formal contract.","The Wangxi Scenic Area now belonged entirely to the Thorn Guild. It could even be established as an independent development zone with its own official departments.","That point was crucial.","Only a clearly documented land transaction with the authorities could establish ownership at the instant the game invaded reality. Otherwise, they would possess only residential or usage rights—not actual ownership.","What Chu Fu wanted was a clear record of the transaction.","That was the only way to secure ownership.","Moreover, completing the transaction in advance allowed them to make use of the nation’s resources. Large quantities of construction materials did not need to be transported by Chu Fu herself.","The country would handle everything.","“Boss, I also got a group of Earth- and Metal-element players to help us build Thorn Town. They’re all from the Civil Engineering Bureau, so they work much faster. They’ll have it finished in a little over ten days!”","“Well done.”","Chu Fu praised her.","She left the matter with Li Weizheng to Feng Huimin, and handed the spoils from the town-defense battle over to her subordinates as well.","Chu Fu planned to focus seriously on raising her own level.","The dungeon progress she had neglected for a while also needed to be resumed.","There was still one final level-thirty-to-thirty-five dungeon in Linjiang Town that she had yet to clear: Destroy the Undead Calamity.","She had yet to claim the reward from the speed-clear rankings, too!","The bosses outside had long since been holding bags of gold, waiting for Chu Fu to lead her team in and do them the honor of a visit.","However, Chu Fu still chose to add a newcomer to her party.","That person was Dogging Around.","After his talent evolved, it became somewhat similar to Chu Feng’s talent and showed tremendous potential.","She would bring him along and nurture him a little.","Everyone used Return Scrolls together and went back to Linjiang City.","Shen Chi’s body suddenly shifted and transformed into a gigantic mecha.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","“Whoa! Wheelchair, did you fuse the mecha into your body?” Jiao Jiao Isn’t Spoiled exclaimed.","The head of Shen Chi’s mecha gave a slight nod, and his voice came through the speakers.","“That’s right. After the fusion, I gained one thousand points each in Constitution, Strength, and Agility. My defensive and offensive power also increased considerably.”","“That’s way too powerful! Your increase is much faster than mine. I’ve swallowed so much poisonous mist—even drank ten thousand bottles of rat poison—and only gained one hundred points in Constitution and Spirit.”","Chu Fu was speechless too.","Still, as long as one possessed a Limit-Breaking skill, future improvements would become much easier.","At least for now, Chu Fu was using resources from reality.","If the resources in reality ever ran out, she would have to start using resources from the game.","For example, she could use the first trait of Poison Person to control spirit rice, transform it all into poisonous rice, and then consume it.","That was the easiest method she could think of.","However, wasting real-world resources would be foolish. She would use them to improve herself first, then rely on in-game resources afterward.","She had to build a solid foundation.","Shen Chi comforted her. “Plant Girl, your method provides a steady, long-term increase. Mine is just a one-time boost. If I want to improve further, I’ll need to advance my mecha to the Epic tier. That’s far too difficult.”","Suture Saint said, “All right, all of you have ways to increase your attributes. That’s already an incredible advantage.","“But Plant Girl’s method really is terrifying. I heard someone merely walked past the laboratory building and was poisoned. It even made the news!”","Chu Fu was speechless.","“How did something like that make the news?”","“There was nothing anyone could do. You’re a celebrity-level player now. But seriously, with this Poison Person ability of yours, does that mean your blood and saliva are poisonous too?”","Chu Fu nodded.","That was indeed the case!","At the very least, anyone who dared hurt even a single hair on her head would be killed by the poisonous gas spraying from her pores.","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Spoiled burst out laughing.","“Then wouldn’t you poison anyone you kissed?”","Chu Fu had genuinely never considered that possibility.","Just then, a buzzing metallic voice came through the speakers.","“Metal Person isn’t afraid!”","“Pfft!”","Chu Fu burst out laughing. What a painfully cold joke.","Xie Lin rolled his eyes so far upward they nearly disappeared. If Shen Chi had been there, he would definitely have killed him with a glare.","“You’re the Poison Person, and you’re the Metal Person, so what does that make me?”","“Ah! So I’m the Sword Person!”"]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203: Weaken the Evil God's Power, Prepare to Declare War on the Holy Wolf Club","paragraphs":["Xie Lin’s antics immediately sent everyone inside the mech into a fit of laughter.","In this cheerful atmosphere, they soon arrived at the entrance to the “Destroy the Undead Calamity” dungeon.","“Destroy the Undead Calamity” was the last dungeon in Linjiang City. Unlike the other dungeons, its monsters did not simply wait around for players to defeat them.","Instead, they surged toward the players’ location like an army laying siege to a city, forming a tide of undead.","As long as the players held out against every monster, they could clear the dungeon.","They could also push forward against the tide, farming monsters along the way until they reached the BOSS’s location, then kill the BOSS and destroy the magic formation ahead of schedule, bringing the dungeon to an end.","That was clearly the method Chu Feng had used back then.","As a result, the dungeon’s record was absolutely ridiculous.","Clear time: 8 minutes and 21 seconds.","At present, even the top players gathered together had no way to clear it.","So quite a few people secretly cursed Thorns for leaving no chance for those who came after.","Chu Feng, however, did not care in the slightest.","By the time Chu Fu and the others arrived, the entrance to the dungeon was already bustling.","Nowadays, players above Level 30 were unquestionably considered top-tier players in the game, and there were quite a few of them gathered outside the dungeon.","“Looking for three AoE mages for Undead Calamity. No assassins or rogues.”","“Kindly declining single-target classes. Holy-light mages get a 5% team subsidy.”","“Assassins and rogues, form your own group—++++.”","Hearing the shouts around them, Dog Sneaky, who played a rogue, immediately felt awkward.","Was the rogue class really this unpopular?","Still, the arrival of the mech attracted the attention of the surrounding players.","“Are those people from the Thorns Guild?”","“Why are they only coming here now? Haven’t they all been Level 30 for days?”","“I heard they were cashing out.”","“They’ve been cashing out for this many days?”","“Your cash-out isn’t the same as her cash-out!”","The time it took other people to cash out was nowhere near as long as Chu Fu’s.","Just then, a player ran over.","Chu Fu initially thought it was one of the clients waiting there, but it turned out to be an ordinary passerby.","“Plant Boss, could I ask you for a favor? I didn’t put on the Masquerader’s Mask on purpose before, but Werewolf Tuge keeps issuing missions that are impossible to complete. If I fail them, he deducts my experience. I really don’t want to stay in the Evil Faction anymore.”","Werewolf Tuge’s missions were practically against human nature.","They involved anything from massacring villages to assassinating NPCs.","Basically, the worse the deed, the better.","This player was quite capable. He had just received a mission to assassinate WhoWantsToBeAVegetable.","What could he possibly use to complete it?","Killing him directly would be easier.","Fortunately, Plant Boss had a way to remove the Masquerader’s Mask, so he wanted to give it a try.","Naturally, Chu Fu did not refuse.","The more Evil God divine-power material she obtained, the more golden-grade accessories she could help the guild’s players create.","Moreover, she had a theory.","The Evil Gods acquired energy through these masks. Wearing a mask and slaughtering NPCs was equivalent to obtaining divine power.","If the masks were removed and the divine power seized, the Evil Gods would grow weaker and weaker.","Of course, this only applied to the Evil God in the Linjiang City area. In overseas regions, Evil Faction players from various countries had already reached nearly one-third the number of ordinary players.","While the players in Flowerland were still holding back the beast tide, those overseas had already begun fighting among themselves. Every day was filled with player-versus-player battles.","And they actually thought it was fun.","Because after dying, their beastified attributes were not weakened, allowing them to continuously improve their accounts’ strength through this method.","What difference was there between that and having no death penalty?","As a result, large numbers of overseas players joined the Evil Faction, while ordinary players found it increasingly difficult to survive.","Chu Fu could not control what happened overseas.","But she could certainly manage her own territory.","“No problem, Wheelchair Brother, come over here! The range of my skill is huge, so I’m worried about accidentally hitting someone else!”","She then looked toward Feng Huimin, who was busy dealing with matters within the team.","Feng Huimin had a lot on her plate, but Chu Fu still brought her along for dungeon runs. She did not need to take action and only had to stay nearby.","“Manager Feng, put out an announcement later. Any Evil Faction player who wants to abandon darkness and turn to the light can come to me to have their Masquerader’s Mask removed.","“We’ll gather at the east gate of Linjiang City at noon every day. Let’s use a registration system. If there aren’t many people, we can wait a few more days and remove the masks all at once.","“If any player above Level 30 can’t make it through the game to Linjiang City, they can come to Linjiang City in the real world to have their Masquerader’s Mask removed.”","Feng Huimin’s brows drew together slightly before she said, “Boss, if we do this, we might offend those overseas forces. For example, the Holy Wolf Club from last time.”","“Who the hell are we afraid of?” Xie Lin cut in. “Last time, we let them off because none of us had cashed out yet. If they dare come this time, I’ll pound them into cookies!”","That was true.","It was not just Chu Fu and the others who were unafraid. The entire Thorns Guild was no longer afraid either.","The Origin-level dungeon did not have the game’s experience-reduction rule, and its rewards were plentiful.","Clearing two Origin-level dungeons granted an additional level of experience, allowing the guild’s leading experts to reach Level 30.","Across the entire guild, a craze for completing Master-level quests had erupted.","And that was not all. There were also powerful solo players among the unaffiliated players, not to mention those from the Military Soul Guild.","In fact, Linjiang City—with a population of only five million—already had more Level 30 players than the combined total across all six servers in Dragon Capital, which had a population of thirty million.","If players from the Holy Wolf Group came over, they would die one after another.","“We really aren’t afraid, but Manager Feng’s concerns aren’t unfounded either. I’m no longer acting alone. I represent the entire Thorns Guild, so let’s put it to a shareholder vote!” Chu Fu said. “Should we openly challenge the Holy Wolf Club?","“They’ve issued assassination missions against me several times. I don’t want to let them keep doing whatever they please.”","Feng Huimin gave a helpless smile. “Boss, what are you talking about? You currently hold an absolute 50% controlling stake. You only need to tell us what you want to do.","“I’m just thinking like a merchant. From a business perspective, this doesn’t seem worthwhile.”","Merchants fought to the death behind closed doors, while maintaining friendly relations on the surface.","Merchants pursued profit.","From Feng Huimin’s point of view, since the Holy Wolf Group had retreated last time, it would be better for everyone to remain at peace.","In truth, she was still somewhat in denial.","She had not yet adjusted from the peaceful era to an age where the game had descended upon reality and players had become like gods.","Her strength had risen too quickly, and most of her combat power was support-oriented. She had yet to develop the mindset of a true powerhouse.","She did not understand where Chu Fu got the confidence to openly challenge them.","“Knock down one fist to prevent a hundred more,” Jiaojiao Not Spoiled said from the side. “I support Plant Girl too!”","The major shareholder and the second-largest shareholder had both spoken, so Feng Huimin could only nod.","However, she did not rush to publish the announcement. Instead, she had her secretary team decide how the announcement should be worded.","After all, this was a major matter.","Meanwhile, Shen Chi had already torn the Masquerader’s Mask off the player, obtaining a piece of golden-grade Evil God divine-power material. The material was now powerful enough to strengthen Level 30 equipment.","Excellent. Another batch of Level 30 golden accessories was waiting for the Thorns Guild.","Once Shen Chi finished dealing with that player, several clients who wanted to join the speed-clear run also arrived.","The price for being carried through the dungeon had risen as well: 5,000 gold coins per person.","One point of all attributes was worth 100 gold coins—nearly the same price as a BOSS from a town-defense battle."]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204: Flower-Planter Station, Linjiang City Makes Prisoners Do Labor Reform in a Video Game","paragraphs":["Chu Fu led her people into the dungeon.","The moment they appeared, an overwhelming army of undead descended upon them from the distance.","[System Notice: Attention! The undead army is attacking! Protect Linjiang City from assault!]","[System Notice: Retreat to the vicinity of Linjiang City’s teleportation array to leave the dungeon. A teleportation fee of 1 gold coin will be deducted.]","The exit for this dungeon was not located in the wilderness but in Linjiang City. This meant that if a player failed to reach Linjiang City, they would be unable to leave the dungeon.","They could only wait to die.","If no one survived inside the dungeon, the entire party would be wiped out there.","However, there were an enormous number of monsters in the “Destroy the Undead Calamity” dungeon.","Many players would voluntarily retreat to Linjiang City and use the city’s arrow towers and archers to clear out the monsters.","If they could not fight them, they could simply return to the teleportation array and spend 1 gold coin to leave the dungeon. For Level 30 players, that was no longer a significant expense.","[Charge Horn] [One Heart, One Legion]","Feng Huimin continuously applied buffs to everyone.","Their movement speed skyrocketed.","The effect was particularly noticeable among the few wealthy players, who felt as if they were about to take flight.","It was easy to imagine how high the Thorn Guild players’ attributes were.","Not only did they dare to clash head-on with the undead army, but they also showed no fear when facing that massive force. The others had already wanted to retreat, and although they slowed down within the formation, someone forcibly dragged them along.","Chu Fu canceled the legion buff and flew out alone. The Poison God’s Wings resembled an agricultural drone spraying pesticides as it scattered poisonous mist below.","She waved the staff in her hand, unleashing calamity skills.","Terrifying undead soldiers fell one after another. All the others had to do was follow Chu Fu.","Soon, they arrived at the BOSS area.","Five Lich Kings had formed a formation resembling a pentagram. At each point of the star stood a gigantic tomb.","Inside each tomb was a massive coffin covered in black energy. Countless monsters crawled out of the coffins, making the place look like a mass grave for ten thousand people.","Chu Fu summoned the Gatling Corn Sprites, but did not order the sprites to attack.","The dungeon timer reached 8 minutes and 14 seconds... 15 seconds... 16 seconds...","“Attack!”","Leaving five seconds on the clock was a show of confidence in the party’s damage output.","Everyone’s attacks landed on the Lich Kings.","Boom!","The five Lich Kings died simultaneously.","[You have cleared the dungeon: Destroy the Undead Calamity (Hard).]","[Dungeon completion time: 8 minutes 19 seconds.]","[Your party has taken first place on the speed-clear rankings. You have received +5 to all attributes and a Golden Chest.]","Everything went smoothly.","The dungeon also dropped Golden-tier equipment, whose attributes were better than those of Level 20 Dark Gold equipment. Everyone bid on whatever they could, then immediately began the next run.","Half an hour later.","All the dungeons had been cleared.","...","At the same time, the secretary team under Feng Huimin submitted a proposal. After Chu Fu reviewed and approved it, they published an announcement.","The official accounts of the Thorn Guild on various platforms, as well as the “Gate of Origin” forum, released statements one after another.","[The Thorn Guild will help players who accidentally joined the evil faction remove their faction bindings free of charge!]","The announcement caused an uproar as soon as it was posted.","The number of comments surged.","“When I was young, I didn’t know any better. Now I just want to be a good person.”","“I used to think the Golden Mask was great, but the quests kept getting harder. Every time I went to complete one, a group of people would kill me. After killing me, I’d still have to find someone to rescue me. I practically lost my pants over it.”","“You’re lucky someone rescued you. I had to remake my account several times, and I still couldn’t take off the mask. My talent level dropped by several grades.”","“There are really that many players who joined the evil faction? Luckily, I started playing late. I saw the guides and knew to fight the werewolves.”","“Do we have to go to the city? I’m only Level 16!”","“Can this event only be held in Linjiang City? Haven’t the teleportation arrays between cities been activated yet?”","“The Level 30–40 maps now have teleportation arrays. You can go to the Linjiang City sanctuary.”","“Thanks for the tip, expert!”","Feng Huimin’s announcement specified several locations.","In-game locations: east of Linjiang City and the sanctuary in Linjiang City’s Level 30–40 map.","Real-world location: Origin University in Linjiang City.","The registration link was instantly overwhelmed.","After all, there were 1,000 servers and 58 regions had already been opened. Countless players had been unable to defeat Werewolf Tuge. Some players who never read the forums had accidentally joined the evil faction and regretted it deeply.","As players grew stronger, the attributes provided by the Golden Mask became less and less appealing, while the mask itself had become a major nuisance.","They all wanted to get rid of it.","After the Thorn Guild made its announcement, it was practically acting like a saint.","...","Within the Flower Nation’s Analysis Bureau.","Not long after the Thorn Guild released its announcement, the Analysis Bureau also took action.","“Director, the analysis report on Werewolf Tuge is here as well. Overseas countries have been thrown into complete chaos.”","The report showed that the disruption was not limited to the game. In the real world, large numbers of players had also joined in the destruction.","This period coincided with the crucial stage when Level 30 players were beginning to cash out, and crime rates in overseas countries had soared by 1,400 percent.","Although the situation was not as severe domestically, it still had to be taken seriously.","More importantly, Werewolf Tuge was currently the only revealed divine envoy of an evil god, and was connected to the clues surrounding the “Gate of Origin.”","“Publish an announcement. All agents of evil gods are prohibited from operating within the Flower Nation!”","“Yes, sir!”","And so, right after the Thorn Guild released its quest—","the official authorities of the Flower Nation also issued a notice.","[Official Notice: Western forces are strictly forbidden from taking advantage of the chaos to incite internal conflict. Effective immediately, all evil-faction players will be purged. All players must register under official supervision and leave the evil faction.]","This was tantamount to the authorities publicly backing Chu Fu.","Afterward, Linjiang City and the official organization Military Soul also released an announcement.","[The early game is your chance to obtain the Golden Mask! Join Military Soul Town and help defeat Werewolf Tuge. Players with talents of Grade B or higher will receive free assistance in killing 100 targets and obtaining the Mask of the Impostor.]","This was clearly a recruitment message.","Thorn Town was already extraordinarily famous. Huge numbers of players flooded into it, and it was packed to capacity every time!","The Military Soul Guild had also built a town capable of accommodating 20,000 players for leveling. However, many players would rather go to newly opened areas—for the all-attribute rewards from defending villages and towns—or to Thorn Town than come to Military Soul Town.","Moreover, the people of the Flower Nation felt not only respect but also a certain dread toward military organizations.","Who wanted to be managed under a military system?","But the promise of a Golden Mask right at the start was enough to tempt some players.","...","Inside Linjiang City Women’s Prison.","Prison guards distributed gaming helmets.","“You were the best-behaved inmates in this group, so you have a chance to reduce your sentences. These gaming helmets were provided by the authorities.”","“From now on, you won’t be working the sewing machines. You’ll be serving your sentences inside the game.”","A middle-aged woman hesitated.","“Officer Wang, I don’t know how to play games! I’m already in my fifties.”","Officer Wang said coldly, “You don’t need to know how to play. Create an account within five minutes. Your account name must be your real name followed by your assigned number. Use the quick-selection options for everything else, then enter the game. We’ll meet you at the starting point. Once you’re there, simply follow orders.”","Some of them were still completely bewildered.","Some people, however, felt that their opportunity had arrived.","Sun Jingya gripped the helmet excitedly, thinking about the recent news and the messages her parents had sent her.","Only by acknowledging the game and accepting it as real could she awaken an ultra-high-level talent.","She wanted to get out of prison. She wanted to leave this place. She didn’t want to spend the rest of her life behind bars!"]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205: The Correct Way to Use Criminals, Death's Envoy","paragraphs":["Before long, she entered the game.","When it came time to choose a name, she hesitated for a moment, but ultimately followed the instructions and entered Sun Jingya014729.","She then began awakening her talent.","Perhaps her conviction really was that strong. To her surprise, she awakened an S-rank talent: The Culprit.","Any damage she dealt while driving machinery, riding mounts, and the like would be increased by 200%, and her mount would also help absorb damage for her.","She had even awakened a hidden class: Dark Knight.","Her excited expression twisted with delight.","In prison, a significant meritorious act could earn a reduced sentence. Now that she was so powerful, surely she would receive special treatment!","She really was heaven’s favored daughter. Even after making a wrong turn in life, Heaven still took pity on her and helped her through the crisis.","With that thought in mind, she entered the game.","This truly was a miraculous world. If not for the environment around her changing, she would never have realized that she was inside a game.","Sun Jingya had originally assumed that they had been brought here to fight monsters and collect copper coins for the authorities.","But once everyone had taken their positions, a player unleashed a skill and killed them all.","Sun Jingya was utterly stunned.","Even though she knew what was happening outside, she had no idea about the detailed strategies involving the Impostor’s Mask.","Still, she certainly had no desire to die.","Fortunately, Sun Jingya was revived moments later.","The Junhun Guild had spent a fortune purchasing a resurrection spell.","The moment she came back to life, Sun Jingya shouted, “Officer Wang, I have something to say! I awakened an S-rank talent and changed to a hidden class. My talent is incredibly powerful, and I used to play games all the time. I can earn money for the authorities! Can’t you stop sending me out to die?”","Officer Wang gave her a long, cold look. “Sun Jingya, you refuse to obey your superiors and have a terrible attitude. Do you still want your sentence reduced?”","Sun Jingya froze. She had thought that revealing her S-rank talent and hidden class would make them value her, but instead, she had only drawn an even harsher reprimand.","Officer Wang said, “Do what you’re told. You’re a major criminal, sentenced to life imprisonment. The law has deprived you of your personal freedom for the rest of your life. If you don’t want to stay in the game, delete your character and go back to operating a sewing machine.”","Naturally, Sun Jingya had no intention of returning to the sewing machine.","She could only lower her head, hiding the fury and resentment in her heart.","And so, the prisoners continued to be killed and revived, over and over again.","Even so, she secretly made small moves whenever she got the chance.","Whenever she was still alive, she would quickly browse the official website, searching for traces of the Four Major Corporations. If she could find even one acquaintance to help her, that would be enough.","Sun Jingya’s plan was simple: spend money and pull strings to get herself transferred to the monster-fighting group. After all, her family was wealthy.","Unexpectedly, the information she found made her go cold all over.","Two months after the game began, the butler had been arrested by the authorities, Old Master Wan had suffered brain death, Wan Huanyu had disappeared, and the Sun family had gone bankrupt.","Only her family had escaped notice because they had always kept a low profile and left no evidence behind.","And all of this had happened because of one person.","Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?","Chu Fu!","The daughter of the couple she had run over and killed!","Sun Jingya thought viciously, Why hadn’t I killed Chu Fu too back then? Now she’s gotten her revenge.","She was unwilling to accept this!","What drove her even crazier was that after dying ten times, her talent had dropped from S-rank to A-rank!","Her talent had degraded!","That was something she could not tolerate.","“I quit! You can’t treat us like this! Reality is going to be invaded by the game, and we need our talents to survive! We may be criminals, but we still have human rights! You can’t deprive us of our right to live!”","Sun Jingya shouted loudly.","But the next moment, Officer Wang killed her.","She heard Officer Wang bark, “Log out! Put her in solitary confinement!”","Sun Jingya had no desire to be locked in solitary confinement either. She had only been trying to fight for her rights. She thought furiously that there was surely no law in the Flower Kingdom requiring prisoners to cooperate in their own deaths inside a game.","She would definitely have a lawyer sue these prison officers.","But if she logged out, her character would die, and her talent would drop from A-rank to B-rank.","If she stayed online, however, she would keep dying and continue losing ranks.","Just as Sun Jingya was wavering, she suddenly saw a figure drifting over beside her.","It was a semitransparent soul dressed in a black robe, a scythe in its hand—the image of the Grim Reaper as imagined by humanity.","Undead Apostle Vale!","“Esteemed awakened one, I can smell the darkness within you. Perhaps you can join the army of the undead and become one of the servants beneath the God of the Undead.","“Look at these humans. They’re abusing you. Do you want revenge? Do you want to avenge yourself?","“Do you want to crush beneath your feet all those who have harmed you?","“As long as you join the army of the undead, every death you suffer will increase your undead power.","“Death is not the end. It is the beginning.”","Sun Jingya was stunned, then clicked to join in a frenzy of delight.","“Your current situation isn’t looking good, but don’t be afraid. The army of the undead will invade reality in one year. You will become the strongest Dark Knight among the undead!”","“Absorb the power of death to your heart’s content!”","The shadow vanished.","The system also issued a notification.","[System Notification: You have awakened a second talent: Return of the Dead (S)]","Within her gray-and-white field of vision, Sun Jingya saw her S-rank talent.","The more times she died, the stronger her dark attack power became.","This was practically an overpowered ability.","It had been tailor-made for her current situation.","She hurriedly typed a message and sent it to the nearby channel.","“Officer Wang, I was wrong. I don’t want to go to solitary confinement. I agree to the organization’s arrangements.”","Only then did Officer Wang order someone to revive Sun Jingya, after which she continued with the mission.","Their goal was to use this method to cultivate large numbers of players possessing the Impostor’s Mask.","According to the information sent over by the Flower Kingdom’s Analysis Bureau, killing Werewolf Tuge continuously weakened the divine power of Werewolf Tuge and the Beast God.","They were testing the limits of a god’s endurance—to see whether this method could be used to kill a god.","Besides, equipment of the mask variety was extremely rare. Every additional mask meant greater strength.","What they did not realize was that, while plundering the Beast God’s power, humanity was also heading toward another extreme.","They were nourishing the divine power of the God of the Undead.","...","Inside the game.","Chu Fu had also witnessed the Junhun Guild’s outrageous strategy.","They were using the deaths of criminals’ characters to obtain Impostor’s Masks for new players.","They truly were making use of every available resource.","But if they were criminals...","Did that mean Sun Jingya had also logged into the game?","If Chu Fu remembered correctly, Sun Jingya had awakened an S-rank talent and her class was Dark Knight.","What were Wan Huanyu and Guan Youlong compared to her?","The greatest villain in this story was actually Sun Jingya!","Chu Fu had no intention of letting Sun Jingya cause trouble for them in the future.","With that thought, she immediately sent a message to Li Weizheng.","“Major Li, does the plan you launched include Sun Jingya as well? She’s also the culprit who killed my parents!","“I’m planning to bring a second lawsuit against her soon, so I really don’t want her to develop in the game!”","Of course, Chu Fu could file a second lawsuit, because they had found new evidence."]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206: Thought It Was Wiped Out by a Butterfly's Wing, but It Actually Accelerated Growth","paragraphs":["The evidence was that video of Guan Youlong.","Releasing it would do more than ruin Wang Silu’s reputation. It could also serve as proof that Sun Jingya hadn’t accidentally hit someone while driving drunk, but had instead committed the heinous crimes of endangering public safety and deliberately murdering someone, treating the violation of another person’s life as a form of entertainment.","A life sentence was far too lenient.","Chu Fu had never intended to punish Sun Jingya through legal means. However, now that Linjiang City was organizing criminals to enter the game, Sun Jingya’s S-rank talent would attract attention.","That was something Chu Fu did not want to see.","Major Li said, “Classmate Chu, rest assured. I’ve already given instructions. The situation you’re worried about won’t happen.","“My subordinate has also reported to me that Sun Jingya did awaken an S-rank talent, but she has already died many times. Her talent has fallen to at least B-rank.","“In a few days, not only will her talent decline, but all her basic attributes will be completely depleted as well.”","Only then did Chu Fu relax.","“Then thank you, Major Li. If there’s anything you need help with, just let me know!”","“Haha, then after midnight, bring some of our Military Soul players along for the Undead Calamity speed run. We’ll negotiate the price.”","“No problem.”","Chu Fu agreed and hung up.","It seemed that the butterfly effect had caused the great villain, Sun Jingya, to be eliminated ahead of time.","Now that Chu Fu had become stronger, countless people naturally wanted to curry favor with her and help her obtain justice.","Sun Jingya’s affairs had been settled by the people of Linjiang City without Chu Fu needing to lift a finger.","That way, Sun Jingya wouldn’t have the chance to grow.","An S-rank talent had been beaten down to F-rank, leaving her with only the Dark Knight class. She was practically useless.","Besides, four months later, Chu Fu would be able to kill Sun Jingya herself.","Chu Fu drew her thoughts back.","Actually, even if Sun Jingya managed to grow, she would be nothing more than a stepping stone for the protagonist.","Naturally, improving herself and making money to cash out were more important right now.","Unbeknownst to her, while Chu Fu believed that the butterfly effect had erased the great villain, she had actually accelerated Sun Jingya’s growth.","...","In the early hours of the morning.","While Chu Fu was leading Military Soul players through speed runs, Server 0488888 had already begun its Village Defense Battle.","When this village server opened, the authorities in Linjiang City had already intervened to prevent internal conflict. It was also the final village established by the Universal Workshop.","Shen Chi’s family, along with his maternal aunt, elder uncle, and younger uncle, had all entered this server.","The entire family worked together to kill monsters and purchase coins. They soon bought enough bombs for the only player in the village who had awakened an S-rank talent and possessed Assassin skills: Eighteen Stabs.","Xu Can did not disappoint. Using her first skill, Bloodshadow Vanish, and taking advantage of the gaps between the monsters’ movements, she made her way to the location of the beehive. After bombarding it with explosives, she successfully obtained the one-point increase to all attributes awarded for the achievement.","Two hours after the server opened, the 100,000 bees had raised her to Level 3.","She had also obtained the recovery item honey, giving her a reliable safety net.","Now, she could lead people to kill the boss.","The team members were selected:","B-rank talent Agile Body, special class Inspirer—Xu Lan, Xu Can’s eldest sister and Shen Chi’s mother.","A-rank talent Well-Read, special class Earth Mage—Shen Zongan, Shen Chi’s father.","B-rank talent Born Leader, class Shield Warrior—Xu Ke, Shen Chi’s maternal uncle.","A-rank talent Orthopedic Saint, class Priest—Chen Daisong, Shen Chi’s uncle-in-law.","Perhaps because this was their first time entering the game, everyone held firm convictions, and their talents were all quite impressive.","The team’s lineup was well-balanced as well: a Shield Warrior, support, mage, assassin, and priest.","With Xu Can, a Level 5 player, leading the way, the five of them gradually made their way to Boar Ridge.","The others first positioned themselves in a crack in the mountainside. Xu Can repeatedly attempted to lure the Boar King into place and ultimately succeeded in trapping it to death.","After a great deal of effort, they secured the first kill.","Xu Can reached Level 4, while the others reached Level 3. Everyone gained one attribute point, and they also obtained five Silver-rank chests.","From that moment onward, they completely replicated Chu Fu’s route.","They secured the first kill at the Mutated Rat Nest, accumulated even more chests, killed the outdoor boss, obtained the first kill at the Beast God Temple, exchanged for the Beast Hunter’s Heart Badge, killed the werewolf Tuge, obtained the Disguise Mask, and completed the Newbie Village’s 100,000-kill achievement.","The day before the Village Defense Battle, someone from the authorities contacted Xu Can and asked whether they would be willing to help explore the Beast Tide Rift.","This was both an opportunity and a stroke of fortune.","As long as they entered the rift and cleared it, they could improve their talents.","They could also bring back valuable information on how to clear it.","Furthermore, the authorities had already promised that as long as Xu Can’s team entered and returned safely, all the official players in Area 048 would unconditionally transfer all their Village Defense Battle contribution points to her.","Xu Can ultimately agreed.","The entire server cooperated wholeheartedly as well, allowing Xu Can’s team to secure seven waves of bosses and obtain a total of 28 points to all attributes, raising their strength yet again.","Afterward, Xu Can led her team to the spatial rift and entered the dungeon.","[The Beast God Temple Divine Envoy’s Conspiracy (Origin)]","Inside the Origin-grade dungeon rift.","Xu Can and the others discovered that it was actually a massive mountain.","Looking up, they could vaguely see a gigantic beast lying atop the summit.","At the foot of the mountain, right in front of them, more than two hundred monsters waited around ten Replication Crystals.","Based on the available information, each wave of the Newbie Village siege consisted of only one million monsters.","With four directions, that meant 250,000 monsters per direction.","They were divided into ten levels.","In an Origin-grade dungeon, each direction contained only 250 monsters.","From Level 1 to Level 10, there were 25 monsters of each level.","The number was not large.","However, when every one of those monsters possessed the strength of a Tiger King and had a gigantic body, the situation became terrifying.","Fortunately, Xu Can’s attributes were now outrageously high.","Moreover, as an Assassin, her damage output was extremely powerful—strong enough to kill the monsters instantly.","The 250 monsters were cleared in only ten minutes, and the entire party reached Level 12 on the spot.","The only pity was that these monsters did not drop equipment. However, their hides were all Golden-rank materials.","With time limited, they could only quickly strip the hides from 25 of the tigers.","At the summit, the beasts roared and charged down the mountain. They had clearly discovered Xu Can’s group and intended to surround and kill them.","Shen Zongan controlled his earth magic and actually dug a cave into the mountainside. The group entered it, using the narrow passage to trap the monsters and rapidly clear them out.","After clearing five full waves in this manner, everyone had reached Level 17.","They had an hour and a half remaining.","There were no monsters left on the summit.","But they knew that someone was up there.","One of the divine envoys of the Beast God Temple.","The five of them proceeded cautiously. They first cleared the monsters remaining in front of the spatial rifts in the other three directions, then climbed to the summit together and killed the divine envoy.","At six in the morning in the real world, an announcement resounded throughout the entire game.","[System Announcement! Congratulations to the players “Eighteen Stabs,” “Dancer Tianlan,” “All-Purpose Professor Zongan,” “A Leader for Life,” and “Orthopedic Surgeon Director Chen” for clearing the Origin-grade dungeon: The Beast God Temple Divine Envoy’s Conspiracy (Origin)! Reward: 100 points to all attributes—the first-clear reward for this dungeon—and +1 level.]"]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207: Even Though the Name Is a Bit Socially Embarrassing, There's Nothing We Can Do About It","paragraphs":["“Man, am I getting my ass kicked! I should’ve known better than to choose the tank class!”","Inside the dungeon, Xu Ke’s face was twisted with pain.","“And it even made the announcement board? This name of mine is seriously embarrassing!”","After ten days of playing the game, Xu Ke had developed a deep understanding of the hostility directed at them by the younger players.","His ID, “A Leader for Life,” had been mocked as overflowing with “dad energy,” an old fossil, and a pretentious show-off.","But there was nothing he could do about it. His nephew had told them that they absolutely had to choose a name related to their class if they wanted a chance at obtaining a powerful talent.","Unfortunately, names related to his class were probably too common and had an extremely high duplication rate.","Since player names could not be repeated, Xu Ke was afraid of wasting time. On a whim, he came up with this name—and it happened to be available.","As for the others, aside from Eighteen Stabs, everyone had used a class-plus-name format to avoid duplication.","That was why the shorter a player’s ID was, the more likely it was that they had been created in an older server.","Players in newer servers came up with increasingly bizarre names.","“A name is merely an external possession. Talents are what you truly need to survive in the Primordial Gate. Have you all improved? My talent has reached S-rank and evolved into All-Knowing and All-Powerful. I can comprehend every element!” Shen Zongan could not contain his joy.","At first, he had entered the game because he wanted to help his son take revenge.","But now, his son had recovered and was back on his feet, while the person responsible for the accident had paid the price. Shen Zongan only wanted to focus on playing the game.","After all, this concerned their very survival.","Who knew what the outside world had become?","Even rabbits, rats, and wild boars could kill people now. Naturally, he wanted to make himself stronger.","With such a powerful ability, of course he was thrilled.","The others had also improved significantly.","“I got a second talent!” Xu Can announced.","“I can spin and dance, creating numerous phantom clones that can attack,” Xu Lan explained, introducing her talent.","“Hahaha! Mine is the Lord Template. My physical attributes and vitality have been increased tenfold. Look at my HP—it’s two digits higher than yours!” Xu Ke laughed heartily, having already forgotten his earlier displeasure at the possibility of being mocked for his name.","“My talent evolved and gained a resurrection spell. I can rearrange a person’s bones and bring them back to life. My class has also become capable of both fighting and healing. I can shatter an enemy’s bones,” Chen Daisong added.","The five of them exchanged information and had all made tremendous progress.","[Eighteen Stabs]: Level 20.","Talent 1: SSS-rank Vengeful Soul.","Talent 2: A-rank Bloodlust (newly acquired).","Class: Blood Vengeance Assassin (Hidden Class).","[Dancer Tianlan]: Level 20.","Talent: B-rank Nimble Body advanced to → Thousand-Spinning Phantom Form (S).","Class: Special Class Cheerleader advanced to → Hidden Class Phantom Dancer.","[All-Purpose Professor Zongan]: Level 20.","Talent: A-rank Well-Read advanced to → S-rank All-Knowing and All-Powerful.","Class: Special Class Earth Mage advanced to → Hidden Class All-Element Mage.","[A Leader for Life]: Level 20.","Talent: B-rank Natural Leader advanced to → S-rank Lord Template.","Class: Ordinary Class Shield Warrior advanced to → Special Class Bastion Guardian.","[Orthopedic Surgeon Director Chen]: Level 20.","Talent: A-rank Orthopedic Saint advanced to → S-rank: Bone-Shattering Revival.","Class: Ordinary Class Priest advanced to → Special Class Bone-Shattering Priest.","Furthermore, all five of them had reached Level 20, allowing them to skip the server merger entirely and head directly to Linjiang City.","Once there, they could officially join the Thorn Guild and catch up with the second-tier players.","...","Inside [Destroy the Undead Calamity], Chu Fu led nineteen players by herself and began attempting a speed-clear record.","Chu Fu’s regular teammates had also split into different groups, continuously challenging the speed-clear records and trying to bring along as many players as possible.","This was the fastest way to accumulate gold coins.","When she saw the global announcement, she was stunned for a moment before speaking in the guild management channel.","“Huh? This ID looks like Wheelchair Brother’s aunt! She actually entered a Primordial-tier dungeon and cleared it?”","Shen Chi was clearly delighted as well.","“That’s right. My aunt, my parents, my maternal uncle, and my uncle-in-law all have S-rank talents now. My aunt’s primary talent is SSS-rank, and she also awakened a second talent. Once the village-defense battle ends, she’ll be able to improve even further!”","“Excellent. Have her come to Linjiang City. We’ll focus on developing her. Manager Feng, make the arrangements. After Server 048 merges, she might even be able to help us take down another Primordial-tier dungeon in one of the towns.”","Chu Fu issued the order.","“Yes, Boss,” Feng Huimin replied.","When she had first joined the guild, she had reviewed its structure and learned that the Thorn Guild also had players in several other beginner zones.","There were not many of them.","One group consisted of Shen Chi’s relatives, who had entered Zone 048.","By coincidence, they were in the same beginner village as the team Feng Huimin had originally taken over from Huanyu Kuangba.","By now, the players under Huanyu Kuangba had long since vanished without a trace. Moreover, because of Shen Chi’s aunt’s intervention, Wantu Real Estate had completely changed hands and fallen into Chu Fu’s possession.","Shen Chi’s aunt had now become a new star player.","The people around the strong really were strong as well.","There was actually another team, recruited by Xie Lin.","At first, it had been very small, with barely a handful of members. They were reportedly friends Xie Lin had met during his time as a professional player, as well as streamers and prospective esports trainees from training camps.","In the beginning, practically none of them had been willing to join the Thorn Workshop.","After all, these people were top-tier players in their own right. They had talent for gaming and had entered the game even earlier than Xie Lin.","Only after some of them died unexpectedly—and Xie Lin painted them a promising picture—did he manage to form a new team. They had originally planned to enter Zone 55.","But plans could never keep up with reality.","Wangxi Village developed too quickly, while Zone 55 opened too late. These people could not afford to wait, so they entered Wangxi Village instead and gradually integrated into the Thorn Guild.","As the Thorn Guild grew stronger, more and more people Xie Lin knew came to join.","The guild had even made an exception to recruit a group of players with B- and C-rank talents.","After undergoing two Primordial-tier dungeons, these players had an 80 percent chance of reaching S-rank talents, which astonished even Feng Huimin.","They had also become the guild’s main force for organizing raids, grinding for others, and carrying players through dungeons. They never made mistakes when entering a dungeon.","Of course, when it came to attribute points, this group was actually inferior to Eighteen Stabs and the others.","Feng Huimin could only say that making the right choice mattered more than working hard.","Just as it had for her.","But Chu Fu was focused on something else.","She had requested the dungeon-clear video from Shen Chi’s aunt and was watching it now, deep in thought.","“The spatial rift in the beginner village was a conspiracy by the players of the Beast God Temple. The spatial rift in the town-defense battle was a genuine goblin lair.","“Every attack leaves clues.","“The Primordial Gate reveals who our enemies are through its dungeons.","“So what about the city-defense battle?","“We’ll soon have nearly ten thousand Level 30 players in Linjiang City, won’t we?”","After all, the Thorn Guild already had a thousand Level 30 players, not to mention the more than eight thousand Level 29 players behind them.","What if I could take part in one more town-defense battle? The siege battle isn’t far off, either.","Unfortunately, Chu Fu’s wonderful hopes didn’t come true!"]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208: Stick with the nation, eat nine meals in three days, the whole team graduates with diamond-level equipment.","paragraphs":["Several more days passed.","During this time, Chu Fu had been constantly running dungeons to showcase her strength, while in the real world, the process of devouring toxic substances continued steadily.","Once her level reached 30, she became locked into a fixed quest. It wasn’t something that could bring about a tremendous change in a short period of time.","However, good news kept pouring in from China.","China occupied 1,000 numbered servers, and as many as 200 servers might conduct Town Defense Battles every day.","With the power of the state mobilized and massive amounts of data collected, the authorities had every server that might enter an Origin-tier dungeon under their watch.","Finding a player like Chu Fu was extremely difficult.","After all, Chu Fu’s talent had been very low at the beginning, yet she had cleared the Novice Village three times:","Once in a Village Defense Battle, and twice in defense battles.","Before challenging the Origin-tier dungeon, she had even participated in a Town Defense Battle.","Just in attribute points alone, she had over 200 more than other players.","She had also taken down every boss on every map.","Not to mention, Chu Fu had thirteen powerful teammates.","Still, China was vast and rich in talent.","An ordinary S-rank talent user could not defeat a divine envoy. But there were still players with SS-rank and SSS-rank talents to be found.","On top of that, a town like this required someone capable of casting resurrection magic.","China had spared no expense. It directly purchased the necessary resources and equipped the teams that were about to challenge Origin-tier dungeons.","The entire nation had poured its strength into the effort, united as one.","Although the battle had been extremely fierce, the first operation was ultimately successful.","They obtained 30,000 sets of Dark Gold-grade equipment, one Diamond-grade set, and a large amount of materials.","The Thorn Guild received 65% of the spoils. It took the Diamond-grade set, a large quantity of materials, and 15,000 sets of Dark Gold-grade equipment.","The 15,000 Dark Gold-grade sets were reinvested into the operation, effectively being loaned to the other parties.","As a result, two servers went to challenge Origin-tier dungeons the next day.","But this time, only one team succeeded.","The other team failed. They were up against an archer-type divine envoy, and the entire team was dragged around and picked off one by one like targets in a kite-flying strategy.","Of the 20,000 people who entered the dungeon, 10,000 died, while only 10,000 managed to escape.","The equipment they lost was a secondary concern.","The 10,000 who died would be unable to enter the game for three months.","China was already overwhelmed just dealing with compensation and calming everyone down.","From then on, the analysts became much more cautious.","If they were not confident of clearing the dungeon, they would simply kill the goblins at the four rift entrances.","As long as they did not approach the Goblin City, they could kill at least 10,000 goblins. If the divine envoy sent more goblins, they could continue killing them.","This was a safe and reliable way to obtain Dark Gold-grade equipment, and the method was practically viable nationwide.","In an instant, Dark Gold-grade equipment went from one to two, two to three, and three to ten thousand!","In just five days, the 22,000 Dark Gold-grade sets Chu Fu had loaned out had, through compounded returns, yielded 330,000 sets of Dark Gold-grade equipment.","It was absolutely terrifying.","Among them, they had taken down the Goblin Divine Envoy thirteen times. That meant Chu Fu had obtained thirteen Diamond-grade equipment sets from that alone.","There were also some Diamond-grade materials, as well as general-purpose items like spatial stones.","Zhimengzhe’s fingers were practically smoking from rubbing them together.","“We can’t keep up—we really can’t keep up! When will the tailors in the guild finally level up?” Zhimengzhe was experiencing the sweet pain of happiness.","Whenever she thought about the several Diamond-grade equipment sets that would arrive in her hands the next day, she felt that she would be spending the rest of her life in the workshop.","Feng Huimin quickly comforted her.","“We’ve already increased the amount of Dark Gold-grade materials they’re allowed to use. Their skill proficiency is rising very quickly.”","After spending so much time with everyone, Feng Huimin was no longer as stiff and formal as before. She had begun offering emotional support as well.","When speaking to the younger girls in the team, her voice would unconsciously soften.","“All the metal equipment has been dismantled into raw materials and placed in the warehouse!” Shen Chi said.","At present, Diamond-grade equipment was exclusive to level-50 divine servants, so no one could wear it.","Fortunately, Shen Chi possessed Violent Dismantling and Metal Manipulation, allowing him to dismantle light and heavy armor.","Zhimengzhe could dismantle cloth equipment, returning cloth items to thread, while leather goods could be cut and reshaped.","However, only Zhimengzhe could craft Diamond-grade robes and leather armor.","The guild, on the other hand, had three blacksmiths:","Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","“The materials are here? Exchange a batch for me. I’m going to forge swords!” Xie Lin said.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao gave him a disdainful look.","“All you know how to do is forge swords. You’re wasting all the materials!”","Xie Lin did not feel pressured in the slightest.","“What do you mean, wasting them? Every sword I forge can increase our combat power. The stronger I become, the greater my contribution to the team.","“Besides, forging swords allows me to comprehend sword techniques and deepen my understanding of the Sword Dao, which increases my attribute points even more.","“Who dares to obstruct my path?","“I’ll kill them with one sword!”","Everyone in the senior management group kept the chat open year-round. Hearing Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao and Xie Lin bicker, they all struggled not to laugh.","Suture Saint: “We wouldn’t dare, we wouldn’t dare. But Great Hero Xie, you’ve already advanced three months of your dividends. Do you even have a single gold coin left in your pocket? I’m worried you’ll be too poor to sleep.”","“It’s fine. We devote ourselves to the sword. As long as there is a sword in our hearts, we have no reason to fear poverty!”","Chu Fu could not hold back any longer.","“Sword Saint Brother, you only spend and never earn. Of course you’re poor!”","Xie Lin forged swords exclusively, then incorporated them into his Ten Thousand Swords Returning to the Sect skill.","After the previous upgrade, Xie Lin’s Ten Thousand Swords Returning to the Sect had unlocked a new effect: Infinite Sword Case.","His weapon skill slot could hold ten thousand swords, and their attributes would stack.","This was different from controlling a large number of swords before.","Although those swords were controlled by Xie Lin, they did not increase his attributes. They only added to the overall attributes of Ten Thousand Swords Returning to the Sect.","The swords placed inside the sword case, however, had their attributes added directly to his character panel.","Unfortunately, this was limited by Xie Lin’s current Strength.","Every 100 points of base Strength allowed him to place one sword inside the sword case, which meant he could currently carry only nine swords!","Naturally, he wanted the best.","All nine swords were Diamond-grade!","A Diamond-grade piece of equipment had a total of 160 attribute points. Nine swords could increase his attributes by 1,440 points.","For the sake of these attributes, Xie Lin took leave from work and devoted himself to forging.","But his improvement was equally enormous. He was practically advancing like a rocket, growing stronger and stronger as the game progressed.","Everyone was happy to see it.","After all, Xie Lin becoming stronger was indeed good for the team. Giving every member of the team one Diamond-grade weapon would not necessarily provide as much improvement as boosting Xie Lin alone.","Besides, although no one had received a weapon, everyone had still obtained a full set of Diamond-grade equipment.","So there was no issue of Xie Lin forging nine weapons and leaving everyone else without a Diamond-grade weapon to wear.","Resources were the one thing the Thorn Guild never lacked.","Their bickering was simply playful banter.","Amid this relaxed and cheerful atmosphere, with the guild’s wealth and resources increasing every day, time quietly reached the 63rd day since the arrival of the Primordial Gate.","...","0248888 Server, Windpeace Town.","A Town Defense Battle was about to begin, and the town had entered its 24-hour preparation phase.","Chu Fu wanted to repeat what she had done before and issue a quest to support Windpeace Town, but she received a rejection from the system.","System Notification: The number of participants in Windpeace Town’s Town Defense Battle exceeds 10,000. This quest does not meet the current conditions and cannot be issued."]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209: The Mysterious Merchant Tianheng, the Unscrupulous Trader Who Emptied Chufu's Wallet","paragraphs":["Everyone in the Thorn Guild, including the players in Thorn Town, had been eagerly waiting to see whether they would be able to go and reinforce the defensive battle at 024 today.","Now, they were destined to be disappointed.","Chu Fu posted an announcement.","[Town Chief’s Notice] [Who Wants to Become a Plantman?]: Wind Harmony Town’s defensive battle already has more than 10,000 participants, so reinforcement missions cannot be obtained. Players who want to take part in the defensive battle should try their luck by finding an NPC and attempting to trigger a mission. You might get lucky.","Chu Fu wasn’t lying.","The NPCs in Linjiang City and those in the various villages and towns were connected by countless ties. As long as players knew one of them and subtly hinted that something was about to happen to the town, they could receive a protection mission, an investigation mission, or even a message-delivery mission.","However, there were not many such missions. According to the information available, only twenty or thirty spots became available each time.","The players of Thorn Town were deeply disappointed.","There was indeed a chance to participate, but without the experts from the Thorn Guild, they could not possibly conquer an Origin-level dungeon on their own.","And it wasn’t only the players from Thorn Town who would compete for these missions. Linjiang City had countless players hoping to farm contribution points and participate in a major event.","After posting the announcement, Chu Fu also headed to Linjiang City to see whether she could trigger any missions.","“Plant Boss, I know an NPC who might be connected to the NPCs from Wind Harmony Town!”","“I know one too.”","“Plant Boss, go give it a try! As long as you do, you’ll gain 10 points in every attribute!”","The story-focused players in Thorn Town began leaving messages on the map one after another.","Chu Fu hurriedly added them as friends before setting off to try to trigger a mission.","Her first attempt ended in failure.","The NPC she encountered was an old man carrying a load of goods.","“Grandpa, I heard that you’re from Wind Harmony Town. The town is about to be attacked by goblins. Do you have any relatives or friends you’re worried about? I can deliver a message to them, or even escort them out of the town.”","The old man quickly waved his hands.","“I wouldn’t dare trouble you, Esteemed Awakener. Besides, I don’t have any relatives or friends. I’m all alone. I came here after begging for food in Wind Harmony Town.”","“Most people find it hard to leave their homeland behind. Don’t you want to go back and take a look? I can escort you there!”","“No, no, no. I still have work to do, my lady!”","The old man hurried away.","This was a typical case of an NPC having no mission available.","There was nothing Chu Fu could do. In The Gate of Origins, it was impossible to simply pay the old man to issue a mission.","All she could do was move on to the next target.","However, before she even reached her destination, she encountered someone familiar.","More precisely, she encountered a familiar NPC.","He was a man dressed in an extravagant robe, with dazzling, multicolored rings on his fingers and enough jewelry to make him look like a walking treasure chest.","It seemed he had upgraded his mode of transportation. This time, instead of carrying a shoulder pole, he was pushing a cart.","The cart was loaded with all kinds of goods.","“Esteemed Awakener, would you like to buy something? I have anything you could possibly want,” Tianheng, the Mysterious Merchant, said.","You don’t expect me to start opening boxes, do you?","Chu Fu never gambled.","Jiao Jiao had already gone bankrupt once because of that.","Even so, she instinctively glanced at the goods on Tianheng’s cart. The next moment, her pupils trembled in shock.","[City Upgrade Blueprint: Can be used once the town’s area reaches 100,000 × 100,000 meters. Upgrades a town to a city. If the settlement has already been upgraded, increases the city’s side length by 10,000 × 10,000 meters.","Price: 1,000,000 gold coins.]","[Village and Town Upgrade Blueprint: Price: 10,000 gold coins.]","[Resurrection Grass Seeds (Diamond): Price: 100,000 gold coins.]","[Resurrection Potion Formula (Diamond): Price: 100,000 gold coins.]","[Holy Light Flower Seeds (Diamond): Price: 100,000 gold coins.]","What?!","Never mind the importance of the first two items.","Even just the two types of seeds had astonishing effects.","Resurrection Grass could be used to make resurrection potions. Players whose corpses had been preserved could be resurrected.","Although resurrection potions required a teammate to use them and were less convenient than resurrection scrolls, they were cheap.","If Chu Fu possessed Resurrection Grass, then with her farming abilities, she could drive down the production cost. The cost of a resurrection potion could probably be reduced to around one gold coin.","Even if she sold them for ten gold coins each, they would still sell like hotcakes.","As for the Holy Light Flower Seeds, they were a necessary ingredient for holy potions. These potions could dispel evil-god contracts and curses.","They could completely replace Chu Fu’s method of eliminating disasters and be made widely available.","As for the holy potion formula, Chu Feng had given it to her long ago.","However, the main ingredient, the Holy Light Flower, had to be gathered from level-40-to-50 maps, and Chu Feng had never encountered any.","As a result, the matter had been put on hold.","Now, Tianheng had brought everything out, using it to tempt Chu Fu.","Chu Fu did not hesitate.","Buy!","She first bought the two plant seeds and the potion formula, spending 300,000 gold coins.","Then she bought the City Upgrade Blueprint. There was only one, and it cost 1,000,000 gold coins.","The money Chu Fu had saved over the past few days was completely wiped out.","But she wasn’t worried. Thorn Town still had money in its accounts, and Feng Huimin could reimburse her later.","There were one hundred Village and Town Upgrade Blueprints, but Chu Fu did not buy them for the time being.","If she bought that item, the Mysterious Merchant would leave.","So she said, “Since you claim that anything can be bought from you, what if I want a pass to Wind Harmony Town? Do you have one?”","Tianheng, the Mysterious Merchant, revealed an extremely handsome smile. It was the kind of smile one might show upon seeing a walking god of wealth.","“Of course I do. A special price for a sincere customer: 1,000,000 gold coins per pass!”","Chu Fu nearly coughed up blood.","She had originally thought that since she only had a little over 30,000 gold coins left, the Mysterious Merchant would sell her an entry pass based on the amount of money she possessed.","That way, Chu Fu could arrange for more people to enter Wind Harmony Town.","She had not expected Tianheng to immediately quote a price of 1,000,000 gold coins.","Chu Fu rapidly calculated the numbers in her head.","Actually, it was still profitable.","With the nation now involved, the price of Dark Gold equipment had plummeted. A single piece was already selling for only 50 gold coins. It was absurd.","The price had dropped to one-tenth of what it had been.","Even so, a full set still cost around 500 gold coins. Once inside the Goblin City, a player could kill roughly 30,000 goblins, earning a total of around 15,000,000 gold coins.","Adding in the Diamond equipment and materials, that would be another 500 gold coins or so.","There was also the corresponding increase in abilities brought about by Divine Power Plunder.","That 1,000,000 gold coins was indeed worth it.","However, Chu Fu had no intention of keeping the opportunity to herself.","She decided to bring twenty people in.","The fourteen members of her fixed party, Sneaky Dog, and the five members of Eighteen Stabs. After all, they were relatives of Wheelchair Brother, so taking care of them was only right.","That made exactly twenty people.","Chu Fu then sent the news to the management group and informed everyone. She also asked Feng Huimin to raise the money first.","“Plant Girl, thank you!” Shen Chi was the first to express his gratitude. The guild now had experts everywhere and S-rank players in abundance, but aside from his aunt, his parents, maternal uncle, and uncle-in-law were not particularly strong.","“It’s only right, Wheelchair Brother. You’re a major shareholder, after all!”","In Chu Fu’s eyes, Shen Chi had actually suffered the most. His entire family had been dragged into the mess by Wan Huanyu, making them victims who stood on the same side as Chu Fu.","Now that they had entered the game, she naturally wanted to look after them as much as possible.","But from Shen Chi’s perspective, he was so moved that he could hardly put it into words. His heart grew softer toward her, and his resolve to follow Chu Fu became even firmer.","Feng Huimin always said that she was a dead soldier.","Do you really think he’d be this loyal if there weren’t money involved?","He had been one of Chu Fu’s most loyal followers since the very first day the game launched!"]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210: City Building, The First City Lord, Someone from the Holy Wolf Club","paragraphs":["Before making the purchase, Chu Fu called over several people.","“Jiaojiao, come here and help me take a look. What can you see in the goods the merchant has for sale on Tianheng?”","Chu Fu had placed a Plant Spirit beside each of her teammates. That way, she could summon them at any time if something happened.","She activated the Plant Channel, and Jiaojiao Bu Jiao walked over through the channel, appearing beside Chu Fu.","It was incredibly convenient.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao’s eyes lit up.","“I’ve made quite a bit of money from blacksmithing lately. Let’s see if my luck is any good! Huh? The box went up in price? It’s 100 gold now?”","“Didn’t you see the village-and-town upgrade blueprints?” Chu Fu asked.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao shook her head.","“No. And the Mysterious Merchant’s exchange page is different every time!”","Chu Fu naturally knew that.","She had only wanted to confirm it.","The goods sold by the Mysterious Merchant differed according to each customer’s wealth, strength, needs, and status.","Chu Fu was a town mayor, while Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was a deputy mayor.","That was why she had asked Jiaojiao Bu Jiao to check whether she could purchase the village-and-town upgrade blueprints.","If Jiaojiao Bu Jiao couldn’t see them, didn’t that mean Chu Fu could monopolize all one hundred?","Since no one else could see them, they were scarce goods.","That was why the Mysterious Merchant was so popular. Many people bought scarce items and resold them at several times the original price.","After confirming everything, Chu Fu mobilized twenty million gold coins from the Thorn Guild and Thorn Town to purchase twenty Wind and Harmony Town Passes.","She then withdrew another one million gold coins from her own dividends and bought all one hundred village-and-town upgrade blueprints.","Since Thorn Town had become a joint-stock town, Chu Fu naturally wasn’t going to pay out of her own pocket to upgrade it.","She posted a quest called “Build a Home.”","Quest: United We Stand—Build a Home!","Submit village-and-town upgrade blueprints to build a new home and receive a reward of 10,000 gold coins!","(Limited to twenty blueprints.)","She completed her own quest herself.","Chu Fu submitted twenty blueprints, fully upgrading Thorn Town to the current maximum level.","Two hundred thousand gold coins also landed in her backpack.","She then posted an advanced version of the “Build a Home” quest.","Quest: United We Stand—Build a Home!","Submit city upgrade blueprints to build a new home and receive a reward of one million gold coins!","The quest was approved, and the reward was issued!","Chu Fu submitted the required blueprints, and one million gold coins fell into her hands.","Half the money she had spent had come back to her.","Afterward, she listed the remaining eighty village-and-town upgrade blueprints anonymously on the Auction House, with a starting price of 100,000 gold coins and an instant-purchase price of 300,000.","The reason she set an instant-purchase price was that Chu Fu feared someone else might trigger the Mysterious Merchant’s shop and purchase village-and-town upgrade blueprints as well. If they started a price war, the value of the blueprints would never rise.","It was safest to get rid of them quickly.","Sure enough, the moment Chu Fu listed the blueprints, they sold at lightning speed.","The Auction House was open to the entire world.","Who wouldn’t want to become a town mayor?","Guilds wanted to profit.","Countries wanted more of their citizens to enter the game. A town-level settlement could accommodate up to one hundred thousand players.","At the very least, China’s official forces would take action.","And 300,000 gold coins wasn’t much for a large guild.","After all, when Shen Chi had used the Siphon Machine to drain the money from Jiang Yixing’s pockets, he had sucked out 30,000 gold coins.","The Star Alliance had only been a Level 2 guild at the time, yet it had already been capable of generating that much money. A Level 3 guild would have accumulated even greater wealth.","In just over twenty minutes, Chu Fu’s backpack had gained twenty-four million gold coins.","The Mysterious Merchant had made a huge profit, but Chu Fu hadn’t lost out either.","Moreover, she hadn’t actually paid for the Town Passes herself. The Thorn Guild had funded them as part of its talent-development program.","After those talents entered dungeons and fought bosses, the 20% share they contributed to the guild’s funds would serve as the return on that investment.","Someone like Eighteen Stabs, for example, was absolutely worth investing in. Who knew? He might one day become an excellent independent team leader.","After counting her gains, Chu Fu happily opened the mayor interface and selected the upgrade option.","The previous quest had only awarded her the blueprints; she hadn’t actually used them to upgrade the town. Now, Chu Fu upgraded it all at once.","By doing things this way, anyone who didn’t know the truth would think she had spent 300,000 gold coins per blueprint to purchase twenty village-and-town upgrade blueprints.","No one would suspect that the blueprints had been sold by Chu Fu herself.","She was making a fortune in silence.","As Chu Fu completed the upgrade, Thorn Town expanded once again, reaching the requirements for a city upgrade.","Chu Fu then used a city upgrade blueprint to upgrade Thorn Town.","From that moment on, Thorn Town became Thorn City.","System Announcement: Congratulations to the player “Who Wants to Be a Plant?” for using a “City Upgrade Blueprint” to elevate Thorn Town into Thorn City.","Player “Who Wants to Be a Plant?” has become a city lord. As the first player to establish a city, all attributes +500.","The reward was five times greater than the one for establishing a town.","Chu Fu happily accepted the attribute points.","The next moment, a new announcement suddenly appeared.","The Undead God of Death has sensed the prosperity of Thorn City and intends to destroy it.","All Thorn City players, prepare yourselves.","The siege battle will begin in one hour.","If the siege is successfully defended, Thorn City will be established. If the defense fails, the city will be destroyed.","All Level 30 players may travel to Thorn City to aid in its defense and receive generous contribution rewards.","Chu Fu’s mind went blank.","How had she not known that players had to face a siege battle after establishing a city?","Her brother was a lone-wolf player, and his way of playing was far too different from hers. As a result, Chu Fu’s information advantage had completely disappeared.","Thinking carefully through the storyline, Chu Fu couldn’t recall a single city established by a player.","That was right—even the future Level 10 guilds had all been established within major cities rather than building cities of their own.","The greatest difference between them was probably Perfect Town Defense.","The Contribution Shop available after an imperfect town defense was different from the one available after a perfect defense. It did not sell town upgrade scrolls.","Once Chu Fu understood everything, she became calm instead.","It was only a city defense battle.","It wasn’t a divine war.","Besides, Level 30 and above players could come help defend the city.","Their chances were still very good.","After all, Chu Fu could summon her guardian deity.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant?”: Brother, brother! What are you doing? Hurry over and help me defend the city!","“Lu Xing”: Add me to the party!","Chu Fu: We’re safe!","She quickly added Chu Feng to the party.","Then she rapidly gathered everyone together.","After reaching Level 30, although Level 30 dungeons could still only accommodate twenty people, a party could include fifty people as long as they weren’t inside a dungeon.","Chu Fu gathered everyone into one party, then added a group of people from the Thorn Guild who had the highest contributions and the greatest potential.","A high contribution score meant that these people frequently ran dungeons. Every time they ran one, 20% of the guild’s funds were converted into contribution points.","This group was therefore certain to be the hardest-working members—the people who contributed the most to the guild.","She rewarded them with +120 to all attributes!","At the same time, large numbers of Level 30 players poured into Thorn City.","There was even a group of fair-haired, blue-eyed players among them.","What made your scalp prickle was the blood-red glow above these players’ heads.","Their names were red, and the guild name was even more glaring: the Holy Wolf Club!"]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211: The Holy Wolf Club Is Causing Trouble, No One Who Comes Will Leave","paragraphs":["“Brothers, let’s go on a killing spree!”","Because the game automatically translated everyone’s speech, everyone could understand what the people from the Holy Wolf Club were saying.","These people had clearly come here to cause trouble.","They truly wanted to see the world burn.","Bombs and magic began blasting everyone nearby. The players who had come to join the excitement and lend a hand were instantly killed, their equipment completely looted.","“Boom!”","The teleportation array was blown apart.","Now, no one could come and reinforce them.","“Thorn Town is nothing special!” the giant wolf sneered.","But in the very next moment, an angry curse rang out.","“Which bastard destroyed the teleportation array? Come out here and face me!”","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate charged forward with a shield slung over one arm and a massive diamond-grade iron hammer in the other.","[Taunt]","In an instant, countless werewolves turned toward Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate.","Their huge bodies pounced on her. Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate swung her hammer at the nearest werewolf.","The giant hammer tore through the air with a howling wind.","With a thunderous crash, the giant wolf seemed to be flattened in midair by the blow and was sent flying more than twenty meters.","In the blink of an eye, its health bar emptied.","Instant kill!","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate swung her hammer again, bringing it down from above. The head of a three-meter-tall werewolf was struck by the massive weapon, followed by its entire body and both legs.","It was smashed into a little pancake.","“Fuck! Where are the mages? Get over here and support us!” the Holy Wolf Club members roared.","Their eyes were filled with disbelief.","It was obvious that their opponent was a shield warrior. Anyone could tell from her equipment.","But her damage was ridiculously high—terrifyingly high, even.","One swing of her hammer had killed one of their companions.","These companions of theirs had committed countless atrocities. Killing players and NPCs granted them attribute bonuses, making every one of them comparable to an elite boss in the game. Combined with their own skills, each of them could take on a hundred players alone.","Some werewolves even possessed naturally powerful talents. With their attribute bonuses, they were practically comparable to map bosses.","But why?","How could they not even survive a single swing from this ferocious woman?","What was even more frightening was that although fear had already taken root in their hearts, the woman’s arrogant taunts somehow drove them to keep attacking her one after another.","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate was having the time of her life.","She rarely got a chance to fight. After all, she was a shield warrior. Her job was to get hit by monsters, not to hit them.","Even when they fought bosses, the damage dealers were always Chu Fu and the others.","As a result, Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate had never realized just how powerful she was.","Now, seeing these hulking werewolves fall to a single swing of her hammer, she felt as though she were simply hammering metal as usual.","Her hammer had been forged from the fangs and club of the Goblin Divine Envoy. It was a diamond-grade weapon with astonishing attack power. At present, it killed one werewolf with every blow.","She swung from the front, from the side, and in spinning arcs.","One person alone beat the Holy Wolf Club’s players so badly that they were scrambling all over the ground.","With Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate taking action, the surrounding players finally came to their senses and erupted in fury.","“Who dares cause trouble in Thorn Town?”","“Fuck, I always thought weapons were forbidden in safe zones! So you can actually attack people here?”","“You can attack people, but the guards will attack you too!”","“These guys all have deep-red names. Killing them won’t make the guards attack us!”","Once that was said, the players rose up as one and attacked.","The Holy Wolf Club members were furious.","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate had the title of Vice President of the Thorn Guild above her head. She was at least someone of importance.","But what did this bunch of people amount to?","They fled in anger, hoping to charge into the crowd.","But in the next instant, they were surrounded and beaten mercilessly.","It hurt!","How could these people’s damage be so high too?","Taking a closer look, they were all wearing dark-gold equipment.","Dark-gold equipment was endgame gear for level-30 players at the moment.","Every one of these people had a full set.","Only then did the Holy Wolf Club players realize that something was wrong with Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate.","“Damn, why is she wearing a full set of diamond-grade equipment?”","They had never seen the effects of diamond-grade equipment before. Only now did they notice that the effects on Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate’s gear were completely different from everyone else’s.","So that was why!","No wonder they couldn’t beat her.","“Forget it! Get out of here and hide!”","All the Holy Wolf Club members had Disguiser Masks. As long as they hid among the crowd, they could seek revenge later.","However, because of the commotion they had caused, more and more people continued to arrive.","They had often been surrounded and attacked in the past. They had even treated human players like ordinary mobs.","But now that they were the ones being surrounded, they finally understood what helplessness felt like.","In the blink of an eye, more than a hundred Holy Wolf Club players lay sprawled on the ground.","The players quickly stripped their corpses, even taking their resurrection scrolls.","Some used resurrection scrolls to revive, only to be blasted back to the ground again in the next instant.","“Damn, they’re so poor! They’re still wearing silver equipment?”","“A wolf this big, and all it’s wearing is some gold gear? Aren’t you embarrassed?”","“Didn’t you say the Holy Wolf Club was made up of powerful nobles, backed by weapon merchants? Is this all you’ve got?”","“Your combat strength is way too pathetic. And you came here to cause trouble?”","“Queen Jiaojiao takes one down with every swing! Jiao Jiao, I recorded your glorious performance just now. Give me one gold coin, and I’ll post it on the forums and praise you to the heavens!”","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate insisted on watching the sample footage on the spot and immediately paid ten gold coins.","“Post it. Promote me exactly like that.”","Just as everyone was laughing and joking, Chu Fu finally returned.","Seeing the corpses scattered across the ground, she knew the matter had been settled.","The surrounding players from Thorn City immediately crowded around and began complaining all at once.","“Plant Master, these people were awful! They blew up the teleportation array, so no one else could come and support us.”","“It’ll take twenty-four hours to repair the teleportation array. Do we have enough people to defend the city?”","“Damn it, these people got us killed!”","The players were just as furious now as they had been excited when attacking the Holy Wolf Club. Naturally, they did not want to lose the city defense battle. This was the best city in Thorn City.","Chu Fu comforted everyone.","“Don’t be afraid. We have more than enough strength to defend it. We don’t need to rely on outsiders.","We’ll defend it ourselves!","Otherwise, you won’t be able to earn any contribution points.","Besides, we still have a chance to enter an Origin-level dungeon. If outsiders come, won’t they take away part of the divine power?”","Upon hearing this, everyone nodded.","They trusted Plant Girl.","However, Chu Fu was secretly worried.","To trigger the village-defense battle early, one thousand level-10 players were required.","To trigger the town-defense battle early, ten thousand level-20 players were required.","Chu Fu had always assumed that triggering the city-defense battle early required ten thousand players, because the rankings only displayed the top ten thousand.","Moreover, her older brother Chu Feng was a lone wolf who had been leveling on the frontier maps at the very front of the game’s progression, so some of the prerequisite conditions had never been described in the storyline.","But over the past few days, eighteen thousand players in the Thorn Guild had reached level 30 and completed their class advancement quests.","The number had long since surpassed ten thousand.","Since the city-defense battle had still not been triggered early, the number of players required to trigger it early had to be one hundred thousand.","In her previous life, not a single city had more than one hundred thousand level-30 players on the hundredth day after the Primeval Gate opened."]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212: The Werewolf's Plan, Making People Laugh","paragraphs":["Furthermore, after the hundredth day, no new regional starter villages would be created.","All of them would be starter villages formed through mergers.","Whether a country was powerful or not was closely tied to its number of players and the number of players protecting its starter villages.","If a city did not have enough people, it would be destroyed.","This time, Thorn City’s player levels and population were actually not far behind what was needed for the city defense battle.","That was right—not far behind at all.","The Thorn Guild alone had eighteen thousand level-30 players, to say nothing of the entire Thorn City.","Before it was upgraded, Thorn Town had been a town-level starter village capable of accommodating one hundred thousand newcomers.","Since everyone leveled so quickly, anyone above level 10 no longer counted as a beginner.","New players could apply to enter.","The player population was increasing by nearly ten thousand beginners every day.","By now, Thorn City had a population of two hundred and fifty thousand.","Earlier, when they had sent reinforcements to Guguan Town, Chu Fu had led a full one hundred and twenty thousand players from Thorn Town there.","The level-one players had all become level-25 players.","So Thorn City had at least one hundred and twenty thousand players above level 25.","That was no different from a city that had developed for a hundred days.","Not to mention that they had around five hundred S-rank players and at least fifty thousand sets of Dark Gold equipment.","The Undead Legion was coming to attack the city.","Were they sure they weren’t just here to deliver free loot?","Actually, Chu Fu had originally planned to close the gates and defend the city on her own, but the system had opened a reinforcement mission, leaving her no choice but to accept it.","Now that things had turned out this way, she did not even need to come up with an excuse.","She could simply say that the teleportation array had been destroyed by the Sacred Wolf Club.","Let them take the blame!","As for the benefits, the players of Thorn City would keep them for themselves.","“Stop crowding around here. Go do your missions!”","Chu Fu gave the order.","She then casually issued a batch of missions.","[Mission: Passing Down Experience—Each level-30 player must bring five players below level 10 in their party. Experience gained increases by 5%.]","[Mission: Sweep Out the Traitors—Find the traitors who have infiltrated the city. Find one and receive a piece of Dark Gold equipment.]","[Mission: Evacuate the NPCs—Persuade NPCs to travel to the Thorn Guild headquarters and temporarily evacuate to a safe area.]","[Mission: Protect the NPCs—If an NPC cannot be evacuated, remain by their side and protect them until the ninth wave of monsters. Reward: one piece of Dark Gold equipment.]","As soon as the missions were issued, every player in the city sprang into action.","“Looking for beginners! Anyone below level 10, join our party and get a free Silver-tier weapon!”","“Silver-tier? What trash! Join us and we’ll give you Gold-tier equipment!”","“Where are all the beginner babies? Come join our party! We’ve got handsome hunks with eight-pack abs!”","“Waaah, so this is the legendary player utopia, Thorn Town? I arrived at just the right time! Beginner looking for a party!”","In an instant, countless beginner players were fought over.","Thorn Town was simply too wealthy.","With so many players, clearing dungeons was easy. The Silver-tier equipment that players received after graduating from other starter villages was considered trash in Thorn Town. Besides, starter villages and towns did not have auction houses, so they could not get rid of all their equipment. Once there was too much of it, it naturally became worthless.","Giving it to beginners was just a way to clear out the junk.","Gold-tier equipment was no longer priced in gold coins. It sold for only a few hundred silver coins.","There was also the daily event, “Goblin City Counter-Invasion,” which dropped large quantities of level-11-to-20 Gold-tier equipment.","This was heaven for beginner players.","As everyone went off to keep busy, Chu Fu’s group also arrived at the scene.","They looked at the more than one hundred werewolves lying on the ground.","The group was still shouting.","“Enough already. Send a priest over to revive us.","“You dragged everyone away because you wanted to do this, didn’t you? You were afraid of losing face.","“Since you’ve shown some sense, we’ll only ask for one million gold coins!”","Xie Lin rolled his eyes. “What kind of daydream are you having? Haven’t you woken up yet?”","“Hmph! You’ll regret offending the Sacred Wolf Club. Even now, none of you from the Thorn Guild dare to go to the future maps. Isn’t that because the future maps are connected by teleportation arrays?","“Now that the cities don’t have interconnected teleportation arrays, your cowardly, peace-loving Chinese players are being protected.","“If you don’t pay up today, then after we return, we’ll massacre the Linjiang City shelter. Every player there will be buried with us because of your stubbornness.”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao brought her hammer down on the head of one of the corpses. That particular head had the most words floating above it.","“You’re already dead, and you still dare threaten us? Your mouth is the only thing that’s tough about you.”","Even more words continued to float above the werewolf’s head.","“By the Beast God, are our mouths really tough, or do you simply have no idea how terrifying the Beast God is?","“We’re lying here because, once your city defense battle begins, the Beast God’s emissary will teleport us away and revive us!","“By then, we’ll be even stronger, and Thorn City will be completely destroyed.","“Don’t you Chinese have a saying about spending money to avert disaster? Do you really want disaster to descend upon you?”","Chu Fu laughed.","As the Seed of Calamity, was there any reason for her to fear disaster?","She found these werewolves’ naivety somewhat amusing.","She had ordered everyone nearby to disperse, not because she was afraid of the Sacred Wolf Club or wanted to negotiate with them. It was because the level of their Impostor Masks seemed rather high, and the monsters that emerged when the masks were removed appeared to be quite powerful.","She did not want any other players to be accidentally injured.","“Is my intelligence outdated, or is yours? Don’t you know that I have a way to turn you into useless trash?”","These people had seen the Thorn Guild’s announcement, but they did not know what Chu Fu was capable of.","They assumed that, just like with the game system, they would have to agree before they could be converted to the normal faction.","If they refused, they would remain part of the werewolf faction.","Moreover, even if they were forcibly converted, so what? After they died, they could still run wild in the starter villages.","And the attributes they had accumulated beforehand would not disappear. Only their levels would drop.","Within the werewolf faction, levels were fundamentally unimportant.","The werewolves looked at Chu Fu and began hurling verbal abuse at her.","“So you’re the Plantman! You look like an underage girl. You’re pretty, though. If you knelt down and ****—”","The instant the player’s words appeared, Shen Chi’s body transformed into metal.","He became a twenty-five-meter-tall mecha and crushed the player beneath his foot.","His enormous leg blocked the view, completely covering the rest of the player’s words.","Then he abruptly yanked the player’s head off.","The scene was horrifically bloody.","In his hand, the head looked like a glass marble.","He squeezed the marble, and a series of cracking sounds came from it.","Because of the system’s rules, the player’s head could not be destroyed. However, the Impostor Mask was crushed.","A vast force of evil god power rapidly condensed into a monster.","“Move faster! The town defense battle starts in less than fifty minutes!”","Chu Fu raised her staff and cast Calamity of Soul Annihilation.","In an instant, darkness enveloped all the werewolves. Their souls rose from their dead bodies, and masks were forcibly torn from their faces.","The attributes they had accumulated began to plummet, rapidly vanishing.","Everything became nourishment for the mask monsters, causing them to swell into enormous, hideous creatures.","Perhaps one day, these monsters will be claimed by the Evil God, and the players on the werewolf faction will be nothing more than well-raised ingredients!"]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213: The first person to ride a black dragon to support, the city defense battle begins","paragraphs":["“What are you doing? Stop! I said stop!”","“My attribute points! Why are all my stats dropping?!”","“Ah, it hurts so much! I’m already dead—why can I still feel pain?”","That was the pain of having one’s soul stripped away.","“Without the Mask of the Impostor, none of you are players on the werewolf faction anymore.”","“Even if Werewolf Tuge wanted to summon you, he wouldn’t be able to. But thank you for coming. You’ll ensure that a werewolf Tuge brimming with divine power descends.”","By then, killing Werewolf Tuge would yield far more evil-god divine-power material.","Moreover, the quality of the evil-god divine-power material dropped by Werewolf Tuge varied with his level.","These players had certainly killed many people. The evil-god divine-nature material they dropped was actually dark-gold grade, and each of them dropped more than a hundred pieces.","That amounted to over ten thousand pieces of evil-god divine-power material in total.","Enough to exchange for ten diamond-grade pieces of equipment. Whoever bought them would surely convert them into diamond-grade accessories.","Since everyone was already well supplied with diamond-grade equipment, they all rushed to the guild and had the players exchange the materials for guild contribution points.","“If these people dropped dark-gold-grade evil-god divine-nature material, then won’t Werewolf Tuge drop diamond-grade material? If we collect a thousand diamond-grade pieces of evil-god divine-nature material, could we get an epic-grade item?”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao rubbed her hands together eagerly.","But Chu Fu knew that it would be very difficult.","Every epic-grade piece of equipment was dropped by an epic-grade character or monster.","Simply put, by a divine emissary.","If they could kill Werewolf Tuge, they might have a chance.","After all, Werewolf Tuge was special.","He was the true “Origin-level” existence.","It was just that he always sent out a clone. Chu Fu had no idea where his lair was.","And now was not the time to think about such things.","Chu Fu arranged for people to throw the werewolves’ corpses outside the city and clean the blood from the ground.","Countless players carried materials out of the city.","In just one hour,","they had built the fifth ring of defenses.","Shen Chi constructed layer upon layer of watchtowers.","That wasn’t all. After advancing to the city rank, Chu Fu, as the city lord, could purchase all kinds of facilities.","Among them was a protective barrier.","A magic formation capable of covering the entire city.","The required materials and gold flowed out like water.","One hour passed in the blink of an eye.","Only three minutes remained on the countdown.","Just then, a black speck appeared in the distant sky.","A player with eagle-eye abilities immediately shouted, “What’s that over there? Why does it look like some kind of monster? Is the undead army playing dirty and attacking ahead of schedule?”","The black speck drew closer and closer.","When it came near enough, they finally saw what kind of colossal creature it was.","A giant dragon!","A mature black dragon standing a full forty meters tall.","Every player felt the suffocating pressure of being targeted by a creature at the very top of the food chain. Their body hair stood on end, a heart-pounding sensation washed over them, and their backs went numb as their legs weakened.","That was the aura of dragon might.","However, when the dragon drew even closer, they saw something seemingly attached to its back.","A dragon saddle?","“There’s someone on it!!!”","“Oh my god, it’s Lu Xing! Lu Xing is here!”","“The number one player has come to reinforce us!”","“The top-ranked big shot!”","Countless people cried out in alarm.","Lin’an City now had two legendary figures.","One was the player’s utopia, widely recognized as the most powerful guild in China: the Thorn Guild.","The other was the mysterious lone powerhouse who ranked number one worldwide: Lu Xing!","Who would have thought he would actually come to support Thorn City?","Thank goodness! Thorn City was saved... Wait.","Had he come to steal the monsters, or to save them?","Lu Xing’s damage output was beyond question. He had always been the nightmare that left everyone despairing on the speed-clear leaderboards.","And he never left anything behind for those who came after him.","Could he have come to steal the stat points from the map boss?","At this moment, the group felt no reverence for the great player at all—only wariness.","They wanted to steal the Plant Boss’s stat points.","Absolutely not.","Fortunately, Chu Fu soon flapped her Poison God Wings and took to the air.","“Whoa!”","Chu Fu cried out in surprise.","What a huge dragon!","It looked to be as tall as a ten-story building.","“Fufu, come up here. I’ll take you for a ride on the dragon,” Chu Feng said, a faint smile tugging at the corners of his lips.","Of course he had to share something this fun with his little sister.","Just like how he used to buy her toys and coax her into saying that her brother was the best.","But now his little sister had grown up.","She didn’t act spoiled nearly as often anymore.","“Okay!”","Chu Fu flew over.","The black dragon suddenly sneezed, and its terrifying dragon breath nearly turned into a tornado as it blasted toward Chu Fu.","Clearly, Blackie was trying to give Chu Fu a little warning.","Chu Feng’s brows immediately furrowed, a cold glint flashing in his eyes.","“Blackie, you’re being naughty!”","Before the black dragon could say anything, the Chu Fu who had been blown away began to emit a green glow.","The black dragon had just exhaled, so naturally, it had to inhale again.","As it opened its mouth to speak, it sucked the green mist straight into its mouth.","In the next instant, the black dragon was poisoned.","Its enormous body plummeted straight from the sky, and Chu Feng felt himself suddenly drop.","Fortunately, it lasted only two seconds. Just as they were about to hit the ground, the giant dragon regained consciousness, a look of panic even appearing in its eyes.","White foam dribbled from the corners of its mouth.","“What happened to me? How did I get poisoned?”","A lecherous middle-aged man’s voice came from the black dragon’s mouth.","After all, it was a black dragon—and black dragons were themselves outcasts among dragonkind. They were often ostracized by the dragon clan and branded as evil dragons or demon dragons.","That was because black dragons possessed the hardest dragon scales, rendering them nearly immune to physical attacks. They were also skilled in dark magic and could restrain elemental spells while reducing the damage they dealt.","And yet it had just been poisoned.","It returned to the sky and looked at the beautiful girl in the wedding dress, who wore an innocent expression.","“Oh, I’m sorry, Blackie! My defenses are just too weak. The wind blew against me, so I released just a tiny little bit of poison. Are you all right?”","The look in the black dragon’s eyes became crystal clear. It no longer dared look down at Chu Fu with arrogance.","“No, no, I’m fine! Hahaha, I was only joking, beautiful princess! Someone as lovely as you must have an incredibly noble identity. Please allow me to take you for a ride!”","The giant dragon lowered its proud, unyielding head.","This girl must be just as despicable and shameless as her master—an exceptionally powerful human who was skilled at playing tricks.","Damn these humans.","They always picked on the honest dragons.","And this little human girl in white was way too savage!","Best not to mess with her.","Chu Fu nodded in satisfaction. Blackie really was a bully who picked on the weak—but at least he knew how to read the situation!","She flew onto the dragon’s back and sat down in the dragon saddle.","Calling it a dragon saddle was a bit of a stretch. It looked more like a small terrace, complete with a golden Western-style chair.","Once Chu Fu was seated, Chu Feng lowered the safety bar.","Blackie immediately let out a mighty roar and circled Thorn City once.","It felt just like riding a roller coaster.","Chu Feng asked in an almost deliberately casual tone, “So? How does it compare to that mecha?”","Chu Fu screamed excitedly.","“It’s a completely different feeling! The mecha was like a futuristic spaceship, while Blackie is more like a roller coaster or a convertible sports car. Blackie is definitely more fun!”","Chu Feng nodded in satisfaction.","His little sister was clearly having more fun riding Blackie.","Girls needed to be raised in abundance; otherwise, someone might trick them away with nothing more than a single piece of candy!","How could a mecha possibly compare to a black dragon?","Just as he was thinking this, the system announced:","【System Announcement: Thorn City is about to be invaded by an undead legion. All players, take heed.】"]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214: Which Demonic Cultivator Is Killing Here Chu Feng's Identity Is Exposed","paragraphs":["[System Announcement: The Undead Legion Invasion has begun. The Contribution Ranking is now active. Participants: 252,378. Preparation quests completed before the battle will also count toward the rankings.]","The first wave of monsters had arrived!","The stench of death and decay drifted through the air and into everyone's nostrils.","Unlike the foul odor of goblins, this stench carried an added chill that sent shivers down the spine.","A pale army of undead advanced.","There were translucent wraiths, rattling skeleton soldiers, grotesque and rotting corpses that moved at a sluggish pace, and carrion birds flying overhead.","Airborne units were the most difficult to deal with.","But in the eyes of the players from Linjiang City, they were all just contribution points.","“Woohoo! We’re taking off!”","The players brought out their third-generation flying wings.","All of them had been made by Shen Chi. They featured kinetic acceleration and jet propulsion, making them much faster.","Chu Fu was still being carried through the sky by Chu Feng!","“Fufu, I’ll take you monster hunting!”","Chu Feng was brimming with confidence. This was his specialty.","The Black Dragon beat its wings, whipping up a fierce gale as it flew toward the tide of pale monsters outside the city. Among them advanced a gigantic skeleton that stood a full five meters tall. Every step it took sent the skeletons around it flying.","The Skeleton King!","Blackie immediately stretched out its dragon neck.","“Whoosh!”","Dragon breath!","In an instant, a terrifying stream of dragon breath—one hundred times more powerful than the one he had used to blow Chu Fu away earlier—erupted from its mouth.","The Skeleton King was blasted back more than a hundred meters. The terrifying attack sent the boss tumbling over twenty meters, while the monsters around it were instantly wiped out.","The Skeleton King’s health bar poured down like floodgates had been opened, vanishing in the blink of an eye.","[System Notification: “Lu Xing” has slain the Undead Legion boss, Skeleton King. The entire party has been awarded 3 free attribute points.]","A level-21 boss was completely outmatched before the level-60 Blackie.","Chu Feng had not even needed to lift a finger. His level had now reached 40, and these monsters simply were not worth his effort.","But while he did not attack, Chu Fu was making full use of the opportunity to farm contribution points.","Black Death Cataclysm!","Black Death Cataclysm corroded the soul, making it exceptionally effective against the Undead Legion.","[System Notification: Your Black Death Cataclysm has triggered the Seed of Calamity passive and received a tenfold enhancement.]","“Oh! What great luck!”","The Seed of Calamity was a probabilistic ability. It did not trigger every time she used a skill.","Besides, she had recently been fighting mostly with Spirit Seed.","The special effect of this class did not have a high activation rate, let alone a tenfold enhancement.","Yet the effect of a skill amplified ten times was truly terrifying.","Three kilometers east of the city, the area instantly became a silent land of death.","A terrifying black cloud shrouded the region and rapidly expanded.","With Chu Fu’s current mental strength, the normal diameter of Black Death Cataclysm’s area of effect was 500 meters.","That was already a very large range for a Cataclysm skill.","But after the tenfold enhancement, it became even larger.","It expanded to five kilometers!","Fortunately, they had already moved to a position six kilometers outside the city in order to kill the monsters ahead of time.","The terrifying disaster spread as black mist, reaching the trenches the players had built. Not a single undead emerged from the surging darkness.","They were all dead.","The black mist expanded into the sky, like a column of black smoke shooting upward, killing all the carrion birds flying above.","The scene was simply too horrifying.","The players in the eastern district all went wild.","[Map]: “What just happened? Which demon is undergoing heavenly tribulation here?”","[Map]: “Did I cross over into another world? Is this actually a cultivation game? The dragon vein has been destroyed, and demonic energy is soaring into the heavens! The mortal realm has descended into purgatory!”","[Map]: “Oh my god! This is scarier than a sandstorm. The entire world went silent in an instant. I can’t even hear the clatter of bones anymore.”","[Map]: “That must be the Plant Boss’s Black Death Cataclysm, right? Just another routine move from a god-tier player. Don’t panic—I’m heading somewhere else to grab monsters.”","At this point, it was not only the other players who were shocked.","Blackie had tucked its tail between its legs and fled as well. It could feel that terrifying aura of death, and even its soul trembled.","It knew it! It had been right all along!","That delicate little sister in the white dress and white wedding gown...","She was black-hearted too!","How terrifying!","It broke into a mad dash and headed toward the southern part of the city.","Chu Feng was momentarily stunned as well.","“Fufu, that skill of yours is incredibly powerful!”","Chu Fu blinked and replied modestly, “It was just a coincidence. There’s a chance it can double in power, and this time I triggered the maximum effect. Not only did the area expand tenfold, but it can also remain in place for over an hour!”","Chu Fu showed Chu Feng the skill description.","Chu Feng nodded.","It seemed she had simply gotten lucky.","“Come on. Let’s keep going!”","Of course, the Black Dragon knew exactly what “keep going” meant. It had already flown to the Wraith King in the southern part of the city.","It unleashed another breath of dragon fire. Wraith-type bosses could not be blown away, but their health bars still plummeted.","It was not killed instantly.","Chu Fu also aimed at the boss and cast Black Death Cataclysm.","[System Notification: Your Black Death Cataclysm has triggered the Seed of Calamity passive and received a tenfold enhancement.]","???","The terrifying black mist once again shrouded the surrounding area.","[System Notification: “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” has slain the Undead Legion boss, Wraith King. The entire party has been awarded 3 free attribute points.]","The players on the map erupted in cheers.","[Map]: “The Plant Boss is still the strongest! Hurry, don’t let Lu Xing steal the bosses. These are all bosses for Thorn City!”","[Map]: “Exactly! Lu Xing may be powerful, but he doesn’t carry us. The players from the Thorn Guild really do take us through dungeons, and they even give equipment to beginners. Sob... I’m so touched! I’ll support the Thorn Guild forever! I’ll always support the Plant Boss!”","[Map]: “Uh... is there a chance that Lu Xing and the Plant Boss are actually in the same party? They clearly know each other. The Plant Boss is even riding on his Black Dragon right now.”","[Map]: “The number-one player on the rankings and the president of the number-one guild? They look perfect together!”","That would never do. This Tomato absolutely would not allow any incestuous shipping.","Chu Fu hurriedly sent a message on the map, though she did not use the public announcement channel. That would have seemed far too deliberate.","[Map] [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “Please don’t spread rumors about things that don’t exist. Starbane is my brother’s friend and is only here to help us. That already shows great consideration on his part, so please don’t make things difficult for anyone.”","Just as Chu Fu sent that message, Chu Feng’s reply appeared.","[Map] [Lu Xing]: “She’s my younger sister. We’re related by blood. Stop making wild guesses.”","The moment that message appeared, the map chat exploded once again.","One of them had said he was her brother’s friend, while the other had called her his younger sister and even said they were related by blood.","Which one of them was telling the truth?","Chu Fu also stared at Chu Feng in shock.","You’re giving up your disguise?","Chu Feng looked back at her and gently rubbed her head.","“Tell everyone that you have a brother watching your back. This isn’t some stray cat or dog that can just mess with you!”","As for the official authorities...","He did not want to deal with them. What could they possibly do to him?","He had already reached a point where no one could threaten or coerce him.","However, Chu Fu hesitated.","“Big Brother, are you sure you’re protecting me? On the future map, it looks like you’ve offended the top experts from every country!”"]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215: Cousin, Reasonable, the Arrived Guild of Military Souls Thought the City Was Destroyed","paragraphs":["Chu Feng’s expression stiffened.","That did seem to be the case!","Moreover, all the dungeons Chu Feng had conquered had effectively made enemies of everyone.","Quite a few people were cursing him behind his back.","If Chu Feng admitted now that he was Chu Fu’s brother, wouldn’t some people think Chu Fu was atoning for her brother’s sins?","And wouldn’t they end up cursing Chu Fu as well?","Just as Chu Feng was hesitating over whether to explain, Chu Fu grabbed his arm.","“Haha, but who cares! If we’ve made enemies, then so be it. I’ll help Big Brother beat them up!”","On the map, people who trusted Chu Fu and Chu Feng began defending Chu Fu.","[Map]: “Whoa, a front-row group photo! The Starbane boss and the Plant Boss are actually relatives!”","[Map]: “Probably the kind of distant relatives who share a bloodline but are separated by countless branches of the family tree.”","[Map]: “The Plant Boss used to be in a vegetative state, too! She probably didn’t know anything back then. I’m guessing Starbane is just more familiar with her brother.”","[Map]: “Speaking of which, why have we never seen the Plant Boss’s brother join the Thorn Guild or play with them?”","[Map]: “I know! I’ve seen him before. The Plant Boss’s brother is incredibly powerful too. In the Future Map event, he was called My Sis Is the Cutest in the Universe. He’s absolutely a sis-con, and he’s completely different from Starbane. They’re definitely not the same person.”","As the rumor spread, Chu Feng went from being Chu Fu’s biological brother to her cousin!","But that was fine, too. It saved Chu Feng from exposing his identity in real life while allowing him to protect Chu Fu and stand up for her openly.","However, some people in the team began to grow thoughtful as they watched the heated discussion on the map.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao suddenly understood.","Damn!","So the sis-con boss was Starbane!","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao had been the first person to come into contact with Chu Feng.","Not only did she have Chu Feng’s phone number and often ask him questions, but after rescuing Chu Fu, she had also gone with Chu Feng to purchase Wangxi Manor.","When Chu Feng had made his move back then, he had bought half the manor in one go. Where had he gotten so much money?","At the same time, Lu Xing had publicly auctioned off a guild token and sold it to the president of the Niuqi Guild. That guild was now one of the major guilds in Linjiang City.","Everything suddenly made sense.","Shen Chi understood as well.","No wonder the other person’s aura had seemed so familiar at the time.","It turned out that the person was actually Starbane.","As for why he had guessed it so quickly, that was because Shen Chi understood Chu Feng too!","Chu Feng took excellent care of Chu Fu. Although they usually didn’t play together, defending the city was extremely dangerous. As someone capable of providing the Poison Dragon Set and resurrection spells, how could Chu Feng not come and help?","Therefore, there was only one possibility:","He had already arrived.","Within the team, Chu Feng’s former teammates also began putting the pieces together.","Xie Lin felt his scalp go numb.","He remembered how, when they had fought the boss together earlier, he had deliberately blocked Starbane’s line of sight from the Plant Girl.","He had really done something incredibly stupid.","Hopefully, Big Brother wouldn’t hold it against him!","Chu Feng truly hadn’t cared.","Once he saw everyone change the subject, he stopped dwelling on it and refocused on the siege battle.","He took Chu Fu to the western and northern parts of the city.","However, the bosses had already been killed.","[System Notification: “Rocket on a Wheelchair” has slain the Death Legion Boss, Corpse King. All team members are rewarded with 3 free attribute points.]","[System Notification: “Who Are You Calling Blind?” has slain the Death Legion Boss, Corpse Crow King. All team members are rewarded with 3 free attribute points.]","The first wave of bosses had all been taken down.","Although Chu Fu hadn’t managed to claim any of the monsters, she still cast two more Black Death Disasters.","The Seeds of Calamity had gone wild today!","They had received the same tenfold amplification.","“Fu Fu, does this skill have a hundred percent success rate?” Chu Feng asked suspiciously as he looked at Chu Fu.","His little sister’s skill was far too powerful!","“Of course not!”","Chu Fu herself couldn’t figure it out, but she still offered a guess.","“Maybe it’s because the undead army carries too many death and darkness elements.","“My Black Death Disaster sounds quite similar to an undead calamity, too. So under special conditions, its amplification becomes much stronger.”","If that was the case, then Chu Fu could fight differently depending on the situation.","The Plague Disaster could be used against flesh-and-blood enemies.","The Black Death Disaster could be used against mechanical enemies.","There was no way to tell what the Toxic Disaster was good for yet, but Chu Fu felt that if she released it into water...","Heh heh heh!","Chu Fu already had six hundred Gatling Corn Elves. Combined with the release of these four Black Death Disaster skills, she didn’t even need to fight herself. She could simply wait and collect the contribution points.","However, there were simply too many monsters in the Death Legion—ten times more than the goblins.","In other words, every wave contained one hundred million undead troops attacking endlessly.","Just moving into position took a full two hours.","The siege battle’s time limit had also changed. It was no longer an automatic failure if the monsters couldn’t be cleared within twenty-four hours.","Now, they had three days.","But Chu Fu didn’t need that much time.","Any monsters that reached her would be instantly killed.","After two hours, the first wave of monsters had been completely wiped out.","The break between waves had been reduced to half an hour.","Shen Chi piloted his mecha around the battlefield, absorbing the equipment, materials, and copper coins.","The accumulated copper coins alone were converted into 3,000 gold coins, half of which had been earned by Chu Fu herself.","All the loot was scattered across the Thorn Guild’s plaza, where the logistics players naturally sorted it out.","The monsters encountered during the siege battle were all level twenty-one. The minor monsters only dropped bronze equipment, while the bosses dropped silver equipment and, at most, one piece of gold equipment. They were incredibly stingy.","The equipment could only be broken down into materials.","The experience, however, was extremely generous.","All the low-level players leveled up together.","During the brief intermission, a group of players riding bone dragons flew over from the horizon.","Fortunately, after the previous incident with the black dragon, everyone could clearly see the people riding on the bone dragons.","They were acquaintances.","It was the president of the Military Soul Guild, Laoji Fuli.","The Military Soul Guild had sent five thousand people. After rushing nonstop, they had finally arrived within fifty kilometers of Thorn City in two hours.","But even from that distance, they could see the black clouds blotting out the sky, along with the enormous rift that was constantly spewing undead creatures. The sheer number of monsters was shocking.","Such a massive undead army, combined with those towering black clouds in the distance...","Could Thorn City have already been destroyed?","Once the spatial rift stopped releasing monsters, he understood that the first wave of the siege had entered its rest period.","Naturally, Laoji Fuli didn’t dare enter the Origin-level dungeon within the rift.","He hurriedly led his people through the gaps between the black fog and entered Thorn City.","[8888 Server, Thorn City] [World Peacekeeper]: “Is everyone all right? The Military Soul Guild has come to provide support!”","The map immediately erupted in enthusiastic replies.","[Map]: “You came at just the right time. Though, honestly, we don’t really need the help.”","[Map]: “The bosses from the Military Soul Guild are all official players, so don’t say that! Welcome, welcome!”","[Map]: “Thank you for coming to support us, and thank you, Old General!”","[Map] [World Peacekeeper]: “You’re thanking Old General, but not Middle-aged General?”","Chu Fu also went to greet them.","Li Weizheng hurriedly asked her, “Student Chu, what are these black clouds outside? Are they a special effect of the siege battle? How powerful are they?”"]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216: Li Wei Strives to Take Notes, Chu Fu's Powerful Butterfly Effect","paragraphs":["Li Weizheng took out his notebook and prepared to record everything carefully.","Thorn City was the first city to face a city defense battle.","In the future, all one thousand servers and cities in China would have to face the same problem.","That was why this battle was such valuable intelligence.","There was nothing wrong with tagging along for the rewards.","More importantly, they needed to gather enough information to prepare for what was coming.","What would the monsters in the first wave be? What about the boss? He still had no idea.","And then there was that terrifying black fog, which looked almost like a forbidden spell.","Could it strengthen the undead legion?","Chu Fu gave him a shy smile.","“You mean that? That’s one of my skills. It’s just a little big and a little powerful, that’s all. It lasts for a little over an hour before disappearing, and I need to keep replenishing it. It’s barely usable!”","Li Weizheng: “...”","Was it really just “a little”?","Did she mean a little in the sense of one hundred million or two hundred million?","He had estimated the area covered by the fog and felt that it was larger than half the city walls.","With strength like Chu Fu’s, what kind of undead disaster could possibly withstand her?","Still, he asked Chu Fu about the city defense battle.","This time, Chu Fu did not hold anything back. She told Li Weizheng everything she knew, including the events that would appear according to the storyline.","“I was noticed by the God of the Undead because I collected the blueprints required to upgrade a village into a town, expanded Thorn Town until each side was ten kilometers long, and brought it up to city standards.","“Then I used a city upgrade blueprint to turn it into a proper city, which triggered the city defense battle.","“Based on the intelligence I gathered, city defense battles will most likely begin two months from now.","“The exact date is the hundredth day after the game launches.","“So the city defense battles won’t take place one after another. They’ll all happen at the same time!”","The game’s regions continued to open, so the village defense battles were different for every village.","Towns only appeared after different regions were merged, so town defense battles also varied.","Cities, however, had been there from the beginning.","Each server corresponded to one city.","Linjiang City corresponded to Server 8888.","There were ten thousand servers worldwide, and China occupied one thousand of them.","If all one thousand servers faced city invasions at the same time, which city could they support?","That would depend on how each city had developed.","“If we want to change this situation, the only option is to stagger the city defense battles.","“We need to arrange things so that every major city has at least one hundred thousand level-thirty players before the two-month deadline.”","Li Weizheng carefully wrote all of this down.","After hearing Chu Fu’s words, he took a deep breath and nodded.","“I understand. I’ll report this to my superiors exactly as you’ve told me,” Li Weizheng said solemnly.","Chu Fu knew how difficult this would be.","In the timeline where Chu Feng had been reborn, this would have been impossible.","But Chu Fu had awakened, and the world was no longer the same as before.","The influence she brought with her was growing greater by the day.","As far as the overall situation was concerned, her first major contribution had been the Wangxi Village model.","She had created a perfect village defense strategy, leading China’s analysts to study and imitate it.","The authorities had stepped in and strictly prohibited verbal abuse, malicious killing, and organized monopolies in the game.","As a result, most regions opened after Region 030 had official personnel involved, and the survival rate for newcomers was around eighty-five percent.","The second major development was the recently launched “Operation to Counterinvade the Goblin City.”","China’s analysts had given it the codename Operation Dark Gold.","...","Inside China’s analysis bureau.","As soon as Li Weizheng’s message arrived, the analysts began making rapid calculations.","Before long, they had worked out a feasible strategy.","“Leader, Operation Dark Gold is currently being carried out across the country. If what Plantman said is true, then we need to target specific cities and repeatedly increase the number of Primordial-tier dungeon runs.","“The experience from Primordial-tier goblins isn’t affected by the restriction that prevents players from gaining experience from monsters more than five levels below them, and the experience rewards are extremely high.","“Assuming level-twenty-five players enter the Primordial-tier Goblin dungeon, at least sixty percent of them should reach level thirty.","“In theory, if around thirty thousand players from a single town participate in the battle, nearly twenty thousand of them could reach level thirty.","“Furthermore, a town defense battle like this only needs to be fought five times for the town to produce one hundred thousand level-thirty players.","“Nowadays, because villages opened after Region 030 have such high newcomer retention rates, most of them are merged from two or three regions into a single town.","“Under those circumstances, we would only need five towns to completely clear the Primordial-tier dungeon and gather one hundred thousand level-thirty players.","“That means we could begin the first town defense battles in as little as half a month.","“After that, we could proceed in batches and have all one thousand servers complete the process in stages.","“However, there’s still one variable...”","“What variable?”","“Whether Plantman will run the Primordial-tier dungeon.","“General Ji has already passed by that dungeon. It’s called the ‘Source of the Undead Calamity.’","“If Plantman clears it, they may be able to obtain even higher-grade equipment.","“What if the equipment from that dungeon is diamond-grade?","“That would mean at least one hundred thousand pieces of diamond-grade equipment, each at least level twenty or higher.","“With that equipment, level-twenty players could reliably clear the Primordial-tier Goblin dungeon.”","By then, they would win through sheer statistical superiority.","Of course, the other analysts were not optimistic.","“Actually, we can tell from the rewards of the town- and city-level dungeons that the increase isn’t particularly dramatic. Diamond-grade equipment is extremely rare.","“The most likely possibility is that the dungeon drops level-thirty dark-gold equipment.","“However, it would still be stronger than the level-twenty dark-gold Barbarian Set dropped by the goblins.","“Each piece adds twenty attribute points, and there are fifteen pieces in a full set. That’s a difference of three hundred attribute points, so the gap is indeed enormous.”","The head of the analysis bureau nodded.","At the same time, he rubbed his chin.","“But if the Primordial-tier dungeons are all real dungeons, then do the skeletons have equipment?”","Countless possibilities were being recorded in the bureau’s reports.","At present, the only way to verify any of them was for Chu Fu and the others to clear the dungeon.","No matter how much analysis they did, it was still no substitute for practical experience.","...","Thorn City.","Monsters surged forward like a tidal wave, only to be completely wiped out.","The battle dragged on for an extremely long time.","Repeatedly casting high-level spells emptied the players’ mana. Taking potions nonstop also increased their drug resistance, making it impossible for them to recover properly.","Most importantly, the players below level thirty who were using gaming helmets had no way to take their physical condition into account.","After playing at such a high intensity, their bladders and stomachs were both sending out desperate warning signals.","Yet every one of them persisted.","“We absolutely can’t log off! We have to follow the boss into the Primordial-tier dungeon!”","“A gaming pod only costs a million! Don’t tell me you can’t even come up with a hundred silver coins?”","“Brother, I only entered Thorn City today. My family’s on welfare. Both my parents are disabled, and I have leukemia. I really don’t have any money!”","“Don’t say another word, brother. Take these hundred silver coins. The moment you log off, go buy another gaming pod!”","“I’ve got another hundred silver coins here. Use them to arrange one for your parents, too!”","“Thank you, big brothers and sisters, but I really can’t take any more. This is enough—there’s already too much!”","“Take it. It’s our way of showing we care. Don’t worry about how you spend it. Even if you eat lobster in the real world, we won’t say a word!","“But in the game, hurry up and reach level thirty. Get your body healthy again. Once you do, come join my team. We’ll play together.”","Chu Fu noticed this too."]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217: Secret Weapon Slays Stars, Cutting Through the Origin-Level Undead Calamity (Please Give a Five-Star Review)","paragraphs":["Originally, Chu Fu had planned to enter the Primordial-tier instance after clearing the ninth wave.","But now, she felt that missing two waves of monsters was nothing!","The most important thing was to make sure every player—especially the newcomers—could enter the instance.","Otherwise, if they were kicked offline halfway through, wouldn’t that be a disaster?","Nothing was more important than the Primordial-tier instance.","But before that, they had to deal with one problem.","The werewolf, Tuge!","This time, however, Chu Fu didn’t need to act.","Chu Feng alone was enough!","Then, just as the seventh wave of monsters attacked, Chu Fu issued a city lord announcement.","[Server 8888—Thorny City] [Thorny City Lord] [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “All players who do not belong to a guild, please take note. Proceed immediately to the eastern area of the city and prepare to enter the Primordial-tier instance. Guild members, with the exception of guild leaders, are to remain behind and continue defending the city. Clear out the remaining monsters and wait for entry into the Primordial-tier instance.”","Since the instance was entered through guilds, as long as Chu Fu, Laoji Fuli, and Lin Haowan applied to enter, the guild members would naturally enter with them.","But the other players could not.","Moreover, the distance was fifty kilometers, and it would take time to travel there.","They had to enter the instance during the thirty-minute waiting period after all the monsters had been eliminated.","Therefore, the unaffiliated players needed to prepare in advance.","This was their first time tackling a level-30 Primordial-tier instance.","They had no idea how terrifying the monsters’ strength would be.","Chu Fu didn’t dare let the other guilds and unaffiliated players enter separate rifts on their own.","So, she decided to have everyone enter through the eastern rift together.","They also had to kill the undead armies from all four directions within thirty minutes.","Otherwise, the undead armies might duplicate themselves and attack Thorny City.","Even the protective barrier wouldn’t be able to hold if that happened.","Fortunately, Chu Fu still had a trump card!","Her brother!","That was why Chu Fu planned to lead the others into the rift to the east.","Chu Feng would enter the rift to the west.","Afterward, they would assess the difficulty and decide whether to split up.","An hour later, all the players without guilds had gathered to the east of the city.","Feng Huimin activated command mode.","[War Horn]","[One Heart, One Legion]","[Rapid Formation March]","Two hundred and twenty thousand players were forcibly organized into a single formation, forming a square half a kilometer across.","The formation advanced, and wherever it passed, the seventh wave of undead creatures was actually wiped out.","The group marched for a full hour before arriving at the rift fifty kilometers away.","This speed was not slow at all—in fact, it was quite fast.","They were traveling on foot at a speed comparable to a small car.","They then surrounded the rift and killed every monster that emerged, assaulting it for a full hour.","The monsters that appeared from the rift stopped respawning.","Soon, they heard a system announcement.","[The seventh wave of monsters has been completely cleared. In thirty minutes, the Undead Legion will organize the eighth wave and launch an attack on the city.]","There would be no eighth wave!","Chu Fu activated the Spirit Forest Passage and followed it to Feng Huimin’s side.","At the same time, she fixed her gaze on the rift.","[System Notification: Enter the special public instance, Source of the Undead Calamity (Primordial)?]","“Enter!”","In an instant, every player inside Thorny City entered the instance.","As Feng Huimin left, ordinary players immediately felt all the buffs that had been strengthening them disappear.","“Commander Feng has entered the instance! Brothers, charge!”","Everyone entered the instance.","Laoji Fuli and Lin Haowan entered as well.","In an instant, Thorny City became an empty city.","However, the powerful protective barrier and the soldiers stationed on the walls continued to guard the city.","Inside the rift, entering it gave them an environment completely different from the Goblin City.","The land was filled with deathly energy, with not a single plant in sight. Everything was pitch-black, and the air reeked of rot. The sky was gray-black, like storm clouds about to unleash a torrential downpour, pressing down heavily on everyone’s hearts.","What surprised Chu Fu was that there were no duplication crystals.","Instead, there were countless magic arrays, along with large numbers of necromancers and liches.","After thinking about it carefully, the reason became clear.","Goblins had no ability to duplicate anything, which was why they needed duplication crystals.","The undead armies, on the other hand, were summoned by necromancers and liches.","Every one of these necromancers might possess the strength of the Lich King from Destroy the Undead Calamity.","“If that’s all this instance has to offer, then I’ve already cleared it!”","Chu Fu raised her staff.","The Black Death Calamity erupted!","With a tenfold calamity amplification, it instantly enveloped the army of necromancers before her.","The bones began to sizzle as they corroded. The necromancers had encountered their natural nemesis.","However, the defense of these necromancers was extremely formidable. Even with the attack power of Chu Fu’s Black Death Calamity, it still took a full five minutes to poison them to death within the calamity.","But these necromancers and liches possessed human intelligence. They would not simply stand there and take the attack.","They began summoning bone dragons and flew out of the range of the black calamity.","That move, however, scattered the necromancers and gave Feng Huimin an opening to attack.","Feng Huimin commanded the team.","“Everyone, follow my orders! Prepare your area-of-effect attacks. Focus fire on a single zone and clear out one group first!”","The location she marked was instantly flooded by countless skills.","In the blink of an eye, thirty necromancers were killed.","The players from the Thorny Guild accounted for eighty percent of the damage.","At the same time, countless shield warriors and guards charged forward and tightly bound the mages and liches, preventing them from summoning any more monsters.","Seeing this, Chu Fu felt that she was no longer needed here.","“Wheelchair Brother, let’s go to the northern area!”","“Okay!”","Shen Chi opened the chest compartment of his mecha.","Chu Fu flew inside.","Apart from Lu An, Holy Healing Angel, and Feng Huimin, everyone else entered the mecha.","Shen Chi did not use the spatial-jump function, since he was unfamiliar with the spatial coordinates here.","However, he could teleport instantly to any location within his line of sight.","After doing so dozens of times, he crossed the fifty kilometers and arrived at the northern area.","Now it was their turn to begin fighting the army of necromancers.","At the same time, Chu Feng entered the spatial rift to the west.","It was Chu Feng’s first time entering a Primordial-tier instance, and he was rather excited.","He quickly traversed the spatial tunnel and arrived in the Land of the Undead.","The mages and Lich Kings before him did not notice Chu Feng at all.","Seeing this, Chu Feng let out a cold laugh and vanished from the spot.","An assassin had entered the midst of a group of mages.","It was like a wolf walking into a flock of sheep.","Chu Feng entered stealth, then appeared behind one of the liches. His dagger flashed like a blur.","At the same time, countless cold afterimages appeared around him.","His dagger had a splash-damage effect, dealing damage equal to eighty percent of his main body’s damage!","And his damage was explosive.","In just five seconds, he had emptied the ten-billion health bars of the necromancers and the thirty-billion health bars of the liches.","In less than three minutes, the twenty-five thousand monsters had been completely wiped out by Chu Feng.","“A Primordial-tier instance? That’s it?”","“Master, you’re simply too powerful. These little skeleton mages aren’t worth your attention!”","Chu Feng did not contradict him.","He really was that powerful.","Afterward, he continued onward, helping his younger sister completely wipe out the necromancer forces in the southern part of the city.","The area was open for only six minutes.","Chu Fu still hadn’t managed to organize those people in six minutes!","That was the advantage of being a lone wolf.","He didn’t need to worry about anyone else at all.","After finishing off the enemies, Chu Feng began moving toward the center.","After traveling several dozen kilometers, he saw the enemy’s... a tower?"]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218: A True Poisonous Person Is Not Afraid of Death, Oli Gei","paragraphs":["The Lich Tower!","It was the equivalent of a Mage Tower.","In the game, only Grandmasters above level 60 could build one.","The divine envoy of the Goblin City was level 50.","The owner of this Lich Tower was level 60, so it was perfectly normal.","There were also large numbers of monsters surrounding the Lich Tower, including bone dragons, headless knights, dark master-apprentice pairs, shadow assassins, and more.","They guarded the Lich Tower as they patrolled the area.","Chu Feng didn’t regard these undead creatures as a threat at all. The only thing that posed any real danger to him was the Lich Tower itself.","“Blackie, go scout it out!”","Chu Feng ordered the black dragon forward.","Blackie went reluctantly, but it wasn’t afraid. It was level 65, an extremely rare black dragon with extraordinarily high magic resistance. It had even mastered the dark element.","What was there to fear?","It immediately charged forward.","The next moment, a beam of black light erupted from inside the Lich Tower and struck the black dragon in an instant.","Instant Death Black Ray!","In that split second, the attack dealt terrifying damage, making the black dragon let out a howl as its health plummeted by a third.","That wasn’t all. The Lich Tower began rotating, and another black beam shot out, striking the black dragon once more!","Two more hits and it would be dead.","At that moment, the black dragon fled in panic.","Chu Feng was speechless.","Useless.","It hadn’t managed to find out anything at all. Instead, it had been scared off.","Chu Feng transformed into a shadow and instantly approached the Mage Tower, searching for any cracks in its defenses.","However, he knew full well that Lich Towers of this kind required immense destructive power to break through their formations and enter.","Otherwise, the Lich Tower itself was a terrifying mobile fortress capable of launching attacks.","One lich and one tower could win an entire battle.","Fortunately, Chu Feng had the Shadow Shield. The Instant Death Black Ray could only withstand one attack when it struck his shield.","While the shield was active, he unleashed a furious barrage of attacks, causing the Lich Tower’s defensive barrier to tremble repeatedly.","The moment the shield vanished, he immediately turned invisible and retreated far away.","He continued to struggle with the Mage Tower.","Meanwhile, Chu Fu and the others wiped out the liches and undead mage corps in the eastern and southern parts of the city.","“We’re rich! We’re rich!”","This time, every undead mage in the undead army had provided a complete set of dark-gold equipment.","As for the Lich Kings, each had at least one diamond-grade piece of equipment.","Even if there were only a hundred Lich Kings in the entire army, that still meant a hundred level-30 diamond-grade items.","The only downside was that they were all magic-type equipment.","However, these magic items weren’t restricted to divine envoys. Level-30 players could equip them directly.","That was fantastic.","“Quickly! Once you’re finished here, Wheelchair Brother, go to the western and northern parts of the city. Brother Star-Slayer has already wiped out the undead armies there, but the equipment hasn’t been collected yet!”","Even the bones of the undead army’s monsters were valuable materials.","Shen Chi’s vacuum machine had been enhanced by the power of the Evil God, giving it even more functions.","It could suck up all the corpses.","It made clearing the battlefield much faster.","Shen Chi did as instructed, while Chu Fu opened a Forest Spirit Passage.","One of her elves was still following Chu Feng!","Soon, the passage opened, and Chu Fu led the remaining members of the team to Chu Feng’s location.","Ever since they had obtained the Forest Spirit Passage, the team’s support and mobility had improved tremendously. They no longer had to rely entirely on Shen Chi.","Moreover, if Chu Fu and the others teleported to a location and reported its exact coordinates, Shen Chi could use the positions of his teammates to pinpoint the location and provide precise support.","The team’s combat methods had become far more varied.","Before long, Chu Fu brought the remaining teammates to Chu Feng’s side.","Chu Feng happened to be attacking the Lich Tower. When he saw a spatial passage made of green vines and flower wreaths appear beside him, he immediately realized it was his sister’s skill.","Oh no!","He had dragged his little sister into trouble again.","“Be careful! Get out of the way!”","Chu Feng shouted.","Chu Fu heard him from inside the passage as well.","However, the Forest Spirit Passage couldn’t last much longer.","Fortunately, Chu Fu had a trump card.","“I’ll go out first. Act according to the situation!”","She instantly released 300 plants and then fused them all together, transforming into a gigantic green plant creature.","Then she stepped out of the passage.","Undead creatures surrounded her from every direction, while a towering structure stood directly before her. Chu Fu found herself caught between the two sides.","A terrifying beam of black light struck Chu Fu, piercing through her enormous body. A huge hole split open across her waist and abdomen, nearly erasing half her chest. Even her heart was pierced through!","The horrifying injury emptied Chu Fu’s health bar.","Yet the portrait representing Chu Fu in the team did not turn gray.","Her health had been locked at 1 point.","SSS-Rank Venomous Human Trait 5: Poisonous Corpse Feigned Death.","An immense amount of poison controlled Chu Fu’s body, allowing her to continue fighting for another hour.","“So you’re attacking me, huh? Let’s see how you’re going to attack me this time!”","Chu Fu tightened her grip on her staff and swung it furiously.","It was the first time she had ever been killed instantly.","Fortunately, she had plenty of trump cards.","At that moment, poisonous smoke poured from her waist and abdomen, corroding the black tower’s defensive barrier. Green plant fibers writhed rapidly as well.","The plants fused into her body were withering and dying at high speed.","Through this method, they healed her body, filling in the hole in her abdomen and restoring her heart.","Chu Fu released even more plants and merged them into her body.","The black rays released by the Lich Tower could kill Chu Fu instantly, but she wasn’t afraid of pain or death. The combination of her poisonous-human and plant-human forms made her invincible.","She unleashed a furious barrage of attacks.","Black Death Calamity!","The Calamity Seed erupted with ten times its normal power.","In an instant, the calamity’s might increased tenfold.","Chu Fu manipulated the calamity.","“The range doesn’t need to be so large. Stack all the power into the attack!”","Any skill could be controlled by its caster. As for what form that control took, it depended on the caster’s skill.","Chu Fu’s mental power was like a giant hand, gathering all the calamity’s energy together.","The terrifying black fog seemed to condense into dark clouds before transforming into black liquid that continuously flowed over the Lich Tower.","Sizzle, sizzle, sizzle, sizzle!","The defensive barrier was immediately corroded, leaving behind hole after hole.","The black liquid continued to flow, dripping onto the Lich Tower. The metal composing the tower—crafted from countless layers of sturdy material—was corroded until it was covered in pits and craters.","Black Death Calamity came with a 110% damage increase against buildings (+11% effect amplification).","And Black Death Calamity was only Chu Fu’s first method.","The Venomous Calamity transformed into green water, staining the black tower green.","Six hundred Gatling Corn Elves began bombarding it with a relentless barrage of fire.","Apparently sensing the threat posed by Chu Fu, the black tower suddenly emitted a shriek that made the soul ache.","Lich’s Wail!","Chu Fu remained where she was, continuing her assault.","“What are you screaming for? You think you’re the only one who knows how to scream?”","Soul-Annihilating Calamity!","Another calamity descended, this one carrying a soul attack.","Gray mist enveloped the Mage Tower.","Then came the Plague Calamity.","The Plague Calamity’s “Infect Living Creatures” effect was useless against a defensive barrier?","No problem! Chu Fu immediately made it useful!","Chu Fu waved her staff.","Venomous Burst +11!","In an instant, all the poison erupted.","The four calamities merged into a gigantic pool of poison.","In the blink of an eye, the Lich Tower sank ten meters, plunging into the poisonous pool.","The sound of sizzling continuously rose from below.","Whenever the Lich Tower let out a shriek, even Chu Feng had to avoid meeting it head-on.","But when he turned his head to look...","His little sister had actually transformed into a gigantic green plant creature and was trading blows with the Lich Tower!"]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219: The Scourge Ends, Long Live the Thorns","paragraphs":["The Wizard Tower stood thirty meters tall, the equivalent of a ten-story building.","Now, it had suddenly dropped ten meters, bringing its height down to exactly twenty meters.","And Chu Fu was also twenty meters tall!","At this moment, Chu Feng actually felt a little confused.","Who was the real BOSS here?","Wasn’t his little sister supposed to be the cute type?","How had she become so terrifying?","Putting himself in the place of the creatures inside the Lich Tower, he could already feel the despair of seeing a twenty-meter-tall monster sprawled outside the tower and attacking it furiously.","Moreover, after transforming into a giant, the black beams could only create holes twenty centimeters deep in Chu Fu’s body at most. The damage was quickly filled by plant fibers, healing almost instantly. They were completely useless.","The Wizard Tower crackled and hissed, sounding almost like it was screaming.","Yet its barrier continued pouring in energy, rapidly repairing the enormous holes that had been melted through it.","It was fighting Chu Fu with everything it had.","It failed to notice that, in the sky opposite Chu Fu, someone was flying through the air on a sword.","“Sword Lord of Heaven and Earth!”","In an instant, an enormous phantom appeared around Xie Lin. It looked like him, but was far more imposing.","It was as though the projection of a true god had descended into the mortal world.","He swung his arm, and nine Diamond-grade swords flew out of the sword case.","After that came a hundred Dark Gold-grade swords and ten thousand Gold-grade swords.","“Myriad Swords Unite!”","All the weapons fused together into a gigantic super sword.","“Sword Opens the Primordial Chaos!”","The tip of the giant sword rose, as though someone had lifted it high into the air, and then it suddenly came crashing down!","In the blink of an eye, the gigantic sword cleaved into the Lich Tower.","The barrier let out a crisp crack, like glass shattering. The sound was almost pleasant to the ear.","The giant sword struck the Lich Tower and split a massive, three-meter-wide opening in it.","Toxic fumes surged inside through the breach.","At that moment, the Lich Tower finally shattered.","“How dare you provoke the gods! Die!”","An enraged roar erupted.","A towering skeleton wielding a massive scythe of death leaped out from inside the Wizard Tower.","[Undead Divine Envoy (Origin-level BOSS), Level: 60, HP: 26 billion.]","The Undead Divine Envoy was five meters tall. But Chu Fu was currently a twenty-meter-tall giant, making the scene look like an adult bullying a child.","Chu Fu raised her staff and hit him with two skills.","Seed of Calamity!","Seed of Misfortune!","First, she lowered his Luck stat.","Then she made sure he had a terrible time.","Her attacks immediately drew the attention of the enormous skeleton. He turned to look at Chu Fu, green flames flickering in his pitch-black eye sockets.","“You are already dead!”","The Undead Divine Envoy swung his scythe and pointed it at Chu Fu. A streak of black light struck her.","Chu Fu was completely unafraid.","She had only been transformed into a Plantman for ten minutes. There was no way the other side could kill her instantly.","The Undead Divine Envoy, however, was equally confident.","That was because he had used a curse.","His powerful curse had higher authority than certain instant-death immunity skills. With divine power supporting it, it was certain to eliminate the Plantman who posed the greatest threat to him.","But unexpectedly, after the black light landed on Chu Fu, it did not even stain a thread of her pristine white dress.","Instead, it seemed to encounter something that countered it. In an instant, it rebounded and struck the Undead Divine Envoy.","The Undead Divine Envoy’s soul shook violently. The HP bar above his head was instantly emptied, and a massive black damage number exploded into view.","-260E!","Dead!","The Undead Divine Envoy had actually died.","Chu Feng, Xie Lin, and the other team members, who had been preparing to charge into battle, were all stunned.","“Wait, is this BOSS really that fragile? We haven’t even started fighting yet!”","Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate shouted.","“Could it be because the Wizard Tower was the real body? Starbane had already damaged it almost completely!”","Suture Saint offered.","Chu Feng shook his head.","“No, the BOSS had 26 billion HP, which is exactly what you’d expect from a Divine Envoy-level monster. It couldn’t possibly be this weak. The problem must be with Fu... Plantman, what did you use just now to reflect the BOSS’s damage?”","“If I say it was a coincidence, will you believe me?”","Chu Fu herself was also at a loss for words.","Only she knew what had really happened. There had simply been too many coincidences.","She then sent everyone the system’s skill log.","[You used “Seed of Calamity” on the “Undead Divine Envoy”: Small-skill probability converted into calamity.]","[You used “Seed of Misfortune” on the “Undead Divine Envoy”: Luck -20. The target’s current Luck decreased by 30.]","[The “Undead Divine Envoy” used a curse on you: Judgment of Death!]","[Your Misfortune Reflection (Passive) activated. Judgment of Death reflected successfully!]","[Your Seed of Calamity was activated. The Judgment of Death skill transformed into the super-large-scale calamity skill: Death God’s Decree.]","[Death God’s Decree is a calamity-type skill. The Seed of Disaster passive effect has been triggered, increasing its power tenfold.]","[You killed the Undead Divine Envoy!]","That was how it happened!","Chu Fu had never even developed this combo herself. Yet, through a series of coincidences, it had come together perfectly.","She had reflected a super-powerful BOSS to death.","It wasn’t that Chu Fu’s attack power was especially high.","The Undead Divine Envoy had simply killed himself.","Of course, Chu Fu’s class amplification had also played a part. The boost it provided was simply too powerful.","It had directly emptied the enemy’s HP bar.","At that moment, with the Undead Divine Envoy dead, the countless Bone Dragons, Dark Knights, Undead Mages, and Lich Kings in the surrounding area all began shrieking before dropping dead one after another.","The dungeon had been cleared. Every monster had been wiped out.","...","At the same time, every player inside the dungeon received the same notification.","[You have cleared the dungeon: Source of the Undead Calamity (Origin).]","[Dungeon clear time: 19 minutes and 34 seconds.]","[All participating players have been granted one free revival. All players’ levels have increased by 1, and all attributes have increased by 100 points.]","[The system will grant rewards based on each player’s performance within the dungeon. Rewards will be settled automatically and do not need to be exchanged.]","[Calculating rewards...]","Feng Huimin was leading her team in a mad dash. They had not even reached the central battlefield when the dungeon ended just like that.","“What the heck? Did Starbane make a move? That was so fast!”","“Is this the strength of a top-tier expert?”","“666! I got another 100 points to all attributes just by tagging along. I’m taking off!”","“Damn, hurry up! I need to get back to the city and log off! I wet the bed!”","“Eww...” someone said disdainfully.","Feng Huimin directed the team toward the central area, leading everyone onward.","As they rushed along, the system’s settlement results finally arrived.","Exclamations rang out throughout the team.","“Oh my gosh, I evolved from an ordinary Mage into an Undead Mage!”","“I heard Undead Mage job-change tokens are being sold for as much as 5,000 gold. I got this one for free!”","“My talent advanced!”","“I’ve become an S-grade talent player!”","Everyone chimed in with their own discoveries.","As they discussed their rewards, they realized that more players from the magic classes had advanced this time, while fewer from the warrior classes had done so.","Feng Huimin would never miss an opportunity to build up Thorn City and promote the Thorn Guild.","After receiving 100 points to all attributes, every one of these players would become an elite in the future.","“Everyone, although we didn’t participate in the BOSS battle, every one of us received attributes and rewards.","“This is the generous treatment provided to those affiliated with Thorn City.","“Later, all players with S-grade talents may apply to join the Thorn Guild!”","There’s no need for the other players to feel disappointed either! The Thorn Guild will be expanding into even more ventures!","Thorn City is recruiting guards, patrol officers, and all kinds of merchants. In the future, Thorn City will be built by you and me!","Let us raise our voices together! Long live Thorn City!”","The next moment, a thunderous cheer rang out across the silent land of the undead.","“Long live Thorn City!!!”"]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220: New and Old Protagonist Group 03","paragraphs":["This chapter isn’t part of the main story! It’s free bonus content, so whether you read it or not won’t affect your reading experience!","【ID: Who Wants to Be a Plant?","Talents: Plant Person (SSS), Poison Person (SSS)","First Class: Goddess of Calamity (Unique God-Tier)","Calamity Skill Tree:","[Deadly Poison Calamity] [Swamp Calamity] [Plague Calamity] [Black Death Calamity] [Soul-Annihilating Calamity]","[Poison God’s Body (Evolves at Skill Level 10)]","[Poison God’s Wings (Skill Level 30)]","Disaster Skill Tree:","[Seed of Disaster] [Seed of Misfortune] [Misfortune Reflection] [Sowing Calamity (a transformed version of Poison Spreading, allowing Seeds of Disaster and Seeds of Misfortune to be scattered over a wide area)]","Second Class: Seed of the Forest Spirit (Hidden Class)","Skills: [Forest Spirit Contract] [Verdure Rejuvenation] [Forest Spirit Channel] [Forest Spirit Collection] [Forest Spirit Pounce]】","......","【ID: Rocket on a Wheelchair","Talents: Mechanical Modification (SSS), Metal Manipulation (SSS)","First Class: God of Mechanics (God-Tier Class)","Second Class: Metal Manipulator (Special Class)","Current mech height: 25 meters.】","......","【ID: Who Are You Calling Blind?","Talents: Mind’s Eye (SSS), Myriad Swords Return to One (SSS)","Class: Sword God (Unique God-Tier)","Current weapon: Once Myriad Swords Return to One merges all the swords, it can evolve to Epic tier.】","......","【ID: Jiaojiao Not Delicate","Talents: Fearless Body (SSS), Mother Earth (SS)","Class Advancement: Earthshielder (Hidden Class)】","......","【ID: Suture Saint","Talents: Thousand Hands to Salvation (SSS), Extra-Legal Avatar (SS)","Class: Medical Saint (Hidden Class)】","......","【ID: Doggo Sneaky","Talent: Master Thief (S)","Class: Thief (Common Class)","Note: There may be a storyline for this character in the next volume.】","......","【ID: Eighteen Stabs","Talent 1: Spirit of Vengeance (SSS)","Talent 2: Bloodlust (S)","Class: Blood Vengeance Assassin (Hidden Class)】","......","【ID: Dancer Tianlan:","Talent: Thousand-Spiral Illusory Body (SS)","Class: Illusion Dancer (Hidden Class)】","......","【ID: All-Purpose Professor Zongan","Talent: Omniscience and Omnipotence (SS)","Class: All-Element Mage (Hidden Class)】","......","【ID: A Leader for Life","Talent: Lord Template (SS)","Class: Fortress Guardian (Hidden Class)","Note: An important supporting character whose top-tier tank class surpasses Lu An’s. He will undergo a second class advancement later, and his class is extremely powerful.】","......","【ID: Orthopedic Surgeon Director Chen","Talent 1: Bone-Setting Restoration (SS)","Talent 2: Bone Shatter (S)","Class 1: Orthopedic Saint (Hidden Class)","Class 2: Bone-Shattering Butcher (Special Class)","Note: An important supporting character. His talents were slightly revised earlier in the story. He has two classes: one for saving people, plus the additional Bone-Shattering Butcher class.】","......","Current party of 20:","1. 【Who Wants to Be a Plant?】","2. 【Rocket on a Wheelchair】","3. 【Who Are You Calling Blind?】","4. 【Jiaojiao Not Delicate】","5. 【Suture Saint】","6. 【Shafu Liangu】","7. 【Zhimengzhe】","8. 【Little Sister Wu】","9. 【Wu Yingchun】","10. 【Bitter Melon King】","11. 【Dream King】","12. 【Commander Feng Huimin】","13. 【Twelve-Winged Holy Healing Angel】","14. 【Lu An】","15. 【Doggo Sneaky】","16. 【Eighteen Stabs】","17. 【Dancer Tianlan】","18. 【All-Purpose Professor Zongan】","19. 【A Leader for Life】","20. 【Orthopedic Surgeon Director Chen】"]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221: God-tier Profession: God of Calamity, Epic-tier Lich Tower","paragraphs":["The central region of the Land of Death.","Chu Fu was bathed in a torrent of divine power.","【You have completed a glorious battle and made an immense contribution!","【Your hidden class, Seed of Calamity, has evolved into the unique class: God of Calamity.】","【The overview of divine-class skills has been unlocked for you. May you embark upon the true path to godhood.】","For a moment, Chu Fu felt as though enlightenment had struck her.","A divine class was naturally different from all other classes.","For one thing, learning new skills no longer required her to seek out a Command Crystal. Divine classes were created by their users themselves.","Just like Xie Lin, she could create her own skills.","She could even make her words law.","Of course, she did not have to create new skills if she did not want to. She could continuously strengthen and modify them instead!","Chu Fu’s God of Calamity class could be divided into two skill trees: the Catastrophe branch and the Misfortune branch.","These branches represented different paths to godhood. Chu Fu had two paths available to her.","In that respect, if the Seed of Nature Spirits evolved into a divine class, it would likewise possess two branches: Summoning and Nature.","Others had only one path. Chu Fu had four.","If she wasn’t powerful, then who was?","【System Notification: The player has thwarted the conspiracy of the God of the Undead within the Source of the Undead Calamity (Origin). The Primordial Gate has acquired the authority of the God of the Undead.","The divine power acquired can be converted into a dungeon: Counter-Invasion of the Land of the Undead. Please select a location for deployment!","The divine power acquired has lifted the ownership restrictions on the Lich Tower. You may obtain an Epic building, the Lich Tower (Damaged). Please select a location for deployment!】","When Chu Fu saw the second system notification, her eyes immediately locked onto the words “Epic” and “Lich Tower.”","An Epic Lich Tower?","Wait!","The Lich Tower was still sitting in a pool of poison!","My Lich Tower!","Chu Fu immediately took out a bottle and absorbed all the poison from the pool.","“Ah! My Lich Tower!”","Chu Fu gazed at the black tower in heartache.","The bottom three floors had been invaded by the poison and corroded until only several enormous pillars remained.","The black tower was on the verge of collapsing.","That wasn’t all. A massive three-meter-wide crack ran through the tower, from which black smoke poured.","The Lich Tower could not be placed inside her backpack either, but this was precisely where the system’s divine power came into play.","Within Thorny City, Chu Fu selected a location and deployed the Lich Tower. From now on, this would be the job-transfer hall for necromancers.","She then deployed the dungeon beside it, putting the dungeon plaza and the job-transfer hall side by side. With a few shops built around them and rented out, it would be perfect.","Once everything had been arranged, the Lich Tower suddenly rose from the ground and vanished into a black hole.","Xie Lin was startled.","“What happened? Where did the tower go? That tower should be our spoils of war, right?","“There must be plenty of good stuff inside.","“The tower’s material is pretty impressive too. I only managed to cut a three-meter-long gash in it with one slash.","“My sword can split a mountain in two now.","“We have to dismantle the whole tower and take it back with us.”","Chu Fu shot Xie Lin a glance.","“That won’t be necessary. The entire tower belongs to us now.”","Xie Lin seemed to realize something. He awkwardly rubbed his nose.","“Ha... ha! It’s all my fault. I got carried away and didn’t hold back. Why didn’t the system say anything sooner?","“Look at this—I damaged public property!”","Xie Lin took the blame without hesitation.","Chu Fu had been feeling a little guilty about using too much force herself, but with Xie Lin sharing the blame, she actually felt a little better.","“It wasn’t Sword Saint Brother’s fault alone. I attacked too. It’s fine. We can just repair it!”","At that moment, Shen Chi also arrived at the scene. Using a suction machine, he vacuumed up every piece of equipment and fragment of bone scattered across the ground.","The main force had also arrived.","The dungeon had come to a complete end, and everyone could now return.","This time, they did not even need to use Spatial Stones to set up a return formation. That would only have wasted them.","Chu Fu opened a Nature Spirit Passage, and everyone entered it, returning to Thorny City.","At the same time, a global announcement rang out.","【System Announcement! Congratulations to the player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” for leading the Thorny Guild and its players to clear the Origin-level dungeon: Source of the Undead Calamity (Origin)! Rewards: +100 to all attributes as the first-clear reward, and +1 level.】","【System Announcement! Thorny City has successfully defended itself against the assault of the God of the Undead! Furthermore, it achieved a perfect defense. Rewards have been doubled: all players receive +10 to all attributes instead of the original +5.】","【System Announcement! As the first city to successfully complete a defense, Thorny City’s size has been increased by an additional 100%, and resource points have been added around the city.】","Previously, the announcements for defending villages and towns had only been server-wide.","This time, the announcement was global.","The announcement regarding the city’s successful defense was global as well.","And as the first city to successfully defend itself, Thorny City had even received a size increase.","This increase did not simply mean that its area had doubled.","The city had originally been ten kilometers long on each side. Now, each side measured twenty kilometers!","Its total area was four times larger than before.","One had to understand that even the central urban area of Linjiang City covered only about twenty kilometers.","If Wangxi Manor were used as the center and the expansion continued beyond Linjiang City, it would even reach Cangsong City.","Of course, that was the situation in the real world.","In the game, the land was unimaginably vast.","After the game’s true invasion began, the land had expanded a hundredfold. A city twenty kilometers on each side was merely a somewhat larger sanctuary.","Most of the world still consisted of monsters, mutated plants, and dangerous wilderness.","Chu Fu opened the Contribution Shop to see if it held any surprises for her.","【City Upgrade Blueprint: Upgrades a max-level town into a city. It can also be used on a city, but can only increase the city’s boundary by one kilometer on each side.","Price: 10 billion Contribution Points.】","“Classmate Chu! Classmate Chu!”","Laoji Fuli and Li Weizheng hurried over, their faces full of anxiety.","The instant they saw the contents of the Contribution Shop, they understood that they absolutely had to obtain this City Upgrade Blueprint.","But they did not have enough Contribution Points!","Only seven waves had appeared during the city defense battle, producing a total of 700 million monsters and 16.8 billion Contribution Points. Chu Fu had claimed half of them.","The Thorny Guild had obtained 80% of the contribution rewards.","There were simply too many talented members in the Thorny Guild. The Military Soul Guild could not seize any contribution points from them at all.","But this blueprint was far too important.","Laoji Fuli began, “Classmate Chu... No, City Lord Chu, would you be interested in acquiring a share of Military Soul City in the future?”","“We’ll exchange shares in Military Soul City for the City Upgrade Blueprint. How does that sound?”","Asking to buy it with gold would have been impossible for Laoji Fuli.","Who would they take her for—a fool?","Could gold really buy something this important?","This was an entire city.","Moreover, according to the information Laoji Fuli had obtained, Chu Fu’s subordinate, Eighteen Stabs, who had secured the first clear of the Level 10 Origin-level dungeon, also had the authority to upgrade a novice village.","The other player had been a member of the Thorny Workshop from the very beginning, and 20% of everything he obtained belonged to the guild.","If they invested through Eighteen Stabs and provided the blueprint to upgrade a village into a town, establishing a new city would not be impossible.","Therefore, after discussing the matter, Laoji Fuli and Li Weizheng had chosen without hesitation to sell shares in exchange for this City Upgrade Blueprint!","The only question was whether Chu Fu would agree."]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222: Thinking Too Small, Repairing the Lich Tower","paragraphs":["Chu Fu thought for a moment before saying, “Please wait. I’ll have someone qualified come speak with you.”","Li Weizheng and Laoji Fuli both had a bad feeling.","They would much rather negotiate with Chu Fu herself.","Sure enough, the next moment, they saw Feng Huimin push up her black-rimmed glasses and appear before them.","She had already received Chu Fu’s private message.","[Who Wants to Be a Plant]: “Elder Ji and the others want our contribution points in exchange for the city upgrade blueprint. They said they can give us shares in Martial Soul Town.”","[Commander Feng Huimin]: “Boss, if I may be frank, Martial Soul Town is official territory. There’s practically no profit to be made there. The only dungeon, the Goblin City Counterinvasion, is one we rented to them.”","[Who Wants to Be a Plant]: “You’re thinking too small. Your perspective is too narrow.”","[Who Wants to Be a Plant]: “When you negotiate with them, don’t ask for shares in Martial Soul Town within the game. Ask directly for shares in the real world!”","[Who Wants to Be a Plant]: “Martial Soul Town is an official settlement. That means once the game invades reality, it’s bound to take in a large number of urban residents—possibly even more than Thorn City. Where there are people, there’s money to be made.”","Chu Fu intended to turn Thorn City into a high-end market.","Naturally, there had to be a lower-end market as well.","That was something Linjiang City and Martial Soul Town would have to handle.","There still weren’t enough safe zones.","They couldn’t accommodate everyone in Linjiang City.","In fact, even now, many players still hadn’t entered the game.","Therefore, once the game invaded reality three months later, those people would certainly relocate to Martial Soul Town and Linjiang City.","If Martial Soul Town became an actual city, it would be able to accommodate even more people. The taxes it generated—essentially protection fees in another form—would be enough to make Chu Fu a fortune.","[Commander Feng Huimin]: “I understand, Boss. I’ll get to it right away.”","[Who Wants to Be a Plant]: “First, tell the players in the guild not to redeem anything. Tell them negotiations are underway. Anyone with more than one million contribution points can buy in directly. Everyone can get rich together.”","For the time being, Chu Fu had no intention of distributing shares in the Thorn Guild.","That said, the guild’s players were already receiving considerable benefits.","None of them would leave, of course, but they still received all the benefits they were entitled to.","If the negotiations succeeded this time, then even if they obtained just 0.01% of the shares, they would still become shareholders.","That would give them a genuine sense of belonging.","Feng Huimin immediately understood.","[Commander Feng Huimin]: “Understood, Boss. I’ll notify everyone.”","Sometimes, Feng Huimin really admired her boss.","She had realized that Chu Fu wasn’t particularly good at business, nor was she especially skilled at management. But in a game where strength reigned supreme, her boss’s position was unshakable.","And yet, despite lacking those abilities, Chu Fu was remarkably perceptive when it came to winning people’s hearts.","She was willing to share profits and provide generous benefits—she had already surpassed 99 percent of the bosses in the market.","Afterward, Feng Huimin began negotiating with Laoji Fuli and the others.","Chu Fu, meanwhile, began studying her first Epic-grade treasure: the Lich Tower.","It was in an absolutely miserable state.","The Lich Tower stood thirty meters tall, with a bottom diameter of fourteen meters and a floor area of roughly 150 square meters.","The bottom three floors had suffered severe corrosion, but their basic framework could still be seen.","What was more, some items had not been contaminated by the poison.","A Necromancer Advancement Crystal!","Chu Fu sucked in a breath.","She carefully examined the enormous crystal placed on the first floor.","[Necromancer Advancement Crystal (Class Advancement Item)]: Touching it allows the user to change their class to Necromancer, a special class.","The very first floor had already given Chu Fu a huge surprise.","Didn’t this mean she could let people change classes as many times as they wanted?","What was more, she could charge for the service.","With a grand wave of her hand, Chu Fu set the price at 5,000 gold coins!","That was also the current market price—though it was a case of something being available at a price but impossible to obtain, since the drop rate for class-change tokens from dungeons was painfully low.","The first player to obtain a class-change token and advance had been extremely grateful to Jiaojiao Bu Jiao.","However, the Lich Tower was now on the verge of collapse, so Chu Fu immediately called for people to come and rebuild it.","Players with Metal and Earth affinities came rushing over. On top of that, even Orthopedic Surgeon Director Chen, who had recently joined the team, came to help.","Director Chen greeted Chu Fu and said, “President, I obtained a second talent and a second class.","I can crush bones, and I can also piece them back together.","This Lich Tower is actually made of bone. If we use bones to construct the walls, the necrotic aura will become much denser. I can help crush and reassemble the bones.”","Chu Fu was extremely surprised.","“You’ve improved so quickly!”","But it wasn’t all that strange. After all, Orthopedic Surgeon Director Chen had obtained the first clear for two Origin-level dungeons.","Strictly speaking, Chu Fu had only obtained two first clears herself—the level 20 and level 30 Origin-level dungeons. Director Chen, on the other hand, had cleared every Origin-level dungeon from level 10 through level 30 first.","That was why the five relatives of the wheelchair guys who had joined the team later had seen their strength soar so rapidly.","“Just luck, just luck. I don’t really know why. It seems I’m particularly suited to absorbing divine power. The others work harder than I do, but somehow, I’ve changed more than they have.”","Could something like that really happen?","Feng Huimin was busy, so Chu Fu asked the secretary team instead.","The secretary team quickly answered her question.","“President, it is indeed as you said. This time, the divine power absorbed by the members as a whole wasn’t particularly effective. However, a few classes advanced extremely quickly—for example, those related to death, dark elements, and spellcasting.","“We believe this is because the Necromancer Legion differs too greatly from us humans in nature.","“Of course, our secretary team has another possible explanation: there were too many people, which diluted the divine power.","“There is one final possibility: the Necromancer Legion was too powerful, so the amount of divine power we plundered was too small.","“Eliminating one Necromancer Legion wouldn’t attract the attention of the God of the Undead, because undead aren’t afraid of death in the first place.”","Chu Fu found the secretary team’s analysis convincing.","They really were impressive. The secretary team’s usefulness now rivaled that of Hua Country’s Analysis Bureau.","Their analysis was logical, well-supported, and persuasive.","After finishing her discussion with them, Chu Fu looked back at the Lich Tower.","By then, even Shen Chi had arrived.","He had come to help rebuild the Lich Tower.","Orthopedic Surgeon Director Chen crushed bones and mixed them into the soil and metal, reinforcing the Lich Tower so it was no longer on the verge of collapse. They also built a staircase leading upward.","The second floor had been completely corroded as well, but it contained a hundred black coffins.","The coffins were made of a special material and had somehow escaped corrosion. They had only been stained with poison.","At first, Chu Fu didn’t understand what they were for.","But she soon figured it out.","[Coffin of the Undead (Resurrection Item): Place a corpse inside the Coffin of the Undead, and it can be resurrected after two hours.","A Necromancer bound to a Coffin of the Undead will have their soul return to the coffin upon death. By placing any skeleton inside, they can resurrect themselves.","Note 1: Necromancers and other races whose souls return in this manner will become undead rather than humans, and any equipment dropped upon death cannot be recovered.","Note 2: After the Lich Tower is cleansed by the Primordial Gate, those who become undead will not change factions or begin worshiping the God of the Undead.]","Chu Fu couldn’t help but marvel.","What other surprises could this Lich Tower have in store for her?","She climbed up to the third floor."]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223: Drive Down the Price of Skill Books, Thorn Printing Factory","paragraphs":["The surrounding walls had already been repaired, but there should have been a carpet on the floor.","The walls were still pitted and uneven, while the gemstones embedded in them had long since lost their luster.","This was actually a meditation room.","Players could go AFK and meditate here, increasing their maximum mana. It was absolutely a treasure trove capable of breaking through the game's restrictions.","Unfortunately, the meditation room had been completely destroyed and was entirely unusable.","Chu Fu could only swallow her heartache and hope that she might be able to repair it someday.","She then climbed to the fourth floor.","The fourth floor gave Chu Fu a pleasant surprise. It was actually an alchemy workshop.","Of course, the alchemy workshops of necromancers and liches were all aligned with the dark element.","Scrolls and bombs of the dark element would be even more powerful when crafted here.","There was also a collection of recipes.","The biggest problem with alchemy was not the workspace, but the lack of recipes.","These recipes had now merged with the alchemy workshop. Anyone who came here could learn them, and the recipes were not consumed after being learned.","This was fantastic.","The Thorn Guild would soon have a whole batch of dark-element alchemy masters.","The fifth floor was a potion room.","It also contained a selection of recipes, including Night Vision Potions and Shadowmeld Potions that allowed the user to blend into the darkness. They were extremely practical.","Another source of income.","By the time she reached the sixth floor, Chu Fu was heartbroken to the point of being unable to breathe.","This was the spot where Xie Lin had struck with his sword, leaving behind a crack a full three meters long.","Most importantly, Chu Fu's poison had also seeped into this area, causing most of the things here to be corroded.","And this floor just happened to be a library!","It contained a huge number of skill books. Players could only learn one skill every five levels, which was nowhere near enough.","Skill books were snapped up the moment they appeared in the auction house. With so many books here, every single one was worth money!","Even if they were kept for the necromancers in the guild who were about to change classes, they would still represent a valuable investment.","“I'm not looking anymore, I'm not looking anymore. The more I see, the more it hurts.”","Chu Fu continued climbing.","Unexpectedly, the seventh floor turned out to be a reception room, with no special effects.","The eighth floor was even more magnificent. It was clearly the residence of a divine envoy.","There was even a large black bed on it, wreathed in black smoke.","Sleeping on it for a while would increase one's dark-element attack power.","This was useful. She would move it to the third floor later and use it for cultivation.","The ninth floor was the control center. It could activate the protective shield and release black light.","However, the core crystal had already dimmed and lost its radiance. It needed to be replenished with mana, or else she would have to wait for it to recover on its own. That would probably take a week.","The tenth and final floor was a prayer room. At a glance, it was clearly a place for worshiping the God of the Undead.","Chu Fu casually dismantled the statue of the God of the Undead.","This place was practically a rooftop, and it could receive sunlight. She could plant some things here later and turn it into a rooftop garden.","However, with such a dense aura of darkness, it would be best to grow dark-element plants.","Fortunately, there were still some leftover materials in the dark alchemy workshop and dark potion room, so Chu Fu brought them over and planted them.","She had just finished taking a hurried look around when the members of the secretarial team arrived as well.","They needed to collect the information and pass it on to Feng Huimin.","The moment they saw Chu Fu, they immediately greeted her.","Feng Huimin was their leader, while Chu Fu was the leader of their leader.","There were few opportunities to make an appearance in front of the top boss.","After all, they were merely “clerical staff.”","Feng Huimin was currently negotiating some business, and Chu Fu had just asked about the promotion of the guild's S-rank players, so the members of the secretarial team hurriedly reported the matter to her.","“President, the new S-rank players have been identified. Would you like to take a look? One of them is particularly unusual.”","“Oh?” Chu Fu's interest was instantly piqued.","The male secretary was named Chen Chen, and his ID was The Old Minister Has Arrived. It was unclear whether his name had influenced his class too much toward support, but his initial class had been Retainer.","Fortunately, after advancing again and again, he had now become a Minister of State.","He had also gained an extremely powerful ability: Contract Signing.","Any contract witnessed by him, whether in the game or in the real world, was legally binding.","He had truly taken off.","However, as a senior secretary, Chen Chen naturally could not openly take credit for his own ability.","That was why he had brought up someone else, hoping to pique Chu Fu's interest.","What he wanted was simply to make an appearance. Once Chu Fu knew about his abilities, she would be even more pleasantly surprised.","After all, aside from Contract Signing, he possessed another ability that was even more astonishing.","Below One Person (S):","Trait 1: The Old Minister Has Arrived: Designate a player as one's lord. As long as the user shouts, “The Old Minister Has Arrived,” they can instantly appear at their lord's side.","Trait 2: Protect the Lord: Protect the lord from harm. Temporarily gain 120% of the lord's base attack and defense, but also bear all damage inflicted upon the lord.","Trait 3: Defense increased by 100.","The only drawback was that choosing a lord required a binding contract.","Although Feng Huimin was very powerful, it was the top boss whom he truly wished to serve as his lord.","He had finally found his chance.","Seeing that Chu Fu was interested, Chen Chen hurriedly said, “Although not many players advanced during this battle, quite a few life-class players did.","“One of them has the ID Professional Book Printer for 20 Years. Their talent is the S-rank Perfect Imprint. If they have a skill book, they can reproduce it perfectly.","“These skills can even become universal skills. Mages can learn warriors' skills, and warriors can learn healing skills.”","Chen Chen handed the information to Chu Fu.","It listed not only Professional Book Printer for 20 Years' talent, but also their class: Engraver.","They could create original printing blocks and use them to make copies.","The documents also contained projections for potential profits.","Projection One: Have a mechanical expert create a fully automatic printing press, ushering in an industrial revolution and allowing skill books to be mass-produced.","Projection Two: Bring the ability into reality and produce skill books in the real world.","Required materials for Level One Warrior's Bash: only one rabbit hide, rabbit blood, plant fiber, and ink.","Wasn't that far too cheap?","Of course, some people might not like Bash, a warrior's skill book.","But what about Minor Heal or Magic Bullet?","The former could heal people, while the latter provided a ranged attack.","They would definitely be highly appealing.","Chu Fu thought of the skill books inside the Lich Tower.","They had now turned into piles of glittering gold coins.","However, she immediately realized that copying high-level skill books would require difficult-to-obtain materials and would be extremely labor-intensive.","Copying basic skills, on the other hand, was a completely different matter.","Suddenly, she had a bold idea.","“This ability is truly excellent. It's obviously perfect for turning over to the state!","“Of course, I'm worried that China won't be able to handle it properly, so I'll help them myself!","“Find Feng Huimin later and have her establish a Thorn Printing Factory.","“Print books with all your might!”","“Yes!”","Chu Fu looked through the information on several more people. The Thorn Guild was truly overflowing with talent now.","It had a full thousand players with S-rank talents or higher.","She wondered whether the invaders were afraid yet.","These people would all become god-tier players in the future, standing against the invasion of the game into reality.","Would the enemy tremble in fear at the thought?","At the thought of this, a smug smile appeared at the corners of Chu Fu's lips.","She was truly amazing. She had cultivated so many talented people.","With her good mood intact, she hurriedly dealt with the guild's affairs.","The team would be heading to Windpeace Town later, after all!","The scroll I bought can’t go to waste. Even an Origin-tier dungeon grants 10 points to every attribute!"]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224: Military Soul Guild's Real-Life Land Dividend, Disappointed Fenghe Town Players","paragraphs":["Chu Fu took another look at the three resource sites the system had awarded to the guild.","These resource sites could be placed freely, and their contents could be selected as appropriate.","The system had awarded them three gold-tier resource sites, capable of producing gold-tier materials.","After carefully considering her options, Chu Fu selected a darkstone vein, a medicinal herb valley, and a logging ground.","Once she finished setting everything up, the land outside Thorn Guild City began to rumble and transform.","Chu Fu immediately went to the medicinal herb valley and began planting Holy Light Grass and Resurrection Grass.","Her grand plans for producing Holy Light Potions and Resurrection Potions were about to begin as well.","Therefore, in addition to the Thorn Printing Factory, she would also need to establish a Thorn Pharmaceutical Factory.","After staying busy for several hours, Feng Huimin finally finished negotiating with Li Weizheng and the others.","She had secured a 45% share of War Soul City’s profits from both the game and reality, though she would have no say in its decisions.","The money earned from these dividends would first be transferred to Thorn Guild’s accounts before being redistributed according to the 100% shareholding structure.","Chu Fu had announced the subscription opportunity, but not many players had one million contribution points.","Among them were more than a thousand players with S-rank talents. Those who lacked the money could borrow from Chu Fu.","Chu Fu would lend them one million contribution points, and they could repay her with guild contribution points.","In other words, she was investing in talent.","At that moment, all one thousand S-rank players were moved to tears by gratitude.","They declared that from then on, they would be Chu Fu’s devoted followers, ready to die for her!","In the end, 3,218 people within Thorn Guild subscribed.","Together, they held 32.18% of the shares.","The monster-clearing experts on Chu Fu’s team also acquired roughly 1% to 3% each.","That left 33% of the shares.","Chu Fu intended to split them evenly between herself and Chu Feng.","But when she looked up, she discovered that Chu Feng had already left.","She immediately contacted him.","Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?: “Big Brother, when did you leave? I negotiated with the authorities and bought us a share of the dividends. I wanted to give some to you.”","Chu Feng sounded a little resentful.","His little sister didn’t even know when he had left? Several hours had already passed.","His little sister had truly become a very busy person.","Of course, although he felt a little aggrieved, Chu Feng was not unreasonable.","However, he did not want any of the authorities’ shares.","My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute: “I don’t want them. And don’t invest too much either. It isn’t necessary!”","My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute: “Don’t be fooled by the fact that the authorities are still doing everything they can to save the situation. That’s only because the current disasters are happening in isolated areas. When one place is in trouble, support comes from everywhere else, so they can still hold on.”","My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute: “But when the day comes that the land expands a hundredfold, communications are cut off, human greed grows without limit, and the strong claim territory as kings, the authorities won’t be able to control anything.”","My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute: “They also love rescuing people. Then the people they save steal food and equipment instead of fighting monsters, while those who step forward to help end up becoming their babysitters!”","My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute: “Fu-Fu, I actually don’t want you to work so hard, and I don’t want you to get caught up in this mess...”","Chu Feng did not want to say too much. He did not want innocent, simple-hearted Chu Fu to see through the ruthlessness of the apocalypse and become filled with despair about the future.","But Chu Fu’s reply left him stunned.","Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?: “I understand, Big Brother. But you said the strong will claim territory as kings. Is it possible that I’m already one of the strong?”","Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?: “I’m already carving out my own territory. In the future, people on my land won’t even need to go out and fight monsters. And if anyone dares betray me, I’ll feed them to the goblins!”","Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?: “I hope everyone can become a player and gain the strength to survive in the apocalypse. If that happens, they won’t need to steal other people’s equipment, right?”","Chu Feng was first shocked by Chu Fu’s kingly attitude. Then he was rendered somewhat speechless by her naive optimism.","Still, he would only indulge his little sister. He would not argue with her anymore.","My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute: “Fine. Whoever tries to steal from you, I’ll help you beat them up!”","Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?: “Mm-hmm! Since you don’t want the shares, I’ll buy them all!”","Afterward, Chu Fu took all 33% of the remaining dividend shares for herself.","She had never intended to make much money from War Soul City.","She was simply using it to provide benefits for her own people and win their loyalty!","Once everything was settled, it was already midnight.","The defense battle for Windpeace Town began.","...","Inside Windpeace Town.","The players stared at the teleportation array in anticipation, but even after the first wave of monsters descended, they still saw no sign of anyone arriving.","“It’s over! Thorn Guild isn’t coming!”","The players of Windpeace Town were deeply disappointed.","They all knew that the members of Thorn Guild had gone to Valley Pass Town.","They had even led the players of Valley Pass Town to conquer an Origin-level dungeon.","Although... only a little over nine hundred players from Valley Pass Town had participated in the town defense battle, and five hundred of them had been moles, they had still been led by Thorn Guild.","As long as they participated, they would gain ten points to all attributes and be able to improve their talents. Otherwise, they would never have had enough contribution points to exchange for Talent Enhancement Stones.","But the result was still disappointing.","“I know someone there. I asked them to find out what happened, and they said Thorn Guild didn’t organize anything. Everyone is repairing the city walls right now!”","“I heard it’s because Valley Pass Town had too few people, so they were able to issue an assistance mission. We have too many players here, so we can’t request assistance!”","“Damn it! Couldn’t they issue a mission just for Plant Boss? She could lead us even if she came alone!”","“Heh, I heard Plant Boss really did ask for one, but all the missions were snatched up.”","Everyone had guessed that Plant Boss would come, so they had frantically fought over the missions, hoping to ride her coattails and reap the benefits.","As a result, they had forcibly pushed Plant Boss out of the running.","Now, everyone was seething with resentment.","“Don’t let me find out who snatched those missions.”","More than thirty players from other servers lowered their heads and did not dare say a word.","They had never expected that trying to hitch a ride on the mission would instead squeeze Plant Boss out.","The players of Windpeace Town were notorious for being difficult to deal with.","After Wang Rongxun had declared bankruptcy to escape his debts, the people of Windpeace Town who had lent him money were naturally unwilling to let such a fat sheep off the hook.","Moreover, because they all shared the same interests, the players of Windpeace Town were remarkably united.","Every day, they went to cause a commotion outside Shepherd Source Corporation.","They had made quite a few headlines.","Perhaps because the incident had gone viral, players from Linjiang City could no longer join Server 030. Instead, they joined Server 024 and developed independently.","Windpeace Town had become famous as well. It was the first server where independent players had forced a group-run studio to retreat.","The number of players participating in the defense battle was indeed substantial—no fewer than forty thousand.","Furthermore, as the Flower Kingdom’s dark-gold equipment program progressed, some dark-gold equipment would inevitably enter circulation.","The price of gold-tier equipment had plummeted.","The authorities of the Flower Kingdom had also provided some support.","As a result, the players of Windpeace Town had more than enough strength to deal with the goblin invasion.","They had originally planned to take their time fighting the monsters.","Then a server-wide announcement suddenly rang out.","[Server 0248888, Windpeace Town] [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “Hello, players of Valley Pass Town. After the ninth wave of monsters in the town assault ends, I will head to the true goblin lair—the rift twenty kilometers away.","“Since a great deal of money was spent on this expedition to provide reinforcements, all Dark Gold equipment obtained from clearing this Origin-level dungeon will be reclaimed. However, participating players will receive a 10-point increase to all attributes, along with some enhancement from the leaked divine power.","Players who wish to participate, please take note of the time and keep up with the group.”"]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225: Speedrunning: The Whole World Is Envious of the Flower Growers","paragraphs":["The players throughout Fenghe Town erupted in cheers.","“They’re here! They’re here!”","“Thank you, Plant Boss! And thank you to the big shots from the Thorn Guild!”","Chu Fu continued broadcasting through the megaphone.","[Server 0248888—Fenghe Town] [Who Wants to Be a Plant?]: “I’ll be clearing out the monsters around Fenghe Town shortly. Please be prepared, and don’t panic. Two hours from now, all members are to assemble at the east gate.”","Everyone was still wondering what she meant by “don’t panic” when they suddenly discovered that the entire area around Fenghe Town had changed.","The ground outside the city turned into a swamp.","A dense pink fog, like a sandstorm, enveloped the entire world.","It was Chu Fu’s Plague Calamity.","Against living, flesh-and-blood creatures, Plague Calamity was simply the most useful skill imaginable.","There was no need for her to control it, nor did she need to rely on amplification from the Calamity Seeds.","It spread automatically.","Goblins fell in droves.","In the end, they all became rotting corpses.","The speed at which the monsters died depended entirely on how quickly they approached Fenghe Town.","No one needed to lift a finger.","Chu Fu alone defended an entire town.","The reason she had asked everyone to wait two hours was that after each wave of monsters was completely wiped out, there was a ten-minute rest period.","It was a mandatory break, during which the goblins used their Replication Crystals to create a new army and launch another attack on the town.","But killing them only took three minutes.","Two hours passed in the blink of an eye.","The ninth wave of monsters had been eliminated.","Everyone was waiting at the east side of the city.","Feng Huimin also sent out a megaphone announcement.","[Server 0248888—Fenghe Town] [Commander Feng Huimin]: “Attention, all players. You will be joining this battle. Do not resist or leave the formation. Otherwise, you will bear the consequences.”","[Charge Horn]","Feng Huimin blew the horn.","Then came the formation.","The players, who had originally been scattered and idle, were forcibly drawn together as if by an invisible pair of hands.","They became a perfectly ordered unit.","Almost subconsciously, they adjusted their positions and became part of the war.","At that moment, a gigantic arch appeared outside Fenghe Town, formed from roots, branches, vines, and flowers.","Shen Chi and the others were already standing in front of the rift. Chu Fu sent a Plant Spirit to follow them, then activated the Nature Spirit Passage.","That way, the players did not need to travel there themselves.","Of course, this was also because Fenghe Town had relatively few people. In a situation like Thorn City, there would not have been enough time for everyone to enter through the Nature Spirit Passage. They would have had to run there on their own.","Everyone passed through the Nature Spirit Passage and arrived in front of the Goblin Rift.","Feng Huimin issued an order.","“Enter on your own. After passing through the rift, wait where you are. Once the dungeon ends, return through the rift from the same location.","“Do not linger. Otherwise, your character will die, and you will be unable to create a new character for three months.”","The distance was only a little over a hundred meters, so Feng Huimin did not need to continue directing them.","Whether the players from Fenghe Town had heard her clearly or not, they excitedly charged through the rift, howling as they went.","They were entering a Genesis-tier dungeon too!","Standing before the rift, they saw the powerful goblins.","One billion HP!","The terrifying and savage goblins made their souls tremble. Their hair stood on end as though they had encountered a natural predator.","The next moment, another veil of pink poisonous fog enveloped the goblin army.","Whether they had one billion HP or one hundred thousand, they all collapsed on the spot.","Their HP represented only the goblins’ limit—not the limit of Chu Fu’s skill damage.","Shen Chi took out the Ground-Sucking Machine and sucked all the corpses inside.","Then the mecha rose from the ground.","Boom!","The members of the Thorn Guild flew away.","They circled around the east, south, west, and north sides, completing the trip in only six minutes.","Afterward, they reached the Goblin City and began fighting the boss.","It took no effort at all. The boss was slain.","The gap between them was simply too great.","[You have cleared the dungeon: The True Goblin Nest (Genesis).]","[Dungeon completion time: 12 minutes and 33 seconds.]","[All participating players have been granted one free resurrection. All players’ levels have increased by 1, and all attributes have increased by 10 points. (The first clear of a Genesis-tier dungeon grants 100 points; subsequent clears grant 10 points. Bonuses may stack.)]","[The system will award rewards based on each player’s performance in this dungeon. Rewards will be distributed automatically; no exchange is required.]","At the same time, the announcement was broadcast worldwide.","Although this was not the first clear, a Genesis-tier dungeon still warranted a global announcement.","It was practically spam, repeatedly ringing in the ears of players around the world.","There was no way to block it.","Aside from the players from China, players from many other countries were furious and began cursing.","“Damn it! Can’t these announcements be blocked? Why are they clearing Genesis-tier dungeons every single day?”","“It’s China every time! What are the people in our country doing? Why isn’t our government maintaining order? My home has been looted!”","“Send in spies! I want to know how they’re clearing these dungeons!”","“It’s that Who Wants to Be a Plant again. Are plant players really that powerful? I want to become a plant player too!”","“Twelve minutes? Can the people who tried it in our country even kill a single goblin in twelve minutes?”","“Are we really going to let China take first place?”","While players around the world complained, Chu Fu remained silent, doing nothing but dismantling Goblin City.","There were only twenty of them this time, so their numbers were relatively small.","After clearing the dungeon, they could remain inside for another hour—the same hour during which the tenth wave would originally have attacked Fenghe Town.","Dismantling a city roughly the same size as Fenghe Town in just one hour was still somewhat tight.","Fortunately, Chu Fu had discovered a new use for the spirits.","She recalled more than six hundred Gatling Corn Plant Spirits into the Spirit Plant Satchel, then released six hundred Giant-Mouthed Venus Flytrap Spirits.","The skirts of the Venus Flytrap Spirits resembled wide-open mouths. When they approached an enemy, the skirts suddenly spread open until they reached a diameter of two meters.","They were razor-sharp as well.","Chu Fu ordered them to swallow everything they saw.","Buildings, bones, fences, stones...","Then she activated Nature Spirit Collection, and all those things naturally fell into Chu Fu’s backpack.","Her backpack was not large enough to hold everything. Once it overflowed, the excess items spilled onto the ground.","But at that point, Shen Chi could use the Ground-Sucking Machine to vacuum them away.","“I feel like I’m missing one of those infinite-space rings from novels!”","Chu Fu sighed.","“It’s a shame this dungeon doesn’t give treasure chests. Everything here is real, and now even the divine power rewards have decreased,” said Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","Feng Huimin pushed up her glasses and said, “The amount of divine power being awarded probably hasn’t decreased. We’ve simply become stronger.","“If divine power is equivalent to experience points, then the experience from a level-ten-to-twenty dungeon is completely useless to a group of level-thirty-six players like us.”","“Good thing there aren’t any speed-farming dungeons on the new map. Otherwise, we would have missed out on a wave of all-attribute increases.”","An hour later.","Chu Fu looked at Goblin City, now chewed down until it was full of holes, and nodded in satisfaction. She left with the Spatial Stone.","All the rifts closed.","She did not know that, just as the dungeon ended...","The players left behind in the rift east of Windpeace Town had unexpectedly fallen into disagreement.","“We cleared the dungeon this quickly? It won’t close for another hour! Why don’t we explore a little? I heard everything here is real—even a random bone you pick up could be a dark-gold-tier item.”","Greed began to spread among the players."]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226: Kind Words Cannot Persuade a Doomed Ghost, Sin Radar","paragraphs":["“That’s right. All these trees are excellent materials. Do you think there might be herbs we can gather in the forest?”","“The Plantman players went off to eat meat, so why don’t we have some soup too?”","“Forget it. This place is dangerous. Even a single goblin getting through could wipe us all out.”","“Do you people never visit the forums? Do you know how that celebrity guild member, Jiang Yixing, died? He died in there, and there was no way to revive him!”","“Fine, then. If none of you are going, I’ll go by myself. Don’t get jealous when I strike it rich.”","And just like that, some people left the main group and began exploring the forest.","The others exchanged glances. Unable to resist their greed, a few more also went off to search the surrounding area.","However, most of them obediently returned through the rift.","They had all obtained 10 points to every attribute, which was already enough.","Once they went outside, they could also achieve a perfect defense of the village and gain another 4 points to every attribute.","What more could they ask for?","As for dark-gold equipment and gold-grade materials...","They had to stay alive before they could take any of it.","After those people left, the players who had gone exploring became absorbed in one gathering item after another.","It was just like fishing.","They always thought, Just one more cast.","Before they knew it, an hour had passed.","They had assumed that an Origin-level dungeon would be just like an ordinary dungeon—that once the time was up, it would “kick” them out.","But there was no notification.","Origin-level dungeons were close to reality itself, and the conditions for leaving were fixed as well.","Only after a long time had passed did those people finally begin to panic.","It was like being trapped on a sandbar while out gathering seafood, only to discover that the tide had risen. They were completely at a loss.","They returned to the place where the rift had been, only to find it empty.","It was gone.","Everything was gone!","The remaining players—two or three thousand of them—gathered together and began searching for an exit.","Just then, they heard the earth trembling.","It sounded like an army marching forward.","Could everyone have returned?","But after hearing the noise, they felt that wasn’t the case.","The army commanded by Feng Huimin had a very light step. Even when marching at full speed, it was as if their feet never touched the ground.","These footsteps, however, were incredibly heavy.","So heavy that they sounded like...","Giants walking.","A foul stench swept through the air.","At last, when the enemy drew near, they saw them.","At least a thousand goblin scouts were advancing toward them with savage expressions.","Spears flew from their hands, instantly piercing through the players’ bodies.","Every one of them was slaughtered by the newly arrived goblins.","The one-hour time limit stated by the system was not merely a restriction on how long players could remain in the dungeon.","It was the time required for the other tribes to reach this place.","The greedy players were annihilated to the last man.","...","Within Windbreak Town.","As expected, they had achieved the perfect completion rating.","Chu Fu received all the contribution points—a total of 1.3 billion.","The others received anywhere from a few million to tens of millions, mainly because they wanted to compete for a place in the top ten rankings and obtain some rewards.","The reason no one fought over the rest was that Chu Fu had obtained all the entry tickets. They had merely ridden along for free during this operation, so all the resources should naturally belong to Chu Fu.","That included the contribution points.","Chu Fu did not keep them for herself, either.","At the market rate of one hundred copper coins per contribution point, the 1.3 billion contribution points could be exchanged for 1.3 million gold coins.","The players in the group then used their guild contribution points to make the exchanges.","That way, everything remained fair.","“Three people in the team still haven’t obtained their second talent. I’m allocating 100 million contribution points for you to purchase one.”","“As for the remaining ten people, exchange them directly for divine artifact embryos. They’ll purchase them in order according to the guild’s accumulated contribution rankings.”","As for talent enhancement stones, skill enhancement stones, and attribute points, they truly had no shortage of those anymore.","The guild’s accumulated contribution rankings were determined by contributions from running dungeons, submitting guild information, and participating in various battles.","Naturally, those who had joined the team earlier had accumulated more contribution points.","However, certain classes were at a disadvantage. Wu Yingchun, for example, was a single-target class with no area-of-effect attacks.","The strongest class was undoubtedly Feng Huimin’s.","Some classes could make additional contributions to the guild—for example, priests who possessed resurrection spells and Dreamweavers who could craft equipment for the guild.","Thus, the ten divine artifact embryos naturally went to the five veteran teammates, Shafu Liangu, Zhimengzhe, Bitter Melon King, Little Sister Wu, and Feng Huimin.","Once everything had been settled, everyone began channeling their town portal scrolls.","“You’ve all worked hard today. Everyone has been online for more than twenty-four hours, and you’ve also gained some new abilities. Cashing them out will take time.","“Take the day off. Tomorrow at six in the evening, we’ll advance into the future maps!","“We’ll start by going to the Level 30–40 map and give the Saint Wolf Club a little something in return.","“We can’t let them think we’re easy targets!”","“Yes!”","Everyone nodded and dispersed.","Some went to cash out their abilities, while others continued growing stronger in the game.","Chu Fu’s abilities were simply too powerful, so cashing them out took even longer. She could only enter a deep sleep to complete the process.","...","Meanwhile.","Inside Soul of the Army Town.","As the town’s mayor, Li Weizheng was constantly purchasing town- and village-upgrade blueprints acquired from various places.","These blueprints were bound. They had been brought out during town-defense battles and could only be converted into cash by issuing quests.","Each blueprint was worth 10,000 gold coins.","It also required a great deal of manpower to handle the process—in other words, only a nation could accomplish something on this scale.","Before long, Soul of the Army Town had expanded to cover an area of 10 kilometers by 10 kilometers.","However, Li Weizheng did not immediately use the city-level blueprint.","The Soul of the Army Guild was not yet strong enough.","If they used it now, wouldn’t they just be preparing the way for Chu Fu and the others?","After all, the Soul of the Army Guild was incapable of clearing an Origin-level dungeon on its own.","They wanted to wait a little longer.","Once their strength had increased, they would enter the dungeon.","At the very least, they should be able to seize half of the contribution points from Chu Fu, right?","It was a rather miserable situation, when you thought about it.","Still, when Li Weizheng looked at his second talent, he grinned from ear to ear.","[S-rank Talent—Evil Radar:","Trait 1: Evil Radar—Scans a radius of 10 kilometers and detects all players with red names.","Trait 2: Evil Tracking—Tracks players from evil factions within a designated area.","Trait 3: Against players with excessively high evil values, damage dealt is increased by 100%.]","This was truly the bane of evil players.","Li Weizheng dared to guarantee that, from this day onward, the territories under his management would become places where no thief could hide.","He had already reported this skill.","Combined with the red-headed official documents, a nationwide purge of players from evil factions was about to begin.","What was more, Li Weizheng had thought of using it to hunt down international fugitives as well!","His ID was World Peacekeeper, after all.","“No, this is still a little too much for me to handle alone. Should I cooperate with the Plantman players again?”","“I heard that members of the Saint Wolf Club came to cause trouble. They even dared to harass our coastal region before.”","“This time, we absolutely have to teach them a lesson!”","“I just don’t know whether Chu Fu will get involved. I’ll go ask her!”","Li Weizheng sent Chu Fu a message, but naturally, she did not reply. With no other choice, he could only contact the Feng Huimin who inspired him with incomparable apprehension."]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227: Journey to the Future Map, Titan Giant","paragraphs":["It was beyond Li Weizheng’s expectations.","Feng Huimin was surprisingly polite this time.","“Since Major Li wants to target the Holy Wolf Club, and our goals as the Thorn Guild are the same, then let’s act together at six this evening!”","“This doesn’t count as cooperation. Think of it as friends going out together to do something bad!”","Do something bad?","Li Weizheng had never done anything bad in his life!","“So, what’s your plan?”","“Go to the future map—the Holy Wolf Group’s headquarters—and strip the place bare!”","Hearing this, Li Weizheng felt his blood surge.","“Good. I’ll definitely be there!”","...","Six o’clock that evening.","In-game: Thorn City.","After more than ten hours of preparation, Thorn City had expanded to an area twenty kilometers by twenty kilometers, and its walls were complete.","The areas outside Thorn City had also changed because of the undead army’s assault.","The southern region had become a beginner area, where monsters ranging from red-eyed rabbits to tigers spawned.","Goblins had appeared to the west and begun harassing the Thorn Guild’s city walls.","The undead army had appeared to the east.","Not to mention that after clearing the Origin-level dungeon, they had gained access to even more dungeons.","[Foiling the Beast God Temple’s Conspiracy (Level 10 Dungeon)], submitted by Eighteen Stabs.","[Counterattack the Goblin City (Level 20 Dungeon)]","[Destroy the Lich Tower (Level 30 Dungeon)]","Although the three undead dungeons in Linjiang City were gone, Destroy the Lich Tower was still high-level enough, and it was more suitable for the players in Thorn Town.","In other words, a single city was enough to let players level from 1 to 30.","Once the siege battle ended, even the players who had previously been low-level had reached their twenties.","After becoming a city, Thorn City could accommodate 100,000 beginners in one go.","While Chu Fu and the others had gone to Guguan Town, a full 100,000 beginners had already logged into Thorn City.","While Chu Fu fought monsters, Feng Huimin and the others handled the affairs within Thorn City.","At present, Thorn City had a full 350,000 players.","It was even livelier than Linjiang City.","There were quests everywhere.","The beginner players had even helped transport lumber and earth, personally building teleportation arrays at the city walls in all four directions.","This saved a tremendous amount of travel time. They could step outside and immediately start fighting monsters.","Feng Huimin had also given the players beginner benefits.","[Beginners ride the teleportation arrays for free!]","The new players instantly developed a sense of belonging.","They had built the teleportation arrays themselves, and now they could use them without paying?","If they weren’t people of Thorn City, then who was?","The beginners had benefits, and the veteran players had benefits too.","[Limited Purchase: Resurrection Potion!]","Original price: 10 gold coins. Current price: 1 gold coin.","Limit: one bottle.","It wasn’t as cheap as finding a priest to revive them.","But it was convenient!","What if there were times when no priests were around?","[Limited Purchase: Three Universal Skills]","Warriors could now learn priest and archer skills as well.","Aside from that, any feature available in Linjiang City was also available in Thorn City.","For example, there was a Master-level Class Advancement Hall, as well as the Temporal Palace in the future map.","“Is everyone here? Prepare to depart!” Chu Fu said.","“J-just the few of us?” Li Weizheng asked timidly.","Including him, there were only seven people in Chu Fu’s party.","Chu Fu, Xie Lin, Shen Chi, Shafu Liangu, Holy Healing Angel, and Eighteen Stabs.","“We originally planned to act together with everyone else, but then we decided that would be a waste of manpower. We don’t need that many people to deal with the Holy Wolf Club.”","Li Weizheng still trusted Chu Fu.","Chu Fu had simply joined the game late.","She had spent all this time wandering around the beginner village.","It was time for her to leave the beginner village and show these people what the wider world looked like!","No—that wasn’t right.","It was time to let everyone, the entire world, see what she was capable of.","The true powerhouse of our country had arrived!","She would definitely make a greater impression than Lu Xing.","But apparently, Lu Xing was one of Chu Fu’s relatives.","Was gaming talent hereditary in their family?","As for the authorities, they had already abandoned their policy of trying to recruit Lu Xing.","After all, there were simply too many matters to deal with. How could one person fighting alone compare with a collective effort?","Li Weizheng was even more optimistic about Chu Fu. He believed that sooner or later, she would surpass Lu Xing.","Just as he was thinking this, Chu Fu entered the future map in team mode.","[System Notice: You have entered Thorn City (Mirror Future Map, Levels 30–40).","This map is a mirrored world. Everything will be adjusted according to the conditions of the original map.","You may exit this map at any time. There is no need to return to a teleportation array; simply use the exit button.","From 12:00 to 18:00 in real-world time, this map will be unavailable for updates. It will periodically synchronize with the real world.]","Their vision went dark, then brightened again.","[You have entered Thorn City.]","The surroundings were brightly lit. It appeared to be early morning, with the sun just rising. Chu Fu and the others stood on a teleportation array.","“Isn’t the level 30 map supposed to be the Underground Shelter?”","They had never entered the level 30 future map before.","This was Chu Fu’s first time here as well, and she looked around curiously.","Li Weizheng, on the other hand, stood there with his jaw hanging open.","“W-what? This is way too tall!”","“What is?”","“The city walls! Didn’t you see them? These walls have to be two hundred meters high!”","Li Weizheng quickly explained, “Haven’t you been to Linjiang City’s level 30 map? On that map, Linjiang City’s walls are about fifty meters high. Even at that height, Titans stretch their necks over the walls every day to look inside. Every player who enters is like food being raised by a Titan. If one gets caught and swallowed, they die.”","“Fortunately, Titans have powerful digestive systems. After swallowing someone, they excrete them two hours later. Healers have to find the pile of feces before they can revive the player.”","“Ew...”","Everyone looked disgusted.","But they also learned something about the level 30–40 maps.","A new type of monster appeared on the level 30 future map.","Titans.","Juvenile Titans were level 31 and stood thirty meters tall.","Adult Titans were level 35 and stood fifty meters tall.","Titan Giants were level 40 and stood seventy meters tall.","Every one of them was a super boss.","They were enormous and possessed tremendous destructive power.","Therefore, at level 30, teams could consist of fifty players.","“It looks like the Thorn Guild is going to develop very well. Every time the level 30 future map updates, it changes according to events that have occurred on the main map.","“A few days ago, someone anonymously submitted a data module that helped us analyze the changes in all the towns and beginner villages around Linjiang City. It’s been incredibly useful.","“We’ve already located many of the corresponding villages and begun protecting them in advance.”","When Chu Fu heard this, a figure immediately appeared in her mind.","The Anti-Magic Teacher.","The data module had been provided by the Anti-Magic Teacher.","The story had mentioned her before. After all, she was a heroine.","A supporting character had to be raised to the altar first. Only then would killing her bring in enough tears.","Chu Fu actually disliked this sort of thing. She hoped that not a single person would be lost.","Otherwise, what meaning would her transmigration have?","Li Weizheng continued, “However, aside from the bosses’ drops, everything else in the future map is fake. The shelters are the same. Even if one is destroyed today, it will reappear after the map updates at two o’clock the next afternoon.","“That’s why the players from the Holy Wolf Club often slaughter the other shelters without restraint.”","They had their own base too, called Morgan City. It was exactly six o’clock now, so they must have just logged on and appeared inside Morgan City!”","Li Weizheng’s eyes lit up.","He could hardly wait to go uphold justice!"]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228: Attack on Morgan City, Friends, I've Come to Revive You","paragraphs":["“I’ll handle the teleportation. You guys come over afterward!”","In the guild, Chu Fu casually selected a newly acquired set of Dark Gold–rank Necromancer equipment.","A black robe and hooded cloak concealed her face completely.","She also hid her name.","Then she initiated the teleportation.","Teleporting to Morgan City. Cost: 1,000 gold!","What an expensive teleportation fee.","Fortunately, party members could get through for free.","After arriving in Morgan City, Chu Fu looked around. Players from the Holy Wolf Club were logging in one after another. Chu Fu didn’t disturb them and instead left the city.","Morgan City was very small.","It was only one kilometer on each side, surrounded by twenty-meter-high walls.","That was to be expected in the future maps.","On the level 30–40 maps, every city had been reduced in size. If they were too large, they would be impossible to defend.","Titans attacked human settlements. The closer one got to the city walls, the more dangerous it became.","The city center was much safer.","Chu Fu could even sense the enormous difference in property prices between the city center and the outskirts in this apocalyptic world.","By the level 40–50 maps, humans had retreated underground to live.","They had been forced back again and again.","Of course, none of this was real. Even if the cities were destroyed, they would be restored the next day.","However, the future maps did have one special rule.","If a city was attacked, players could not log out of the future map until the crisis had been resolved.","Because of this, players tried to head outside the base as soon as they logged in.","On the flat ground one kilometer outside Morgan City, the players from the Holy Wolf Club had set up a large open-air camp, which they used as their base.","Chu Fu followed the others out of the city.","There were people everywhere disguised with Disguiser Masks, so Chu Fu didn’t stand out at all.","Soon, she left the city.","The instant she stepped outside, Chu Fu released the plants stored in her Plant Spirit Pouch and fused with them.","A twenty-meter-tall Plant Man appeared.","She swung her arm. Amid the buzzing roar of a chainsaw, it slashed toward Morgan City’s walls.","Even though the attack had not come from an enemy, the system still reacted.","[Morgan City is under attack! All players have automatically been enlisted in the city defense battle! Eliminate the enemy immediately!]","The players in Morgan City cursed under their breath. They looked toward the coordinates indicated by the system notification and rushed outside.","As for the players who had been accompanying Chu Fu, every one of them stared wide-eyed.","They had just watched this black-robed figure transform into a gigantic green man!","“What is that? A new monster from the Titan race? It can even disguise itself as a human!”","“Fuck, are you blind? Don’t you recognize her? She’s the Plant Man!”","“I know she’s the Plant Man! Her entire body is made of plants!”","“Who would want to be a plant person?!”","“No kidding! Who would want to become a plant person?!”","“You idiot! Cut down on the drugs!”","Some players cared only about destroying things and paid no attention to what had happened in the guild.","But others knew the truth. They knew that yesterday, Thorn City had announced that it was defending the city, and the teleportation array had been opened. The Holy Wolf Club had rushed over immediately to destroy it.","Unexpectedly, all two hundred players had had their characters deleted.","All the power they could have taken away through death had completely vanished.","Still, it didn’t matter. These players had begun slaughtering villages again and had once more obtained Disguiser Masks.","The Evil God’s energy was immortal.","But all their levels above thirty, along with the attributes they had painstakingly accumulated, were gone.","Who wouldn’t be heartbroken?","They never expected their opponent’s retaliation to come so soon.","“Get to the central control room and activate the defensive barrier!”","“It’s on! It’s on!”","A defensive barrier rose, enveloping the entire city.","Chu Fu didn’t care. She had only wanted to make Morgan City register as being under attack.","Then she opened the Forest Spirit Passage.","Xie Lin and the others walked out.","Standing on a flying sword, Xie Lin shot straight into the sky and hovered above Morgan City.","Then ten thousand flying swords arranged themselves in the air, merging into a single enormous blade.","[Primordial Genesis Sword]","“Clang!”","The city-level defensive barrier was surprisingly sturdy. It actually withstood the attack.","Chu Fu waved her staff.","[Spread Misfortune]: Transformed from Poison Spray. Upon use, scatters Seeds of Disaster and Seeds of Misfortune. The first time the target is attacked, the Calamity effect is guaranteed to trigger at ten times its normal power.","Shen Chi’s mecha also expanded to a height of twenty meters. After flying into the sky, it fired a missile.","“Boom!”","At that moment, the missile exploded above Morgan City like a nuclear bomb.","The defensive barrier shattered.","The terrifying heat scorched the players inside.","Everyone let out agonized screams.","But that was not the most desperate part.","The most desperate part was the terrifying cloud of gray that descended.","Their souls were crushed, and their vision faded into complete darkness.","They were dead!","The entire team had been wiped out!","Three thousand master-level players from the Holy Wolf Club had all died without even seeing their enemies’ faces.","“Buzz!”","They seemed to hear some kind of sound.","Then they discovered that even the resurrection scrolls in their inventories had vanished.","“Fuck, where’s my resurrection scroll?”","They had all been sucked away by the Ground Vacuum.","But the next moment, they felt an even more terrifying suction force pulling at their faces.","Chu Fu was removing their Disguiser Masks.","One by one, she stripped them off and obtained the Evil God’s divine-power material.","Every person present had committed countless atrocities, so the amount of Evil God’s divine-power material they dropped was enormous.","As she removed the masks, Chu Fu taunted them.","[Server 3444, Morgan City] [Who Wants to Be a Plant Person]: “Holy Wolf Club, you came to our Thorn City to provoke us before, saying that I only dared to hide in the main map and didn’t dare come to the future maps to face you directly!”","[Server 3444, Morgan City] [Who Wants to Be a Plant Person]: “Now I’ve come to face you, just as you wanted! And you? Is that all you’ve got?”","The members of the Holy Wolf Club cursed furiously in their hearts.","Which idiot had said that?","Going to destroy the city was one thing, but after getting themselves killed, they had even provoked such a powerful enemy by running their mouths.","However, they also knew that Chu Fu was trying to sow discord among them.","All they could do was curse her furiously.","But no sound came out. They were already dead and could only send text messages.","Chu Fu simply blocked them.","She didn’t bother looking at them.","An hour later, all three thousand-plus players had been stripped of their masks.","Their corpses were piled up inside the city, forming a small mountain.","Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin left in triumph.","Seeing this, Li Weizheng felt an immense sense of satisfaction.","“Fantastic! All these players were level thirty or higher members of the Holy Wolf Club. This blow must have cost them dearly. At least the world will be safe for the time being.”","Chu Fu looked at Li Weizheng.","“This isn’t enough!”","Li Weizheng was stunned.","“Not enough? This... Is there another part to the plan? Wait, aren’t we missing someone? Where’s the Holy Healing Angel?”","...","Inside Morgan City.","A flash of light appeared over the teleportation array.","A beautiful priestess stepped out. She wore a formal dress resembling the attire of a Western palace and had long golden hair.","“Oh! My heavens, what happened here? Don’t be afraid, my friends. I’ll revive you all.”","The priestess raised her staff.","“Resurrection!”"]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229: Treat the Holy Wolf Club like pigs to be slaughtered, massacre in the main picture","paragraphs":["What kind of angelic priest was this?","The players immediately accepted the resurrection, only to discover in despair that all the equipment on their bodies had vanished.","Their weapons were gone as well.","They were wearing nothing but the plain clothes issued in the Novice Village, just enough to preserve their modesty.","The girl spoke again. “Hurry up and log out! Do it before they come back. Be careful—they might return for another attack.”","With that, the girl logged out of the map, her body gradually fading away.","Some of the players began to sense that something was wrong.","But in the next moment, a thunderous roar rang out.","A colossal mecha appeared overhead.","“Log out of the map!” someone from the Saint Wolf Club shouted.","This time, they did not dare hesitate. They hurriedly returned to the map.","Xie Lin hurled a massive sword, instantly piercing through the teleportation array.","[The Morgan City teleportation array has been destroyed. Teleportation and the summoning of Awakened Ones are unavailable. It may be repaired manually or will refresh at 6:00 a.m. tomorrow.]","“Done!” Xie Lin said.","Chu Fu nodded.","She then sensed her plant sprites.","Just now, when the Saint Wolf Club players had logged out of the game, Chu Fu had sent her plant sprites to follow them.","Unfortunately, teleportation was involved, and the plant sprites had gotten lost.","“I can’t determine their location,” Chu Fu said.","“No problem. I’m already calculating it. The margin of error is no more than ten kilometers. Let’s log out of the Future Map first.” Shen Chi’s fingers flew across the keyboard.","The coordinates of the Future Map were actually the same as those of the Main Map.","That meant that as long as they obtained the coordinates of Morgan City in the Future Map, they could use spatial teleportation in reality to reach Morgan City.","After all, the Primordial Gate conducted its selection in batches, with players from the same batch competing against one another.","During the Novice Village phase, the map only opened after the village defense battle. Unless something unexpected happened, players from other regions could not enter.","After reaching a town, players could connect to cities through teleportation arrays only after the town defense battle had ended.","The same applied to cities.","At present, city teleportation arrays were available only in the Future Map.","The Main Map did not allow teleportation between cities.","However, players were not forbidden from traveling into someone else’s territory.","But the distances in the game were a hundred times greater than those in reality!","The distance between two cities was at least twenty thousand kilometers—half the length of the equator.","How were they supposed to travel that far?","Even by plane, it would take twenty-two hours.","And that was only between two neighboring cities.","Chu Fu did not even dare imagine how far Thorn Town was from Morgan City.","But once they had the coordinates, Shen Chi could teleport there directly.","“There’s no need to go through all that trouble calculating,” Eighteen Stabs said. “My Soul of Vengeance can lock onto an enemy and teleport instantly behind them. I’ll log out of the dungeon and teleport over there. Then I’ll send you the coordinates.”","“As expected of my aunt! Your talent really is the best!” Chu Fu praised.","The corners of Eighteen Stabs’ lips curved into a smile, exuding the imposing air of a mature woman.","“I’ll head out first!”","Eighteen Stabs logged out of the Future Map.","“We’re leaving too,” Shen Chi said.","Everyone logged out one after another.","Li Weizheng still wanted to ask more questions, but when he saw everyone else leave, he could only log out as well. Otherwise, once Shen Chi logged out, he would be left hanging in midair.","He had no ability to fly.","In the next moment, Li Weizheng returned to the Hall of Time in Thorn City.","Chu Fu and the others appeared around him.","Even Holy Healing Angel was there.","She had merely changed into another set of equipment. Her hair was still golden.","“What happened to you? And your face!” If the words “Twelve-Winged Holy Healing Angel” had not been displayed above her head, Li Weizheng would have suspected that his eyesight was failing.","“Temporary hair dye. It’s a fashion-player item from the game. That’s not all—look at my face. I’m wearing a human-skin mask right now.","“I can have all kinds of customized faces, and every one can look different. What do you think? Do I look like a Westerner? I managed to fool all those people from the Saint Wolf Legion just now.”","Holy Healing Angel did not possess a Mask of Disguise, so she had no way to conceal her name.","However, her name already sounded somewhat Western. In the eyes of the Saint Wolf Club players, it appeared as translated text.","On top of that, she had put on a wig and a human-skin mask.","With such thorough preparations, she had actually managed to deceive the Saint Wolf Legion.","The Saint Wolf Club players had been desperate to revive, so they had not had time to think too much. The moment they were resurrected, they accepted it.","Even if it meant dying a second time, at least they would have a chance to escape.","That was better than lying on the ground in despair, waiting for their characters to be deleted.","A moment later, Eighteen Stabs vanished from where she stood.","She had gone to track down the enemy.","Soon, she appeared behind one of them.","However, before she could even steady herself, Eighteen Stabs was blasted away by a surge of spatial energy.","[You have entered the Saint Wolf Club’s guild headquarters through illegal means!","You are not a member of the Saint Wolf Club. The opposing side has activated a spatial barrier!","You have been automatically teleported outside the guild headquarters.]","Who would have thought that after returning to the city, the Saint Wolf Club players would use their guild skill to return to their guild territory?","This came as a pleasant surprise to Eighteen Stabs.","The guild headquarters on the Main Map was the true base of the Saint Wolf Legion.","She immediately checked her coordinates and sent them to Shen Chi.","Shen Chi summoned his mecha and brought all five of them aboard.","Spatial lock-on!","Teleport!","The next moment, they appeared outside the Saint Wolf Club’s headquarters.","This was their real plan.","First, they would go to Morgan City in the Future Map to obtain its coordinates, then destroy the teleportation array and force those players back into the Main Map.","After that, they would head to the Main Map and locate the Saint Wolf Club’s guild headquarters.","The only ones who might escape were the Saint Wolf Club’s top players in the level 40–50 maps.","If those players returned to rescue the others, they would be killed.","If they did not return, they could only watch as the Saint Wolf Club was destroyed.","When they chose to attack Thorn City, they should have anticipated this outcome.","“Attack!” Chu Fu shouted.","She had not yet canceled her Plant Girl transformation; she had merely made herself smaller.","Very soon, she transformed into a gigantic plant person.","Xie Lin also flew into the sky and looked down at the guild headquarters below.","“Plant Girl, there’s a lot of good stuff here. Don’t use poison!”","Chu Fu felt that Xie Lin was calling attention to her weakness.","“Darn it! I wasn’t planning to use the Black Death Calamity this time. How about the Plague Calamity?”","A cloud of pink mist instantly spread over the entire guild headquarters.","“Enemy attack!”","“Raise the barrier! Dispel it! Priests, use Dispel!”","“It’s a plague! Everyone, spread out and take antidotes!”","“It’s the plant person! She’s attacking us! How can she even reach us here?”","The people from the Saint Wolf Club cried out in panic.","A protective barrier rose into the air.","The soldiers hired to guard the city walls hurriedly raised their weapons in terror and fired at Chu Fu and the others.","Most importantly, the walls of the guild headquarters were only ten meters high, while Chu Fu stood twenty meters tall. To the soldiers defending the headquarters, she was a giant.","Shen Chi’s mecha was the same.","Shafu Liangu took out his own equipment and summoned his Gu insects.","In an instant, enormous spiders, centipedes, mosquitoes, and cockroaches crawled out. Each one was ten meters long.","A massive cockroach, as large as a truck, slammed violently into the city gate.","The city gate had its own health bar.","With a single impact, its health dropped by five percent.","After twenty blows, the city gate gave way."]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230: The Holy Wolf Guild Is Breached, Werewolf Tuge's True Form Descends","paragraphs":["Of course, it didn’t take twenty hits.","Shen Chi used the Mechanic’s Violent Dismantling.","In less than ten seconds, the guild’s main gate had been torn down.","The protective barrier didn’t cover the gate.","So once the gate was breached, activating the barrier was useless.","These people could still march straight in.","Li Weizheng took one look at the team’s lineup and drew a deep breath.","Just who were the villains here?","Anyone who didn’t know the situation would think the Sacred Wolf Club was the victim—some poor guild that had offended a major boss and was now being slaughtered at its own doorstep.","“Stop them! Hurry! Our experts will be back soon!”","Every member transformed into a werewolf and charged forward with angry roars.","A pack of little wolf cubs facing a twenty-meter-tall Plantman, a mecha, and a giant beast looked as though they were trying to take down a boss.","The scene was incredibly bizarre.","At that moment, countless flashes of white light appeared inside the Sacred Wolf Club.","Clearly, the club’s higher-ups had returned as well.","They had come back from the Level 40–50 future maps to defend their guild.","The guild warehouse and guild funds were enormous. If the Plantman and the others really wiped them out, the losses could amount to several million gold coins’ worth of supplies.","A player in a cyan mage robe pointed at Chu Fu and the others and shouted,","“Banish!”","The next moment, the six of them felt an irresistible force lift them into the air and send them flying.","Li Weizheng had researched the Sacred Wolf Club.","“This player is called Sada Apo. His S-rank talent is Banishment, and his class is Wind Mage. He can blow a target as far as ten kilometers away.”","The man also possessed spells such as Tornado and Hurricane.","His strength was terrifying.","If someone like him appeared near Linjiang City, he could cause a devastating natural disaster.","In Huaxia’s database, his threat level had likewise been classified as S-rank.","However, perhaps because Lu Xing had made a move last time, the Sacred Wolf Group had only provoked others in the future maps and hadn’t ventured into the real world.","This time, though, it was Chu Fu and the others who had launched the first attack against them.","As Chu Fu and the others were blown away, thunderous cheers erupted from inside the Sacred Wolf Club.","But the next moment, they witnessed a scene that plunged them into despair.","A rift tore open in space, and the mecha returned.","A passage formed from roots, branches, vines, and flowers appeared in the void, and the twenty-meter-tall Plantman stepped through once more.","A massive flying sword came hurtling back at incredible speed, once again hovering over their heads.","At the same time, a tall woman in leather armor appeared behind Sada Apo. She plunged a dagger viciously into his neck, instantly killing the Level 39 expert.","“No! There’s no hope! We can’t beat them. Run!”","“Quick, get out of here! Forget the club—we just need to stay alive!”","“That’s right! The Plantman can remove our Disguiser’s Masks. We can’t take them off ourselves. Anyone who can log out, log out now! Anyone who can escape, run!”","As they spoke, a red-and-black area suddenly spread across the ground.","[You have entered the Avenger’s Domain. You cannot log out while inside this area until you fight the Avenger to the death.]","This was the fifth effect of the talent Stab the Liar Eighteen Times.","It could cover all enemies within a one-kilometer radius and prevent them from escaping.","That completely cut off their last avenue of retreat.","At the same time, Chu Fu activated the skill stored inside her staff:","“Charm!”","The people who had been trying to flee were immediately drawn toward her. Their feet moved against their will, carrying them in Chu Fu’s direction.","Chu Fu then used Black Plague Calamity once more, enveloping all of them.","This time, they died with their eyes open.","The entire guild fell into a deathly silence.","Chu Fu had slaughtered another five thousand people.","Then she began dismantling the guild base.","She was an old hand at this.","“Take apart the guild warehouse first!”","Chu Fu and Xie Lin began tearing everything apart with brute force. Before long, the guild warehouse burst open.","Equipment spilled out, forming an actual mountain.","Shen Chi pulled out a floor vacuum and started sucking everything up.","The Sacred Wolf Club’s guild base had been established beside Morgan City, making it their Level 20–30 headquarters.","All the equipment was Level 20 to Level 30.","Although the quality was inferior to the dark-gold Goblin Set, the level was higher and the quantity was enormous.","Its total value was definitely greater than the rewards from clearing an Origin-level dungeon once.","Awesome!","Next came the workshops!","The potion room was quickly dismantled, and vast quantities of alchemical materials were dug out.","The smithy, the jewelry workshop, the guild cafeteria—","Tear it down!","Tear it down!","Tear it all down!","The players lying on the ground were so furious that they nearly lost their minds.","Those were guild assets, obtained through all the evil deeds they had committed. Why should Chu Fu and the others get them?","“We can’t let them keep running wild! If the players can’t kill them, summon the Divine Envoy! Kill them!”","“Exactly! Summon the Divine Envoy! Summon his true body!”","The players of the Werewolf faction lying on the ground finally made up their minds.","Sacrificial Summoning!","This was an effect available only to Diamond-grade Disguiser’s Masks belonging to members of the Werewolf faction.","Chu Fu’s Disguiser’s Mask had also reached Diamond grade, but she hadn’t joined the Werewolf faction, so she didn’t have this ability.","Of course, Sacrificial Summoning came with a drawback. All the attributes the players of the Evil faction had previously gained would be completely wiped out.","But given the current situation, there was little difference between keeping them and losing them.","Chu Fu could remove their Disguiser’s Masks anyway.","The only reason she hadn’t done so yet was that she was afraid the effects of Black Plague Calamity would damage the buildings inside the guild.","But were these still buildings belonging to the Sacred Wolf Club?","No.","They now belonged to the Thorn Guild.","Because of this, the Sacred Wolf Club players began conspiring loudly in the guild channel.","“Another nine people! Sacrifice yourselves together! That’ll be enough to summon the Divine Envoy’s true body. The Divine Envoy is a Level 70 powerhouse!”","“Sacrifice everyone! The more people we sacrifice, the stronger the Divine Envoy’s enhancement will be. Kill the Plantman, then camp their corpses! As long as we kill them, the Thorn Guild and Thorn City will be ours!”","Incited by these words, every Sacred Wolf Club player lying on the ground offered themselves as a sacrifice.","A full five thousand people sacrificed themselves at once.","The next moment, daylight turned into night.","A red moon appeared overhead.","The blood-red moon seemed to transform into a gigantic eye. It blinked once, then began shedding blood.","The blood rained down, and it seemed as though some enormous creature was being born within it.","The crimson substance absorbed the power offered by all the Sacred Wolf Club players.","In an instant, the system announcement issued a scarlet warning.","[System Announcement: Evil God’s Apostle Level 70 Werewolf Tuge is descending into the Prime Plane. Coordinates: XXX, XXX.","For every minute Werewolf Tuge’s true body remains, the power of the Evil God will pollute the entire world, increasing the combat power of beast-type monsters by 1%.","All humans, eliminate it as quickly as possible!]","It said to eliminate him as quickly as possible.","But the teleportation arrays in the main map had not yet been activated. Who could possibly come and stop him?","Chu Fu was stunned for a moment before opening a private chat.","“Big brother, big brother, big brother, big brother, big brother!”"]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231: Global Sensation, the Flower-Planting Family Mobilizes Collectively, an Invincible Force","paragraphs":["Within the level 40–50 maps of the future.","Chu Feng naturally heard the global announcement as well.","He was utterly shocked.","Yet another thing that had never happened in his previous life had now occurred.","Almost instinctively, he felt that this must have something to do with his sister.","Sure enough, less than a second later, Chu Feng’s private messages began ringing incessantly.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Brother, brother, brother, brother, brother! I caught Werewolf Tuge! Hurry, hurry, hurry over so we can fight the BOSS together. This BOSS is guaranteed to drop something good!”","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “I have Spiritwood Plants in Morgan City and Thorn City on the future map. They can open passages!”","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Come quickly!”","Ever since the Spiritwood passages appeared, Chu Fu had instinctively placed spirits everywhere she went.","The Plant Spirits were extremely intelligent. Some could even fight monsters on their own.","So there was no harm in placing more of them.","Her base Spirit attribute had doubled in just two days.","The First City Lord bonus: +500.","The City Defense Battle BOSS: +120.","The Origin-level dungeon, Source of the Undead Calamity: +100 Spirit.","Perfect City Defense: +10.","The Origin-level dungeon, Goblin’s Nest: +10.","Two contribution shops: +20.","And the 30 Spirit gained upon reaching Level 36.","The number of Plant Spirits she could contract had increased by more than 150.","A full 750 contracted Plant Spirits were scattered throughout the places Chu Fu had passed through.","Who would have thought that her unintentional actions had opened a convenient path?","Before long, three Spiritwood passages had been activated.","One was in Morgan City on the future map, another in Thorn City on the future map, and the third was within Thorn City’s teleportation array.","Chu Fu immediately issued a city lord announcement, which could even be received by players far away in Thorn City.","[Thorn City Lord]: “Players above Level 30 may use the central teleportation passage to travel to Morgan City and participate in the battle against the Evil God. Players below Level 30 whose total attributes are under 100 will die instantly upon arrival. Proceed with caution.”","The entire Thorn City erupted once again.","Even the players who had just logged in at midnight were thrown into a frenzy.","“Only players above Level 30 can go? Players below Level 30 aren’t allowed?”","“Why are you asking so many questions? Just go! The Plant Boss wouldn’t let us down, would she?”","“I’m going! I’ve only been in the game for a few days, and I’ve already taken part in one major battle after another. We have to keep up with the Plant Boss!”","“Charge! Even if we can only take one look from the sidelines, it’ll be worth it.”","Everyone in Thorn City mobilized.","Chu Fu also sent messages to Feng Huimin, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, and the others.","But would the people from Thorn City, together with Chu Feng, be enough?","Chu Fu wasn’t sure.","According to the original storyline, Werewolf Tuge was supposed to die when Chu Feng reached Level 50.","But Chu Feng was only Level 40 now!","It would take at least two months to reach Level 50.","In the story, those two months passed in the blink of an eye.","But in reality, Chu Fu knew that Chu Feng’s Plunder skill could grant the target several hundred attribute points every day.","Using an average of 500 points, that amounted to 30,000 attribute points.","Of course, these weren’t all-purpose attributes. Even so, they were roughly equivalent to more than 7,000 points in total attributes.","A Chu Feng like that had still fought Werewolf Tuge to a standstill.","And an advantage of more than 7,000 total attributes was definitely not something seven thousand—or even seventy thousand—people could make up for.","For example, an adult might be beaten to death by a hundred five-year-old children.","But that adult definitely wouldn’t be killed by a hundred one-month-old babies.","That was the difference between the players and Werewolf Tuge right now.","Chu Fu turned her gaze toward Li Weizheng in the team.","At that moment, Li Weizheng was trembling all over.","His attributes were simply too low to withstand the pressure released by the Evil God’s Apostle.","[Evil Pressure (Negative Buff): You are within the vicinity of the Evil God’s Apostle. The evil power reduces all your attributes by 100!","When Constitution is negative: Instant death.","When Strength is negative: Your limbs become weak.","When Agility is negative: You cannot move.","When Spirit is negative: Mental collapse.]","Li Weizheng’s class did not increase Spirit, and few of his pieces of equipment increased all attributes. If he hadn’t participated in several Origin-level dungeons led by Chu Fu, he would probably have already suffered a mental breakdown.","“Major Li, Werewolf Tuge’s strength is probably even more terrifying than we imagined. Everyone needs to join forces now! I need more people to come and help!","“If we don’t completely eliminate Werewolf Tuge, the beast tide invasion in the Novice Village version will become far more terrifying, and the success rate of the village defense battle will drop drastically.","“There are only four hours left before the village defense battle!","“All the monsters in Region 055 are being enhanced.","“Eliminating Werewolf Tuge is an urgent priority.","“Call for reinforcements! Get players from across the country to come fight Werewolf Tuge!","“Oh, right—any players who have the Heart of the Beast Hunter badge must come.”","Chu Fu had already given the official authorities the guide for obtaining the Heart of the Beast Hunter badge.","As a beast-type divine apostle, Werewolf Tuge would upgrade the Heart of the Beast Hunter into an Epic-grade item after being killed.","This was the greatest boost her brother, Chu Feng, had received after killing Werewolf Tuge in the original storyline.","The only question was whether the upgrade would still be Epic-grade once more people were involved.","But the Primordial Gate often distributed rewards to everyone together.","At the very least, Origin-level dungeons awarded all players an increase to their total attributes, regardless of whether they had made any contribution.","Chu Fu would never pass up an opportunity to take advantage of the system.","As for the possibility that they might fail, she could only wrong her brother.","“City Lord Chu, don’t worry. I’ll notify them immediately and have players from across the country come here.”","Li Weizheng didn’t even care whether they could actually defeat Werewolf Tuge. He had already placed blind faith in Chu Fu.","He immediately reported upward and sent a message to Laoji Fuli. Then he began making phone call after phone call.","The Flower Kingdom swiftly issued an emergency order: Every Level 30 player was to abandon whatever they were doing and head to Thorn City in the future map.","At that moment, countless players in Thorn City surged into the Spiritwood passages.","Chu Fu opened ten more Spiritwood passages, providing enough routes for the players to enter.","However, the moment the lower-level players arrived, they felt as if a giant hand had seized their bodies. It was as though a road roller had crushed them from head to toe.","They collapsed instantly and died on the spot.","“Damn, how did I die? I didn’t even see where the monster was!”","“It’s up in the sky! There’s Evil Pressure! Anyone with less than 100 points in all attributes, stay away!”","“Ah! Someone save me! I can’t see your battle from my death perspective!”","“We told you not to come. You Flower Kingdom people really will risk your lives just to watch the excitement.”","Just as everyone was feeling as if their bodies had become unbearably heavy, an impassioned war horn rang out.","[One Heart, One Legion]","Feng Huimin had arrived!","This was Chu Fu’s greatest trump card.","In theory, the more people there were—and the stronger those players were—the greater Feng Huimin’s enhancement would become.","The Flower Kingdom had a thousand servers, and every one of them could potentially produce S-rank or SS-rank players.","As the protagonist of the world, Chu Feng’s SSS-rank talent was a national-level existence. In other words, every country had its own savior.","But the current storyline was now completely different from the plotlines of Chu Feng’s first and second lives.","Ultimately, it was the conquest of the Origin-level dungeon and the execution of the Dark Gold Project that caused the number of S- and SS-rank players across China to surge. It might even lead to the emergence of other SSS-rank players.","Once every SSS-rank player became part of Feng Huimin’s battle formation—","it would be an invincible army!"]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232: 500 Million Damage with One Palm Strike, The Precarious Legion Formation","paragraphs":["Within Thorny City, there were a full 200,000 players above Level 30.","That was a lot of thorns to deal with!","Some had completed Master-level quests, while others had not. But without a doubt, every one of them had participated in at least one first-clear attempt of an Origin-level dungeon.","Their attribute points were therefore more than sufficient.","With Feng Huimin’s Legion Unity enhancement on top of that, everyone managed to withstand the pressure.","And as more and more people gathered, the attribute enhancement grew stronger and stronger.","“Don’t let Werewolf Tuge descend so easily! Attack! Attack now!”","The Black Heaven and Blood Moon were merely phantoms formed from divine power.","There was no way Werewolf Tuge’s true body was really 360,000 kilometers away in terms of health.","The Blood Moon hung directly overhead, only a kilometer away.","The enormous red lump of flesh was two hundred meters in diameter, resembling a giant tumor.","Chu Fu controlled the Wings of Venom God and took flight.","Shen Chi piloted his mech into the air, while Xie Lin flew on his sword.","Those with flight skills used them; those without used flying wings.","The entire Thorny Guild took to the skies!","Feng Huimin arranged them into formation. Everyone took off together, densely surrounding the lump of flesh and launching attacks in advance.","The moment Chu Fu arrived, she cast Sowing Disaster.","The Seeds of Misfortune and Seeds of Disaster actually embedded themselves in the lump of flesh like real seeds.","“Use your skills on the seeds’ locations. There’s a chance of increasing their effects!” Chu Fu shouted.","Everyone attacked in unison.","Sneaky Dog crept closer to the lump of flesh, unable to resist any longer.","Steal!","System Notice: Steal successful! You obtained Evil God Divine Power Material (Diamond-grade)—enough quantity acquired.","Evil God Divine Power Material (Diamond-grade item):","Can be used on equipment below Level 70, including Level 70, to increase its quality.","Silver to Gold: 1 piece required.","Gold to Dark Gold: 10 pieces required.","Dark Gold to Diamond: 100 pieces required.","Diamond to Epic: 1,000 pieces required.","“Oh my god, Captain! I stole something amazing!” Sneaky Dog shouted.","“Keep stealing! Steal as much as you can!”","Evil God Divine Power Material only dropped when Werewolf Tuge died. In other words, it was the source of his attributes.","If they stole it in advance, they would effectively weaken him.","Sneaky Dog had finally found his role in battle and began stealing nonstop from the side.","He also discovered that as long as he hit the locations marked by Chu Fu’s Seeds of Misfortune, he could steal Diamond-grade items. Anywhere else, Steal would fail.","Got it. The captain’s skill had made this lump of flesh extremely unlucky.","Before long, the lump of flesh was covered in pits and dyed in every color of the rainbow, all of it stained by Chu Fu’s toxins.","Under the relentless bombardment, perhaps even Werewolf Tuge could no longer endure it.","At last, the lump of flesh before them began to change.","A massive limb covered in flesh and hair tore through the red membrane.","A horrifying monster slowly crawled out of the scarlet lump.","From the ground, they could vaguely make out its enormous silhouette, while torrents of bloody water continued crashing down onto the streets.","Werewolf Tuge had emerged.","It was a gigantic blood-red wolf.","Its upper body was covered in scarlet fur. As it tore its way halfway out of the lump of flesh, a pair of pitch-black eyes fixed themselves on everyone below.","The next moment, it bared its teeth.","Blood stained its snow-white fangs, dripping like saliva.","“Awooooo!”","A wolf’s howl rang out.","A terrifying sonic wave swept over them, blasting every player away. Unable to control themselves, they plummeted back to the ground.","Airspace lockdown!","Apart from players with innate SSS-rank skills, everyone else was forced to the ground.","Werewolf Tuge revealed a cruel smile. With both hands, he seized the edges of the lump and violently pulled himself free!","“Not bad, my believers. You learned to summon me so quickly! I will let you experience the joy of becoming the Beast God! Rise again!”","A surge of blood essence surged forth, flowing into the bodies of the thousands of fallen players from the Evil faction.","“Blood Resurrection? What if the blood is poisonous?”","Chu Fu raised her staff.","Blood-Melting Venom Pool!","The corpses of the players still lying on the ground were already carrying the plague’s toxins.","The Blood-Melting Venom Pool engulfed the blood.","The players were forcibly resurrected—","only to be killed by Chu Fu once again.","What a complete joke.","Werewolf Tuge immediately locked onto Chu Fu. Countless images appeared in his black pupils.","They were scenes experienced by his incarnations in this world.","“It’s you! The one obstructing the Evil God’s rule over this world! Blasphemer! Die!”","The Blood Moon overhead suddenly emitted a scarlet beam of light that struck Chu Fu.","Chu Fu had already prepared to activate her Corpse Venom.","But in the next moment, Feng Huimin blew her horn again. The entire group gathered together, and a barrier resembling a massive energy shield materialized around them.","Boom!","The blood-red beam collided with the energy barrier. A visible ring of energy rippled outward.","Every player within the formation lost health simultaneously.","Players with roughly 2,500 health or less were instantly killed, tumbling from the sky.","But more of them endured the attack.","Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate and Lu’an had only lost one-third of their health.","A Leader for Life had lost only one-tenth.","“Five hundred million damage per second. We can handle it!” Feng Huimin shouted. “Resurrect quickly! Healers, heal! Hold back the damage! MT, taunt!”","“Come and fight your granny, you oversized monster!” Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate roared as she charged forward.","Werewolf Tuge floated in midair. He kicked off with his hind legs, creating a sonic boom ring, and shot toward Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate.","Absolute Defense!","Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate activated invincibility mode.","However, while Werewolf Tuge could not deal damage to her, the overwhelming force of his attack still smashed the enormous Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate into the ground like a mole.","The next second, Lu’an took over, only to be knocked flying as well.","Finally, it was A Leader for Life’s turn.","“I’m the real BOSS! I’m the lord!”","The elderly man, who looked as though he had been steeped in authority his entire life, roared. He became the only player who was not sent flying.","“Leader, that was good! Hold him! All healers, focus on the Leader!”","A Leader for Life could indeed withstand the attacks, but his taunt had a cooldown. Werewolf Tuge’s attributes were simply too high, allowing the taunt to hold him for only one second.","The next moment, he would return to attacking his original target.","Chu Fu!","He did not merely attack Chu Fu—he also charged into the formation.","Each of his wolf claws was a full fifteen meters long. A single swipe could strike more than a hundred people.","Two hundred thousand players might have seemed like a lot, but under Werewolf Tuge’s attacks, casualties mounted rapidly.","It was raining corpses from the sky!","At this rate, the entire player force would be wiped out in less than a minute.","Once there were no longer enough players to share the damage, Chu Fu and the others would not survive either.","Just then, another figure emerged from the Spirit Passage.","The figure wore a black cloak and carried a blood-red dagger.","Chu Feng had arrived!","His attributes were overwhelmingly powerful. The moment he entered the formation, the overall enhancement of the legion shot up explosively. The attributes that had been teetering on the brink began to climb back up.","At that moment, Li Weizheng was so excited that he could barely contain himself.","“Hold on! The First has arrived! The rest of our people from Huaxia are coming too! They’re almost here! Almost!”"]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233: The dragon soars across the Nine Provinces, dragons battle in heaven, a million mighty lions gather together","paragraphs":["Li Weizheng shouted frantically in the guild.","At this moment, he regretted not having upgraded General Soul Town.","If General Soul Town had been upgraded into a city, it and Thorn City would both be cities that had successfully defended themselves, and they would have been able to establish a teleportation link.","By then, all they would have needed to do was teleport into Thorn City and rush to the Saint Wolf Club’s guild headquarters.","But now, they first had to use Return Scrolls to go back to Linjiang City, head to the Master-Class Job Advancement Hall, and find the NPC who could teleport them to the Future Map.","From the Future Map, they would then have to teleport to the location of Thorn City in the future and find the spatial passage.","Even with the most professional team moving at top speed, it would take at least ten minutes.","And every minute of those ten minutes felt like an eternity.","Moreover, the system kept issuing prompts like a death knell.","[The attributes of all beast-type creatures have increased by 1%.]","[3%.]","[5%.]","[7%.]","...","In the real world.","All of the Analysis Bureau’s data was flashing red.","The Liaison Bureau and Coordination Bureau were frantically making calls, notifying everyone to provide support.","The Experimental Bureau sent out an alarm as well.","“Director, this is bad! The Experimental Bureau just detected signs of frenzy in the lop-eared rabbits, mutant rats, and wild boars in the real world. Their strength is increasing too!”","A 7% increase was already extremely obvious.","The red-eyed rabbits and mutant rats had grown a full size larger.","The wild boars had become stronger, and their destructive power was astonishing.","Most importantly, the players stationed there had been summoned online by Huaxia to support Chu Fu.","“All soldiers below Level 30, log off! Distribute firearms and fully suppress every incident involving attacks by the mutated beasts!”","“Yes!”","“Contact every country in the world. This isn’t just Huaxia’s problem—it’s an international crisis. Have the Level 30 players join the battle as well. Doesn’t Morgan City have a passage too? Send them there!”","“Move! Faster! Faster!”","Amid these frantic commands and desperate prayers...","In the game:","Within the twelve Forest Spirit Passages in the Saint Wolf Club, the second passage—the one representing the future location of Thorn City—once again saw someone emerge.","It was an old man with dark skin and a face covered in wrinkles. Yet his body was incredibly robust. He stood a full one hundred ninety centimeters tall and was extremely broad-shouldered.","Three lines of text appeared above his head.","[Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces]","[Grand Marshal Long Zhantian]","[President of the Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces Guild]","The official forces had arrived.","This was the true official guild of Huaxia, and its guild level had already reached Level 4.","Maximum player capacity: 40,000.","A Level 4 guild possessed a unique guild skill: Mass Summoning.","When the guild leader issued an order, players who were not in special maps could click confirm and instantly arrive beside the guild leader.","However, each use consumed one gold coin per player, and it could only be used once per day.","The battlefield was far too intense. The players had not even noticed Long Zhantian’s arrival. Instead, Long Zhantian saw the members of the Thorn Guild and revealed a faintly astonished expression.","No matter how much the reports said, nothing compared to seeing it with his own eyes.","The Thorn Guild—or rather, Thorn City—truly lived up to its reputation!","The next moment, he activated Mass Summoning.","Forty thousand players instantly appeared beside him. At the same time, they were enveloped by a military formation, injecting strength into everyone’s hearts like a powerful stimulant.","Li Weizheng was so excited that tears glistened in the corners of his eyes.","“They’re here! Reinforcements have arrived! Old Commander!”","“Don’t talk. Fight together first.”","Long Zhantian stopped Li Weizheng. Gripping a massive ax, he leaped into the air and joined the battle.","Chu Fu was attacking as well, and she noticed someone new who was fully equipped in diamond-grade gear.","When she saw the player’s ID, she immediately matched him with the player from the storyline.","Huaxia’s super-god-tier player, known as the Huaxia Titan, Descendant of Pangu, and Strongest Warrior—Long Zhantian!","After the Primordial Gate appeared, Huaxia’s upper echelons underwent a reshuffle. In the end, strength in the game still decided everything.","The weak obeyed the strong. Talent was simply that unreasonable. This marshal in his sixties had obtained an SSS-rank talent at the start and had become the undisputed pillar of Huaxia.","Chu Fu glanced at him briefly before turning her attention away and continuing to unleash attacks at full force.","By contrast, Chu Feng’s gaze fell on Long Zhantian, and he raised an eyebrow.","He was a reincarnator. Although he had never met Long Zhantian in his previous life, Long Zhantian had always been the spiritual pillar of Huaxia.","Chu Fu did not know whether Long Zhantian had led Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces to survive until the end of the game’s descent in the previous life.","But in this life, she could stand as an equal with such a powerful figure. In fact, her level was even higher than his!","Long Zhantian was only Level 35.","Chu Fu had already surpassed him.","Even so, that level was definitely not low among the current players.","With forty thousand players joining the battle, the force expanded to 300,000 people.","Their arrival triggered a chain reaction. As Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces arrived, even more players, guilds, and official organizations began rushing over.","This time, a large group of players flooded in.","The player at the head of the group was not tall. He wore a blue mage robe and had an unremarkable appearance—he was even somewhat ugly.","But he was the most famous star player in Shanhai City.","Luo Qi!","“Lieutenant Colonel Luo Qi of Shanhai City has arrived to provide support! Brothers and sisters in Linjiang City, hold on!” Luo Qi shouted.","He even began recording, hoping to capture his heroic appearance.","He couldn’t imagine how cool he was going to look in this footage!","He had brought a full two thousand people with him.","That was everyone from the Shanhai City official forces.","Not every city had players like those in Thorn City, who had participated in so many Origin-level instances.","Players who had reached Level 30 in two months were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Most of them were players from the top ten regions.","Feng Huimin’s formation instantly enveloped them.","“Everyone, enter the formation! Let’s hold back the Evil God’s Envoy together!”","Feng Huimin sounded the horn. Whether they were members of Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces or players from Shanhai City led by Luo Qi, everyone’s attributes increased dramatically.","“Hahaha! This feels amazing! Doesn’t this make me invincible?” Luo Qi shouted excitedly.","The next moment, the werewolf Tu Ge swiped at them with one claw. The entire group immediately lost health.","Among the forty-two thousand newcomers, the weaker mages and assassins instantly collapsed to the ground.","Even Luo Qi, a mage with excellent equipment and an extreme attribute build, was killed on the spot.","Damn!","He was stunned.","Looking at the terrifying werewolf Tu Ge from his death perspective, the other party’s evil-god pressure seemed almost tangible, as though it were mocking him.","But in the next moment, he saw new players surging out of the Forest Spirit Passage.","A woman in an ice-blue mage robe led the group out.","The ID above her head read: Icefrost.","She was a star player from Cangsong City, as well as a former esports host—Fang Ning.","“Cangsong City has arrived to provide support! The main force will be here soon!”","Another two thousand people joined the battle.","“Yungang City has arrived to provide support!”","“Qiutan City has arrived to provide support!”","“Baizhou City has arrived to provide support!”","“Wujin City has arrived to provide support!”","More than two thousand people joined from every city.","Not a single one of Huaxia’s one thousand servers was absent.","S-rank and SS-rank players joined one after another.","The more people there were, the more the damage was divided among them, and the stronger everyone became.","The size of the force increased tenfold.","The true million-strong army has assembled."]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234: Exterminating the Werewolf Tuge, The Terrifying Reward for First Killing a Divine Envoy (1700 Five-Star Reviews Bonus Chapter)","paragraphs":["Shen Chi began frantically manufacturing flying wings and sending them out for everyone to equip.","Any flying wings capable of withstanding the devastation caused by Werewolf Tuge’s wolf howl were naturally far superior to the ones from the Novice Village.","The base cost of each one had already reached 1 gold coin. In just over ten minutes, Shen Chi had spent a full million.","The players surrounded Werewolf Tuge in a ring, forming a gigantic millstone that revolved around him layer by layer.","As more and more flying devices joined the battle, they became like a great net, constantly tightening and imprisoning Werewolf Tuge.","No matter how fiercely it attacked or how much it clawed at them, it could no longer kill a single person.","Feng Huimin knew that the battle had been decided.","“You miserable ants! Damn humans! You should all have become food for the blood feast, yet you actually dare to resist!”","Werewolf Tuge finally sensed that something was wrong, but it could no longer break out.","Countless players surrounded it.","Countless tanks endured its attacks head-on.","At that moment, its health bar was finally shaken—if only by the slightest amount.","Fifteen minutes.","One percent.","Its health bar was visible!","“Attack!”","Everyone roared.","At that moment, the first player with golden hair and blue eyes emerged from one of the Forest Spirit Passages.","“I’m here to join you too! The Holy Wolf Club is nothing but a bunch of scum. They should be wiped out. Evil forces have no place in this world. For world peace!”","“No matter what country you’re from, as long as you stand on humanity’s side, you’re our comrade-in-arms today.”","With the arrival of that first player, Level 30 players from overseas began appearing one after another in the Forest Spirit Passages.","People from other nations had finally arrived.","Some were solo players, while others had been dispatched by their governments.","The countries friendly with China had sent support first, though it had taken some time to gather their players.","The Bear Nation dispatched its official guild, the Winter Alliance!","It was also a Level 4 guild, with forty thousand members.","Aside from them, official guilds from various regions were sent over as well, bringing the total to two hundred thousand players.","That was practically the full extent of their support.","Next came Bashiling, whose official guild, Kunlun Watch, also had forty thousand members.","However, that country had a huge population, and many of its players had already reached Level 30.","They sent a full three hundred thousand players.","With their arrival, the balance of victory began to tilt.","The total number of players had reached 2.7 million.","Feng Huimin sent a message to Chu Fu.","“Boss, there’s no need to send anyone else. We can’t control the formation anymore! Besides, anyone who comes now is probably just waiting to see what happens, hoping to swoop in and take advantage of the situation!”","Li Weizheng immediately nodded from within the group as well. “That’s right. I’ve received word that the Triumphant Holy Alliance from the Romantic Nation, the Iron Order from the Will Nation, the Maple Guardians from Maple Leaf Nation, and the Brahma Domain Gate from Tianzhu Nation are all waiting in Morgan City. But they have no intention of using the passage to come here.","“They’re definitely doing it on purpose.","“The same goes for the Kimchi Nation and Cherry Blossom Nation around us. They’re waiting in Thorn City, which is much closer to them.","“And besides...”","Li Weizheng hesitated for a moment before looking toward the very front of the group, at the man with the highest damage output.","“Number One and these countries have a grudge against each other!”","Chu Fu understood.","Big Brother had once again taken the path of others, leaving them nowhere to go.","What was there to hesitate about?","Chu Fu immediately closed the Forest Spirit Passages.","Keeping them open consumed a tremendous amount of mana. Although her equipment was now exceptionally powerful, and her Plantfolk trait, Plant Symbiosis, allowed her to recover mana rapidly, who knew what might happen?","If anyone asked, she would simply say that she had run out of mana. Time waited for no one.","Two million seven hundred thousand troops were more than enough.","A dense mass of players surged forward to attack, creating the genuine impression of ants biting an elephant to death.","Werewolf Tuge was like a trapped beast, terror filling its eyes as its health continued to fall.","Four hours later, Werewolf Tuge’s health had dropped to 80%.","However, a terrifying wave of village-destroying disasters had swept through the Novice Villages around the world.","The strength of all beasts had increased by 240%.","Red-eyed rabbits, mutated rats, and wild boars in the real world had grown to 2.4 times their original size.","The wild boars charged around like tanks. They had to be slaughtered and suppressed, and all the dead boars were frozen and stored in cold storage.","For the foreseeable future, China would be eating nothing but frozen pork.","At that moment, the entire world finally realized how terrifying an impact the descent of the divine emissary had caused.","Countries and players that had not wanted to get involved now all wanted to come and help.","But by then, they discovered that the passages had been closed.","The phones of China’s Foreign Ministry and Analysis Bureau were immediately overwhelmed with calls.","“We understand the situation, but don’t worry.”","“The battle will definitely be over within twenty-four hours. There won’t be a second crisis.”","“What? Rodents are running rampant in your country? We’re truly sorry to hear that. But you can’t blame us. If you want someone to blame, blame that damn Holy Wolf Club!”","In the game, the battle continued.","Fortunately, ever since the Siege Defense Battle, China’s players had realized the importance of gaming pods and had purchased them in droves.","Never mind another sixteen hours.","Even if they had to fight for three days and three nights, they could hold out.","Chu Fu led countless players in maintaining their relentless assault.","All kinds of disaster skills were unleashed, and the misfortune skills never stopped either.","However, the Gatling Corn Sprite’s attacks could not break through the target’s defenses, so Chu Fu summoned new plant sprites.","The Revival Grass Sprite, the Holy Light Flower Sprite, and the Frost Mage Sprite.","Chu Fu first used her Plantfolk ability to mutate the Revival Grass and Holy Light Flower, but neither of them gained any combat talent.","However, after she bound them with the Forest Spirit Contract, both of them transformed into incredibly powerful support units.","The Revival Grass evolved into a sprite capable of casting resurrection spells.","The Holy Light Flower transformed into an angel.","The Ice Crystal Snow Lotus already possessed a mutated combat talent. After being bound by the Forest Spirit Contract, it became even stronger. It wore a dress shaped like a snow-lotus bud, its entire body a pristine white, and held a staff in its hands.","Trait 1: Frost Mist.","Trait 2: Iceball Attack.","Furthermore, when two hundred Frost Mage Sprites released their skills together, even Werewolf Tuge would be frozen.","They could forcibly control Werewolf Tuge.","At that point, Chu Fu’s sustained damage output had already surpassed her big brother’s, making her the undisputed Number One.","Werewolf Tuge’s health continued to plummet.","Twenty percent.","“Execute it! Use every execution skill!” Feng Huimin shouted.","Xie Lin immediately unleashed Holy Light Judgment.","Countless skills rained down upon Werewolf Tuge.","Time passed bit by bit.","Three hours later, Werewolf Tuge’s health finally reached zero!","At that moment, a system announcement rang out like the tolling of a great bell!","[System Announcement: Under the leadership of the player “Who Wants to Be a Plant?”, humanity has defeated the Evil God’s divine emissary and driven the Evil God’s power out of the Primordial Gate. All participating players are rewarded with +1,000 to all attributes. First kill of a divine emissary.]","[System Announcement: Due to the death of the Evil God’s divine emissary, Werewolf Tuge, the Evil God’s power has been punished. All beast enhancements have disappeared. At the same time, mutation levels and attributes have been reduced, and the difficulty of beast instances has decreased. However, the rewards remain unchanged.]","[System Announcement: The stolen divine power will be returned to all players. Please continue striving!]"]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235: All Hail, the Leader of a Major Power","paragraphs":["【System Announcement: The Disguise Masks of all players who joined the Werewolf faction have been deactivated. All attributes they carried have been withdrawn. The Sin Leaderboard is now open. Killing a player on the Sin Leaderboard will earn a gold reward. Players may also place bounties on sinful players through the leaderboard to obtain their coordinates.】","At that moment, the hidden IDs of every player who had joined the Werewolf faction reappeared in the game. Their red names were exposed without any attempt at concealment, and their faces became clearly visible.","Red-named players were monsters.","In an instant, everyone around them became an enemy.","The red-named players inside the cities were in an even worse situation. They were killed by the guards, and their heads were hung on the execution grounds. No one would revive them.","Some of the experts were participating in events on future maps, but those maps were updated every day, and the players would be sent back to the Master-level Class Advancement Hall.","The problem was that the guards inside the hall were all level 60.","The only way to escape was to stop logging into the game forever and live beyond the law using the power they had transferred into reality.","It was worth mentioning that once a player had transferred their strength into reality, dying in the game would not cause that power to disappear.","However, the death of a character in the game was equivalent to severing that player’s path to the future.","And for many players, not being able to log into the game was something they simply could not endure.","All that could be said was that this day had become a nightmare for every player in the Werewolf faction.","After Werewolf Tuge was killed, the global situation changed completely.","The increasingly chaotic situation overseas came to an abrupt halt, returning to a superficial stalemate.","Chu Fu had been the fuse that set everything off, yet she had also accomplished a truly meritorious deed.","Naturally, the system was not stingy with its rewards.","Pleasant notifications continued to ring in Chu Fu’s ears.","【Your class, Seed of the Forest Spirit, has evolved into God of the Forest Spirit.】","【You have obtained a genuine Fragment of Divine Power (Mythic, Bound): It possesses extremely powerful divine might. Collect 10 fragments to condense a False Godhead.","Note: A False Godhead may only be used once you reach level 100 or one of your attributes reaches 10,000.】","【Your Soul-Stealing Ring has absorbed the soul of the Evil God’s Apostle and evolved into Epic quality!】","【The levels of all your skills have increased by 3.】","【Your current level has increased by 3.】","All the players erupted in astonishment.","The resources each player received differed according to their contributions, but without exception, their talents, classes, and skills all improved.","The lowest level increase was one, while the highest went to Chu Feng, whose level rose directly by five, reaching level 45.","There had been a full 2.7 million players participating in the battle.","That meant that when the game invaded the future, there would be 2.7 million players with astonishingly powerful builds.","Based on the current equipment values in the game, it was equivalent to every one of them putting on three complete sets of diamond-grade equipment.","In reality, however, Spatial Stones were scarce, and players’ levels continued to rise, causing equipment to become obsolete rapidly.","Many players extracted only one weapon they found useful and stopped there.","Now that they had gained another 1,000 points to all attributes, naturally they would extract more equipment. This demonstrated just how valuable those attribute points were.","Every one of them had become a superhuman.","Their attributes were simply too outrageous.","Just as Chu Fu thought the rewards had come to an end, the system sent another notification.","【Based on your performance in this battle, after absorbing divine power, you have obtained a third talent: Hulk (SSS)!】","What... what?","After Plantman and Poison Man, she had become the Hulk too?","Wasn’t the gap a little too extreme—from a frail, sickly Plantman to a terrifying Hulk?","Chu Fu’s gaze fell on the talent description.","【SSS-Rank Talent—Hulk:","Trait 1: Plant Growth: You can enlarge any plant.","Trait 2: Plant Strength: Enlarged plants possess tremendous strength.","Trait 3: Physical Damage increased by 100%.","Trait 4: Fiber Toughness: Your defense is greatly increased. You are immune to most physical damage, and attacks cannot leave wounds on your skin.","Trait 5: Hulk: After transforming through a plant enhanced by “Plant Growth” and “Plant Strength,” your own body will also become gigantic and immensely powerful.】","This was actually somewhat like a tank skill, and the talent was built upon Trait 5 of Plantman.","This was a standard derivative talent.","Perhaps because she had fought Werewolf Tuge at close range during the battle—and had relied on the military formation to distribute the damage while desperately entangling him—the system had decided that her actions had been very “tank-like.”","Chu Fu was both amused and exasperated, but there was no doubt that this was an extremely powerful skill.","Hulk provided an enormous boost to Plantman.","She was satisfied.","Everyone was cheering.","After the laughter and celebration, the guildmaster of Dragon Conquers the Nine Provinces walked over to Chu Fu.","“Hello, Guildmaster Thorn. I’ve long heard of your reputation, and I’m very glad that we were able to fight alongside you this time. On behalf of all the players and all the soldiers of our homeland, I’d like to thank you for your deep exploration of the game and for everything you’ve contributed to society.”","He raised his hand toward Chu Fu.","“Salute!”","“Whoosh!”","It seemed as though countless voices echoed through the air.","The players, dressed in different equipment and carrying different weapons, raised their right hands in perfect unison.","They saluted!","Even the players from neighboring countries who did not belong to China’s side applauded enthusiastically.","This was an honor that belonged to Chu Fu—and to Thorn.","“Guildmaster Thorn, how exactly do you play this game? Can you teach us? You people are true gaming geniuses.”","The guildmaster of the Winter Alliance, the Winter Commander, spoke with a humorous tone. He was currently the commander of the Bear Kingdom, and had also become the guildmaster of the Winter Alliance.","“China and our country are friends. Thank you for bringing us along to fight monsters this time and helping us gain so many attributes. If you ever need anything, just let us know!”","The guildmaster of Kunlun Watch, Foothill Guide, was much more straightforward.","The two sides engaged in a friendly exchange.","Only now did Chu Fu truly feel that she had become the leader of a major power.","Moreover, in front of these people who wielded real authority in the outside world, she felt neither inferior nor timid in the slightest.","Because her strength had already reached the pinnacle.","Er... what about the other pinnacle?","Chu Fu discovered that her brother had actually slipped away.","...","Elsewhere.","The leaders of other countries, already overwhelmed by the monsters plaguing the real world, received the system’s reward announcement.","They all regretted their decision so deeply that they could have torn their own guts out.","Why had they chosen to stand by and watch?","If they had joined in, those 1,000 points to all attributes would have belonged to them as well.","It wasn’t as though they didn’t know that Chu Fu frequently appeared in system announcements, or that following her meant there would be rewards to share.","But opportunity and danger went hand in hand. Werewolf Tuge’s strength had been far too terrifying, and they were afraid that Chu Fu would use them as cannon fodder.","So they had decided to wait and see.","Why had that Plantman been the one to close the passage?","Their losses had been enormous because of it.","It was all the fault of that person who wanted to become a Plantman.","Chu Fu had no idea what the various countries were thinking.","They had been given an opportunity and failed to seize it. What a useless bunch.","After exchanging pleasantries with Long Zhantian and the others and adding them as friends, Chu Fu returned to Thorn City.","She issued two orders."]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236: Establish the Thorn Branch, Fight the Titan Giant","paragraphs":["First: Raise the guild to Level 4.","Second: Establish the Thorn Branch Guilds.","After this hunt for the divine envoy, nearly half of the S-rank talent players within the Thorn Guild had reached S-rank.","There were also a large number of unaffiliated players from Thorn City who had awakened S-rank talents, but the Thorn Guild was already full.","Not to mention the A-rank and B-rank talent players, who also had great potential.","The Thorn Workshop was growing larger by the day, yet many of its members still did not belong to a guild.","Without a guild, they had no warehouse or contribution-point exchange system, which put them at a disadvantage.","Besides, the War Soul Guild had invited them repeatedly, but they still refused to leave Thorn City.","This clearly couldn’t continue. Chu Fu decided to establish branch guilds under the Thorn Guild.","She planned to establish three guilds, but the branch leaders had to be people she trusted.","She intended to discuss it with everyone.","In fact, she wanted Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and Jiaojiao Bu Jiao to each lead one of the branch guilds.","After all, the three of them were also major shareholders.","Unexpectedly, both men refused.","“I’m a technical specialist. I spend more time at the workbench than fighting monsters. I don’t want to manage a guild!” Shen Chi said.","Xie Lin was even more direct. “It would interfere with my swordsmithing. I’m not doing it.”","Chu Fu was speechless.","“Then what do Jiaojiao, Sister Suture, and Manager Feng think? Would any of you be willing to lead a branch guild?”","“Will we still be in the same team afterward?” Jiaojiao asked reluctantly. She couldn’t bear to leave Chu Fu. If becoming a branch leader meant disbanding their team, she absolutely wouldn’t agree.","“Of course!” Chu Fu said. Jiaojiao was such a wonderful person that Chu Fu couldn’t bear to part with her either.","“Then I’ll do it!” Jiaojiao said.","“I can do it too!” Suture Saint said.","In just two short months, Suture Saint had gone from being a doctoral student to becoming a powerful healer respected by everyone.","Strength brought confidence.","If she wanted to become a guild leader, she was more than qualified. At worst, she could hire someone to handle the work.","She could even establish a secretary team.","After all, she was incredibly wealthy now.","Once the decision was made, all that remained was to put it into action.","One billion contribution points from the town defense battle could be exchanged for a Guild Token. The highest-ranked boss of each level also had a chance to drop one.","In the future maps, even the Titans would directly drop Guild Tokens.","Moreover, because the Dark Gold Plan had caused gold prices to fall, bosses had become easier to kill and dropped more Guild Tokens.","As a result, the price had stabilized.","A single token could be purchased for roughly nine thousand gold coins.","Chu Fu accessed the guild funds and bought them directly.","The three women immediately established Thorn Guilds Two, Three, and Four.","They first recruited the S-rank players from the Thorn Workshop, as well as the S-rank talent players among the unaffiliated players.","A Level 1 guild could accommodate only five hundred people.","As long as a new guild stronghold was built in town, the guild could be upgraded to Level 2. In other words, upgrading from Level 1 to Level 2 only required money.","After some discussion, the three of them established strongholds near the Herb Valley, the Logging Camp, and the Mine Vein. Once the strongholds expanded, they would be able to cover the surrounding resource points.","That would allow them to monopolize those resources.","After all, these were rewards from the town defense battle and rightfully belonged to the Thorn Guild.","Upgrading a guild from Level 2 to Level 3 required reputation. Chu Fu was the city lord herself, so she issued several simple collection quests. The guilds reached Level 3 in a single day.","Level 4 was different.","Although the Level 4 quest was also issued by Chu Fu, it was a quest mandated by the system.","[Guild Upgrade Quest: Travel to the Level 30–40 map, hunt Titans, and obtain Titan Hearts (0/100).]","This presented a major problem.","Each city spawned roughly ten Titans attacking the city every day. If they only hunted the Titans in their own city, it would take ten days to upgrade a single guild.","The problem was that each city had many guilds.","“I finally understand why my brother made so many enemies. Don’t tell me upgrading a guild to Level 5 will require Elemental Spirit Crystals?”","Chu Fu could only say that she was going to have to compete for them too.","...","Level 30–40 Future Map.","Inside Thorn City.","Everyone entered once again.","Not only that, but the flood of players left even Chu Fu astonished.","It felt as though every player in Thorn City had come.","There were no dungeons in the Future Map, but bosses and monsters were everywhere.","The beasts, goblins, and undead legions were all above Level 30.","It was worth mentioning that because they had killed the werewolf Tuge, the strength of beast-type monsters had fallen by 100%, making them exceptionally easy to defeat.","The players immediately began focusing on beast-type monsters, and their leveling speed naturally increased by a great deal.","Chu Fu had already reached Level 39 and would soon be unable to enter this map.","The Future Maps allowed lower-level players to enter higher-level areas, but higher-level players could not enter lower-level maps.","That rule prevented them from monopolizing resources meant for lower-level players.","The Primordial Gate made sure that all players developed at different paces.","Therefore, Chu Fu could no longer go to the town defense battle to fight the goblin Origin-tier dungeon.","Those few attributes were no longer worth her time.","“Everyone, get in the mecha!”","Shen Chi smiled as he summoned his mecha.","When they saw the colossal machine, everyone was stunned.","It was actually a hundred-meter-tall mecha, grayish-white in color. Most striking of all, its design was far more savage than ordinary mecha—and it resembled a werewolf!","“Is this the mecha you made from the divine envoy’s corpse?” Chu Fu asked as she examined it.","When the divine envoy died, it had not dropped any equipment. Everyone had been too captivated by the reward that granted an increase to all attributes to pay attention to what Werewolf Tuge had dropped.","In the end, Shen Chi had simply placed Werewolf Tuge’s enormous body into the vacuum machine.","The upper echelons of the Thorn Guild had secretly divided up the spoils after returning.","Every part of Werewolf Tuge’s body was valuable.","Its blood could be used as medicine, while its flesh could be made into food that granted attributes.","Its heart and other internal organs were fed to the giant insects used for Gu cultivation.","Its claws and bones were made into the mecha.","Xie Lin took the fangs to forge into a sword.","Its hide and fur were given to Zhimengzhe to make equipment.","Not a single drop or scrap had been wasted.","“This is a newly constructed mecha,” Shen Chi explained. “Because it’s made from wolf bones, it can’t fuse with my own body. Instead, it’s a large mecha containing a smaller one.”","The hundred-meter-tall mecha formed the outer shell, while Shen Chi’s twenty-meter-tall mecha was inside. That inner mecha could still fuse with his body and shrink down.","What difference was there between this and wearing two sets of equipment?","Mechanists really were completely dependent on their gear.","Everyone climbed into the wolf-shaped mecha. There was much more room inside than expected, and the central area resembled a small shopping mall, with enough space for a great many people.","The interior had also been constructed from spatial stone. No matter how violently the mecha moved outside, the people inside felt no shaking at all.","Shen Chi had even built a lounge, study, kitchen, small workshop, smithy, and plant cultivation room inside.","Anyone who didn’t know better might have mistaken it for a small fortified base.","It was astonishingly comprehensive.","Everyone’s horizons had been broadened.","Soon afterward, Shen Chi piloted the hundred-meter-tall mecha as it raced across the map.","Before long, they found their first wandering Titan.","It was a juvenile Titan, only twenty meters tall. The moment it saw the wolf-shaped mecha, it froze in confusion.","How could there be a creature in this world that was even larger than itself?"]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237: Promoted to Level 4 Guild, Fourth Wave of Synchronized Monsters","paragraphs":["Shen Chi did not let any of them get out.","He piloted the wolf-type mecha and charged straight in.","Its massive claws slammed down, sending the twenty-meter-tall juvenile Titan staggering as the earth shook.","Then he reached in with both hands.","The opponent’s heart was ripped out.","The scene was extremely bloody.","But the damage dealt was tremendous.","There was no need for Chu Fu or the others to intervene. Shen Chi had dealt with it on his own.","Feng Huimin watched from the side and calculated the damage.","Then her communicator began sending out group messages.","Although she was personally in charge of the Fourth Branch, she still handled all the personnel assignments.","“Exclude Huaxia’s territory. Form fifty-person teams and disperse them across the world. Preferably send them to smaller countries with sparse populations.”","“Each guild can currently form four hundred teams. Try to complete the mission within a day.”","Feng Huimin continuously organized teams and dispatched groups. This was even more difficult than organizing a direct battle.","During a major war, all she had to do was blow the horn, and every player would follow her orders.","Now, she could only rely on guild notices and group messages.","Feng Huimin was effectively managing more than a hundred groups.","She worked at an intense pace.","Before long, the Bramble Guild’s players had scattered across the world.","...","Onyx City.","One of the island nations in Oceania, it had a population of only one hundred thousand and just a single server.","Moreover, once the ten districts had been established, no new districts were opened.","There were currently only 143 level-30 players.","And because the population was small, there were few talented players, making dungeon clears extremely difficult.","As a result, they had no money.","Most players possessed only a few pieces of gold equipment. The rest of their gear was level-30 silver equipment.","Previously, whenever they came here to level up, they had to band together for warmth. A party of fewer than twenty people had no chance of dealing with level-30 monsters.","But today, after the death of Werewolf Tuge, the combat power of beast-type creatures had been reduced by half. Leveling up had finally become a little easier!","As they were fighting monsters, the ground suddenly began to tremble.","“Is a boss showing up this early today? Get back to the city!”","“Damn, it’s an Elder Titan! The city’s going to be demolished again!”","“Teleport away quickly, or we won’t be able to level up today!”","“Do you think teleportation is free? It’s so expensive! I’m out of gold!”","The players were utterly helpless.","It was bad enough that their country was small. Even in the game, things were this difficult.","Just as they were thinking this, the teleportation array suddenly began to flash with white light.","A group of players appeared.","The melee players were all equipped in complete sets of Savage Dark Gold gear, while the magic users wore black robes of the Dark Gold rank.","They marched through in neat formation. The radiance and afterimages from their equipment were so dazzling that the eyes of the small nation’s players hurt.","Boom!","The seventy-meter-tall Elder Titan viciously smashed the towering tree in its hands against the city wall.","Cracks immediately spread across the wall.","A level-40 Titan stood a full seventy meters tall and possessed astonishing combat power. A single Titan could destroy an entire city, to say nothing of Onyx Island, which was tiny to begin with.","“Pretty lucky. We just got here and already found a Titan. Brothers, attack!”","“Only seventy meters? I’ve fought a hundred-meter werewolf before!”","“Slow down and wait for the tanks! Are you planning to tank the monster yourselves?”","“I have a thousand points in Constitution. What do I have to fear?”","A crowd surged forward and surrounded the Titan.","Under their overwhelming advantage in attributes, the Titan fell to the ground in less than ten minutes.","Equipment spilled everywhere.","The equipment dropped by a seventy-meter Titan consisted of Dark Gold gear with attributes close to level 40—but there was only one such item, along with seven or eight pieces of gold equipment.","All of it was far better than the level-20 Goblin sets.","After an internal auction, everyone replaced their gear.","Then the group climbed onto the Titan’s corpse and began cutting it apart.","The scene was extremely bloody and violent.","But the Bramble Guild’s players followed one principle above all: waste nothing.","The guild even had a Little Pig-Raising Expert. By turning in the corpses of various exotic beasts to the guild warehouse, players could earn guild contribution points.","Most importantly, these exotic beast corpses also counted toward the guild’s twenty-percent cut. To them, it was practically free profit.","The players from Onyx Island stared at the group, so shocked that their jaws nearly hit the ground.","Was it really this easy?","Hadn’t it taken more than twenty teams, with over a thousand people working together, to bring down these Titans?","Scenes like this played out one after another across the small countries overseas.","Before long, one guild became famous.","The Bramble Guild.","An immensely powerful guild from Huaxia.","The guild killed Titans, while the players of these small countries could level up safely. It was mutually beneficial.","With so many people working together, one hundred Titan Hearts were soon collected.","Even the Second, Third, and Fourth Branches had gathered all they needed.","Chu Fu submitted the Titan Hearts and completed the guild promotion.","Jiaojiao Not Delicate, Suture Saint, and Feng Huimin submitted theirs as well.","Thus, all four guilds reached level four, giving them a combined capacity of 160,000 players.","Chu Fu then checked the mandatory quest for a level-five guild.","As expected, it required them to kill Elemental Spirits and collect Elemental Hearts.","Quantity: 500!","Elemental Spirits killed by other people did not count.","Chu Fu and the others did not linger long in the level-30-to-40 maps before turning toward the level-40-to-50 maps.","However, Chu Feng, who had already reached level 45, was now grinding monsters in maps for players above level 60.","He was always at the forefront, leading all other players by three versions.","But Chu Fu was not anxious.","She felt that her current approach was fine too. She was steadily building her strength, and she had already led 2.7 million players worldwide to kill a Divine Envoy.","They had ruthlessly milked the system for a wave of rewards.","In the timeline when Chu Feng was the protagonist, she had defeated the boss alone and obtained a reward of 1,000 points in every attribute.","What an enormous difference that was!","She had missed out on a full 2.7 billion points in total attributes by not freeloading off those rewards.","Of course, Chu Fu understood Chu Feng. As a lone wolf, he was satisfied as long as he got the rewards himself and had no concern for whether others lived or died.","Even Chu Fu herself did not really want those countries harboring ulterior motives to freeload off the attribute rewards.","She was generous, but not that generous.","...","Time passed quietly.","One week later.","Everyone in the Analysis Bureau’s main hall was busy.","Time since the game opened: 72 days.","“All wolf-type creatures in the cities and zoos have been brought under control. Personnel have been stationed in the mountainous regions.”","“We’re currently monitoring them for signs of mutation.”","“Mutation detected!”","“Wait, Director! Someone has reported that their dog has grown enormous!”","The expressions of everyone in the Analysis Bureau suddenly changed.","The fourth animal synchronized by the Primordial Gate was the wolf!","If it had only been monsters like those, there would have been no need to worry. After all, they were creatures of the wilderness.","But what if these mutated creatures turned out to be dogs?","How many dogs were there across the world?","And Huaxia had far too many dogs.","“Quick, issue an announcement and open a hotline. The moment an incident involving a mutated dog biting someone is reported, deal with it immediately.”","“Clear out all stray dogs and establish dog-control squads.”","“Quickly! Everyone who owns a dog must be monitored by their local community and placed under separate isolation.”","Everyone’s expression was tense.","They felt that the world might descend into chaos at any moment.","The announcement was sent out.","Linjiang City received the notice as well.","Li Weizheng was just about to pass the message on when, in the next instant, someone rushed up directly in front of him.","“I don’t agree! I have a way—don’t kill those dogs!”"]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238: The Druid's Call, Dogs Are Humanity's Good Friends","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Li Weizheng sighed as well. “Student Feng, don’t get worked up. I know you love dogs, but you can’t control these mutated creatures and stop them from attacking people. If something happens, who’s going to take responsibility? This is a matter of life and death!”","Feng Leyuan’s chubby face twitched. “Give me one hour. Please, Major Li. I even joined the official organization. Can’t you help me with something this small? Otherwise, I...”","Li Weizheng’s expression instantly turned stern. He snapped, “Student Feng, what do you take the official organization for? You can’t just join whenever you feel like it and refuse to take on any responsibility! The official organization invested resources in training you, too.”","Feng Leyuan’s breathing grew heavy, and his eyes turned bloodshot. “If I’d sided with Bitter Melon King and Dream King back then, would I be able to ignore orders now?”","Li Weizheng’s face flushed red this time as well.","He felt as though he were being disciplined by a young employee in the workplace. Kids these days were simply impossible to manage!","Feng Leyuan was one of the people rescued from the internet-addiction rehabilitation school alongside Chu Fu and the others.","He was a professional Druid with an A-rank talent.","After speaking with the four of them individually, Li Weizheng had discovered that Feng Leyuan was relatively timid by nature and had a genuine love for small animals. That was why he had worked so hard to recruit Feng Leyuan into the official organization.","Dream King and Bitter Melon King, however, had both insisted on following Chu Fu.","The difference between the official organization’s benefits and those offered by the Thorn Guild was obvious.","Bitter Melon King and Dream King, who had followed Chu Fu, were now both holders of SSS-rank talents. They had even obtained second talents, and their attributes and equipment completely overwhelmed those of the other players.","Although everyone’s attributes had increased by 1,000 points after killing the divine messenger, that did not mean the others had caught up. It only meant that those two had become even stronger.","Li Weizheng had to admit that he had held Feng Leyuan back.","Thus, his tone softened despite himself. “One hour is impossible. I can only give you half an hour. What are you planning to do?”","“I’ll take away every stray dog, and I’ll make sure none of them attack humans.”","After saying this, Feng Leyuan logged out of the game.","His level had already reached 30. His talent had risen to S-rank when he killed the divine messenger last time, and he had already cashed out his rewards.","He soon rushed out of Primordial University, his body transforming into the shape of a wolf.","Not a werewolf, but a true giant wolf.","“Awooo!”","He began to howl.","In an instant, countless stray dogs hiding in corners came running out, wagging their tails around Feng Leyuan.","He could even hear their vague thoughts.","“Boss, what are we doing?”","“Are we going to play together?”","“Is there any food?”","This made Feng Leyuan feel even worse.","He hurriedly howled again and again.","“Tell all the good dogs you know to evacuate to the outskirts together. Humans are coming to kill you. And don’t attack humans, or the other dogs will be in even more danger. Leave now!”","“The big dog says so, so we’ll listen.”","“I’m scared!”","“Good friends run together!”","Countless stray dogs gathered together. Their barking rang out without pause as one dog led another, eventually forming a huge pack that left the city and headed into the wilderness.","At least they wouldn’t be killed there!","Li Weizheng naturally noticed what Feng Leyuan was doing and let out a sigh.","“Feng Leyuan, one person’s strength is limited in the end. Wait here. I’ll get you a helicopter.”","Li Weizheng was worried about Feng Leyuan as well, so he personally followed him and boarded the helicopter.","The helicopter flew low over the ground. Feng Leyuan called out to the stray dogs and directed them to flee.","Afterward, Li Weizheng issued a notice to all the city’s residents.","[Residents, starting today, canine creatures may undergo supernatural mutations. Please prioritize your own safety. The official organization is currently dispatching professional Druids to drive away the monsters. Please avoid them, take detours when necessary, and remain at home whenever possible.]","It wasn’t that the authorities were refusing to deal with the problem. They were simply using professional Druids to handle it.","If the problem could not be resolved within half an hour, however, they would have no choice but to wipe out all the mutated dogs.","Li Weizheng had already gone against orders once in secret. He could not continue violating his superiors’ commands.","Fortunately, Feng Leyuan’s efforts were not in vain.","But as he watched the large pack of stray dogs heading into the wilderness, Feng Leyuan knew that this would not work.","After earning money through the game, Feng Leyuan had established a shelter for stray dogs.","It was a bottomless pit.","The dogs needed food, and people had to be hired to care for them. What was more, after mutating, the stray dogs had grown much larger and seemed to require even more food.","There was no way they could survive in the wild without a source of food.","How were so many dogs supposed to live?","Feng Leyuan could not possibly rescue them all.","Just as he was thinking this, he suddenly saw a mutated rat crawl out.","The pack of dogs became extremely excited when they spotted it. They immediately rushed forward and tore it apart.","Before long, the mutated rat had been bitten to death.","At that moment, a bolt of lightning seemed to split through Feng Leyuan’s mind.","He suddenly grabbed Li Weizheng by the thigh.","“Major Li, I’ve got it! I know what to do!”","...","In the game.","Chu Fu and the others had just finished killing the final elemental spirit.","The quests for all four guilds were finally complete.","Every Thorn Guild had reached level five and could accommodate 60,000 players. Together, the four guilds held 240,000 players, which had more or less swept up every player with an A-rank talent or higher.","The remaining tens of thousands of players who had not joined the Thorn Guilds were not anxious in the slightest.","As long as they stayed in Thorn City, they would eventually have opportunities to obtain high-level talents.","“That’s done. We can head to the level-50 map to level up now.”","Over the past few days, they had killed elemental spirits. Although every one of them was a boss, Chu Fu still felt that her leveling speed was too slow.","She had only gained one level in an entire week. Her level had now reached 40.","Her brother, Chu Feng, on the other hand, gained one level every two days and had already reached level 48.","Of course, this was also because Chu Fu now had two classes.","Just as Chu Fu was thinking about leveling up faster, her communicator rang.","It was Li Weizheng.","Major Li never called without a reason.","Something must have happened again.","Chu Fu answered the call.","“Chairwoman Chu, have you seen the news online? The fourth wave of monster invasions has affected all canine creatures. The city is currently preparing to launch a campaign against the stray dogs. Feng Leyuan has thought of a solution, but he may need your help.”","“Oh? What’s going on? If I can help, I certainly won’t refuse.”","Li Weizheng breathed a sigh of relief before continuing. “Can the Thorn printing factory under your command produce the Summoner’s basic skill, Contract?”","“If so, everyone would be able to learn Contract and form contracts with their own pets.”","“Even ordinary people could contract a dog.”","“These dogs could hunt mutated rats, which would free up the high-level players currently stationed here to guard the city. It would benefit everyone.”","Chu Fu thought the plan sounded quite good.","“Of course. I’ll have the factory stop copying the other skill books and switch to mass-producing Contract skill books immediately!”","Li Weizheng gritted his teeth. “I know skill books aren’t cheap. How about this: the state will subsidize 50 percent, and our city of Linjiang will subsidize 80 percent.”"]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239: Chufu's Conscience: Find God, Kill God","paragraphs":["Chu Fu was starting to feel a little embarrassed.","Skill books weren’t cheap.","However, a Level 1 skill book only required rabbit hide, rabbit blood, plant fiber, and ink.","The production cost was roughly three copper coins.","After all, rabbit hide and rabbit blood cost two copper coins, while plant fiber and ink could be bought in the real world for no more than ten yuan.","But there were also the costs of spending twenty years as a professional book printer, the potions needed to restore mana, a full set of mana-regeneration equipment, and a team dedicated to helping him level up.","“This is something that benefits both the country and its people. How about this? I’ll give up twenty percent of the profits as well.”","Chu Fu didn’t waste time politely arguing with Li Weizheng. She covered all the expenses.","But wouldn’t the buyers who had already purchased skill books cause a commotion?","Besides, after this plan was promoted, Li Weizheng would take a loss in the short term, but in the long run, he would make a fortune.","These players could use their pets to kill the mutated rats and help maintain the safety of the cities.","Even taking the worst-case scenario into account, once the game invaded reality, every player would pay taxes to their villages, towns, and cities.","This taxation would be mandatory.","Players accompanied by contracted beasts would likely work even harder to earn money for cat food and dog food.","The more they earned, the more taxes they would pay.","By giving up twenty percent of the profits, Chu Fu would gain a reputation and promote her own skills.","Li Weizheng hurriedly said, “Thank you so much, Chairwoman Chu! You really are a conscientious entrepreneur!”","Chu Fu’s conscience hurt a little.","Li Weizheng ended the call, then immediately dialed his superiors.","“Leader, I have a better solution on my end...","“Yes, I’ve already contacted Chairwoman Chu. She’s willing to fully support us and produce Summoner skills on a large scale. She’s even willing to give up twenty percent of the profits.","“Leader, what do you think about reimbursing the public for part of the cost? This would actually benefit us as well. Level 30 players won’t waste their time fighting Level 3 monsters anymore.","“Yes, yes!","“I discussed it with Chairwoman Chu. The government can subsidize fifty percent. What do you think? If it costs one gold coin, many players won’t be able to afford it. But if they only need to pay three hundred silver coins, I think some players would be willing to borrow the money, even if they had to borrow from one another.","“Understood. I’ll make sure it’s publicized properly.","“Yes, I didn’t force her to lower the price. Chairwoman Chu offered this herself. She really is a wonderful person with a truly sincere heart. She even helped us fight the divine envoy and never held back when it came to sharing the benefits.","“Rest assured, Leader. I’ll cooperate fully with Chairwoman Chu.”","Li Weizheng hung up with a broad smile.","It had worked.","He had acted as the intermediary and ultimately made the whole arrangement possible.","Fortunately, everyone was currently staying home and playing the game. It was also only the first day that canine creatures had mutated, and no attacks on humans had occurred yet. Otherwise, it would have been impossible for the policy to change so quickly.","Soon, Contract Arts were promoted nationwide.","According to statistics, roughly forty million households across the country kept pets, so the demand for Summoning Arts was enormous.","As soon as the order came down from above, these people dragged their dogs along and began frantically ordering Summoning Arts.","It didn’t take long for them to realize how wonderful the arrangement was.","Netizens flocked to the official website to share their experiences. These days, traffic on the major video platforms had plummeted, while The Gate of Origin had instead become the largest platform for communication.","“Ever since I contracted my dog, I’ve put it through a series of training exercises. It’s now learned how to open the door, carry its own leash, and walk itself. The day before yesterday, it even brought me ten mutated rats.","“In a few days, I’m going to teach it how to recognize the route to the quarantine station. Then I can have it sell the rats itself.”","“The poster above has a Border Collie, right? No wonder! I must have assigned my husky’s attribute points wrong. It really did get smarter after I contracted it, and its eyes look much clearer now. But while I was playing the game yesterday, it ate an entire bag of dog food, couldn’t hold it in, and left ten pounds of poop in the house!”","“My beagle—I think it’s learned a sonic attack.”","“Oh my god, I think my Snowball learned Holy Light healing. Otherwise, why would I feel so happy and healed every time I look at it smiling? (Samoyed photo.)”","“(Caucasian Shepherd photo.) No interruptions, please. I just came down from the mountain after taking down three wild boars.”","Some people joined in for fun and bought Contract Arts to contract their cats.","Before long, some cats learned how to fetch water, some learned how to bring tissues, and one could even do a backflip.","For a time, everyone seemed to return to the days before the game descended upon the world. They began showing off their pets again, and the tense atmosphere of facing a catastrophe gradually eased.","But this was true only in China.","Other countries had clearly descended into disaster.","This was especially true for countries near vast grasslands, where wolf packs genuinely existed.","The wilderness had become extremely dangerous.","And such crises would only continue to multiply.","...","Inside China’s Analysis Bureau, everyone was summarizing the intelligence from this incident.","“If canine creatures can mutate, then next will be...","“Level 5 Berserk Bulls—bovines.","“Level 6 bears—ursines.","“Level 7 snakes—reptiles.","“Level 8 black panthers—felines.","“Level 9 ravens—birds.","“Level 10 striped tigers—which are also felines.","“However, there are also some special creatures in the various starter villages, such as wildebeests and dragon-blood lizards. Taking every possibility into account, perhaps by Level 10, all creatures will have mutated.”","Everyone sensed the overwhelming danger.","“Still, there’s some good news. These creatures’ combat power has currently fallen by half. It seems their bodies underwent mutation, but their attack power has actually decreased significantly.”","“With China’s current strength, we can completely guarantee the safety of our citizens once all the safe zones have been established.”","“Next, we need to explore the goblin divine envoy.”","The Analysis Bureau concluded its discussion of the beasts. Then a map appeared on the enormous screen.","It was an ultra-high-definition, futuristic map with a three-dimensional effect, depicting an entirely new planet.","This planet appeared to be a hundred times larger than Earth. Vast forests covered much of its surface, while water occupied half the planet.","Yet despite its terrifying size, its gravity was actually weaker than Earth’s, allowing the creatures living there to grow even larger.","The race that inhabited this world was the goblins.","That was right. This was the map created through the Dark Gold Project after entering the Goblin City and continuously exploring the surrounding areas.","“Since Werewolf Tuge was a divine envoy, and killing divine envoys grants a large number of attribute points, all we need to do is find new divine envoys and kill them. That way, the monsters’ strength will continue to weaken.”","“Also, during the last siege of Werewolf Tuge, Leader One obtained a divine fragment. Lu Xing, City Lord Chu, and the others obtained fragments as well.","“This means that, hypothetically, if we kill ten divine envoys, our players can become false gods.”","“The background of The Gate of Origin is an invasion by evil gods. Our ultimate enemies are the gods themselves. Only by defeating them can we end this apocalyptic crisis!”","“Then let’s find those gods!”","“Kill them!”"]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240: The Mechanical Giant City, Shen Chi's Domain","paragraphs":["In the game.","After hanging up the phone with Li Weizheng, Chu Fu called out to everyone.","“Let’s go. Time to enter the Level 50 map!”","“Come on. Let’s see what our Thorn City will look like under the calculations of the Primordial Gate and Version Six!”","Low-level players had to pass a combat-power check before entering high-level maps.","Without a doubt, Chu Fu and the others all qualified, and they were able to teleport to the higher-level map.","The teleportation array lit up.","The power of space carried everyone to another location.","Their vision returned.","At the same time, the sound of dense gunfire reached their ears, along with a buzzing noise that sounded like a chainsaw.","Everyone instinctively looked toward the source of the noise, only to realize that it was coming from directly above them.","The sight left them stunned.","At that moment, Thorn City was enveloped by a gigantic energy shield. Countless small machines and robots were attacking the shield from all around, while several enormous airships overhead were firing back.","The words “Thorn” were written across the airships.","They were locked in a fierce battle with the robots outside, neither side gaining a clear advantage.","This was obviously the future predicted by the Primordial Gate.","Their Thorn City had developed airships and was fighting against the Mechanical Race.","It made perfect sense!","After all, they had the Mechanical God!","“We start fighting the moment we arrive? This is exciting!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao charged forward and unleashed a taunt, hoping to draw all the monsters together.","However, MISS appeared above the heads of every member of the Mechanical Race.","The Mechanical Race followed its underlying code and had no souls, so taunts were ineffective.","That immediately enraged Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","She promptly summoned the earth element. The bluestone paving beneath her feet was torn from the ground, enveloping her body and transforming her into a giant made of rock.","She stomped on the ground.","A mountain rose from the earth, carrying her beyond the energy shield.","Fortunately, the shield was only five hundred meters high. Otherwise, she really would have had to create an entire mountain.","“Jiao Jiao! This is only a future map. If you did this inside Thorn City, do you realize how much you’d destroy? You’d tear your own home apart!” Suture Saint shouted.","“I can’t worry about that now! A tank who doesn’t want to be a damage dealer isn’t a true tank. I’m switching to a damage-dealing class!”","Ever since they had defeated the Divine Envoy, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had risen rapidly.","She was no longer satisfied with being a tank. After all, the team already had two tank classes. It would be better to let her break free and become a damage dealer.","Being a berserker was much more comfortable.","Battle! What a thrill!","But before Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao could truly show what she could do, Shen Chi transformed into a metallic man as well. His entire body turned a dazzling white, as if he were glowing.","He raised one hand.","“Metal Manipulation.”","A strange energy wave, resembling a magnetic field, spread outward.","Every machine attacking Thorn City was swept up by the wave.","In the next instant, the machines began twisting and collapsing.","“Beep beep beep beep! The body is being controlled. The body is deforming.”","“Metal-type Awakened detected. Activating self-destruction annihilation mode.”","“Self-destruct system failure. Control overridden! Control overridden!”","Countless robots flashed red warning lights.","But there was nothing they could do. In just a few seconds, the robots had all been reduced to lumps of scrap metal.","Shen Chi raised his hand and clenched it.","Countless iron blocks gathered from every direction and instantly condensed into a cube.","The sound of pieces locking together rang out.","Above them, the countless metal blocks formed a gigantic Rubik’s Cube.","All the members of the Mechanical Race had been compressed into it.","They were already dead.","The next moment, loot began raining from the sky.","“Wow!”","Chu Fu’s eyes glimmered. At that moment, Shen Chi seemed to be glowing.","He was so cool.","Xie Lin watched from the side and curled his lips.","“Look at you, showing off.”","Shen Chi was also a little embarrassed. He glanced at everyone, his gaze lingering briefly on Chu Fu, then coughed.","“I did this for convenience. Absorbing metal is beneficial to me, and these machines should still contain chips. I might be able to learn more from them. For all we know, these airships were built by me!”","This time, Xie Lin did not argue.","What Shen Chi said did make sense.","Shen Chi then summoned the metal and began slowly merging it into his body.","No one would disturb him during a moment of improvement like this.","“Should we go up and take a look? Do you think we can get inside the airship?”","“We should be able to. Let’s try!”","“Wow, high technology! Even though everyone has gained supernatural powers, technology still exceeds our imagination!”","The group flew toward the airship.","Just then, the airship spoke in an oddly human voice.","[Beep! Administrator identity detected. The surrounding environment is safe. Opening cabin door.]","The airship opened its doors automatically.","Everyone immediately entered with great interest and began looking around.","Although the interior of the airship had a certain technological feel, most of the decorations were actually exact replicas of the interior of Shen Chi’s wolf-type mecha.","“Even the cup I keep in my workshop is here.” Zhimengzhe found it amusing.","“The Primordial Gate is really cutting corners.”","“Since this is a prediction of the future, it’s actually reasonable. We’ll be taking airships into battle from now on!”","After looking around for a while, everyone lost interest.","The monsters did not respawn either.","The group could only leave and search for new monsters to fight.","They had to admit that these monsters provided quite a lot of experience.","One wave of monsters had given them 0.3% experience. At that rate, they only needed to clear 330 waves to level up.","As long as they found 330 cities and cleared them all, they could level up without even using a full day.","The only problem was the teleportation cost.","Thinking of this, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao called out to Shen Chi.","“Put that huge metal lump away first! When we go to another city, you can just stay idle and absorb it.”","The others often did things like this. For example, Feng Huimin never participated in minor battles. At most, she would give everyone a buff before handling guild affairs.","Their damage output was simply excessive.","“Okay!” Shen Chi’s gentle voice rang out as he agreed.","The group walked toward the teleportation array.","But once they opened the teleportation interface, everyone fell silent.","During the Titan Version, the destinations available from Thorn City had been densely packed together.","During the Elemental Storm Version, there had still been fewer than five thousand sanctuaries.","But now, there were only a little over thirty destinations available.","Among them was Dragon City, where Dragon Conquers the Nine Provinces was located.","“Then let’s go to Dragon City first and take a look,” Chu Fu said.","Everyone nodded.","After spending the required gold, they all teleported from Thorn City to Dragon City.","The moment they arrived, they felt as though the sky had turned completely black.","A huge rift had appeared, and countless machines were emerging from it.","[Origin-level dungeon discovered: Mechanical Star. Enter?]","An Origin-level dungeon had appeared in the future map?","Chu Fu was stunned for a moment.","She vaguely sensed that something was wrong.","...","At the same time.","High above the planet where Chu Fu lived, or more precisely, within a dimensional space at an even higher level, ten thrones floated in the void.","“They’ve seen it. The plan succeeded!”"]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241: The Gods' Conspiracy, Chu Fu's Playing It Safe and Not Reckless","paragraphs":["“Don’t rush. The humans haven’t gone in yet!”","“Heh heh heh. They’ll definitely go in. The Origin-level dungeons from this phase have fattened them up nicely, so they’ll surely think this is their opportunity.","“Besides, the chosen pieces always believe they’re the saviors and rulers of humanity. Hmm... they’re accustomed to calling themselves the male and female leads.","“Wasn’t that how Chu Feng died in the previous game?”","Their opponent had enjoyed one stroke of good fortune after another, becoming the strongest human alive. But once he entered an Origin-level dungeon, he was besieged by countless divine envoys.","In the end, he was cursed to death by one of the Death God’s curse-bearers.","However, as the three games progressed, the gods invested more and more into the human side.","For example, the profession obtained by the currently chosen heroine had already begun to counter curses.","So the Death God’s side had sacrificed a Lich Divine Envoy, making this “heroine” even more arrogant.","This had laid down the killing move for the next wave of Origin-level dungeons—the siege of Army Soul City.","Unexpectedly, before the second wave of Origin-level dungeons descended, the Werewolf Tuge was summoned first.","Sometimes, even the gods couldn’t control an entire game. They had to invest pieces of their own.","Every god on the attacking side had a piece.","Everyone on the defending side was a piece as well; some were simply stronger, while others were weaker.","Pieces would always be captured.","But no one had expected the Werewolf Tuge, an important piece meant to divide humanity, to die.","There was no choice. They could only set another trap.","After all, even the gods were restricted in how they could interfere with this world.","That restriction was divine power.","The amount of divine power they invested was fixed. Suppose it was ten thousand units—every interference would consume some of it.","Attacking villages, towns, and cities was the result of their manipulation of divine power.","The amount of divine power used for those actions was small, however.","Most of it was invested in the divine envoys and the Origin-level dungeons.","This time, it was the Mechanical God who took action.","Shen Chi’s abilities were already threatening his divine nature.","He had to be eliminated in advance.","While the humans worked desperately to find and hunt down the divine envoys, the gods were also eliminating humanity’s hopes...","On the Longxiang Jiuzhou Shelter in the Future Map, Chu Fu and the others looked up at the rift, all of them letting out startled cries.","“Could the Future Map already be capable of detecting Origin-level rifts without waiting for a city siege? What are we waiting for, then?”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was eager to give it a try.","“Could this be the future city siege?” Xie Lin analyzed.","“The difference is that the players haven’t arrived yet. If a city siege means that, during the first hundred days after the game opens, they’ll continuously dispatch monsters to destroy human cities according to a set pattern...","“For the level 30–40 map, the Titans will come after two hundred days.","“For the level 40–50 map, the Elementals will come after three hundred days.","“For the level 50–60 map, the Mechanical forces will come after four hundred days?","“Of course, judging by the experience requirements at our current levels, things won’t progress this quickly. The timeline may be extended.”","Chu Fu nodded.","In the story, Brother Chu Feng had also constantly recalled his past life. During the first life, every version’s invasion lasted a year, and Brother Chu Feng had struggled to survive for seven years.","During his second life, Brother Chu Feng’s level had risen to seventy, but in truth, not much time had passed in the book.","Brother Chu Feng had always crushed the monsters from the Future Map. When he reached the level 70 dungeon featuring the servants of the gods, only a year had passed since the game descended.","Millions of words had been written, yet only a single year had passed.","The Origin-level dungeon before them was a level 50–60 dungeon.","It had appeared even earlier than the dungeons Brother Chu Feng had encountered.","And since Chu Fu had transmigrated into this world, only two and a half months had passed at most.","Chu Fu took a deep breath. That intense sensation rose within her once again.","That was it. This was definitely a trap.","She even faintly sensed that something seemed to be watching them.","In that instant, countless thoughts flashed through Chu Fu’s mind. In the end, she made her decision:","Put on an act!","She didn’t know whether the evil gods were watching them, but since the trap had already been set, Chu Fu decided to turn it to her advantage.","So she said, “Every monster in an Origin-level dungeon is a boss-level monster for the current version—in other words, level 60.","“With our current strength, dealing with one won’t be a problem. Ten won’t be a problem either. The only thing we have to worry about is the sheer number of them.","“So let’s level up here first and see if we can upgrade Wheelchair Brother’s mecha by another level!”","Shen Chi nodded seriously as well.","“It’ll be very difficult for my mecha to reach Legendary rank. The gap is simply too large. But there’s an enormous amount of metal here, as well as chips and energy crystals.","“If we use them, I can build more mechas.","“And I can have AI control them by setting commands, making all the mechas attack together like robots.”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao nodded from the side. “I get it now. The Sword Saint wants to make ten thousand diamond swords, and you want to make ten thousand diamond robots, right? You two are such money pits!”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was a wealthy woman and even something of a patron saint of reckless spending. But compared with the two of them, she couldn’t invest nearly as much of her own money.","Those two were the real gold-devouring beasts.","Chu Fu made the final decision.","“Then do it. Not ten thousand—if we’re doing this, we might as well make a hundred thousand! Better yet, let’s aim for a million and sweep across the Mechanical Star!”","After discussing the plan, the group began farming monsters under the protection of the Longxiang Jiuzhou barrier.","Suppose the number of monsters attacking a player settlement increased tenfold each time.","By this version, that meant a hundred billion monsters.","There was no way to finish them all. They simply couldn’t be finished.","They farmed for more than ten hours straight. By two in the afternoon, the Future Map needed maintenance.","Even then, everyone was still reluctant to leave.","All of them had gained one level.","“Let’s come back tomorrow!”","Chu Fu and the others exited the Future dungeon.","In the high-dimensional dimensional space, all the gods fell silent.","The plan had failed. Instead, it had allowed the humans to enjoy an effortless monster-farming session.","The Mechanical God, however, was not discouraged.","“Based on the data projections, she will definitely enter the Origin-level rift.”","Indeed, once Shen Chi had made enough mechas—one hundred thousand of them—Chu Fu would definitely go and take a look inside the rift.","But for now, she would pass.","After exiting the Future Map, Chu Fu logged out and headed to Primordial University. She began mutating plants into poisonous flora, using giant man-eating flowers to devour them.","Improving herself outside the game would save the coins required for stat extraction.","Shen Chi and Xie Lin went with her as well. Everyone had agreed to improve together.","Some people, however, had not logged off.","Eighteen Stabs opened the wanted list and found a name on the crime-value rankings.","[Young Master Wandering Dragon: Level 38. Class: Ranger.]","A cold smile curled the corners of Xu Can’s lips.","After the Werewolf Tuge’s death, her class had not advanced to the divine level. Instead, it had changed once again, transforming from Blood Vengeance Assassin into a Blood Revenant.","As long as she identified someone as an enemy, she could lock onto the target and combine it with the Vengeful Spirit to teleport instantly to that person’s side.","The prerequisite of having seen the target in person had been removed.","Skill activated.","[Activation successful.]","Like an evil spirit, Xu Can crawled out of a bloody vortex."]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242: Collapsing Guan Youlong, Endless Battle, Military Soul Builds the City","paragraphs":["Abroad, in the Maple Leaf Kingdom, 500 kilometers outside Mexico City, at a level-40 monster grinding spot.","Guan Youlong caught the familiar scent of rust as it seeped into his nostrils.","Pain shot through the back of his neck, and his HP was instantly depleted. With a thud, Guan Youlong collapsed to the ground.","His vision faded to gray and black. This was the perspective of death.","Nearly losing his mind, he typed out a message.","“Big sis, why is it you again? Are you ever going to stop?”","Ever since the death of Werewolf Tuge, all the Disguiser Masks had stopped working. The players who had joined the evil faction had lost their final layer of protection and were exposed for all to see.","More importantly, their red names meant they could no longer survive in the cities.","Once they reached level 35, they could not even enter the final dungeon.","On top of that, the future maps required players to enter the Grand Hall of Master-Class Advancement. Red-name players naturally could not enter, which meant they could not go to any nearby leveling areas either.","Guan Youlong had no choice but to travel to high-level maps 500 kilometers away to hunt some beast-type monsters.","Not only was the area incredibly far from the cities, but supplies could not be obtained there either. Fortunately, Guan Youlong had money and could pay someone to bring supplies over.","He never expected this to trap him in a desperate situation.","The moment the bounty board was activated, a bounty was placed on him.","As soon as his coordinates were exposed, a gigantic mecha descended from the sky and crushed him beneath its foot.","“He has a guild too? Rocky Mountain Hidden Guests? Could that be his guild? Wipe it out.”","Naturally, it was not Guan Youlong’s guild. It was the most powerful evil guild in the Maple Leaf Kingdom, an organization formed from underground forces. Its members were all ruthless fighters, and more than half of them, like Guan Youlong, were red-name players from evil organizations.","Guan Youlong had secretly held out some hope. The Hidden Guests Guild was full of talented players. Perhaps one of them might be able to take these people down.","He knew it was impossible. The difference in attribute points alone was a full 1,000 points in every attribute.","But Guan Youlong’s darker thoughts had begun to surface. If he was going to die, then everyone else might as well die with him. That way, he would feel more balanced.","Chu Fu and the others were indeed arrogant. They wiped out the evil faction’s guild on the spot.","All three guild strongholds were uprooted, and the guild was disbanded immediately.","The Maple Leaf Kingdom’s authorities not only failed to pursue Chu Fu and the others, but actually thanked them for their righteous actions.","They even declared that they hoped to cooperate with them in the future.","Guan Youlong regretted everything all over again.","Once the guild was disbanded, there was even less chance of anyone rescuing him.","He could only pay a priest an exorbitant fee to revive him, hoping to kill monsters as quickly as possible and wash away his red name.","But removing a red name required killing monsters no lower than the player’s own level.","That left Guan Youlong with no choice but to travel even farther away to level up.","From that day onward, Guan Youlong’s nightmare began.","Shen Chi came to kill him whenever he had free time.","His aunt also came to kill him whenever she had the chance.","After killing him, they took all his equipment. He could only spend real-world money to buy replacements.","And the money in the real world was about to become worthless.","No matter how deep his family’s pockets were, they could not withstand this kind of spending.","He could not bear to give up an account he had already developed this far, so he continued gritting his teeth and hanging on.","As for logging off to lie low, he naturally did not dare to do that either.","He had information on Eighteen Stabs. Once she decided that someone was one of her targets for revenge, she could kill them in the real world after they logged off.","Logging off would be Guan Youlong’s true death sentence.","After a week, he finally broke down.","“Can’t you just let me go? My entire family has already left China and is barely scraping by overseas. We’re stray dogs with nowhere to go.","“I’ve had terrible luck. I wasn’t even the one who hit anyone. Why are you making my life miserable?”","“Oh? You weren’t the one who kidnapped the person in a vegetative state?” Xu Can sneered.","Guan Youlong fell silent, then began making excuses. “But nothing happened to her, did it? And you won in the end. Besides, she’s her, and you’re you. I’ve never offended you, have I?”","One fewer enemy was still one fewer enemy.","As long as he could deal with Xu Can, that would be enough.","Xu Can nodded.","It was true that Guan Youlong was not the one who had made things difficult for her.","Before Guan Youlong could celebrate, Xu Can continued, “Wan Huanyu was the one who made things difficult for me. So let me ask you this: Why didn’t you tell me where Wan Huanyu was?","“If you had told me, I could have gone after him, couldn’t I?”","Guan Youlong continued, “Big sis, I already told you. He disappeared. After he went overseas, he never contacted me again.”","“Heh. You’re pretty loyal to him. Then keep wasting your time here.”","Xu Can stripped all the equipment from Guan Youlong and returned to the city.","He was wearing a full set of silver-grade equipment, which made him look like an absolute pauper.","If he had not been unable to kill monsters, Guan Youlong would have preferred to wear a full set of bronze gear.","“Oh, and if you call me ‘big sis’ again, I’ll coat my dagger with a pain-amplifying poison before I use it on you.”","Xu Can gave him a contemptuous sneer, then returned to the city.","Guan Youlong was furious.","But in the end, he still gave in to Xu Can’s intimidation and called Wang Rongxun.","He asked about Wan Huanyu’s whereabouts.","Wang Rongxun, however, clearly found his naivety amusing.","“You really think they’re going to let you off?","“Your relationship with them is one of blood feud. If Chu Fu weren’t the leader of a major guild cooperating with the authorities, and if she didn’t have to worry about her reputation, you would have been crushed to death long ago.","“Whether Wan Huanyu disappeared or died is for me to determine.","“My family has gone bankrupt. Now all I can do is sign a contract with a dog and catch rats.","“By the way, don’t contact me again. You spoiled rich brats dragged me into this mess and ruined me!”","He was the truly innocent one.","...","Elsewhere.","After dealing with the new problems that had arisen, Li Weizheng finally breathed a sigh of relief.","He called Chu Fu.","“Chairwoman Chu, are you busy? The War Soul Guild is starting a city-defense battle shortly. Would you and your people like to come help us clear an Origin-tier dungeon?”","This time, Chu Fu hesitated.","The level-30 Origin-tier dungeon no longer held much appeal for her.","It might drop epic equipment, but how would they divide the loot afterward?","The War Soul Guild had also been brought up to speed by now. Every member had 1,000 points in all attributes.","They had enough damage and combat power.","If Chu Fu went, would she not simply be forcing them to split the equipment?","Besides, each city-defense battle took a full day.","The level-60 Origin-tier rift was still waiting for them to farm the machines.","After weighing the pros and cons, Chu Fu politely declined.","“Thank you for the invitation, Major Li. You’ve already helped us gain plenty of attribute points, but we have something more important to deal with right now, so we won’t be joining you.”","Li Weizheng was not angry at being rejected. In fact, he felt a little embarrassed.","It was like Chu Fu inviting him to dinner at her house and letting him freeload a meal.","Then, when Li Weizheng hosted dinner at his own house, Chu Fu did not show up.","It was rather awkward.","Although Li Weizheng knew that Chu Fu did not need that meal, nor did she need those ten attribute points.","Perhaps this was simply the difference in strength.","“All right. But if we run into trouble and need Chairwoman Chu’s help, you absolutely mustn’t refuse us.”","“Of course. If you run into difficulties clearing the dungeon, I’ll definitely come.”","By then, she would feel comfortable taking a share of the loot from the epic Lich Tower."]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243: The Trap Prepared for Chu Fu Was Stepped on by Li Weizheng","paragraphs":["After speaking with Chu Fu, Li Weizheng began mobilizing all the players back to the city and then activated the city defense battle.","He had notified China’s official personnel in advance that, after the city-support mission was complete, they would let their own people enter first and then seal off the teleportation array.","However, he soon discovered that his plan had been overly optimistic.","[The city-support mission has reached its player limit. The population of War Soul Town has reached 1,000,000.","The teleportation array in this area can no longer transport players. Otherwise, it will attract the gaze of the God of Death and increase the difficulty.","Players who log out in the current map must wait before other players can enter.]","Li Weizheng immediately shut down the teleportation array.","Even if some people logged out midway, they would have to be replaced by their own people. They absolutely could not allow players from other countries in.","After all, they were also afraid that members of the evil factions might come and cause trouble.","Although Chu Fu had already killed Werewolf Tuge, they were planning to clear an Origin-level dungeon this time. Their own people had to be the ones who obtained the ten points to all attributes.","They had no intention of letting outsiders benefit.","Countless countries hoping to spy on China’s intelligence rushed to enter War Soul Town after seeing the announcement, but they were already too late.","China had far more Level 30 players than they did.","Once all the preparations were complete, the city defense battle began an hour later.","Fortunately, there were a full million players.","The defense proceeded smoothly.","A wave of monsters arrived roughly every three hours.","Since everyone was using gaming pods this time, no one was forced to log out because they could not endure the strain.","However, they soon discovered that their clearing speed was actually inferior to that of Thorn City, which had only had three hundred thousand players.","One had to understand that, at the time, the Thorn Guild had not had every member equipped with 1,000 points in all attributes.","They had relied almost entirely on powerhouses such as Chu Fu.","It was obvious that a single Chu Fu was equivalent to half the players in War Soul Town.","Still, they had to thank Chu Fu. Without her, things would never have been this easy.","“Marshal Long, we don’t have the movement speed or army coordination capabilities of Chairwoman Chu and the others, so we plan to enter the dungeon during the sixth wave.","“We’ll enter from four directions, with 250,000 players per direction. Do you think this battle plan is acceptable?”","Long Zhantian nodded.","“Fine. Proceed according to this plan.”","Having gained 1,000 points in all attributes, he felt much more confident.","Six waves of monsters later, eighteen hours had passed.","All the players entered the Origin-level dungeon.","The moment they entered, the pressure on everyone increased dramatically.","It took a full four hours to clear the monsters from the four directions.","Afterward, they rushed toward the central area.","When the four forces gathered, they saw that the central region of the Land of the Dead was actually occupied by an ancient castle.","Li Weizheng’s heart sank.","This was completely different from the guide.","It meant they would have to explore the dungeon from scratch.","“What are you afraid of? We have so many people. One spit from each of us would be enough to drown these monsters!”","Suppressing the inexplicable unease in his heart, Li Weizheng commanded the team forward.","...","Within higher-dimensional space.","Everyone stared at the game screens before them.","On one screen was the area before the mechanical Origin-level rift in the future dungeon, where Chu Fu had once again farmed for an entire day.","On the other was the Origin-level dungeon of the Land of the Dead, where Li Weizheng was located.","At that moment, ghostly fire erupted inside the ancient castle, and countless spirits drifted out.","Yet the most terrifying thing here was not those spirits.","It was the true divine emissary who had infiltrated their ranks.","Undead Apostle Vale!","Vale’s greatest advantage was his soul form. Unless one possessed Eagle Eye, Advanced Holy Light Illumination, or something similar, no one could detect his existence at all.","And so, a silent slaughter began.","Players throughout the entire formation began dying for no apparent reason. They did not even know who was attacking them before suffering massive casualties.","“What’s going on? Where’s the enemy?”","Only then did Li Weizheng finally understand that the gap between them and the Thorn Guild was not limited to Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin.","They also lacked the Suture Saint’s ability to revive groups of people, as well as Feng Huimin’s command of military formations.","If they had Military Unity, they would never have died without even understanding how.","Long Zhantian had done everything he could as well.","He had even purchased the basic universal skill Taunt from Chu Fu’s Thorn Printing Shop.","Using a warrior as a tank, he rushed forward to taunt whenever a team member died, yet he could not see a single monster appear.","There was simply nothing he could do.","“Retreat first! Keep your distance and bring our fallen comrades’ bodies with us!”","Li Weizheng hurriedly shouted.","If this continued, they would all end up trapped inside the dungeon.","The enemy was specifically targeting their priests.","But they could not afford to lose their healers.","Just as the entire force was about to retreat, they heard a mournful cry rise from the depths of their souls.","In an instant, they felt as though they wanted to sink into eternal slumber right where they stood.","“Thud!”","“Thud!”","“Thud!”","A full two hundred thousand players throughout the army collapsed to the ground.","Their health bars had been emptied instantly.","Skill: Vale’s Requiem. After chanting for thirty seconds, it deals massive soul damage.","At that moment, Li Weizheng, who had still been harboring the faint hope of continuing the challenge, shouted:","“No! Marshal Long, this boss is too bizarre. There’s no way we can defeat it. Let’s retreat!”","“We want to retreat too, but will the boss let us? Besides, so many people have died here. They won’t be able to log back into the game for three months. How far will that set us back?”","Long Zhantian’s eyes were bloodshot.","He did not know that this was a conspiracy.","All he knew was that he was useless. A mistake in his decision-making could destroy the entire Longxiang Jiuzhou Guild. Their hard-earned Level 5 guild would disappear completely, effectively leaving humanity with one fewer large-scale sanctuary.","He opened his communicator.","He had no choice but to admit that only one person could save them now.","[WhoWantsToBeAVegetable]","Within the higher-dimensional plane.","The gods finally smiled when they saw this scene.","Although everything had gone wrong during the process, the outcome was exactly what they wanted.","“This human named Long Zhantian seems to have been the bearer of national fortune in the first game.”","This was not the choice of the gods on humanity’s side.","He was a true hero among humanity.","Unfortunately, heroes like him found it difficult to resist an invasion. In the end, they all died tragic deaths.","Such people carried the fortune of their nations. Once they were killed, an entire country or civilization would decline.","They had not expected Chu Fu to stay away, yet they had managed to hook an even bigger fish.","If he led his entire guild to destruction this time, the invading faction would gain a tremendous advantage.","And when Long Zhantian called Chu Fu, the evil gods achieved two goals with one move.","...","“What? You’re trapped inside the dungeon? How is that possible? Even an Origin-level dungeon shouldn’t be that powerful.”","These were a million official players from China—the most important point being that every one of them had 1,000 points in all attributes.","“That’s exactly what happened. The boss is too strange. We still haven’t seen it appear. We’ve only seen its skills.","“The skill is called Vale’s Lullaby. It’s a soul-type attack.”","“Wait. You said the boss was named Vale?”","That strong scent of conspiracy was back once again!"]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244: Wits and Courage Against the Air, or a Brilliant Counterattack Plan","paragraphs":["A BOSS with a name was absolutely no ordinary existence.","This BOSS, Wale, was a high-level divine envoy on the same tier as the werewolf Tu Ge, and his body contained an enormous amount of divine power.","He was level 80, and his special trait was unbelievably powerful: when attacking in soul form, he left no visible trace.","How were they supposed to fight that?","In reality, it wasn’t that players couldn’t see Wale.","It was that low-level mental power couldn’t perceive him. Once one’s attribute points exceeded 5,000, however, it was possible to see him.","Chu Fu glanced at her own attribute points.","3,147 (1,920) = 5,067.","Ah, then there was nothing to worry about!","Chu Fu was just about to speak when she suddenly looked up at the spatial rift overhead.","It resembled a gigantic eye staring down at her.","At that thought, she closed her mouth.","Then she began typing.","“We can fight him. Here’s what we’ll do: you guys run toward the rift first and put up a show of resistance. I’ll join you shortly!”","Long Zhantian stared at the message. In particular, when he saw the words “put up a show of resistance,” something stirred in his heart.","“Chairwoman Chu, what do you mean?” he typed back.","“I suspect an enemy is manipulating this situation, and they should be able to observe us. However, I don’t know how much authority they have or whether they can see our private messages.","“Actually, I suspect they can’t.","“More importantly, this kind of surveillance should be unable to affect reality.”","Otherwise, now that Chu Fu had gained the ability to fight a divine envoy, would the enemy really be so confident as to send someone here to die?","The enemy simply didn’t know that Chu Fu had mutated a vast amount of plant toxins in reality and absorbed them into her body. Her poison-type attack power was rapidly increasing, and her mental power was improving every day as well.","Of course, this was only a guess.","Were they underestimating Chu Fu, or were they simply too confident in their divine envoy? That would have to be verified later.","Long Zhantian understood.","“Got it.”","His heart immediately settled, and he began issuing orders to everyone once more.","Without Feng Huimin, even Long Zhantian felt exhausted during this massive battle.","“Everyone retreat! Even if only one person manages to escape!”","The morale of the entire team had taken a tremendous blow. They could only force themselves to keep running toward the rift.","Meanwhile,","Chu Fu spoke up. “Major Li’s group has run into trouble. Return to the city and prepare to provide support.”","At the same time, she left a message in the team channel.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “I suspect this is an enemy counterattack.","“We killed the werewolf Tu Ge, so they sent another divine envoy to target humanity.","“If Major Li’s entire group dies inside the dungeon this time, our losses will be enormous.","“They make up nearly 30% of the high-level players in our nation.","“We can’t be sure whether they’re monitoring our actions, or whether we’re just outsmarting ourselves and fighting an enemy that isn’t there.","“But it never hurts to be cautious.”","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “The plan will be carried out through the team channel for now. As for anything spoken aloud, just say whatever you like.”","Chu Fu spoke again. “Have the Thorn Guild members gather. I’m calling my brother.”","She then switched back to typing.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “This BOSS is in soul form and can turn invisible, but any creature in soul form is afraid of light magic!","“I’m returning to the apothecary to extract all the Holy Light potions. I’ll use Poison Sprinkling to scatter them over everyone, so that all of you will be enveloped in holy light.","“Also, soul-type creatures can’t damage mechanical creatures. However, if the weapons of mechanical creatures are coated with Holy Light potions, they can harm soul-type creatures.","“Wheelchair Brother’s newly made mechs must all be enchanted. Prepare for battle.”","[Rocket on a Wheelchair]: “Understood!”","Everyone typed two words in reply: “Understood!”","After quickly explaining everything, Chu Fu immediately sent a message to Chu Feng and told him to return.","Chu Feng’s Return Scroll was bound to Thorn City. Recently, he had also been entering the Future Dungeons from Thorn City, and he had housing there through the Thorn Guild.","Although he had not joined the Thorn Guild, he was already a resident of Thorn City in all but name.","He exited the Future Dungeon and immediately applied to join Chu Fu’s team.","Meanwhile, over the course of the past week, another group of newcomers had arrived in Thorn City. The city now housed 500,000 people.","To put that into perspective, the entirety of Linjiang City had only a population of five million. One-tenth of its population was now living in Thorn City.","Next, Shen Chi used spatial positioning to bring Chu Fu to Martial Soul Town.","After locating the spatial rift, they entered it.","Although Chu Fu and Long Zhantian had claimed they were heading to the eastern rift to reinforce the others, Chu Fu and Shen Chi had actually gone to the western rift instead.","Once inside, Shen Chi continued accelerating and rushed straight to the center of the Origin-level dungeon—the castle.","Only then did Chu Fu begin summoning.","A full twenty Forest Spirit Passages opened.","All the players waiting in Thorn City surged through them.","“Holy crap, they’re here! We made it in time again! We can get more attribute points!”","“I knew sticking with Thorn would pay off!”","“We’re getting carried again. That’s Thorn for you!”","The players entered the Forest Spirit Passages and swiftly appeared inside the Origin-level dungeon.","Feng Huimin led the charge. As soon as enough people had arrived, she activated the Battle Formation, enveloping everyone within it.","Their attributes immediately skyrocketed.","Chu Fu took out the items she had cultivated inside the Spirit Plant Pouch.","[Sunflower] [Sunflower] [Glimmergrass] [Flame Maple Leaf]","A large quantity of materials gathered together.","She then infused them with Holy Light potions, forming a strange, paint-like medicine.","This substance wasn’t technically a toxin, but it could still be controlled with Poison Sprinkling.","After all, who said she had to sprinkle poison? Medicine or powder worked the same way.","Using her mental power, Chu Fu manipulated this bizarre, ultra-concentrated holy-light paint and covered all 400,000 people with it.","The players immediately felt their skin grow scorching hot.","Every one of them became like a giant lightbulb.","In this dim, death-filled land of the undead, their radiance was dazzling enough to turn even weak souls to ash.","Shen Chi also summoned 10,000 diamond-grade mechs.","Chu Fu enchanted them once again.","In an instant, the entire army was gleaming golden.","“Move out!”","At Chu Fu’s command, the army headed toward the eastern rift.","Along the way, they came across the corpses of countless dead players. They revived every one of them, and the army continued to swell.","Like fireflies gathering in the night.","“Marshal Long! The plan worked! We’re coming to you now.”","Rumble!","The entire army charged forward at full speed, like a sun rising over the horizon and illuminating every patch of darkness.","The 10,000 remaining members of Long Zhantian’s team saw the light.","Wale, who was in soul form, saw it as well.","He felt a searing heat—the kind of warmth he had not experienced since his death many years ago.","That warmth caused him pain.","The next moment, he heard what sounded like a summons from the god of death.","“Brother, he’s over there! Hit him!”"]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245: Battle the Undead Apostle Valle, Soul Self-Destruct","paragraphs":["Chu Fu’s staff swung toward a specific spot, and Poison Spray erupted.","The Seeds of Disaster and Misfortune landed on her opponent.","That wasn’t all. Even the paint-like holy-light potion was hurled out by Chu Fu.","A gigantic phantom immediately appeared in the air.","Compared to the werewolf Tuge, Wale was far smaller, standing only around ten meters tall. However, he was in a soul state, floating five or six meters above the ground.","Now that the holy-light potion had landed on him, thick black smoke billowed from his body, giving Chu Feng an opening.","Chu Feng’s figure vanished from his original position in an instant, reappearing behind Wale.","What was more, out of the corner of his eye, Chu Feng saw two other figures.","To the left was Sneaky Dog.","To the right was Eighteen Stabs.","An assassin’s reactions really were incredibly fast!","[Plunder!]","[Steal!]","[Hatred Flame!]","Unseen, the Seeds of Disaster and Misfortune took effect.","[Plunder successful! You have obtained one of this divine envoy’s important abilities: Soul Concealment.]","[Soul Concealment: While in a soul state, you are completely invisible to creatures whose mental power is lower than your own and cannot be detected by any detection skill. You will not reveal yourself even when launching an attack.]","Very powerful.","Although the ability wasn’t particularly suitable for Chu Feng, it had permanently broken through his opponent’s invisibility, making an enormous contribution.","Sneaky Dog also began shrieking excitedly.","[Steal successful! You have obtained the Epic Death Reaper (Epic Weapon).]","“I stole his weapon! Hahahahahaha!”","“Nice work!” Chu Fu knew that players with stealing abilities always came with surprises.","And an even bigger surprise was still to come.","Xu Can’s skill was likewise detonated by the Seed of Disaster.","In an instant, the Flames of Vengeance roared to life, making Wale let out a shrill scream.","His soul trembled violently. Ghostly green flames flickered wildly within the two empty eye sockets of his translucent skull, while his arms flailed about chaotically, as if he wanted to extinguish the flames consuming him.","But this was only the beginning.","With the disappearance of Soul Concealment, every player—including ordinary players with only one or two thousand points of mental power—could now see Wale.","“So this is the thing that attacked us?”","“Brothers, it’s time to avenge ourselves!”","“Hit him! Hit him as hard as you can!”","[Undead Apostle · Wale (Origin-Level Divine Envoy) Level: 80, Soul Power: 100 billion.]","His health bar was actually composed of green soul power rather than vitality. Only soul attacks could damage him.","And now, after Chu Fu had used Poison Spray and released Disaster, all one and a half million players present were coated in holy-light paint.","Holy light could target any monster belonging to the soul, dark, or undead categories.","This meant that every player could now damage him.","Wale also realized that something was wrong.","The gazes of all the humans fell upon him, gleaming with the excitement of hungry wolves.","The second divine envoy had appeared. Once they defeated him, would they receive another 1,000 points to all attributes?","Wouldn’t that make them invincible?","In reality, that was impossible. Only the first player to kill a divine envoy received 1,000 attribute points. The second divine envoy would grant only 100 points.","But that was more than enough.","Most importantly, they could obtain a second divine power fragment.","Wale let out a piercing shriek.","Undead monsters could all use a banshee’s wail, but Wale’s shriek had evolved into a forbidden spell—Requiem.","Furthermore, his Requiem had a magic-suppression effect.","In other words, while Requiem was being cast, Priest players were unable to heal.","That was also why so many people had died horribly along the way.","But this time, when Requiem descended upon all the players, Legion Unity shimmered with layer upon layer of ripples, evenly distributing all the damage.","Not a single player died.","“The time to counterattack has come!”","Chu Fu raised her staff and condensed a mass of black light, aiming it at Wale.","[Black Disaster]","[Soul-Exterminating Disaster]","Two Disaster skills targeting the soul struck Wale simultaneously.","Both sides unleashed their attacks with all their might.","Shen Chi’s mechs raised both arms. After undergoing extensive modifications, their attack weapons’ energy crystals had been replaced with light-element crystals, causing every energy blast they fired to carry the power of light.","The attack power of ten thousand Diamond-level mechs was comparable to that of one million ordinary players.","This time, Chu Fu had also summoned Light Sprites. They had no offensive power and simply continued healing the players.","Shen Chi’s damage output actually took first place.","Chu Feng came next.","Then came Chu Fu, followed by the Holy Healing Angel.","The Holy Healing Angel’s second class had transformed into a Light-Type Forbidden Spellcaster. Holy light was already her natural attribute, so the skills she unleashed were terrifyingly powerful. If her attributes had not been inferior to Chu Fu’s, she absolutely would not have ranked fourth.","Under this frenzied barrage of attacks, the soul-power bar above Wale’s head finally dropped by a sliver!","Soul Power: 99%.","As long as the bar could move, they could keep fighting!","With thirty-five hours set aside, they had more than enough time.","Time passed unknowingly.","One day later.","The world still had not heard any news of a successful defense. On the overseas sections of the forums, heated discussions began to erupt.","“China’s second city started its defense ahead of schedule. Could they have been wiped out?”","“They refused to let our countries send reinforcements. If they were wiped out, they deserved it.”","“Don’t they have the Thorn Guild?”","“Heh. The authorities are arrogant. Maybe they didn’t even involve the Thorn Guild.”","This time, all the players defending the city were government personnel, and their discipline was extremely strict. Naturally, they would not leak any information.","As for the players in Thorn City, they were focused solely on maximizing their damage output in this battle and earning more favor from the divine power. Why would they go onto the forums and run their mouths?","Besides, if they went out bragging and ended up being hated by everyone and expelled from Thorn City, they would be unable to make up for such a loss.","When the benefits were great enough, the urge to show off could be firmly suppressed.","Thus, the outside world had no way of knowing what was happening.","Only the senior military officers of certain countries had obtained vague answers by planting spies within China.","But they didn’t know that those spies were already preparing to defect.","China had simply performed too strongly this time—so overwhelmingly powerful that it had demonstrated what a truly formidable race capable of resisting the entire world looked like.","“Everyone, you don’t understand. Death is the final destination. Only in death can one exist forever. My death will merely return me to the embrace of my god.”","Wale had only 10% of his soul power remaining.","The green light in his eyes suddenly grew incomparably intense. Even the flames within his eye sockets fused together, forming a gigantic green orb.","The orb continued expanding, growing from one meter to ten meters, completely enveloping his head.","“Not good—it’s self-destruction! All melee players, fall back!”","Feng Huimin abruptly manipulated the formation.","Every melee player felt their body being yanked backward, retreating from the battlefield.","They were pulled thirty meters away as if by teleportation.","But that distance was clearly not enough.","The green orb seemed to contain the energy of a massive nuclear explosion.","“Return of the Soul!”","“Rumble—!”","Wale’s health dropped from 10% to 0%.","He died completely.","But the terrifying self-detonation of his soul still swept across the entire battlefield."]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246: Whale Fall, Massive Power Boost for the Death Legion, New Dungeon","paragraphs":["A terrifying soul explosion swept across the entire battlefield. Even Feng Huimin’s military formation was torn apart by the blast, which far exceeded its limits of endurance.","In the games of the past, there had been a professional term for this:","A full-screen instant kill.","In other words, every player within the screen was killed.","The moment the enemy detonated its soul, Chu Feng entered the Dimensional Domain and evaded the explosion.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao activated her invincibility.","Chu Fu was knocked into a poisoned corpse.","After the self-detonation, only a handful of people were still alive.","But there was no doubt about it—they had won.","[System Announcement: Under the leadership of player “Rocket on a Wheelchair,” humanity has defeated the Undead Apostle and driven it out of the Gate of Origins. All participating players are rewarded with +100 to all attributes. (Can stack)]","[System Announcement: The stolen divine power has been returned to all players. Please continue your efforts!]","Four flashes of white light passed over Chu Fu’s body, and she rose four levels in a row.","The bodies of all the players lying on the ground were covered in densely packed words.","[Champion!]","[We did it!!!]","[Long live China!]","[Long live the Thorns!]","[Long live Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces!]","[Long live the Military Soul!]","Ignoring her exhaustion, Chu Fu burst into a helpless laugh. She then recalled the Holy Light Fairy and released the Resurrection Fairy, reviving everyone.","Fortunately, even if a player died inside the Gate of Origins dungeon, they could still receive the final rewards. Every player received the nourishment of divine power and a huge amount of experience.","At the very least, everyone gained one level.","Chu Fu revived Shen Chi and Xie Lin.","As one of the main forces in the battle, Shen Chi gained a full five levels, reaching Level 46.","The most frightening one was Chu Feng. Perhaps because he did not have a second class, despite already being high-level, all the experience he received was allocated to a single class. His level soared to 54.","Just as everyone was cheering to celebrate their victory, another system announcement rang out.","[System Announcement: The Undead Apostle Wale has perished. Due to the influence of the God of the Undead’s Law of Death, all undead-type creatures and classes have been enhanced by 100%.","The difficulty of undead dungeons has increased. A new Level 40 dungeon has been added to the entire map: The Fall of the Undead Apostle Wale. (Nightmare Mode, Hell Mode, Abyss Mode, Ruined Wasteland Mode: Diamond-grade equipment may drop)]","These two messages were broadcast worldwide, dealing a heavy blow to all players.","“How could this happen? When we defeated Werewolf Tuge last time, didn’t the monsters become weaker? Why did they become stronger this time?”","“The situation was different back then. After Werewolf Tuge descended, all beasts began to grow stronger. It was only after he died that their strength decreased.”","“So the enemy didn’t make them stronger while he was alive, but made them stronger after he died? We’re doomed. I can already imagine how the other players are going to curse us!”","“We got the benefits. Let them curse us if they want!”","“A Level 40 dungeon! Doesn’t that mean we can compete for the speed-clear rankings again?”","Everyone began discussing the matter among themselves.","Chu Fu quickly understood what had happened.","“It may be because the gods possess different Laws. The God of the Undead controls death. Perhaps Wale’s death was actually a form of divine power recovery for him.","“The more creatures that die, the stronger his Law becomes.","“However, after Wale died, his divine power should have been absorbed by him. Instead, it scattered outward.","“It’s like Werewolf Tuge, who left behind a corpse. Wale’s corpse, on the other hand, was his own soul. Since we failed to capture it, the power naturally returned to all undead creatures.","“When one whale falls, countless other life-forms thrive.”","The others also felt that this explanation made sense.","“Who cares which one it is? Even if the difficulty has increased, it’s not as though the dungeon is impossible to clear. Everyone has a full set of Level 20 Goblin equipment now. Are we really supposed to be afraid of a few undead monsters in the wilderness?”","Li Weizheng sighed.","That might be true, but in twenty days, the full-scale city defense battles would begin.","China might be able to hold out.","But what about the players from the other nations?","Their cities would probably be destroyed.","It seemed that the Military Soul Guild’s defense of the city had caused an enormous problem.","For now, however, everyone tacitly chose not to mention it.","Afterward, Chu Fu and the others checked the rewards they had received for killing the divine emissary, and delight appeared on their faces.","They had grown even stronger!","[You have obtained a genuine Divine Power Fragment (Mythic-grade) (Bound): Contains extremely powerful divine power. Collect 10 fragments to condense a False Godhead.","Note: A False Godhead can only be used after reaching Level 100 or attaining 10,000 points in any single attribute.]","[Your Soul-Stealing Ring has absorbed the soul of an evil god’s divine emissary and gained enhanced attributes!]","[All of your skill levels have increased by 4.]","[Your current level has increased by 4.]","[Your talents and classes have been enhanced.]","This time, she had not received any stage-based evolution.","However, her three SSS-grade talents and two divine classes had all received attribute enhancements.","They had not yet surpassed the level of SSS-grade or reached the realm of the Transcendent Divine.","She would need to kill more divine emissaries to obtain further abilities.","After checking her equipment, it was time for the part everyone loved: distributing the loot.","Unlike Tuge, Wale had dropped a huge amount of equipment.","All of it was Epic-grade.","Aside from the Epic-grade weapon stolen by Dog Sneaky, there were still sixteen pieces remaining.","In addition to equipment for the fixed slots, there was also an off-hand weapon called the Death Codex. Its special ability could directly erase an enemy from existence.","It pronounced the target’s death on the spot.","It was extraordinarily powerful.","In the end, the loot was naturally distributed according to contribution.","For ease of distribution, Thorns City, Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces, all the Chinese legions, and Military Soul City were counted as a single faction. Chu Feng was then counted separately.","Thorns Guild: 80%","Chu Feng: 10%","Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces: 9%","Military Soul City: 1%","The contribution percentages were quite convenient. Thorns City, led by Chu Fu, was the first to choose and took twelve pieces.","Chu Feng took two.","The remaining items were divided between Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces and Military Soul City.","Afterward, Chu Fu led her people in thoroughly looting the Origin-tier dungeon.","Without the Epic-grade Lich Tower, only a black Undead Manor remained.","Chu Fu naturally refused to leave it behind. Even the manor’s roof tiles and stones were dismantled and carried away.","Not a single piece was left behind.","The players from Military Soul City and Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces did not join them. This was considered one of the benefits of Chu Fu’s support mission.","They had already withdrawn from the dungeon.","Chu Fu’s group searched the dungeon for an hour before finally leaving.","Only after everyone had exited did the system announcement appear.","[System Announcement! Congratulations to player “WhoWantsToBeAVegetable” for leading the Thorns Guild and the other players to clear the Origin-tier dungeon: Source of the Undead Calamity (Origin)! Reward: +10 to all attributes. (Attributes can stack)]","There was no level increase reward, and the all-attribute reward had also been reduced to ten points.","However, when they considered that there were still 9,999 cities to defend in the future, reaching more than 10,000 in every attribute seemed to be just around the corner.","Of course, that was impossible. After all, most cities would be attacked on the hundredth day after the game’s arrival, and Chu Fu could not be everywhere at once.","Then, the final announcement appeared.","[System Announcement! Military Soul City has successfully defended itself against the attack of the God of the Undead! It has also achieved a perfect defense. The reward has been doubled: all players receive +10 to all attributes. (Original reward: +5)]","[System Announcement! As the second city to successfully repel the siege, Military Soul City will receive a 0.5x additional increase in size, and two additional resource sites will appear around the city.]","The defense of Military Soul City had officially come to an end.","......","On a higher-dimensional plane.","Several statues seemed to fall silent.","The God of the Undead spoke in a hoarse voice.","“I sacrificed an Undead Apostle and strengthened the power of all undead.","In twenty days, every human on Blue Star will face an assault by an undead army.","At least 50% of the cities will be destroyed.","It’s not too great a loss.”"]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247: The Evil God's Internal Strife, Preparing to Refresh the Dungeon (1900 Reviews Bonus Chapter)","paragraphs":["Really?","These high-dimensional evil gods actually began to feel a sense of distrust in their hearts.","The Goblin God let out a cold laugh in the void. Compared with the other deities, it looked rather weak, yet its eyes gleamed with greed and wickedness.","“Heh heh. That’s what you say, but in the end, you still fattened up this batch of humans!","“You should understand that what we want isn’t a partial victory.","“It’s total victory.","“If even one human reaches godhood, they could overturn this entire game board.”","The God of the Undead’s face darkened. Everything it had said just now had indeed been meant to preserve its dignity and image.","It had not expected the Goblin God to expose it so bluntly.","Suppressing its anger, it spoke in a voice that sounded like countless dead souls whispering at once.","“Hmph! That was also because the Mechanical God interfered and insisted on starting a Source-level dungeon, creating ten thousand Diamond-ranked mechs!","“If those ten thousand Diamond-ranked mechs hadn’t existed, Valle might not have lost.","“What a pointless move.”","The Mechanical God’s voice rang out as well.","It sounded like countless pieces of metal scraping against one another—cold and utterly devoid of emotion.","“All conclusions must be based on data. The plan itself had no flaws.”","“No flaws? Then why didn’t those humans enter your Primordial-level dungeon directly?” the God of the Undead sneered.","“The enemy will not act according to my will. This is a matter of probability.”","The Mechanical God’s tone remained calm. “According to my calculations, the probability of her entering the Primordial-level rift was 57.3%. The remaining 42.7% consisted of unforeseen variables beyond my calculations. This is known as human nature. I do not understand the female protagonist of this scenario particularly well.”","“Unforeseen variables? You’re the Mechanical God, with computational power that reaches the heavens, and you’re talking to me about unforeseen variables?”","“Precisely because I am mechanical, I acknowledge the existence of randomness.”","The Mechanical God replied, “The behavioral patterns of organic life-forms are far more complex than those of my creations. There are variables in this game piece’s decision-making chain that I cannot access.”","For example, interference from reality, the structure of her soul, and the influence of the Primordial Gate.","The gods would never be able to fully grasp all the information about one another, either.","Without information, data, or a model to work from, the results would always be wrong.","“Although we are allies, I have no obligation to explain my plans to the others.”","After the Mechanical God finished speaking in its metallic voice, its enormous phantom slowly faded away. It would not participate in the discussions to come.","At that moment, another seductive voice drifted across the ears of every god.","“Stop arguing. If you ask me, my brood should have been sent in first. That would have given us the highest chance of success. After all, my apostle was the one who killed the male protagonist.”","Behind that alluring voice was an indescribably bloated and terrifying creature.","Its upper body resembled an enormous cockroach, while its lower body was a plump, writhing mass like a queen ant. Countless short, thick, fleshy legs slithered through the void, making everyone’s scalp crawl.","The Insect Mother!","The God of the Insect Tribe.","When it mentioned killing the male protagonist, its greasy tongue even licked around its cheeks, causing all the other gods to shudder with revulsion.","The Insect Mother was indeed powerful.","However, the order in which the various monsters appeared was not actually decided by the gods themselves. It was determined by the selection process of the Primordial Gate.","When the evil gods invaded human planets, the Primordial Gate’s system defenses were activated, keeping these high-dimensional beings outside.","They had no way to interfere with reality.","They could only clash with humanity through the games established by the Primordial Gate. As time passed, more and more loopholes—Primordial Laws—were drilled open, allowing them to eventually complete their invasion.","However, as a game system created by humanity, the Primordial Gate possessed one astonishing ability:","Rollback.","It could return to the moment when the invasion began.","But because the evil gods continued to exploit more and more loopholes, the speed of their invasions would grow faster and faster.","Once the game became a dead save, the power of the Primordial Gate would disappear completely.","Humanity’s planet would then be carved up by these evil gods, reduced to a wasteland.","At present, the Wolf God’s invasion had failed, while the God of the Undead’s invasion had suffered a fifty-percent setback.","The other gods still had a chance.","After the God of Death departed, the Wolf God soon withdrew as well.","Its greatest ability was actually subversion.","It incited internal conflict among humans. During the first and second rounds, it had been extraordinarily successful. The number of people killed by monsters had even been lower than the number killed by their fellow humans.","The third round had begun even more smoothly than the previous two. More and more people were being influenced by its divine power, to the point that its influence had even begun to affect reality.","It had become extremely arrogant. However, it had also sensed that, on the human planet, there was a region shaped somewhat like a rooster, as impregnable as a wall of bronze and iron.","It had used some of its divine power and issued a divine revelation, but in the end, it had achieved nothing.","Now that the werewolf Tuge was dead and its divine power had weakened, it could only wait and see whether the other evil gods would be able to seize this round.","For a being with its incredibly long lifespan, this was no more than the time it took a human to play a game of chess.","Being eliminated early did not mean it would remain out of the game forever.","In the next round, humanity’s breathing room would not be six months. It would be only three.","Before long, humanity’s ability to resist would continue to decline.","Ultimately, they would face a direct invasion.","The Primordial Gate’s rollback ability would become a dead save.","...","Inside the game.","Chu Fu and the others exited the Primordial-level dungeon, used Return Scrolls, and went back to Thorn City.","“Brother, don’t leave! Let’s run a dungeon together! We might have to waste a little time this time, or it’ll be very difficult for the rest of our Thorn Guild to farm the dungeon afterward!”","Chu Fu looked at Chu Feng as she spoke.","Thinking of how ruthlessly he had cut off every possible retreat earlier, Chu Feng felt guilty for the first time.","“All right. Let’s go together!”","By then, players around the world had already begun tackling the new dungeon.","After all, the Undead Apostle Valle’s Fall dungeon started at Nightmare difficulty. As long as they cleared it, they could claim both the First Clear reward and a place on the Speed-Clear leaderboard.","The attribute rewards for the two rankings were identical.","Nightmare difficulty: 15 points to all attributes.","Hell difficulty: 20 points to all attributes.","Abyss difficulty: 25 points to all attributes.","Wasteland difficulty: 30 points to all attributes.","The combined reward for the First Clear and Speed-Clear rankings was 180 points to all attributes—more than the reward for killing a single divine apostle.","Every nation went berserk.","However, an hour had passed, and no player had cleared the dungeon yet.","The dungeon could only be entered by 100 players, but its Nightmare difficulty truly was a nightmare for the players.","After all, this was a level-40 dungeon featuring an Undead Apostle with a 100% increase to its strength.","At present, level-40 players were exceedingly rare across many servers and cities.","Fortunately, the dungeon only required players to be level 40 or higher. There was no upper-level restriction.","At level 54, Chu Feng could not only enter the dungeon—he could even bring fourteen level-39 players with him.","Chu Fu quickly selected the top one hundred players by guild contribution to participate in the First Clear attempt.","Their talents were not necessarily outstanding.","But their contributions to the guild were unquestionably the greatest.","Furthermore, aside from the shareholders, the player with the highest guild contribution was unexpectedly...","[Sneaky Doggo]","He had sold the Death Scythe he had stolen—an Epic-ranked item—to the guild in exchange for contribution points."]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248: The Might of Epic Equipment, Entering the New Dungeon","paragraphs":["Because it is equipment for the Soul profession, this item can be resized at will, whether larger or smaller.","That meant players could equip it directly without any post-processing.","However, in the current game, Epic-grade equipment was practically an existence on the level of a cheat.","[Reaper’s Scythe (Epic Grade):","Soul Attack +800.","Spirit +360.","Trait 1: Soul Rend: Ignores the target’s physical and magical defenses to rend their soul, causing excruciating spiritual pain. The severed body part will lose control temporarily.","Trait 2: Soul Surge: Attack range increased by 100%.","Trait 3: Death Sentence: 5% chance to kill instantly.","Trait 4: Summon Lord of Wraiths: Summons a level 70 Lord-rank monster, the Lord of Wraiths, to assist in battle.","Trait 5: Soul Convergence: When an enemy dies, its soul is absorbed into the Reaper’s Scythe, increasing its attack power. One soul is consumed per minute, with the effect gradually diminishing.]","It could be said that whoever obtained this piece of equipment would instantly become an overwhelmingly powerful, god-tier player.","Naturally, Chu Fu would never let such equipment fall into the hands of outsiders.","In addition to requiring an enormous number of contribution points, the exchange also required the player to belong to the Thorns Guild or Thorns Studio.","Furthermore, players were granted usage rights only, not ownership. If they acquired better equipment and replaced it, the Epic-grade item had to be returned to the guild, with the contribution points refunded at a depreciated value.","In the end, this terrifying piece of equipment was obtained by the Bitter Melon King, who had bankrupted himself and borrowed money from everyone he knew.","He felt as though it would take ten months of working for the guild to pay it off.","But it was worth it.","Who wouldn’t want such a treasure? Even if others wanted one, they couldn’t get it!","The players in the guild’s whale group were anxious as well.","These players held a special position within the Thorns Guild. They had paid to remain in the guild—in other words, they were among the first players to hire the Thorns Guild to carry them through the speed-clear rankings.","One of them was a player whose ID was Virtue Bears All.","He was also one of the players who had purchased a Necromancer class-change token from Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate. He had changed classes long before the Lich Tower was established.","Thanks to his wealth, he had spent lavishly and even purchased an exclusive Thorns Guild membership.","He had coasted along the entire way.","By now, he had an SS-rank talent and the hidden class Lord of the Undead.","However, because he did not want to work for Thorns, he had never joined Thorns Studio.","Naturally, he had no qualifications to purchase Epic-grade equipment.","He panicked.","“Guild Leader, please let me join Thorns Studio! I’ll work for Thorns from now on! I was born a member of Thorns, and I’ll die a ghost of Thorns!”","More importantly, the currency system in the real world had collapsed. No matter how much money he had, it could no longer keep up with the prices in the game.","However, every member of the whale group was a shrewd businessman. They had all invested in the game, establishing small studios or monopolizing certain hard currencies. Within the game, they had also become top-tier merchants.","After shamelessly befriending Jiaojiao, Virtue Bears All rented three shops and made a fortune every day. That was the only reason he could afford to spend so extravagantly in the game.","But no amount of money could buy Epic-grade equipment!","Who didn’t want to become a god-tier player?","What was more, the Thorns Guild had now grown to the strength of a nation. Virtue Bears All decided to abandon his former stubbornness. He would no longer act like an arrogant, high-and-mighty tycoon. Instead, he would become a working member of the Thorns Guild.","At fifty-five, he was still in his prime.","“Sure, Uncle Li. Just have Manager Feng arrange it for you.”","Chu Fu gave the order.","Before long, Virtue Bears All joined the Thorns Guild as well. However, his contribution points were too low, so he could only earn them through purchasing.","This created a virtuous cycle.","The Epic-grade equipment became a carrot dangling in front of players who wanted it, driving them to buy guild contribution points.","Other guild members who wanted money would sell their contribution points, and to obtain more contribution points, they naturally had to improve their standing.","They completed guild missions: carrying new players, working in life professions, helping the guild gather materials, and submitting high-quality equipment to the guild warehouse.","The guild’s finance department would then sell those items through the auction house and various shops, bringing in funds, earning gold, and returning the profits to shareholders such as Chu Fu.","Therefore, to determine whether a guild was strong and profitable, one only had to check whether its warehouse contained a treasure capable of anchoring the entire guild.","Before long, all the Epic-grade equipment had been exchanged, mobilizing an astonishing amount of capital—up to 100 million gold coins.","The publicly listed price of a single piece of Epic-grade equipment was currently 8 million gold coins, making it even more expensive than a City-Building Token.","After distributing the equipment and organizing their team, Chu Fu finally set out.","They found a new dungeon 50 kilometers outside Thorns City. This was also the location where an invasion rift had appeared when Thorns City was defending itself.","When they arrived, they saw a leaderboard suspended above the dungeon.","Speed-Clear Leaderboard: Current Clear Teams: None, None, None, None, None.","Since no team had cleared it yet, the first-clear reward was naturally still available.","[Enter The Fall of Undead Apostle Valle (Nightmare Difficulty)? This dungeon is highly challenging. Please choose carefully!","Please note: The speed-clear leaderboard for this dungeon is global, and reward attributes are doubled.]","Now that was a pleasant surprise!","Wouldn’t that mean a full 360 points to all attributes?","They had arrived just in time!","Failing to respect an all-attribute reward like that would have been unforgivable.","With a wave of her hand, Chu Fu entered the dungeon.","The world around them grew dim, as though they had stepped into the land of the dead.","If not for the surprisingly small number of monsters ahead, they might have suspected that they had entered another Origin-level dungeon.","[Battleaxe Skeleton Summoner (Elite Boss), Level 31, HP: 180 million]","There were ten bosses like this.","Upon seeing the group appear, the Battleaxe Skeleton Summoners began summoning battleaxe skeletons.","In an instant, the monsters surged toward them like a stampeding horde.","“Pull them all together and wipe them out!” Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate shouted.","Her body became encased in thick layers of rock, transforming her into a giant made of stone.","She slammed one fist into the ground. The earth trembled, drawing the attention of every boss.","The bosses had originally intended to remain where they were and continue attacking, but Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate clenched her massive hand, and the ground beneath every monster turned into quicksand, dragging them all together.","That made it easy for the others to focus their fire.","Chu Fu also unleashed Soul-Extinguishing Calamity and Black Death Calamity, forming a dense black-and-gray fog that enveloped all ten bosses.","In less than two minutes, all ten Elite Bosses had been slain.","“That was easy! I wonder why the other teams still haven’t cleared it!”","“This dungeon requires level 40 to enter. It’s probably not easy for the other servers to gather a hundred level 40 players!”","“True. After all, people from outside can’t compare to the Thorns Guild.”","As they talked, they continued forward. Each wave contained ten bosses, and every round summoned at least a thousand monsters, but the group slaughtered them all with overwhelming ease.","Compared to them, players from the other servers had never faced monsters of this level.","Chu Fu and the others had no idea that players overseas had already begun cursing on the forums.","[What the hell is this dungeon? How is it so difficult? The first stage of Nightmare difficulty starts with Elite Bosses!]","That elite boss has a whopping 180 million HP, and it keeps summoning an endless stream of monsters. We’ve been holding them off for a full hour, and the monsters still haven’t stopped spawning.","Has anyone beaten the boss from the first wave yet?】"]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249: Successfully Clear the Dungeon, Long Zhantian Plots a Grand Plan","paragraphs":["【This must be because the people of China killed Waller, the God of Death, causing the dungeon monsters to become far too powerful. China needs to take responsibility for this!】","【I hereby declare that no team can clear the Valle dungeon!】","【A dungeon that a million players are attempting to clear—how could just a hundred people possibly beat it?】","【The hardest dungeon in history. Even a vegetable couldn’t clear it.】","Likes: 47.26 million. Dislikes: 76.25 million.","Just as everyone was cursing and arguing heatedly, another earth-shaking announcement appeared.","【Global Announcement: Player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” has led a team to clear The Fall of Undead Apostle Valle on Nightmare difficulty, achieving the world’s first clear!","Reward: +30 to all attributes (global synchronization, double rewards).】","【Global Announcement: Player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” has led a team to clear The Fall of Undead Apostle Valle on Nightmare difficulty, taking first place on the dungeon speed-clear rankings!","Reward: +30 to all attributes (global synchronization, double rewards).】","Inside the dungeon.","The hundred players cheered as one and looked at their results.","【You have cleared the dungeon: The Fall of Undead Apostle Valle (Nightmare difficulty).】","【Clear time: 48 minutes and 23 seconds.】","【First-kill reward: 1 Dark Gold Chest.】","【First place on the speed-clear rankings: 1 Dark Gold Chest.】","This was a Level 40 dungeon, so the equipment it dropped was naturally Dark Gold-tier. Its price was considerably higher than that of the mass-market Goblin Set.","Everyone gained something.","Chu Fu waved her little hand and said, “It’s settled. The other teams should also be competing for first place on the speed-clear rankings for this difficulty.","“They haven’t challenged the other difficulties yet. We can set a speed-clear time based on our damage output—something that will be easy for everyone to clear, so later players won’t have too hard a time surpassing it.”","In the end, Chu Fu settled on two hours.","They couldn’t spend too much time here. That would be wasting the time of someone as powerful as Chu Feng.","After that, every two hours, Chu Fu appeared on the global announcement board.","They completely cleared the remaining three modes, gaining another 360 points in all attributes.","The boss’s final drop was Diamond-tier equipment. Its stats were close to those of Level 50 Diamond-tier gear, making it the best equipment available in the current version.","After all, not everyone could go to the future map to level up and defeat its bosses.","What was more, this equipment could be mass-produced.","It completely outclassed the equipment dropped by the Goblin Divine Emissary.","Everyone began placing bids.","Chu Fu didn’t bid. As her attributes continued to rise, she became less dependent on equipment. Besides, her class made this gear unsuitable for her.","“You guys have fun. I’m going to continue leveling.”","“All right, big brother. I’ll call you again the next time we fight a divine emissary!”","Chu Feng was both amused and exasperated.","Where were they supposed to find so many divine emissaries to fight?","Still, if Fufu really was the Savior...","It might not be impossible.","Before leaving, Chu Feng glanced at Chu Fu.","She was still wearing that set of Diamond-tier equipment, but it appeared to have been dropped by the Goblin Divine Emissary—probably around Level 20 Diamond quality.","Fufu should change her equipment!","Yes, he would find some Green Dragons and Lone Dragons for her.","And this time, they wouldn’t be hatchlings.","They would be true Dragon Kings.","After that, he could have the Dreamweaver from her guild craft some good-looking equipment for her.","The NPCs inside the Primordial Gate had terrible design sense.","Their equipment wasn’t attractive at all.","With that thought in mind, Chu Feng also added the Dreamweaver as a friend.","Zhimengzhe was startled, her round eyes opening wide. She cautiously examined Chu Feng, who was cloaked from head to toe.","【Zhimengzhe】: “Boss! Is there something you need?”","【Lu Xing】: “I’ll be farming some materials later. Help me make a set of equipment for Fufu. Tell me what materials you need, and set whatever crafting fee you like.”","【Zhimengzhe】: “Ah, Boss, you don’t need to pay me a crafting fee. I’d be happy to make equipment for the guild master. Besides, if you give me high-level materials, I’ll gain some experience too.”","【Zhimengzhe】: “I originally wanted to use the materials from Werewolf Tuge’s body to make something for her, but the equipment I crafted all came with bonuses to Agility and Strength. The equipment from Valle this time is soul-bound equipment, so it can’t be dismantled.”","【Lu Xing】: “All right. It’s up to you. You can keep any excess materials for yourself. I’ll keep an eye out for more.”","After discussing the required materials, Chu Feng entered the future map.","Chu Fu and the others naturally went to the future map as well.","The 10,000 Diamond-tier mechs had been incredibly useful in that battle. Shen Chi had gotten a taste of the benefits and was determined to milk that Origin-level rift for all it was worth, as long as it remained open.","Thus, they hurried to the future map.","Shen Chi led everyone directly to the location of Dragon City.","When they saw the familiar spatial rift and the familiar Origin-level dungeon prompt, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","“Great! The rift hasn’t disappeared. We’ll farm another ten thousand mechs, then enter and clear this dungeon.”","“Yes!”","Everyone shouted in unison.","Within a higher-dimensional space, the Mechanical God watched with satisfaction as the probability of Chu Fu falling into the trap rose once again.","However, after an entire day of farming, Chu Fu and the others had made a killing, yet they showed no intention of entering the dungeon.","Then, at two in the afternoon, the future map closed.","Everyone had no choice but to leave.","At that moment, Chu Fu received a private message.","【Long Zhantian】: “Chairwoman Chu, I have an important confidential matter to discuss. Could you bring the key members of the Thorn Guild to the Dragon City Analysis Bureau? It will only take two or three hours. Our coordinates in the real world are...”","【Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?】: “No problem. Give me a moment.”","As the current leader of China, Long Zhantian would never make a fuss over nothing.","An “important confidential matter” almost certainly meant that he had made a major discovery.","As for the Thorn Guild’s upper management, there were only six shareholders, all of whom were the six people Chu Fu trusted most. She simply sent messages to the remaining five.","Although they had no idea what was going on, they still logged off.","...","In the real world.","Chu Fu climbed out of the gaming pod.","One piece of equipment after another materialized around her. It was the Poison Dragon Little Demon Set.","She had brought this equipment out into the real world.","She was also holding the colorful black staff known as A Little Poisonous. Its imposing presence was extraordinary.","Chu Fu then walked out.","When she passed Chu Feng’s room, she knocked on the door and entered. Standing beside his gaming pod, she greeted him.","“Big brother, Marshal Long asked me to go to Dragon City to discuss something important. Do you want to come and take a look too?”","Chu Feng hadn’t expected Marshal Long to contact Chu Fu.","When he realized that Chu Fu was about to leave the house in the real world, a trace of anxiety immediately surfaced in his heart.","He didn’t want his little sister going outside.","He promptly put aside what he was doing in the game and logged off as well.","The buildings around them were thoroughly modern. The only incongruous sight was Chu Fu, who was dressed in her in-game outfit, while the staff in her hand radiated an aura that felt incomparably dangerous and terrifying.","In an instant, Chu Feng’s eyes cleared.","It seemed he really didn’t need to worry too much about Chu Fu’s strength.","The strongest creatures in the real world were only Level 4 mutated wolves.","If anyone should be afraid, it was the civilians. If his little sister—the God of Calamity—casually released a skill, everyone would be killed.","“I’m going with you! But I won’t show myself!”","Chu Feng still wasn’t reassured, but he could follow them while invisible.","That was just how stubborn a siscon could be."]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250: The Analysis Bureau's God-Making Plan: Creating a Million God-Tier Players","paragraphs":["“All right! Fine!”","Although Chu Fu didn’t understand, she respected her brother’s decision.","Before long, Shen Chi, Xie Lin, Jiao Jiao, Suture Saint, and Feng Huimin had all gathered outside.","Shen Chi summoned a mecha.","However, this mecha was only three meters tall and two meters wide. It looked as though it could seat only two people.","Shen Chi said, “We’re limited by our current conditions. I couldn’t make the mecha too powerful because we don’t have enough materials. Still, this mecha has been fitted with a Spatial Stone, so it can teleport through space.","“I’ll take you to the coordinates first. Once we arrive, you can open a Forest Spirit Passage and let everyone else come through.”","Chu Fu was just about to nod when Xie Lin said from the side, “It really is rather cramped in there. Just let Fufu’s contracted spirit go up. Once you reach the destination, you can open the Forest Spirit Passage in reverse.”","The moment he finished speaking, Xie Lin clearly felt two gazes stabbing into him.","One came from Shen Chi. It seemed to contain a silent accusation and a wordless question.","The other was filled with killing intent.","Xie Lin’s Heart’s Eye talent stirred faintly. He then kept his eyes straight ahead, pretending not to notice the enormous invisible presence nearby.","Chu Feng: Fufu is not someone you can call Fufu!","Chu Feng: That said, the suggestion itself is fine.","“Let’s do that,” he said.","Hearing this inexplicable voice, everyone’s hearts stirred. They understood what had happened, and their expressions became rather strange.","They had always felt that Chu Feng really, truly disliked the authorities.","Shen Chi entered the mecha cockpit, while Chu Fu sent one of her contracted Snow Lotus Spirits inside.","It was summer, after all. The spirit could help keep Shen Chi cool.","Shen Chi gave a helpless smile, then closed the mecha’s hatch and tore open a spatial rift, arriving at the designated coordinates.","Once he reached the location, Shen Chi sent Chu Fu a message.","Chu Fu opened a Forest Spirit Passage, and everyone walked through.","As soon as they arrived, a large number of people came forward as well. After passing through layer upon layer of checkpoints, they reached the tenth underground level, where they met Long Zhantian.","“This is currently the most heavily defended location in Flower Country. It is also the only institution in Flower Country equipped with a shielding array.”","Long Zhantian gave only a brief introduction. Unlike Li Weizheng, he did not show Chu Fu and the others around.","They were short on time.","He did not waste a single word.","Long Zhantian took out a set of documents and distributed them to everyone.","“Based on our investigations into the enemy, we’ve made a reasonable deduction. Their influence and ability to interfere rank as follows: Origin-level instances > future maps > game worlds along the normal timeline > the real world.”","Within Origin-level instances, the enemies truly existed there, and their apostles could appear whenever they wished.","In future maps, monsters of various levels could invade and launch an all-out assault.","In game worlds along the normal timeline, Werewolf Tuge could only operate within the Novice Village. For him to truly appear, certain means of ‘descending into the world’ were required—for example, a player joining the werewolf faction and offering themselves as a sacrifice.","As for the real world, the influence was weakest. So far, only Level 4 monsters had synchronized with reality. In another eight days, Level 5 monsters would synchronize as well.","The enemies had also been clearly identified.","The Wolf God, Goblin God, and God of the Undead.","The Titan God, Elemental God, and Mechanical God.","At present, even the strongest players in Flower Country could not enter Level 70 maps, so they had no idea what enemy forces awaited them in the next four maps.","But their current objective was already crystal clear.","Counterattack!","Clear more Origin-level instances, accumulate attributes, and kill the invading gods in return.","Gods?","Flower Country had never believed in the existence of gods.","Those who could be put to use were gods.","Those who could not be put to use were monsters—and would be beaten to death.","“Chairwoman Chu, your reminder has been of tremendous help to our analysis team. This Origin-level instance is a conspiracy targeting us.","“Today, we had Wale. Tomorrow, there may be a second apostle, or even a third. We have no choice but to guard against it.","“However, entering the Origin-level rifts is something we must do. Clearing Origin-level instances allows us to stack our attributes. Because of the cultivation policies of the [Gate of Origins], it is impossible to enter village-level and town-level Origin instances.","“But city-level instances have no such requirement. Everyone can support one another.","“Suppose there are ten thousand cities across the entire world, and we begin participating in the Origin-level instances of every one of them. That would allow us to obtain one hundred thousand attribute points.","“Of course, I know this is an idealized estimate.","“But what about Flower Country? We have one thousand cities and one thousand servers. That would give us ten thousand points to every attribute.","“Based on the fact that ten thousand attribute points are enough to use a Godhead, this should be the standard for becoming a god.","“But how do we ensure that the people participating from every corner of the country can obtain the full attributes from the Origin-level instance in every city?","“That is why we need your help, Chairwoman Chu, as well as yours, Mr. Shen Chi.","“Here are the coordinates of all one thousand server cities in Flower Country.","“At present, because of our rapid development, the four servers located in Dragon Capital will trigger the Level 30, one-hundred-thousand-player rule ahead of schedule and begin their city defense battles early.","“We’ll start the city defenses in batches and stagger their times.","“There are still eighteen days left. Each day, we’ll tackle fifty Origin-level instances and forge a group of invincible forces.","“Or, perhaps, we should call them teams of god-tier players.","“This plan has been named the God-Making Project.”","Chu Fu was not surprised in the slightest upon hearing this.","Based on her understanding of the original story, Flower Country had carried out the God-Making Project in every lifetime.","All available resources were poured into a select group of people to create god-tier players capable of resisting the invaders.","But once such a plan was truly implemented, it would become an exploitation of low-level players to fatten those at the top.","When the enemy’s strength became overwhelming, the upper-level players would flee whenever an attack came, while the lower-level players would die.","It was under such circumstances that Chu Feng had barely survived in the first lifetime.","In that first lifetime, the authorities in Linjiang City had been unable to defeat the Four Great Conglomerates. The conglomerates occupied the safe zone and ruthlessly exploited the survivors. The low-level players lived worse than dogs.","But could anyone say Long Zhantian’s decision was wrong?","Of course not. Without those god-tier players, how could they resist the countless monsters?","Take The Anti-Magic Teacher and Water Mage Loki, for example. Had either of them not fought with everything they had to protect their city?","As for those who fled, one could only say that people were capable of both good and evil.","Taking a step back, Chu Fu had now been reborn. She understood the plot and stood on the third level, so to speak. She knew how the current situation compared with the first and second lifetimes, and she was stronger now.","Clearing Origin-level instances meant creating a path through which everyone else could also reach breakthrough-level strength.","Long Zhantian’s plan was not wrong.","In fact, he had not been wrong even in the first or second lifetime. His mistake lay in having too few resources at his disposal.","Once resources became abundant, the God-Making Project would not create a single god, but countless gods.","This time, Chu Fu did not bargain at all.","She nodded without hesitation.","“I’m willing to cooperate!”","Shen Chi nodded as well. “Naturally, I’m willing too.”","This was their support for the entire plan.","Although Chu Fu was an important part of the project, putting such a plan into practice would be incredibly difficult."]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251: Terrifying Forest Spirit Passage, Flower-Planting Players Assemble","paragraphs":["The first issue was timing.","The cities had to stagger the start of their battles. Every dungeon had to be entered at precisely the right time, and at least fifty Origin-level dungeons had to be cleared within a single day.","Each dungeon had a maximum time limit of thirty minutes.","And that was only for the nine hundred Origin-level dungeons.","The remaining one hundred would be delayed, since the city-defense battles lasted three days.","The second issue was how to control which city would begin its defense battle first.","To put it another way: how could they precisely control the timing once one hundred thousand Level 30 players had gathered?","Without Huaxia's powerful coordination abilities and its comprehensive investigations into every player's data, this would have been impossible.","Chu Fu raised her concerns.","Long Zhantian answered.","“That is also the second point we wanted to bring up, but we're not sure whether it will grant us attribute points.”","“Recently, we've been investigating every aspect of Goblin City. Based on the data we've observed and collected, the entire goblin world is actually a planet.","“So the Land of Death may also be just one of their strongholds—the place we entered could be one of them. If that's the case, might there be other similar strongholds nearby?","“If we can deduce the locations of those strongholds, could we counterattack directly without having to launch a city-defense battle?”","Chu Fu fell into thought.","“We can give it a try!” Chu Fu agreed.","Not only that, Chu Fu also revealed the details about the future map and the Origin-level dungeon, Mechanical Star.","The machines were equally important.","Thus, they decided to work on both fronts at once.","Shen Chi would remain in the future map and continue clearing out the machines.","Chu Fu and the others would enter the Origin-level dungeons to clear the weaker monsters. When it was time to fight the boss, Shen Chi would come over and leech ten points to all attributes.","The plan was perfect!","Once the cooperation had been finalized, there was no time to waste.","Without lingering, Chu Fu used the Plant Spirit she had left at home to return to Linjiang City.","She also left a Plant Spirit at the Analysis Bureau.","Long Zhantian had even prepared a room for Chu Fu, making it her exclusive office. Plants had already been arranged inside, so the Plant Spirit would not dissipate over time due to a lack of wood element.","The group soon returned to the game.","...","The Thorn Guild.","Inside the Mechanical Workshop.","This was a massive factory belonging exclusively to Shen Chi.","At this moment, countless piles of metal were stacked inside, along with densely packed mechs.","Chu Fu placed all her Plant Spirits inside the mechs.","Shen Chi entered spatial coordinates into each mech and then activated them.","In an instant, spatial rifts opened one after another, and the mechs entered the designated coordinates.","Every coordinate belonged to a guild established by the authorities, much like Soul of the Army Town.","Feng Huimin was assisting from the side as well.","For such a large-scale operation, communication and preparation were the most important factors.","“The mechs for Shanhai City are in position. Everything is normal, and the liaison is ready. We have a Level 8 tinkerer from a life profession who can operate the mech.”","“The mechs for Cangsong City are in position. We have a mechanic who can operate them.”","“The mechs for Wujin City are in position...”","“Yungang City...”","“Qiutan City...”","“Baizhou City...”","The positions in every city were confirmed.","Chu Fu felt that, at this moment, her contracted plants had formed a gigantic network, occupying an enormous territory that was clearly displayed in her mind.","After a full three hours of preparation, all the mechs had been deployed.","However, the invading gods from the higher dimensions knew nothing about this.","They only observed humanity when the Origin-level dungeons were opened and spatial rifts appeared.","When they saw Shen Chi return to continue grinding monsters, the Mechanical God assumed that everything was proceeding as before.","Meanwhile, all fifty servers in Huaxia had entered a frenzy of leveling.","The number of Level 30 players continued to rise.","[System Announcement: The Undead Reaper has sensed the prosperity of Dragon Capital's Eastern City and intends to destroy it!","All players in Dragon Capital City, prepare yourselves.","The city-defense battle will begin in one hour.]","It worked!","As expected, once one hundred thousand players reached Level 30, the city-defense battle would begin ahead of schedule.","The players in Dragon Capital's Eastern City immediately sprang into action.","Then, one system announcement after another appeared.","[System Announcement: The Undead Reaper has sensed the prosperity of Dragon Capital's Southern City and intends to destroy it!]","[System Announcement: The Undead Reaper has sensed the prosperity of Dragon Capital's Western City and intends to destroy it!]","[System Announcement: The Undead Reaper has sensed the prosperity of Dragon Capital's Northern City and intends to destroy it!]","All four cities of Dragon Capital had entered city-defense battles.","The other countries naturally heard the news as well, and they were all stunned.","“The city-defense battle has begun? Why hasn't ours started?”","“Didn't you see the announcement? Dragon Capital City was prosperous enough to trigger it first.”","“People on the forums are guessing that it requires one hundred thousand Level 30 players.”","“Damn, that many? At our current pace, we'll probably have to wait another two months.”","“What if we never get one hundred thousand players?”","“It's probably similar to the village-defense battle. Either one thousand players reach Level 10 ahead of time, or you wait for the timer. Who knows how long that will take?”","“Our small city has fewer than one thousand Level 30 players in total. Could we really fail to hold the city?”","At first, everyone believed that it was all just a coincidence.","Players from Huaxia had already experienced several major events, Origin-level dungeons, and so on. It was only natural for them to be ahead of the other servers in terms of progression.","After all, even Level 20 Dark Gold equipment had been obtained through their relentless efforts.","But two hours later, when the first wave of Origin-level dungeons was cleared, followed by wave after wave of successful clears, they finally realized that something was wrong.","Inside Dragon Capital's Eastern City.","During the first wave of the undead assault, all the players pushed aggressively forward, blocking the spatial rift and slaughtering the undead.","The undead army had not even traveled fifty kilometers before being killed the moment they emerged. As a result, the first wave of monsters was wiped out in just one hour.","Afterward, the Longxiang Jiuzhou Guild entered an Origin-level dungeon.","One of the mechs followed them inside.","After arriving in the Land of Death, the other players began holding back the undead army. The diamond-grade mech opened its hatch, revealing a Holy Light Elf inside.","The elf flew out, then instantly opened a Forest Spirit passage.","In the blink of an eye, orderly footsteps emerged from within the passage.","Feng Huimin led all the guild members and the players from Thorn City into the dungeon together.","At the very front was Chu Fu.","With a wave of her hand, Chu Fu opened one hundred enormous spatial passages.","Each passage was twenty meters wide, making a total width of two kilometers.","Chu Fu's mana began burning at a frantic rate.","However, a hundred-man priest squad was following beside her, desperately restoring her mana.","Chu Fu left the spot and sprinted three hundred meters forward, opening a second batch of one hundred Forest Spirit passages.","At that moment, countless players began pouring out of the first batch of Forest Spirit passages."]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252: Frenziedly Absorbing the Reaper's Divine Power, Overseas Players Are Green with Envy","paragraphs":["They moved in perfect formation, creating square-shaped units. Their pace was uniform, yet pushed to the absolute limit.","Two minutes.","With forty thousand players in each passage sprinting at a hundred-meter pace, they poured out of the channels.","A hundred channels carried a total of four million players, who charged out like a tidal wave—comparable to the undead army formed by the Undead Legion.","“Whoosh!”","The channels closed.","Chu Fu wiped the sweat from her brow. By then, she was already half a kilometer from where she had been moments earlier.","The second batch of forest-spirit channels opened!","Another hundred forest-spirit channels appeared.","Once again, each channel held forty thousand people.","The cycle continued without pause.","More than twenty minutes later, the army of players occupied an area a full ten kilometers by ten kilometers.","Then, everyone lined up in perfect formation and stood at the mouth of the rift, waiting.","How many players were there?","The number was terrifying to even say aloud.","Nearly fifty million.","Every one of them was a player from an official guild on one of the major servers.","All the guilds had now reached Level 4, allowing them to accommodate forty thousand members.","Some players were not part of any guild, but the Analysis Bureau had stipulated that no more than fifty thousand people could pass through at once. Otherwise, too much time would be wasted.","Now, the players from all one thousand servers had gathered together.","Chu Fu opened another forest-spirit channel specifically for Shen Chi.","Shen Chi disappeared from the mechanical version of the map and reappeared in the Land of Death.","At that moment, the top-tier boss representing the Origin-tier dungeon had only a sliver of health remaining.","Shen Chi arrived, fired one shot from his mecha, and tagged the boss for a bit of damage.","The Origin-tier dungeon was cleared.","[System Announcement! Congratulations to player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable” for leading the Thorn Guild and its allied players in clearing the Origin-tier dungeon: Source of the Undead Calamity (Origin)! Reward: 10 points to all attributes (stackable)]","Players across the globe were already used to it.","Even those who were green with envy had no time to dwell on it. All they could do was feel bitterly jealous.","They hated that they weren’t from China.","Meanwhile, inside the Land of Death, nearly fifty million players received attribute points simultaneously.","At that moment, a scene that had never occurred before unfolded.","The dark clouds in the sky seemed to descend, transforming into wisps of energy that poured into everyone’s bodies.","The aura of death that filled the air seemed to vanish.","Some kind of energy had been completely absorbed by all fifty million players.","It was divine power.","The God of Death’s divine power naturally transformed the Land of Death, making the environment more suitable for the Undead Legion.","The sky was eternally black, and the ground was black as well, filled with the stench of decay.","But on closer inspection, all of it was energy.","Dark elements, death elements, and the mana in the air were all manifestations of divine power.","When the reward was excessively massive, how could it not amount to plunder?","The energy absorbed by the players drew away even the gray mist in the sky and siphoned off the dense aura of death from the ground.","The entire world instead regained its color.","Yet the players keenly sensed that this place had changed.","It was just like... the real world.","No elements drifted through the air anymore, and the atmosphere could no longer contain the substances needed to restore their strength.","Everything had become ordinary.","When a god wanted to reshape the environment for its own race, it was like a human furnishing their house. It required money too.","And now, the players who had invaded the Land of Death had become thieves, siphoning away all the energy within it.","Stealing an enemy’s energy was equivalent to weakening their strength.","This move was absolutely correct.","The dungeon ended, and everyone withdrew.","“Wheelchair Brother, you keep fighting. We’ll start the next round right away!” Chu Fu said.","“Mm. I’ll be back immediately.”","Shen Chi once again entered a forest-spirit channel and returned to Longdu City on the future map.","In a higher-dimensional space, the Mechanical God watched Shen Chi disappear before the rift, then saw him return.","What had he gone to do?","The data was unclear. Without knowing the necessary variables, the Mechanical God merely recorded everything mechanically, one fact at a time.","The Undead Reaper also was not monitoring every move humanity made from the higher-dimensional plane.","As gods, they had placed countless pieces on the board they controlled. There was no need to keep their eyes on a single game.","Little did they know that, before long, the pieces on the board were about to make a world-shaking move.","The instant the dungeon ended, nearly fifty million people streamed through the rift and left.","Like an army of undead, they transformed into a sea of humanity.","But they were definitely faster than those foolish skeletons.","The only sound at the scene was the synchronized rhythm of their footsteps.","Every player’s eyes were filled with determination and excitement, and they desperately suppressed their surging emotions.","Only after reaching this point could they truly be said to have boarded the high-speed train.","They sprinted ten kilometers, spreading the entire formation out, and waited for the next round.","...","Elsewhere, Chu Fu and the players from Thorn City returned to Thorn City and waited for the next wave.","The players from Thorn City were not as well-trained as the Chinese players, but their attributes were far superior.","Even new players were carried along, so their speed was not slow either.","To accommodate them, their forest-spirit channels would remain open the entire time.","That was more than enough for them to pass through and claim their attribute rewards.","“I got attribute points the moment I arrived. Sure enough, waiting for Thorn was the right choice!”","“Don’t panic. There’s plenty for everyone today. Don’t log off. If you’re using a gaming helmet, hurry up and log off to put on an adult diaper.”","“What? There are more events like this?”","“Didn’t you hear that so many cities are defending themselves? Of course we’re going to take all of it!”","As the dungeon in Longdu’s eastern district ended, the players in Longdu’s western district—who had spent half a day delaying the final wave of undead instead of killing them—quickly wiped out the monsters and entered the first rest period.","Then everyone charged into the spatial rift.","A diamond-grade mecha carrying a plant spirit entered as well.","The plant spirit flew out of the mecha.","The next moment, it formed a gigantic forest-spirit channel twenty meters wide.","Chu Fu and the members of the Thorn Guild entered it.","Then Chu Fu opened a new forest-spirit channel.","Connection point: outside the eastern district of Long City.","A hundred forest-spirit channels opened.","The one thousand forest spirits previously sent to other cities were recalled. The one hundred forest spirits that had not been needed for siege defense were brought back.","This time, Chu Fu did not need to do anything extra. The one hundred forest-spirit channels transported more than forty million players, and they passed through even faster than expected.","It took only fifteen minutes for every player to pass through the forest-spirit channels and enter the Land of Death.","As a result, this clear was even faster.","[You have cleared the dungeon: Source of the Undead Calamity (Origin).]","[Dungeon completion time: 18 minutes, 34 seconds.]","[System Announcement! Congratulations to player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable” for leading the Thorn Guild and its allied players in clearing the Origin-tier dungeon: Source of the Undead Calamity (Origin)! Reward: 10 points to all attributes (stackable)]","The announcement appeared again.","From then on, every twenty minutes, Chu Fu would trigger another system announcement.","The overseas players grew more and more uneasy as they watched.","What kind of grand gaming strategy was China carrying out?","They were farming like this?","What was the point of balance anymore?","Weren’t they going to become absurdly powerful while everyone else turned into weaklings?","“Where’s the administrator of our nation? When are we starting the city defense battle? I want to claim the dungeon’s stat points!”"]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253: Brother Got Carried Again, Green Poison Queen Set","paragraphs":["Under mounting pressure from the public, the leaders of the major nations were forced to step forward and calm everyone down.","“This is nothing more than a fake moon landing. Huaxia wants to trick us into investing huge amounts of resources and sending people to their deaths. What we need to guarantee is the survival of our citizens. We have established shelters in various regions and are distributing food free of charge.”","“At present, none of our cities have entered an early city-defense battle. Furthermore, because the undead legion is growing stronger, we recommend that everyone level up slowly to avoid triggering a city-defense battle ahead of time and getting the entire team wiped out.”","“The game is fake. This is a Sixth-Generation War. Don’t believe those lies. It’s just a game, and the authorities won’t intervene.”","Of course, there were also some more honest countries that simply exposed everyone’s lies.","“You haven’t even cleared Walle’s dungeon, so stop thinking about an Origin-tier dungeon.","“At present, our country doesn’t have the technology to overcome the distance and gather elite players from every city in one place.","“Even with just one million people, we still wouldn’t be able to attack an Origin-tier dungeon.","“But Huaxia can.","“Mechanists can pinpoint coordinates, while Plant Masters can open passages. Huaxia was the first country whose government officially intervened in the game, and they also possess sufficient foundations.","“However, if we had Spatial Mages or Flight Masters, we could indeed give it a try—gathering the strongest players from every city and launching an assault on an Origin-tier dungeon.","“We hope you succeed.”","However, after the post was published, the comments were overwhelmingly negative.","“Impossible. The leaders of our country have already started selling out the nation. The game has changed the existing class system. Players with SSS-rank talents can rise to the top overnight, while the wealthy might awaken nothing better than an F-rank talent. They can only spend money to pile resources onto themselves and force their way to higher talents.”","“That’s right. On our server, a wealthy businessman wanted a better talent and greater strength, so he bought up a huge number of slots for the town-defense battles. In the end, he even bought contribution points and used Talent Enhancement Stones and Skill Enhancement Stones to strengthen himself. Meanwhile, players with naturally powerful talents had no way to improve.”","“If they have money, why shouldn’t they use it?”","“But once they monopolize those resources, there are naturally fewer resources left for everyone else.”","“Players who originally had high-level talents have become disadvantaged groups with no way to improve. Meanwhile, low-talent players with money have to pour in even more resources, wasting them in the process.”","“If they took those resources while also shouldering responsibility, why haven’t they taken us to attack an Origin-tier dungeon? I often follow the Thorn Corporation of Huaxia. They take people into dungeons and help them speed-clear them. Our capitalists only know how to exploit us!”","Amid the wave of criticism, Huaxia had no time to respond at all.","They were far too busy—insanely busy!","Chu Fu and the others didn’t even have time to rest, let alone check the messages on the forums.","All Chu Fu had to do was open and close the Forest Spirit Passage.","By six o’clock the following morning, she had completed city-defense battles on a total of fifty-seven servers.","There had been no time to rest.","Every player in Huaxia had taken part in this grand campaign of early city-defense battles.","Forty million government personnel participated, but even more ordinary citizens had followed carefully planned leveling schedules. After all, every server needed one hundred thousand level-30 players.","The entire nation had mobilized.","Naturally, the rewards were astonishing.","Five hundred and seventy points to every stat.","Chu Fu looked at her Spirit stat.","She could now form contracts with another 114 contract plants.","Moreover, her prolonged use of the Forest Spirit Passage had deepened her understanding of the skill considerably.","After all, her class was also a divine-class profession. Like Xie Lin, she could create her own skills—or, more accurately, enhance the power of existing skills.","As she used it over and over, opening the Forest Spirit Passage became easier and easier.","This allowed more passages to be opened each time, increasing the speed at which players entered the dungeons.","However, Chu Fu didn’t compress the time. Instead, she chose to increase the number of participants.","For every additional Forest Spirit Passage, Chu Fu allowed another forty thousand people to enter the dungeon. As long as they could keep up, everyone was welcome.","This was truly a benefit for the entire nation.","On the second day, Chu Fu worked with the national team to complete sixty city-defense battles.","On the third day: sixty-one.","On the fourth day: fifty-eight.","On the fifth day: sixty-two.","In just five days, all her stats had increased by 2,980 points.","Whenever she had free time, Chu Fu could also log in ahead of schedule and unleash a wave of Cataclysm skills on the undead legion.","That way, she could also benefit from the ten all-stat points awarded for a perfect city-defense battle.","The increase in stats was simply too satisfying.","Even Chu Feng no longer wanted to visit high-level maps. He preferred to stay beside Chu Fu and farm stats with her.","Chu Fu knew that Chu Feng could also plunder monsters’ stats, but he couldn’t repeatedly plunder the same type of monster.","So she even gave her brother special treatment.","With Chu Fu’s current strength, she could already set foot on maps for levels 60 to 70. She personally entered one of them and released a Forest Spirit.","This allowed Chu Feng to farm stats just like Shen Chi. Each time he farmed stats, Chu Fu would take him along, and when it was over, he would return to the future map.","The rewards came quickly.","Chu Feng hunted an adult Green Dragon King and a Venom Dragon King, then handed the materials over to Zhimengzhe.","Zhimengzhe combined them with the diamond-grade equipment and materials that had dropped over the past few days, upgrading everything that could be upgraded.","In the end, she crafted the Verdant Venom Queen Set.","This time, Zhimengzhe had adopted the design concept of a Western court gown with an enormous train. The train alone was a full four meters long, mainly to accommodate the countless soul crystals condensed by the Lich King that were embedded across its surface. As it happened, the crystals were also green.","Each soul crystal was a diamond-grade material, roughly the size of a thumbnail. When embedded in a staff, it could increase mana and spell attack.","Now, all of them had been arranged and embedded into the outfit, elevating the main skirt to epic grade.","Zhimengzhe was still quite disappointed. After all, only the main skirt had reached epic grade, while the other pieces remained diamond grade.","“Guild Leader, the other pieces are still diamond grade, but their base stats should be equivalent to level-70 diamond equipment. Each piece provides 260 points of stats—one hundred more than level-20 diamond equipment. Please don’t look down on my craftsmanship!”","“Dreamweaver darling, how could I possibly look down on your craftsmanship? I love every outfit you’ve made for me.”","Chu Fu removed her bridal gown and changed into the Verdant Venom Queen Set.","The main skirt provided 300 points of stats. The other twelve pieces gave Chu Fu a total of 2,736 additional Spirit points. Her combined Vitality, Strength, and Agility also increased by roughly 700 points.","Chu Fu’s Spirit instantly broke through the ten-thousand mark.","At the same time, her entire presence seemed to change.","This outfit looked imposing, magnificent, and powerful.","If the bridal set had made her look like a pure-white flower, then the Verdant Venom Queen Set made her resemble a ferocious man-eating plant.","Now, whether as the Thorn Guild’s president or the lord of Thorn City, Chu Fu looked far more suited to wear such an outfit."]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254: Global City Defense, Asking for Help from China","paragraphs":["“Dreamweaver, you made the Bridal Gown Set. I don’t plan on putting this equipment in the guild warehouse. Do you want to keep it? After all, you made it yourself! You can display it in your shop!”","Zhimengzhe had also opened a shop in Thorn City. It was a high-end equipment store specializing in custom orders, and business was booming.","Equipment with identical attributes cost ten or even a hundred times more when commissioned from Zhimengzhe, yet players still flocked to her. It had become the first luxury shop in the game.","Naturally, Zhimengzhe nodded.","“Okay, okay, okay! Thank you, Guild Leader!”","Although she had made the outfit, the materials had been obtained by Chu Fu, so ownership naturally belonged to Chu Fu.","Given Chu Fu’s current status, the outfit had already made a dazzling appearance on countless occasions. It was practically a trademark. Displaying it in the shop would be extraordinarily meaningful.","“You’re only thanking Zhimengzhe? Aren’t you going to thank your brother?”","“Brother, Brother! Do you even need to ask? You’re the best brother in the whole world! Love you, bro!”","Chu Fu formed a heart with her fingers and sent it flying toward her brother.","A smile tugged at the corners of Chu Feng’s mouth as he watched Chu Fu act playfully. When she had put on the outfit just now, her mature and fierce aura had genuinely startled him.","For a moment, he had felt as though his little sister had become a stranger.","But now, his familiar little sister had returned.","The others smiled as well. Xie Lin watched from the side and made a gesture.","“The Bean Sprout has turned into a real queen. But doesn’t she seem to be missing something?”","“What’s missing?”","“A whip. Whip me mercilessly, Your Majesty!” Xie Lin joked.","Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate twisted her wrist. “The Queen of Plant Girl is still a queen. Come on, I’ll do it for her. I absolutely won’t go easy on you!”","Everyone burst into laughter.","After the joking ended, Chu Fu looked toward Shen Chi.","“Wheelchair Brother, how are things over at the Mechanical Star?”","It had already been five days, and Shen Chi had been ruthlessly milking the benefits for five straight days.","Before this, Chu Fu would never have considered entering an Origin-level dungeon.","But now, their strength had soared to a terrifying degree. Should they go this time?","Chu Fu said, “The Origin-level dungeon at Mechanical Star feels like another conspiracy aimed at us. There’s a good chance a divine envoy-level being will appear.","“A conspiracy represents danger, but it also represents resources.","“If we can defeat that divine envoy, it will be our third one, and we’ll obtain a third Divine God Fragment.","“But machines are ultimately level 60 in strength. Our attributes far exceed those of level 60 players, but I’m worried that we might encounter something beyond our control.”","“Plant Girl, with our current attributes, even if another divine envoy appears, we can easily chew through it,” Jiaojiao Isn’t Delicate said. “But if you think it’s too risky, then we won’t go!”","They trusted Chu Fu unconditionally.","Chu Fu was conflicted as well.","She wanted to enter after the city was built.","But she was also afraid that the Origin-level rift might disappear.","In the end, reason overcame greed.","Chu Fu said, “If they close it, then so be it! What we need to do now is fight the global city defense battle!”","She had made her decision.","They would focus on completing the upcoming city defense battle properly and avoid any unexpected incidents.","Everyone nodded.","Shen Chi said, “There’s no need to worry so much. Those machines seem to operate according to fixed procedures. I can alter some of their programs and infiltrate the area with disguised robots to record the coordinates.","“We can also send some plant sprites inside.","“Once we successfully defend the city, we’ll head there immediately.”","“Okay!” Chu Fu’s gaze grew even more resolute.","They had to play it safe—really play it safe!","They couldn’t afford to be distracted.","From then on, everyone focused entirely on protecting the city and preparing for the defense battle.","Ten days remained until the city defense battle.","At last, players from other countries began their city defense battles ahead of schedule.","It was not the powerful Beautiful Country, but the Bear Country.","After all, these people had fought the werewolf Tuge alongside China and had obtained an increase of 1,000 to all attributes, as well as a +1 level bonus.","That gave them an inherent advantage in level.","The city defense battle was fairly easy for them, and they even entered the Origin-level dungeon and successfully cleared it.","This put the other countries at ease.","If the Bear Country could do it, then their countries naturally could as well.","Most importantly, China had been constantly participating in city defense battles, leaving them with a surplus of equipment. They began selling it off in large quantities, quickly driving down the prices of level 30 Dark Gold- and Diamond-grade equipment.","After buying the equipment, the other countries felt that their strength had increased substantially and became confident that they could defend their cities as well.","At that moment, China unexpectedly released an announcement.","“To all players around the world:","“The city defense battle is imminent. Cities across the globe will soon be plunged into battles of defense, where danger and opportunity will coexist. Please do not attempt Origin-level dungeons blindly.","“If you require assistance, you may contact the official Chinese authorities. If we have sufficient manpower, we will help defend your cities.","“However, due to our limited numbers, priority will be given to countries friendly with China, as well as countries with smaller populations.","“Please send the coordinates of your city to this email address. We will assemble professional rescue teams for you on a first-come, first-served basis.”","As soon as the message was released, it caused an uproar around the world.","Before long, several small countries sent in their addresses.","Not only that, even though some major nations had no intention of requesting China’s assistance, their players independently sent their locations anyway.","This saved China the trouble of gathering the information itself.","A massive amount of data was soon compiled.","Before long, the server of the Beautiful Country also began its early city defense battle.","The large quantity of equipment Chu Fu and the others had sold had accelerated the leveling speed of players around the world.","The Beautiful Country did not request assistance from China.","Once the city defense battle began, the enhanced undead legion proved extremely difficult to deal with.","Still, they managed to hold off wave after wave.","“We can do this too! Should we try the Origin-level dungeon?”","“We have a million players. If China can do it, why can’t we?”","“Exactly! Let’s give it a try! I heard that clearing an Origin-level dungeon can improve your talent, and everyone gets the upgrade!”","All the players became excited.","Then, without anyone knowing who had started it, they began moving toward the Origin-level dungeon on their own.","Millions of players entered one after another.","However, even though there were quite a few SSS-rank talent holders among them, the Origin-level dungeon—strengthened after Wale’s death—was not something they could easily challenge.","Unprepared, the players rushed in one after another, only to die inside.","They wasted a full half hour without managing to clear the dungeon. Instead, countless undead surged out and swept toward them.","The players could only flee the rift in a panic, return to the city, and rely on the walls, arrow towers, and NPCs to fight.","“This is bad! The city—the city is under attack!”","“We can’t hold them off! Call for reinforcements!”","“Our group’s president is still inside the dungeon! Offering a bounty of one million gold coins! Please, someone get a priest to save him!”"]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255: Life-Saving Business: Refusing a Toast Only to Drink a Forfeit","paragraphs":["The Thorn Group’s Business Services Department occupied the former Wantou Properties building.","All the employees here belonged to the Thorn Guild’s outsourced team. They handled online public opinion, provided services for guild members, sold equipment, purchased materials, and dealt with various other matters.","At that moment, the department’s phone lines had been ringing off the hook.","Numerous companies from overseas—mostly from the United States—were calling in hopes that the Thorn Guild would sell its resurrection services and bring their people back to life.","They had never accepted this kind of business before.","But now, the requests were submitted one after another, and the final quoted price was three million gold coins.","The offer was simply too generous.","In the end, Feng Huimin decided to accept it.","It was hardly any trouble.","Using the same method as before, Shen Chi selected one of the coordinates provided by the players, then operated a mecha to teleport through space.","Thanks to the steady stream of machines being produced by the Origin-level instance dungeon, Mechanical Star, Shen Chi’s skills had continued to improve.","Before long, he had developed a mecha that everyone could use.","Its combat power was beside the point.","Its movement speed and ability to perform spatial jumps alone were enough to crush every mount in existence.","Now, any player could operate a mecha to travel around. It was no different from driving a car.","“Send two people,” Chu Fu said. “Have Suture Saint and Holy Healing Angel go together. Once they revive everyone, come straight back. Don’t waste time. And make sure they get overtime pay for the field assignment.”","Holy Healing Angel immediately beamed. “Thank you, boss!”","Suture Saint and Holy Healing Angel then climbed into the mecha.","For safety’s sake, Chu Fu also gave them a Plant Sprite.","The two entered the coordinates, and the mecha performed a spatial jump, arriving in a city in the United States.","The moment they entered the city, they saw architecture completely different from what they were used to. Not only that, but shouts of killing rang out everywhere.","Magic, artillery fire, and the deathly aura of the undead surged toward them.","The battle had actually reached the city itself.","An endless undead army had pressed against the city walls.","There were still four hours before the siege battle would end.","Time was tight, so Suture Saint did not stop. She picked a direction, and the mecha roared into the air.","The fifty-kilometer distance took only one minute to cover.","By then, the rift was still continuously spewing out monsters. The moment they entered it, they collided head-on with the creatures pouring through.","Suture Saint pressed the accelerator and drove straight ahead.","A group of undead bone dragons flew over, attempting to stop them.","“Holy Light Descends!”","Holy Healing Angel cast her skill. In an instant, it was as if sunlight had split open the clouds in the sky, sending golden radiance cascading down.","Every undead creature touched by the golden light melted away like snow beneath the spring breeze.","The radiance dispelled the darkness, killing every undead creature within a full kilometer.","It punched a massive hole through the dense formation of the undead army.","With Holy Healing Angel clearing the monsters beside her, Suture Saint stepped on the accelerator and forced her way into the rift.","There were even more undead inside.","Suture Saint drove against the current, quickly bursting out of the rift and entering the familiar Land of Death.","After more than ten days of fighting, Suture Saint had entered the Land of Death so many times that she was more familiar with it than the route between her own front door and the street.","She knew it like the back of her hand.","In the distance, great numbers of necromancers and Lich Kings—more than ten thousand Origin-level bosses—were summoning countless undead cannon fodder to attack the city.","That was right. In the eyes of other countries, this was the most powerful segment of the undead army.","In Suture Saint’s eyes, however, they were nothing more than cannon fodder.","Suture Saint opened the mecha hatch, and she and Holy Healing Angel flew out together and began attacking.","At that moment, more than a hundred thousand players lay sprawled across the ground.","Among them was Duke Morgan, chairman of the largest financial power in Freedom City, Morgan Gold Bank.","His subordinate had already called to tell him that they had contacted the Thorn Guild and that the other side was willing to send people over.","But as he watched the endless undead army and the sight of monsters identical to those in the Wale instance dungeon—only tens of thousands of times more numerous—he still felt utterly hopeless.","If they had come during a lull in the siege, there might have been hope of rescuing them without alerting the monsters.","But now they had to confront the undead head-on.","Unless the entire Thorn Group came, there was no way they could pull it off.","Just as he was thinking this, he suddenly felt light.","A blazing sun exploded in the sky. Its radiance split open the gloom of the Land of Death, and beneath that blinding light, the terrifying bosses in Duke Morgan’s eyes screamed as more than half their health vanished.","Then it began to rain.","On closer inspection, however, those were not raindrops.","They were steel needles.","The needles moved with incredible speed, tearing through the void and creating spatial slashes as they killed every monster in their path.","A short while later, not a single undead creature remained on the battlefield.","Duke Morgan had an excellent vantage point, allowing him to see the two women clearly.","One was a young girl dressed in an ice-blue mage robe. The other wore a black-and-gray mage robe, with countless arms extending from her back.","Then he heard the woman with the countless arms speak.","“They’ve been trampled into minced meat. Only their heads are left. I’ll sweep them over for you—then you can revive them.”","The countless silver needles rose into the air, skewering the heads one after another and stringing them together.","Holy Healing Angel used her resurrection spell, bringing all the bodies back to life.","The two worked together with astonishing speed. In just ten minutes, they had revived everyone.","After reviving Duke Morgan, the two women naturally turned their attention to him.","“The chairman of Morgan Gold Bank,” Suture Saint said. “Your subordinate offered three million gold coins to have us come and revive you. The resurrection is complete, so pay the remaining balance.”","Duke Morgan knew that his subordinate had offered such an exorbitant sum, but he had assumed that no one from the Thorn Guild would actually come.","He had never expected them to truly show up. Now that it was time to pay, he felt an intense stab of pain.","He could not help saying, “Three million just to revive us? You should at least have to clear the dungeon first!”","Suture Saint’s eyes narrowed.","“You don’t want to pay?”","“No, no, no,” Duke Morgan hurriedly said. “I just feel that the price isn’t worth it. Look, this was easy for you. I remember that where you’re from, resurrection only costs a hundred silver coins.”","Suture Saint was so furious that she laughed.","She suddenly remembered how, when she had worked part-time in the past, employers would see that you were working too easily and then decide they did not want to pay your full wages, claiming that the money was not worth it.","Suture Saint raised a hand.","It began to rain.","Countless silver needles drifted down from the sky, falling onto the heads of the players below.","In an instant, Suture Saint’s Masquerader Mask advanced all the way to Diamond grade.","“From now on, each person gets revived individually. Pay, and then leave. I won’t overcharge you. One thousand gold coins per person. As for you—three million. Not a single coin less.”","He had refused a toast only to be forced to drink a forfeit!","All the players cursed Duke Morgan inwardly. Three million could have been pooled together easily. But now things had become much worse!","More than a hundred thousand players would have to gather one hundred million gold coins for Suture Saint?","The president of the Jack Group hurriedly shouted, “Lady Saint, please don’t be angry! I’m sure Duke Morgan didn’t mean it. He simply wants to clear the Origin-level instance dungeon too badly.","“How about this? We’ll pay you extra to take us through the Origin-level instance dungeon. Name your price.”"]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256: Day 100 of the Game's Launch, the Global City Defense War Is About to Begin","paragraphs":["What had originally been a cooperative arrangement had now turned into a business transaction.","The Suture Saint was not one to be polite about money.","“At the going market rate, one point in all attributes is worth 100 gold coins. Ten attribute points would be 1,000 gold coins. Since there are so many of you, I’ll charge a flat rate of 100 million gold. Do you agree?”","“Oh, and that includes the resurrection fee. Two hundred million gold coins. If you agree, pay immediately. If not, I’m leaving.”","“And don’t waste time. You don’t seriously think this place is safe, do you? The lich here is dead, but the liches and undead legions in the other rifts are still alive. For all you know, the divine envoys in the central region could be sending bone dragons over. You have ten minutes to decide. Once the time is up, I’m gone!”","The Suture Saint made her ultimatum.","Jack sent Duke Morgan a private message.","“Let’s have the guilds pool their money and clear this Origin-tier dungeon. The undead are all carrying level-30 Dark Gold equipment, and the bosses can drop diamonds. We won’t be losing money.","“Besides, what if we improve our talents? Even improving a talent just once would be more profitable than grinding contribution points.”","Duke Morgan agreed that it made sense. He then said, “We can’t be the only ones paying. Every player has to contribute.”","“Is this really the time to argue about that? She’s only giving us ten minutes.”","“Fine!”","The veteran guilds were indeed wealthy. The five major guilds pooled their resources and eventually scraped together 200.03 million gold coins, which they handed over to the Suture Saint.","Only then did the Suture Saint revive them. This time, she did not use the Holy Healing Angel. When the Holy Healing Angel had resurrected them the first time, their flesh and blood had already been completely restored.","The Suture Saint’s skill was quite impressive. It left only small wounds, killed people quickly, and made resurrection relatively painless.","Afterward, the Suture Saint took the Holy Healing Angel with her and piloted her mecha. In less than a minute, they reached the central region.","The enemy they encountered was a headless knight divine envoy.","Of course, as divine envoys went, an unnamed one was nothing to fear. It was only level 30, though it did possess a World Boss template.","The Suture Saint and the Holy Healing Angel launched a relentless barrage of attacks. It took only thirty-three seconds to kill the boss.","The Suture Saint also cleared out the bosses in the other areas while she was at it.","Then she took out a vacuum cleaner and began sucking up the equipment.","Shen Chi was a mechanic, and machinery existed to serve people.","At first, mechanical wings had become popular among the masses. Later came mechas. Now even vacuum cleaners were beginning to see widespread civilian use.","The thing really was convenient.","The Suture Saint sucked up everything.","The dungeon was over. The two of them piloted their mecha out of the Origin-tier dungeon from the location of the final wave of monsters—the western part of the city.","They then used the mecha’s spatial-jump function to return to Thorn City.","When the others heard that the Suture Saint had raked in 200 million gold coins, they were stunned.","“We thought 3 million gold coins was already a lot. You two really know how to make money!”","The Suture Saint said, “That only proves they’re wealthy. The gold has already been handed over to the guild. Remember to give us our bonus.”","This mission had originally been accepted by the guild. If Chu Fu had not sent the two of them, she could just as easily have sent Little Sister Wu or Dr. Chen, the orthopedics director.","Still, the two of them had been sent out on field duty, so they were entitled to a 5% bonus!","Two hundred million gold coins had netted them 10 million directly.","The Suture Saint did not care much. After all, she owned shares in the guild. Now that there were 1,000 Origin-tier dungeons, and each one provided the guild with a 50% share of the profits, she could receive dividends from those earnings as well. She had long since achieved absolute financial freedom.","The Holy Healing Angel, on the other hand, was a worker who had abandoned the darkness for the light. Receiving 10 million gold coins was practically a fortune to her.","No one paid much attention to the money. After all, they all knew that one day, when the game descended upon reality, the thing that would give them a sense of security would never be real-world currency or in-game gold.","It would be their own strength.","...","Meanwhile, after being resurrected, Jack and Duke Morgan discovered that the dungeon had ended. Naturally unwilling to give up, they hurried into the dungeon to search for equipment, only to find that not a single item had been left behind.","“Are their spatial bags really that huge? They took everything? They even took the corpses?”","“Fuck! Dismantle this place. Take everything that can be carried. We’ll recover whatever we can.”","They began moving things out piece by piece.","Unfortunately, these people had far too little experience with Origin-tier dungeons.","They had entered the dungeon only after the ninth wave of monsters had died.","Then they had fought to hold the line, died, and finally found the Thorn Guild.","By the time the Suture Saint arrived, five hours had already passed.","Only two hours remained, and those two hours slipped away unnoticed while they were busy looting.","These people knew too little about Origin-tier dungeons. They assumed that once the dungeon timer ran out and the spatial rift closed, they would still be able to use a Return Scroll to go back.","They had no idea that once the rift closed, they would be trapped there permanently and hunted by every undead creature in the dungeon.","Logging out was impossible as well.","If they logged out, they would be unable to log back in, because the server for the Origin-tier dungeon—the plane itself—was not located on the side of the Primordial Gate. A connection could be established only while the rift was open.","As time passed, the deadline finally arrived.","The rift closed completely.","The players were trapped inside the dungeon, unable to escape.","Fortunately, the siege of Freedom City had ultimately been successfully defended. At least no city had been lost.","Otherwise, when the game invaded reality, the United States would have been overrun by monsters, and countless American civilians would have been forced from their homes.","As for the players who had died in the dungeon, they naturally began making a fuss as well.","“Boycott the Thorn Guild for making outrageous demands and concealing information, causing one hundred thousand players to be stranded in an Origin-tier dungeon!”","“You’re the ones who were insatiably greedy! They had already cleared the dungeon and left, but you stayed behind to loot it!”","“Do you know that Gao Qiang used to protect the people of China—not you? Otherwise, we could have drowned you in spit with a single mouthful! How dare you still make a scene?”","“The Thorn Guild went out of its way to save you, and you still bit them in return. You’re nothing but rabid dogs.”","“Ban all further cooperation with the United States!”","At the same time, Feng Huimin posted three messages in succession.","[The Truth Behind the Freedom City Origin-tier Dungeon]","[Specific Requirements for Requests for Assistance in Clearing Origin-tier Dungeons: Full Payment Must Be Made in Advance. The Thorn Guild Guarantees a 100% Dungeon Clear Rate.]","[Statement from Thorn Group Refusing Cooperation with All Guilds in the United States]","A guild from a game actually dared to challenge an entire country?","Although the Thorn Guild’s statement was directed only at guilds within the United States, those guilds were effectively controlled by financial conglomerates.","It was much like the four major corporations of Linjiang City before this—they dominated their server.","And now, they had finally encountered someone capable of imposing sanctions on them.","Moreover, after the statement was released, it did not make players from other countries hate the Thorn Guild. Instead, even more people sought to cooperate with them.","Everyone had realized that without cooperation, no one could obtain the divine power to improve their attributes and talents.","As a result, requests for cooperation came pouring in like snowflakes.","Time continued to pass.","Only two days remained before the full-scale siege battles began!","All of China’s servers had already completed their defensive battles.","Chu Fu had begun making arrangements for the sieges in other countries. If they could take a little more, they would take a little more.","One day left on the countdown!","The countdown reaches zero!"]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257: The Roar of the Undead Reaper, Summoning New Apostles","paragraphs":["The system announcement echoed across the entire world.","[System Announcement: The Undead Reaper has dispatched an army of undead, launching an all-out war to annihilate humanity’s cities!]","[System Announcement: The current number of servers that have fully initiated the City Defense War is 8,838.]","[System Announcement: As of today, all beginner villages have been opened. From now on, players who die or newly register may only create characters and log in through existing servers, joining the battle against the monster invasion.]","[System Announcement: Since the City Defense War is taking place worldwide at the same time, a global ranking has been added. The top ten players on the ranking will receive Divine Power Fragments belonging to themselves.]","Divine Power Fragments for the global top ten?","Although no one knew what they were for, they clearly seemed extraordinary.","Only those who had killed Werewolf Tuge and ranked highly in contribution knew just how precious these things were.","They were the foundation for becoming a pseudo-god.","They were far too important.","What were they waiting for?","“The situation differs from our original plan. We’ll adjust it immediately!” Feng Huimin said at once.","They had anticipated that the City Defense War would take place on the same day.","What they had not anticipated was that the Primordial Gate could also reward Divine Power Fragments.","Still, the changes to their plan were not substantial.","Feng Huimin quickly selected nine people from among them whom she believed had the potential to become gods.","As for why there were nine, it was naturally because Chu Feng would also be competing. He wanted to farm contribution points, and the members of the Thorn Guild might not be able to outcompete him.","Feng Huimin quickly settled on the remaining nine.","Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao, Suture Saint, and Shafu Liangu.","Bitter Melon King, Dream King, and Holy Healing Angel.","They could farm monsters in groups, possessed the highest attributes, and had the strongest combat power.","Although Holy Healing Angel was a priest, with the rise of second talents and second classes, she had become a Light Forbidden Curse Mage and had tremendous potential.","Several of them had originally been assigned to lead teams in supporting weaker cities.","Now, they were simply freed from those duties and allowed to farm monsters independently, competing for the top ten positions.","“All other plans remain unchanged. Players who still want additional attribute points should wait for the Guild Leader to issue an announcement within one minute. The Thorn Passage will be opened for three minutes. After clearing the dungeon, exit on your own and repeat the process.”","“Yes!”","Everyone shouted in perfect unison.","Immediately afterward, the five teleportation arrays within Thorn City erupted with countless beams of white light.","Chu Fu also began to act.","She had been assigned several smaller cities as well.","Her first destination was Icefield City.","Located near the pole, the city had only ten thousand players. There was no way they could defend Icefield City on their own.","At that moment, the players in Icefield City stood atop the city wall, their faces as pale as the surrounding snow.","“There are only so many of us. Can we really hold the city?”","“We already submitted a request for assistance. Why haven’t the people from the Thorn Group arrived yet?”","Just as they were thinking this, the teleportation array erupted with white light.","“They’re here! They’re here!”","“Huh? Why is there only one person?”","“My God! It’s Plant Human! One person should be enough, right?”","There was only one thought in everyone’s mind.","Chu Fu stood where she was without even taking a step.","Because of its small population, Icefield City was only slightly larger than an ordinary village.","Chu Fu raised her staff. Immediately, a dense black poison spewed from it and surged into the sky, forming a colossal mass resembling a dark cloud.","Then the energy continued to churn and spread, until the entire small city seemed to have been covered by a gigantic black bowl.","This did not look like a city defense battle.","It looked more like the destruction of a city.","Most importantly, Chu Fu vanished from the teleportation array in an instant.","She had left.","Yet the black protective barrier she had created did not disappear.","“What... what is this? Why did she leave just like that? Doesn’t she think that a single barrier will be enough to defend the city?”","The players in the small city were extremely uneasy. Even though Chu Fu was famous, they did not completely trust her.","But when the monsters truly arrived an hour later, every monster that approached the black mist died instantly.","Whether they flew through the sky or crawled across the ground, every direction was protected without a single blind spot. Not one monster was allowed to enter.","And Chu Fu was still creating more barriers like this.","In one breath, she created ten.","Her contribution points soared wildly.","Shen Chi followed closely behind.","After all, he currently had an army of two hundred thousand mechs.","Shen Chi had been assigned one thousand cities to defend. He sent two hundred mechs to each city and left them to defend on their own.","The other players competing for the top ten had also been assigned different areas by Feng Huimin.","As for how many contribution points they could farm in the end, that would depend entirely on their own abilities.","Chu Fu constantly traveled through the arrays, unleashing her skills and enveloping all the monsters assigned to her outside the protective barriers formed by Soul-Annihilating Calamity.","Her overwhelming power resulted in instant kills and total domination without question.","Not a single player inside the cities suffered even the slightest injury.","Although two hundred mechs were numerous, players still competed with Shen Chi for monsters.","The mechs’ intelligence was still somewhat lacking. Their movements were rigid and methodical, so their efficiency was naturally inferior to Chu Fu’s comprehensive isolation and annihilation.","Chu Fu’s skills had also activated the power of calamity, producing astonishing results.","Basically, every city she passed through was completely sealed off. No one else needed to lift a finger.","Feng Huimin assigned each of them 880 cities. Some had larger populations, while others had smaller ones. This was done to make it easier for them to compete for contribution points without interfering with one another.","Of course, how many cities they could actually secure depended on their own abilities.","If a city had a large number of players and its contribution points were difficult to seize, they would enter a spatial rift after the first wave and clear a Primordial-level dungeon.","At a time like this, Chu Fu no longer cared about anyone else’s life or death.","They had to secure the rewards firmly in their own hands.","...","At the same time,","in a higher-dimensional plane,","the Undead Reaper returned once more.","Not only him—even the other gods began returning.","Then the Undead Reaper let out an angry roar.","“What happened? Where is the divine power I invested? How did I lose so much?”","During the wager, every god had placed divine power on the table as their stake.","The Primordial-level dungeon was the battlefield where divine power was hunted.","When a Primordial-level dungeon was cleared, divine power was plundered, and the divine power the Undead Reaper had previously wagered there would disappear.","Now, a full tenth of it had vanished.","More importantly, since he had lost, someone else had naturally won. This would affect the entire game.","He looked toward the Mechanical God.","“You’ve been here the whole time. Didn’t you notice anything strange?”","The Mechanical God’s metallic voice remained completely emotionless.","“Without access to your rifts, I can’t observe anything. How would I know?”","In truth, the Mechanical God had noticed Shen Chi’s strange actions, as well as the fact that Shen Chi’s strength was increasing.","But this was not a bad thing for him.","An increase in strength meant that Shen Chi would become more confident and would be more likely to enter the rifts.","The conspiracy targeting them would then be triggered.","When that happened, the one who emerged victorious would be him. As for whether the Undead Reaper suffered losses, what did that have to do with him, the Mechanical God?","The Undead Reaper, meanwhile, felt more and more that something was wrong.","Every city was resisting the undead army. None of them had been annihilated as he had expected.","Instead, countless troops were being wiped out.","All the players from the Flower Country had finished the city-defense battles ahead of schedule, becoming a freely deployable force that could support armies anywhere at any time.","They had already been assigned to reinforce various regions.","Not to mention members of the Thorn Guild like Chu Fu—each one of them could defend an entire city alone.","At this rate, they probably wouldn’t be able to capture even a single city in the defense campaign.","Worst of all, if another Origin-level dungeon were breached, he would suffer a devastating loss.","“No, this won’t do. I need to condense divine power and summon new apostles!”"]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258: The Gambler Who Lost His Mind, the Second Apostle Sun Jingya","paragraphs":["The other evil gods had also arrived, but they all frowned deeply.","At that moment, the Undead Reaper looked like a gambler who had lost everything and was preparing to make one final, desperate wager.","This was a game of chess. Humanity had built up far too great an advantage in the early stages, making it increasingly difficult for the evil gods who appeared later to turn the tide.","Yet anyone could see it.","If things continued this way, the advantage humanity had built would become unimaginably overwhelming.","“You’d better think this through. If you lose this time, you may very well exhaust your divine power—or even expose your trail.","“On top of that, you might end up giving the other side another fragment of divine power for free.”","The God of Death’s gaze was vicious.","“There’s no other choice!”","If only he had kept an eye on this place from the beginning. Who could have imagined that the “God-Making Project,” which had failed in the first two rounds, would actually succeed in the hands of Long Zhantian?","He had arrived too late.","Still, 90% of his divine power remained. If he had infused it into a new divine emissary earlier, he might have stopped the enemy long ago.","However, activating the rules when there was no siege battle required him to pay a much higher price.","Perhaps this was simply that damnable thing called fate.","The Undead Reaper stopped dwelling on it and immediately activated the hidden move he had planted inside the Primordial Gate.","A supervirus that had been cultivated long ago.","...","Outside War-Soul City.","Inside a mine, Sun Jingya was digging when she suddenly sensed an incomparably familiar call.","“My devout follower, from this day onward, you will become a divine apostle and gain unparalleled power. Go forth. Return to the embrace of the Reaper, listen to the Reaper’s will, and kill those humans who show disrespect toward death.”","Boom!","In an instant, Sun Jingya felt it.","Countless necromancers, Lich Kings, and divine emissaries from the army of the dead turned to ash and merged into her body.","She absorbed an endless amount of deathly power, and terrifying black light erupted from her entire body.","Her health rose from several hundred to several hundred billion.","And it continued to increase.","In an instant, she comprehended countless skills.","She had become terrifyingly powerful.","A line of dark-red writing appeared before her eyes.","[Kill WhoWantsToBeAVegetable. Annihilate everyone in the Thorny Rose Guild.]","Sun Jingya’s entire body trembled.","She was both excited and afraid.","“God of the Undead, thank you. Thank you for giving me this power. But my body is still in prison. They’ll make me log out.”","The red letters appeared once again.","[Don’t worry. You will not die. In truth, death is your power!]","Sun Jingya only saw the first part of the message, and her heart immediately settled.","She understood. Since she had been summoned by the evil god, she would not die.","Moreover, she was now level 80.","As for those people from WhoWantsToBeAVegetable’s group—WhoWantsToBeAVegetable was only level 54 on the rankings, while Lu Xing was level 60.","Neither of them was any match for her.","And since she had reached such a high level, why shouldn’t she withdraw her power?","She immediately chose to cash out. Since she had joined the evil god’s faction, the power she withdrew did not come from the Primordial Gate.","The crimson letters appeared:","[Withdrawal successful.]","This meant that she possessed terrifying power in the real world as well.","Once she completed the evil god’s mission, she would immediately escape the game and break out of prison.","Sun Jingya no longer hesitated. With a casual gesture, she summoned a skeletal warhorse.","As a divine apostle, she also possessed her own class. She was now an undead knight.","With another wave of her hand, countless bones appeared and enveloped her entire body. A long bone spear materialized in her grasp.","As a top heiress from a wealthy family, she had been riding horses since childhood, so she handled the mount with exceptional skill.","She galloped wildly through the mine. Everywhere she passed, players were killed by the aura of death.","After leaving the mine, her body grew larger and larger.","She transformed into a twenty-meter-tall giant.","She happened to pass by War-Soul City.","Since she was already here, she might as well finish what she had started.","Those people had once treated her like an ant, crushing her casually and repeatedly tormenting her. They had even used her as one of the many heads displayed on the masks of their impersonators.","Now, it was her turn to strike back!","The skeletal warhorse suddenly leaped, clearing the walls of War-Soul City in a single bound.","“Enemy attack!”","The NPCs of War-Soul City roared in alarm.","Only novice players remained in the city. The high-level players had all gone to support other locations. When they saw the terrifying, twenty-meter-tall monster, they immediately screamed.","At the same time, Laoji Fuli and Li Weizheng both received a system notification.","[System Notification: The War-Soul City under your management is under attack by an undead divine emissary. Return immediately.]","“What happened?”","The two men had no time to think. They abandoned their support of the other cities and crushed their Return Scrolls.","The players of the War-Soul Guild also all returned.","Then they saw the terrifying undead knight.","[Undead Apostle: Sun Jingya 014729","Level: 80","Health: 876 billion]","Wale only had 100 billion soul power.","That was eight times less than hers.","And what was with that name?","By now, however, they had gained a thorough understanding of the game.","Li Weizheng quickly realized that Sun Jingya had probably done what those players who joined the werewolf faction had done. She had joined the faction of the Undead Reaper and finally betrayed them at this crucial moment, gaining power in order to wreak havoc.","This was the Undead Reaper’s method.","But they had certainly never expected that she was a player.","And not just any player—a criminal.","Moreover, she was an enemy of Chu Fu.","Li Weizheng immediately made a phone call.","“Wang Lifeng, the Sun Jingya I asked you to watch over has sided with an evil god in the game. She’s destroying War-Soul City right now. Find her immediately and execute her!”","“What? Yes, Major Li! I’m on my way.”","Wang Lifeng was the officer supervising Sun Jingya.","He never would have imagined that such a major incident would occur right under his nose.","Sun Jingya had not only become a terrifying divine emissary—she had even gone on to attack War-Soul City.","She deserved to die.","He immediately logged out. As soon as the game pod opened, his body burst forth with astonishing speed, and he arrived at Sun Jingya’s location.","She and many other criminals were lying on small beds in the workshop, wearing helmets and immersed in the game.","Wang Lifeng said nothing. An iron chain appeared in his hand.","One end of the chain resembled a spiked mace, a metal ball covered in sharp spikes. The other end was shaped like a spear.","Class: Warden!","Gripping the special weapon, he showed no hesitation and thrust the spear straight toward Sun Jingya’s heart.","In an instant, a splash of scarlet blood erupted.","Sun Jingya did not even make a sound.","Instead, blackness began spreading across her entire body.","She had withdrawn her power as well.","Wang Lifeng’s expression changed drastically. If Sun Jingya had also brought the power from the game into the real world, then who could stop her?","Most importantly, with attributes that terrifying, she might be capable of destroying their entire city.","They absolutely could not let her succeed.","Wang Lifeng hardened his resolve. He switched the weapon to a massive blade and brought it down viciously toward Sun Jingya’s neck.","Slash!","Her head, along with the game helmet, fell to the ground."]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259: The Headless Knight Sun Jingya: The Battle of Vengeance Between the Avenger and the Murderer","paragraphs":["Th-That’s it? It was that simple?","The corpse that had been emitting black smoke seemed to have lost its eerie quality and returned to normal.","The light on the gaming helmet, which indicated that its wearer was still in the game, also dimmed.","Wang Lifeng called Li Weizheng.","Apparently still uneasy, he immediately summoned a fire mage to dispose of Sun Jingya’s corpse in an environmentally safe manner.","Before long, the corpse that represented the Evil God’s Apostle had been reduced to ashes.","Only the gaming helmet remained intact. After a quick wipe, it could still be used.","Once everything was taken care of, Wang Lifeng called Li Weizheng.","“Major Li, I’ve executed Sun Jingya. How are things on your end? Has she logged off?”","Li Weizheng was lying on the ground. His vision had turned black and white, and his character had already died.","Not only that, he had actually been controlled in reverse and turned into a member of the undead army.","Fortunately, his soul remained conscious, so he could still make calls and send private messages.","Before him stood a terrifying, towering figure, roaring again and again.","“My head! How dare you cut off my head!”","“My head is actually moving on its own?”","“Well, this isn’t bad either. Not bad at all.”","Sun Jingya had become a headless knight.","Earlier, while Li Weizheng had been fighting her, he had personally witnessed her head falling off.","He had no idea what had happened, but it was probably Wang Lifeng’s doing.","Wang Lifeng had killed Sun Jingya in the real world.","However, because Sun Jingya had been infused with too much divine power by the Undead Divine Envoy, she had completely mutated within the game.","She was no longer a player.","Instead, she had truly become a BOSS within the game—","the Evil God’s Apostle.","What was more, her separated head and body had actually become two separate BOSSes.","One was a flying head with 300 billion HP.","The other was a headless knight riding a skeletal warhorse, with 800 billion HP.","Compared with before, her strength had increased even further.","“I understand. You’ve done well. Log in now and wait for further orders. Whatever you do, don’t return to Junhun City.”","Wang Lifeng froze.","That sentence sounded strange. If the matter had been resolved, why add the warning not to return to Junhun City?","Something must have happened that they couldn’t deal with.","Wang Lifeng had no time to think it over. He immediately returned to his office and logged into the game.","At that moment, reports were flooding through the guild channel.","That was only possible because the Junhun Guild had such strict discipline. In any other guild, the channel would have been buried under a dense wall of text.","Based on the reports, Wang Lifeng quickly learned what had happened.","Sun Jingya wasn’t dead after all.","She had mutated.","What should they do now?","All the players who had returned to reinforce Junhun City had been controlled and turned into members of the undead army.","Leading them, Sun Jingya had fought her way to the city lord’s residence in Junhun City and was currently destroying the city crystal.","Once the crystal was destroyed, both the guild and the city would disappear.","That would be an unbearable loss for Junhun.","Li Weizheng could do nothing but anxiously await reinforcements.","Especially Chu Fu.","“Sun Jingya’s body has already died, but her head and body have transformed into two separate BOSSes.","“The most terrifying part is that anyone killed by her can’t be revived. Even revival scrolls are useless.","“So bringing more people won’t help. They might simply end up under her control.","“If you get controlled too, I’m afraid we’ll all be finished!","“So get ready before coming over!”","“Understood!”","Chu Fu wasn’t surprised when she heard the news.","In the original storyline, Sun Jingya had indeed become a powerful undead knight.","It was just that she shouldn’t have appeared this early.","But thinking about it carefully, because of the “God-Making Project,” Chu Feng was already level 60.","Everyone’s strength had increased, and the resulting butterfly effect had caused a villain who shouldn’t have appeared yet to make an early entrance.","As for what they were supposed to do about Sun Jingya’s overwhelming strength?","Having one more Sun Jingya would merely delay the undead army’s destruction.","Sun Jingya would never amount to anything.","Furthermore, her appearance would only allow everyone to take their revenge once and for all, bringing an end to the grudges between Chu Feng, Chu Fu, Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and the four major corporations.","Even so, Chu Fu respected Sun Jingya as an opponent.","“Everyone else, continue with your own battles. We’ll handle this one ourselves.”","Only four of them went.","There was no need for more.","If too many people came and died, they would simply become part of the enemy’s summoned army.","“I’m going too. I’m an MT, after all! There’s no way she can kill me instantly!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao shouted.","Naturally, she didn’t want to watch her friends risk their lives while she stayed behind.","But Chu Fu shook her head.","If Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao went, Suture Saint would certainly come as well.","Then would the others stay behind?","More and more people would keep joining them.","It was better for no one else to come.","“Don’t worry. We won’t fail.”","Suture Saint said, “If you really do fail, it won’t be long before the rest of us are wiped out too.”","They were genuinely frightened.","However, after improving for so many days, they had no idea how strong Chu Fu and the others had become.","Perhaps this was exactly the moment to put their strength to the test.","The four of them teleported to Junhun City.","By then, Junhun City was in complete ruins, looking like a wasteland. In the distance, they could see Sun Jingya’s enormous figure.","Chu Fu opened her Spirit Plant Pouch.","Countless plants were summoned around her.","In an instant, the area surrounding her transformed into a dense botanical garden.","There were all kinds of plants—hundreds, even thousands of them.","Fusion!","The next moment, Chu Fu transformed into a gigantic plant creature.","Transform again!","[Hulk]","Her body became incredibly tough.","She stood a full fifty meters tall, roughly the same height as Sun Jingya atop her warhorse.","At the same time, Shen Chi recalled all of his mechs.","They might not have any more players to help them.","But they had countless mechs.","A full hundred thousand of them.","Shen Chi looked at the vicious head flying through the sky. It reminded him of that desperate night, when Sun Jingya had been just as arrogant and unrestrained.","“Die!”","Shen Chi let out a furious roar.","Countless mechs charged forward and attached themselves to Sun Jingya’s body.","Then the mechs began to transform, forming a gigantic iron sphere that pressed down on her with tremendous force.","The headless knight was trapped beneath it. Her bones creaked under the pressure, while the health bar above her head rapidly fell.","0.1% per second.","Don’t think that was a small amount.","On the contrary, it represented 800 million damage every second.","At that rate, Sun Jingya could be killed in 1,000 seconds.","“What are you doing to my body? Do you think this can kill me? Hahaha! How ridiculous!”","“You’re nothing but a bunch of filthy peasants, yet you dare provoke me and even try to bankrupt my family!”","“Didn’t I give you money? What more do you want? A bunch of poor wretches should know their place and stay beneath our feet!”","“Who told you to resist? Who told you to resist?!”","Sun Jingya’s enormous head roared furiously. Green flames blazed in her eyes as she aimed at the iron sphere.","With a boom, flames engulfed the sphere.","In an instant, it melted into molten iron, revealing the body of Sun Jingya’s headless knight.","Sun Jingya’s head then turned toward Shen Chi’s mechs.","Those ghostly flames seemed to have a special ability to counter metal.","But in the next moment, an incredibly thick black vine shot toward her.","“Sun Jingya! I’m your opponent!”","Chu Fu’s hands transformed into enormous vines that viciously pierced through Sun Jingya’s head."]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260: Sun Jingya Dies, the Undead Legion Suffers a Backlash","paragraphs":["Sun Jingya’s eyes turned toward Chu Fu.","This was the first time the two of them had formally met.","Ever since the car accident, Chu Fu had remained in a vegetative state, so the two had never actually seen one another.","Now, at their first meeting, neither of them looked anything like their original selves.","One had become a headless knight with a gigantic head.","The other was a Hulk-like giant, a plant-like being who had once been in a vegetative state.","But there was no doubt that both of them were looking at each other with undisguised disgust and hatred, wishing nothing more than to kill the other.","Green flames erupted from Sun Jingya’s eyes, burning Chu Fu’s vine-like arms.","At that moment, a figure appeared behind Sun Jingya’s head.","The phantom was a full twenty meters tall. Cloaked from head to toe, it drove a dagger into the back of her skull.","It was a textbook assassin’s backstab.","Chu Feng had activated his God of Slaughter mode.","His phantom body grew larger, and his attack power surged.","The phantom looked like the Grim Reaper himself, truly harvesting death.","A massive damage number immediately appeared above Sun Jingya’s head.","Her health plummeted by 1%.","One slash dealt three billion damage.","At the same time, Shen Chi and Xie Lin continued attacking the Headless Knight.","Shen Chi’s mech was colossal. Even when it collided head-on with the Headless Knight, it did not lose out in the slightest. The mech remained completely steady, with astonishingly high defensive values.","Meanwhile, Xie Lin stood in midair and transformed into Sword God mode.","All the diamond-grade swords fused together.","Myriad Swords Return to One!","Every diamond-grade sword now possessed the power of an epic-grade sword.","With a single sweeping slash, he actually severed all four of the Headless Knight’s legs.","The Headless Knight was like an enormous BOSS. Its attributes were so powerful that it was almost immune to crowd-control effects such as stuns.","Yet having all four legs cut off in an instant caused it to collapse to the ground, leaving it temporarily paralyzed.","The Headless Knight quickly summoned new bones to replace its legs, but it still remained unable to move for more than ten seconds.","Shen Chi unleashed a barrage of attacks beside it, blasting away a full 5% of its health.","As for the players controlled by Sun Jingya, they had already been crushed to death during the battle.","In the end, even their bones were turned into horse legs.","In the eyes of Chu Fu and the others, these players were nothing more than minions. One ultimate ability was enough to wipe them all out.","The battle between Sun Jingya, Chu Fu, and the others was the true BOSS fight.","Its might shook the heavens.","For a time, the entire Soul of War City was destroyed. Buildings collapsed, and the rubble was subsequently reduced to dust.","Chu Fu’s poison wrapped around Sun Jingya’s head, eroding her soul.","There were no flashy tricks.","It was simply a forceful battle.","Originally, it had taken more than a million people to fight the Werewolf Tuge.","Now, four people were battling the even stronger Undead Apostle Sun Jingya.","What was more, the four of them were suppressing her.","“No! How is this possible? With power as great as mine, how can you possibly—why?!” Sun Jingya roared as her head and body began moving toward one another, attempting to reunite.","“Don’t let her put herself back together.”","Although they did not know what would happen once she reunited with her body, Chu Fu knew that if Sun Jingya wanted to do it, then stopping her was unquestionably the right choice.","Chu Fu used Charm, forcing Sun Jingya’s head to turn away.","Shen Chi drove his mech forward and slammed the Headless Knight violently into the distance.","Soon, the health of Sun Jingya’s head was depleted.","The head returned to its normal size and fell to the ground. Sun Jingya died with her eyes open in disbelief.","As for the remaining Headless Knight, it was even stronger, but seemed to possess little intelligence. After Chu Fu cast Charm, it focused solely on attacking her.","That gave everyone else an opportunity to deal damage.","“What a great chance!”","Chu Fu had already set her sights on the divine envoy’s attribute-point reward.","The situation was under control!","Time to start harvesting rewards!","Chu Fu immediately opened the Forest Spirit Passage in Thorn City.","[Thorn City Lord Announcement]: “All city players, return to the city and enter the passage.”","She then sent a private message to Long Zhantian.","The players participating in the “God-Making Project” were currently scattered across various locations.","However, because China had completed the city-defense battle ahead of schedule, all the teleportation arrays were interconnected.","As long as they teleported to Thorn City, they could come to the battlefield.","Whether they could arrive in time depended on how quickly they could move.","Soon, the players from Thorn City returned first and immediately passed through the Forest Spirit Passage, arriving at the battlefield.","Their number: 500,000.","They also resurrected the players from Soul of War City.","Next came Long Zhantian and his forces.","Countless players joined in.","Their numbers grew larger and larger.","...","Higher-Dimensional Plane.","The Undead Reaper watched everything unfolding in the game and could do nothing but rage helplessly.","The plan had failed once again!","Not only that, more and more people were appearing, and every one of them was taking part.","That meant every single one of them would receive a reward.","Inside the game, Feng Huimin was directing the troops.","“Deal damage for ten seconds!”","“Stop attacking! Withdraw! Next team.”","“Begin attacking! Ten seconds are up. Next team!”","The players excitedly unleashed their skills. After completing one wave of attacks, they immediately withdrew.","As long as they dealt damage to the BOSS, they could receive 100 points to all attributes.","Finally, after being worn down in this manner, the Headless Knight’s health was depleted.","Its enormous body fell from the sky and transformed into countless white bones.","It was completely dead.","This time, the deaths of the Undead Apostles did not strengthen the other undead creatures.","That was because Sun Jingya had absorbed the power of every Undead Apostle and condensed it into this BOSS. She had exhausted all her divine power, but the final result was still an undeniable defeat.","[System Announcement: Under the leadership of player “WhoWantsToBeAVegetable,” humanity has defeated the Undead Apostle and driven it out of the Primordial Gate. All participating players are rewarded with +100 to all attributes. (Stackable)]","[System Announcement: The stolen divine power will be returned to all players. Please continue your efforts!]","A full eighty million people filled the area within ten kilometers, densely packed across the sky and the ground. Every one of them received the all-attribute bonus.","These attribute points had all been converted from divine power. If the available divine power was insufficient, the system would instead plunder the power of the God of the Undead.","At that moment, the Undead Reaper felt as if its body had become utterly hollow.","A massive amount of divine power had been drained away!","Meanwhile, inside the game, countless players were cheering.","“I got a share again!”","“I leached off the rewards again!”","Because the majority of the damage had been dealt by Chu Fu and the other three, beams of light flashed repeatedly around their bodies.","Chu Fu’s level shot directly up to Level 60!","She could now undertake her class-change quest.","Aside from Chu Feng, the others were all stuck at Level 60.","As for the other players who had come to leech rewards, every one of them had received 100 points to all attributes.","[System Announcement: The Undead Apostle Sun Jingya has perished. Because the God of the Undead overdrawn divine power to activate the Second Apostle, violating the rules, the undead army has suffered a backlash. The power of all undead monsters has been reduced by 200%. Players with undead classes are unaffected.]","[System Announcement: The difficulty of Primordial-tier dungeons has been greatly reduced. All players may now clear them freely!]","There was even a helpful hint.","Chu Fu immediately issued orders for players to go and clear the Primordial-tier dungeons.","Although she wanted to maximize their profits, if everyone entered the dungeons one group at a time, they could leech even more rewards from the Reaper.","However, now that the difficulty of the Origin-level instance had dropped, players from other countries certainly wouldn’t miss the chance to increase their attribute points.","In the end, everyone could only rely on their own abilities.","At the same time, a few new items had appeared in Chu Fu’s inventory."]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261: Super God-Level Talent Traits, The Choice of Divinity","paragraphs":["[You have obtained 3 genuine Divine Power Fragments (Mythic) (Bound).]","The system had directly given Chu Fu three Godhead Fragments.","Including the one Divine Power Fragment from the werewolf Tuge and the one from Wale the Undead, Chu Fu now had five Divine Power Fragments in her possession.","And that was without counting the additional rewards from this siege.","There would be even more gains to come.","However, Sun Jingya was a newly formed apostle who had become a divine being as a player, and she had no equipment at all. Besides, the siege was still underway, so everyone had to race against time.","“Everyone, keep completing the siege missions! Try to achieve perfect defenses across the board and secure as many attribute points as possible!”","Only one day had passed since the siege began.","Yet apart from War Soul City being attacked, every other city had been successfully defended.","Moreover, with the Undead Legion’s combat power reduced by 200%, defending the cities had become much easier for the players.","Everyone began thinking about tackling the Primordial-tier dungeons.","But once they entered the dungeons, they discovered that all the bosses inside had been reduced to piles of bones.","Only the legion stationed at the entrance to the rift remained.","There were a total of one hundred thousand Primordial-tier undead creatures.","All they had to do was kill them to clear the dungeon.","The reward was still 10 points to all attributes.","Who wouldn’t want to take part in such a good deal?","As long as they had the ability to fight, they wanted to clear it.","Of course, because siege contributions and Primordial-tier dungeon contributions were calculated separately, several well-organized nations planned to wait until the ninth wave before finishing the dungeons.","They also reached cooperative agreements with the Flower Kingdom one after another.","Working together meant they could gain many more points to all attributes.","Chu Fu coordinated everything from the middle, steadily increasing her attributes.","However, even though a dungeon had become easier, players still had to transport people into it, so the dungeon could still only be entered once every twenty minutes.","As a result, over the course of three days, Chu Fu and the others could only complete a maximum of two hundred dungeon runs.","Chu Fu no longer had any spare time to slip away and grind dungeons. Instead, she cleared out the Undead Legion before the rift, exchanging the kills for contribution points.","And so, after three days and three nights without sleep, the siege finally came to an end.","[Global Announcement: The Undead Reaper’s invasion of this plane has ended. Humanity has achieved a resounding victory.]","[Global Announcement: All players have completed the Epic Achievement “Not a Single City Lost.” The human race’s fortune has increased. All players gain +1 to all attributes, and all newly created players gain an additional +1 to all attributes.]","[Global Announcement: The global contribution rankings have been released. The top ten players are as follows!]","[First Place: Who Wants to Be a Plant Person]","[Second Place: Rocket on a Wheelchair]","[Third Place: Lu Xing]","[Fourth Place: Suture Saint]","[Fifth Place: Who Are You Calling Blind?]","[Sixth Place: Holy Healing Angel]","[Seventh Place: Long Zhantian]","[Eighth Place: Shafu Liangu]","[Ninth Place: Jiaojiao Not Delicate]","[Tenth Place: Bitter Melon King]","“Damn it! My Godhead Fragments! My chance to become a god!” Dream King wailed as he found himself ranked eleventh.","But there was nothing he could do. Long Zhantian had a far more professional team working behind him, making arrangements and laying out strategies. Although he lacked an advantage in area-of-effect attacks, he had killed an enormous number of monsters.","Moreover, Long Zhantian was ranked sixth. For Dream King to overtake him, he could only aim to surpass Bitter Melon King.","But Bitter Melon King was now equipped with Wale’s entire set of equipment. Its stats were so powerful that he had left everyone else far behind.","Dream King genuinely admired him and knew that he was inferior in skill, but his mouth remained as stubborn as ever.","Chu Fu offered him some consolation as well.","“Don’t worry. As long as divine apostles appear in the future, you’ll have more chances to obtain Divine Power Fragments!”","Chu Fu then turned her attention to her own rewards.","The system had given her a pleasant surprise.","[System Notification: Player “Who Wants to Be a Plant Person,” you ranked first in contribution during the global siege event, “Undead Calamity.” Contribution: 15 trillion.","You have obtained: 3 Divine Power Fragments, 3 Transcendent God-tier Talent Enhancement Stones, and 1 Epic Chest.","Because the global achievement “Not a Single City Lost” was completed, all rewards have been doubled.","You have received: 3 Divine Power Fragments, 3 Transcendent God-tier Talent Enhancement Stones, and 1 Epic Chest.]","There was actually another pleasant surprise.","Still, it was only reasonable. Perfectly defending a city granted double rewards. Although requiring every city to achieve a perfect defense had seemed unrealistic, successfully defending all ten thousand servers was an unprecedented feat.","In her first life, a great many sieges had failed, accounting for nearly seventy percent of all cities. There had also been far fewer beginner villages back then.","In her second life, Chu Feng had existed, but the butterfly effect he caused had only produced minor changes. The overall situation had still been more or less the same as in the first life.","But this life was different.","This was a true transformation—a complete upheaval of the entire situation.","“Not a Single City Lost” meant that Chu Fu could now form a Godhead.","However, Chu Fu’s attention immediately turned to her Transcendent God-tier talents.","She used one of the enhancement stones on her talent.","Then she used two more in succession.","Suddenly, her Plant Person talent flashed brightly, changing from SSS-rank into a brand-new rank no one had ever seen before:","Z!","[Plant Person (Z: Transcendent God-tier):","Trait 6: You are the god who governs all plants in the world. You can obtain attributes from plants, and your believers can offer plants to you in exchange for your power.]","The description was extremely vague.","But at that moment, Chu Fu gained a new understanding.","She was already considered a pseudo-god. She could establish her own divine name and allow her believers to make sacrifices to her.","Naturally, the offerings would consist of various plants.","As long as the plants were of a sufficiently high level, Chu Fu could absorb the attributes contained within them and then return a portion of those attributes to the believers who had made the offerings.","Images already began to form in Chu Fu’s mind.","On planets that had not yet been contaminated by the supernatural, people would build sacrificial altars and place materials such as pearwood and ebony—woods that could not be eaten—upon them as offerings.","Chu Fu would absorb the attributes and then distribute a portion of them to those who had made the sacrifices.","Their physiques would instantly increase by 10 points.","The sickly and elderly sacrificers would be cured of all their ailments in an instant, their lifespans extended and their bodies rejuvenated.","How could anyone not go mad over such power?","This was what a Transcendent God-tier talent was!","Even Transcendent God-tier talents were beginning to develop in the direction of true divinity.","Chu Fu then used the remaining Transcendent God-tier Talent Enhancement Stones to strengthen Poison Person.","[Poison Person (Z: Transcendent God-tier):","Trait 6: You are the god who governs all poisons in the world. You can obtain attributes from poisons, and your believers can offer poisons to you in exchange for your power.]","Its effects were essentially the same as those of Plant Person.","Both talents had surpassed the divine level. Chu Fu had not yet tested them, so she did not know what kind of changes talents that required the efforts of all living beings could ultimately bring about.","After that, Chu Fu turned her attention to the Divine Power Fragments.","[Divine Power Fragment (Mythic) Bound: This Divine Power Fragment has no attributes. You may select divine power matching your own attributes as its core. Fuse 9 Divine Power Fragments to form a pseudo-godhead.]","Chu Fu opened the Divine Power Fragment interface.","To her surprise, the fragment possessed four possible attributes.","[Poison Divine Power]","[Wood Divine Power]","[Calamity Power]","[Contract Power]","Her talents and class could actually lead her down four different divine paths.","Chu Fu hesitated for only 0.1 seconds before making her decision."]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262: The Power of a False God, Continuously Updated Across 3 Versions","paragraphs":["The power of calamity.","Without a doubt, in terms of the specifications of a godhead, this power was truly unique. Among her current abilities, the power of calamity was the only one that could not be enhanced through any means.","The power of poison could absorb toxins and accumulate them continuously. Chu Fu felt that if all of humanity offered toxins to her, they might even be able to nurture her into a god of their own.","The same applied to the power of wood.","As for the power of contracts, it could be enhanced by contracting with more and more plant spirits.","Only the power of calamity was different. Although it had originally evolved from the Poison God’s power, everything that followed was completely different.","That was why Chu Fu chose it.","At present, she had six blank divine-power fragments. If she were a little more greedy, she could preserve all four divine powers.","But she knew that such greed might ultimately result in accomplishing nothing.","So Chu Fu chose the power of calamity without hesitation.","Next, Chu Fu selected the attributes of four divine-power fragments in succession, then kept one blank divine-power fragment.","She fused all the rest.","[Main Divine Power: Power of Calamity]","[Secondary Divine Powers:","Power of Calamity ×4","Power of the Undead ×4","Power of the Wolf God ×1]","[Fusion!]","As the radiance of a rainbow-colored Mythic item erupted, an indescribable substance appeared before Chu Fu’s eyes.","Its shape was constantly changing and fluctuating, like a unique law.","[Divine Power of Calamity (Mythic): After absorption, you will grasp the laws of calamity. The power of all calamity skills will increase by 10,000%.]","Simple and brutal.","A hundredfold increase in power!","Was this the strength of divine power?","Chu Fu was even afraid that a sneeze from her might create a viral catastrophe.","[Integrate? Yes/No]","“Yes!”","Chu Fu instantly fused the pseudo-godhead into herself.","She had grasped power that approached the level of a true god.","But that raised a question.","What kind of power did true gods possess?","Was her current strength enough to contend with a god?","Although she felt that it probably was not, her strength had indeed increased tremendously.","She now had complete confidence in entering the level-60 Primordial-tier dungeon.","...","The Higher-Dimensional Plane.","The Undead Reaper, who had suffered a crushing defeat, wore a hideous expression.","“Everyone, I’m withdrawing from this round first!”","The Undead Reaper was absolutely furious.","Even if they won this round, the humans who survived would most likely carry the Reaper’s divine power with them as they escaped through the [Primeval Gate].","The Undead Reaper had suffered a catastrophic loss.","The other evil gods frowned deeply.","“Idiot!”","The Insect Mother said coldly, “You’re running away, but how are the rest of us supposed to fight? Are you really going to let them clear this round? Won’t all our previous investments be wasted?”","The Undead Reaper’s voice sounded like countless vengeful spirits wailing together.","“Then descend into the game and plunder it before leaving.”","In truth, the Undead Reaper had already realized that humanity was about to turn the tables completely.","So they could also play dirty.","Humans could roll back the game.","The gods could destroy it.","“Hehehe... Aren’t you afraid the primordial humans will come after us?”","If they truly destroyed the game, the gods would no longer be players controlling the board. They would all be forced to enter the game themselves.","The primordial humans on humanity’s side would discover them and hunt them down.","Humanity was growing stronger by the day, spreading across countless planes. Every one of those primordial humans was an outstanding existence who had fought their way up from minor planes.","The Undead Reaper did not want to confront them either.","“Then what do you suggest?”","At that moment, an existence as immense as a mountain spoke.","“There’s no need to worry. From here on, let our Titan faction take over. We’ll tear these city walls apart completely. This time, I’ll invest more than ten times the number of Titans we used before!”","The Titan God spoke.","Only then did the gods’ quarrel come to an end.","Not only that, but the Mechanical God spoke as well.","“The probability of entering the Primordial-tier dungeon is 100%!”","Everyone else turned to look at the Mechanical God.","The Mechanical God continued, “The trap we prepared specifically for them is about to be triggered!","“However, we don’t know what rewards the Primeval Gate has given these humans. If the rewards are too generous, the trap may prove useless.”","At this, all the evil gods became alert.","...","Within the game.","After the siege battle ended and countless players cheered, they began frantically collecting contribution points.","In the contribution-point shop, a divine-power fragment cost ten trillion points, and each person could exchange for only one.","A city’s Undead Calamity would provide a total of only 22.5 billion contribution points. In the final wave, none of the cities fought, reducing the total by another three billion points.","Moreover, only 8,838 servers had participated in this battle. Some Primordial-tier dungeons had been cleared earlier, allowing their cities to survive, so the actual amount of contribution points obtained was even lower.","Chu Fu’s fifteen trillion contribution points—changed from the previous figure of fifteen—were already an enormous amount.","Even so, she could exchange them for only one divine-power fragment.","It was easy to imagine just how precious this item was.","Across the entire world, only a little over ten fragments could be exchanged for. There would definitely be fewer than twenty.","That was equivalent to killing a divine envoy.","Most importantly, no single person could possess all of them.","The difficulty was immense.","But one only had to look at the strength of a pseudo-god to understand that a hundredfold increase in skill effects was absolutely worth it.","In fact, Chu Fu had always been considering one question.","If pseudo-gods were already this powerful...","How strong were true gods?","How did one become a true god?","Of course, it was still too early to think about such distant matters.","For now, it was time to acquire more fragments.","Among the four people, Chu Fu and Chu Feng had each obtained three divine-power fragments, while Shen Chi and Xie Lin had obtained two each.","After adding the rewards and the fragments they had exchanged for, Shen Chi currently possessed nine divine-power fragments and was about to become a pseudo-god.","Her older brother, Chu Feng, had only eight.","He needed to kill two divine envoys.","Chu Fu had a feeling that there had to be a divine envoy inside the Primordial-tier dungeon, Mechanical Star.","Now, they were the hunters.","They had to begin the hunt.","But before that, Chu Fu decided to rest for a day.","She was too tired. She was exhausted.","For a full twenty-one days, Chu Fu had not slept even once.","Not to mention that the attributes she had acquired had not yet manifested in the real world.","She could use this period to withdraw those attributes.","Chu Fu returned to her City Lord’s Mansion in Thorn City and collapsed into bed.","As she entered a deep sleep, she extracted her attributes at the same time.","Chu Fu slept extremely well. When she woke, her muddled mind had become much clearer.","The moment she opened her eyes, a new game announcement appeared.","[System Announcement: The Undead Calamity version has ended. The Undead Reaper has suffered severe injuries, and the undead spawn rate has decreased.]","[System Announcement: The game has been updated to Version 4.0. Titans will now appear randomly in the wilderness, attacking cities, player guild strongholds, and other locations at any time.]","[The level-40 dungeon “Giants Destroy the City” has opened.]","[System Announcement: The number of level-40 players worldwide has reached one million! Game Version 5.0, Elemental Calamities, is now available.]","[The level-52 dungeon “High-Temperature Apocalypse,” the level-54 dungeon “Howling Winds,” the level-56 dungeon “Ocean Survival,” the level-58 dungeon “Global Freeze,” and the level-60 dungeon “Calamity Survivors” have opened.]","[System Announcement: The number of players worldwide who have reached Level 50 has surpassed ten million! Game Version 6.0—Mechanical Invasion—is now live.]","[Warning! An Origin-Level Dungeon is opening above Dragon Capital City. A massive mechanical invasion is underway. Players, proceed to the front lines and provide support.]"]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263: The Poisonous Kingdom in the Palm, Long Zhantian's Plan","paragraphs":["Talk about waking up to something this exciting!","Still, the situation should be manageable. Otherwise, these people would have contacted Chu Fu already.","The moment Chu Fu woke up, the others—who had set up special alerts for her—noticed immediately.","“Plant Girl, you should’ve cleared this level-60 Origin-level dungeon by now, right? I’m itching to see it. There might even be a divine envoy inside!”","Chu Fu had naturally decided to go as well.","Before she could say anything, a message from Feng Huimin arrived.","“Boss, go complete the level-60 Grandmaster promotion quest first. Once you finish it, you won’t be bottlenecked by experience anymore. These machines give quite a lot of EXP, and if you encounter another divine envoy inside, you’ll level even faster. Don’t waste the opportunity.","“I’ve already used my authority as vice city lord to change the Grandmaster quest. You’ll be able to turn it in as soon as you arrive.”","“OK!”","Chu Fu sent back her reply.","With Feng Huimin acting as her capable housekeeper, everything was always arranged perfectly.","That reminded Chu Fu of another matter.","“Manager Feng, help me build two structures. They need to be built both in the game and in the real world!”","“One should be a Calamity Temple, and the other a Nature Temple.”","“In the real world, print out this prayer and formation array. We’ll promote them afterward.”","Feng Huimin was astonished.","“Boss, what are you—?”","Chu Fu almost teasingly replied, “There’s no point explaining this to people who haven’t become gods.”","But in the end, she still explained.","“I used that Transcendent God-tier Talent Stone to raise my talent to another level. Through this path, I should be able to become a god independently, so I want to give it a try!”","“I understand, Boss. I’ll get right on it!”","Chu Fu ended her communication with Feng Huimin, replied to the others, and moved to the Promotion Hall.","There were surprisingly few people inside, but that was only natural.","After the recent city-defense battle, the players who had joined earlier had once again reached the endgame. They had probably all accepted their quests yesterday.","As for the newly joined players, it was impossible for them to reach level 30 overnight.","There were quite a few level-60 players in the guilds who had kept pace with them, but after opening the guild interface, one would discover that there were only around fifty in total.","Combined, the four guilds had fewer than two hundred players who had reached level 60, and those players had already completed their promotions.","Chu Fu walked up to the Grandmaster promotion NPC.","“I’m here to accept my promotion quest.”","“So it’s the City Lord herself! I’ll prepare your promotion quest right away.”","A dialogue box soon appeared.","[Main Quest: Promote to Grandmaster. Complete any one of the following objectives.]","[Objective 1: Kill 100 million monsters above level 60.]","[Objective 2: Clear an Origin-level dungeon above level 60.]","[Objective 3: Kill 10,000 bosses above level 60.]","[Objective 4: Participate in a level-60-or-higher battle against a True Name-level divine envoy—one who has possessed a name of its own. Participation in a kill will also count toward completion.]","Chu Fu immediately understood what Feng Huimin had meant by using her authority.","Without a doubt, Feng Huimin had arranged for her to take Objective 4.","In that case, not only had Chu Fu completed it, but every player in Thorn City had completed it as well. Once they reached level 60, none of them would be stuck on their promotion quest.","And the system apparently considered this perfectly reasonable. After all, the might of the divine envoy had been plain for all to see.","Chu Fu selected Objective 4.","[Quest complete: 3/1.]","She had even exceeded the requirement.","[Important System Notification!]","[Your level has surpassed 60, and you have completed the promotion quest. You have become a Grandmaster-level awakened.]","[From this moment onward, the basic attributes, skills, and talents you obtain in the game will gradually synchronize with the real world. You no longer need to enter deep sleep!]","[Please take note: Your current strength is extraordinarily powerful. With a casual gesture, you could destroy an entire city. The power you obtain within the “Gate of Origin” should be used to protect, not destroy! Those capable of annihilating all things should show even greater reverence for them. Restraint is the first lesson anyone with great power must learn.]","The system was worried that someone among the masses might turn evil!","Chu Fu couldn’t help thinking about her current physical abilities.","Uh... At this point, she was afraid that merely speaking might poison someone to death.","Everyone had joked before that if she kissed someone now, she could poison them on the spot.","Shen Chi, being a Metal Person, was the only one who wouldn’t be affected.","Though... he was obviously too busy.","Chu Fu hadn’t even had time for a sweet romance, but once the world was at peace, she wanted to find herself a handsome boyfriend too!","She couldn’t go her whole life without even being able to kiss him, could she?","With that thought, Chu Fu used the properties of her god-tier class to begin creating a skill of her own.","She compressed all the toxins in her body into a single point.","As for the location, the center of her palm would do nicely!","That way, she could draw on the toxins through her palm. Once she punctured the center of her hand, countless deadly poisons would pour out, forming a terrifying natural disaster.","Perfect.","After all, Chu Fu was far too poisonous now. The toxins stored in her palm were absolutely more potent than those of any other natural disaster.","Furthermore, Grandmaster-level players could possess domain-type skills.","Within a domain, other people had to obey its laws, and it could also produce a variety of unique effects.","“Then I’ll call this skill... Palmful of Poison.”","Other people had Palmful of Buddha. She had Palmful of Poison.","It was perfectly fitting!","Once she finished compressing the toxins, Chu Fu felt as though she were holding a supercharged nuclear poison bomb.","This was going to be one of her greatest trump cards.","After finishing the skill, she received another system notification.","[“Rocket on a Wheelchair” has invited you to join a party.]","Chu Fu clicked Confirm.","“Fu, are you ready? Guild Leader Long wants to tackle this Origin-level dungeon. Otherwise, even the dragon will be under too much pressure!”","Xie Lin immediately noticed what was happening and said, “What do you mean, ‘Fu’? Do you think you’re worthy of calling her that? You should call her Queen! Thorn Queen, have you finished your quest? Should this humble servant fly over on his sword to pick you up?”","Chu Fu burst out laughing.","“I’m coming, I’m coming. I’ll be there soon.”","Chu Fu still had a Plant Spirit stationed in Longdu, so she could simply teleport there.","Longdu’s situation was rather unique. It was divided into four cities in the east, south, west, and north, while Long Zhantian had established the Longxiang Jiuzhou guild headquarters right in the center.","Moreover, according to predictions regarding future dungeons, this would also become the only survivor base in Longdu.","However, because three versions had descended ahead of schedule, the future dungeons no longer included future maps for levels 30–70. Only dungeons for levels 70–80, 80–90, and 90–100 had appeared.","This could be considered a massive butterfly effect—one that had truly triggered a tsunami.","Nowadays, low-level players entering the game were more likely to die. After all, whether they were Titans, elemental monsters, or mechanical monsters, they were all far too powerful.","However, those low-level players had no idea what kind of earth-shaking plan Longxiang Jiuzhou—the official organization of China—was secretly preparing.","They were going to launch a counterattack!"]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264: Step One: Copy the Players, the True Fourth Cataclysm","paragraphs":["“Chairwoman Chu, you’re here!” Long Zhantian walked over and continued, “You said this rift was strange even before the update. I never expected it to actually appear in the game after the version update.”","“But it doesn’t matter. It’s the perfect chance to test out some of Longxiang Jiuzhou’s new technology. We can give it a try without taking any risks.”","“Oh? What kind of new technology?”","Chu Fu’s curiosity was piqued as well.","With a wave of his hand, Long Zhantian summoned a massive crystal.","The crystal looked extremely familiar. Chu Fu recognized it at a glance.","[Copy Crystal]","“After researching it, Longxiang Jiuzhou finally managed to reorder and cleanse the energy inside the Copy Crystal, transforming it into something humans can use.","“Once the Copy Crystal is activated, it can create a copy of a player. Of course, the copy only possesses one percent of the original’s strength.","“An ordinary player naturally wouldn’t be able to use it. However, after the God-Making Project is completed, every player who takes part in it will have at least 10,000 points in every attribute. Even one percent of that would still amount to 100 points.","“Based on a total of 400 attribute points, that’s the equivalent of an level-80 player’s stats.","“Now imagine releasing a hundred, a thousand, or ten thousand beings of that level—and having them fear neither death nor sacrifice.","“How terrifying would that be?”","“Heh heh. The young people at the Analysis Bureau say this plan should be called the ‘Fourth Calamity’ Project. And now, the first batch of players is ready to give it a try! Chairwoman Chu, your attributes are the highest, so why don’t you go first?”","Long Zhantian gestured for her to proceed.","Chu Fu had never imagined that Longxiang Jiuzhou would have developed something like this.","It was yet another thing that had never appeared in the original storyline, yet it made perfect sense.","After all, the Dark Gold Project had caused a large number of Copy Crystals to fall into Huaxia’s hands.","The Analysis Bureau and the Research Institute had begun studying them, eventually creating this item that was somewhat similar to a magical formation or an alchemical artifact.","A player Copy Crystal.","And now, they were using these crystals to create copies as well.","However, this Copy Crystal could only copy a player’s own attributes. It could not copy the attributes of their equipment.","Chu Fu glanced at her basic attributes.","[Constitution: 20,581","Strength: 13,026","Agility: 13,026","Spirit: 23,581]","In addition to the God-Making Project, Chu Fu had also been absorbing toxins. Every 100 points of toxins she absorbed increased her Constitution and Spirit by one point.","As a result, her Spirit was 10,000 points higher than the base attributes granted by the project.","If she created a whole army of copies with attributes like these...","How powerful would they be?","Following Long Zhantian’s instructions, Chu Fu began the copying process.","Before even a second had passed, a new “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” appeared.","Not only that, but Chu Fu and her copy seemed to share a faint connection. She could at least view its status panel and issue it commands.","Only at that moment did Chu Fu truly feel as though she was playing a game.","A 3D role-playing game.","[ID: Who Wants to Be a Vegetable? (Copy)","Class: Seed of Calamity (Hidden Class), Seed of Nature Spirit (Hidden Class)","Talents: Vegetable Person (SS), Poison Person (SS), Green Giant (S)","Attributes:","Constitution: 206, Strength: 130, Agility: 130, Spirit: 236]","Hiss!","Although the attributes looked rather pathetic, they were still equivalent to those of a level-40 player.","And the copy’s talents and classes were unbelievably powerful.","Before the God-Making Project, this would have been an exceptionally impressive status panel.","What was more, creating these copies did not consume Chu Fu’s own energy. It only used the energy stored in the crystal.","As long as she wanted, she could create as many copies as she liked.","“Incredible!” Chu Fu couldn’t help exclaiming.","Long Zhantian also struggled to contain his delight. His aged face wore the smug, almost childlike expression of someone showing off a prized toy.","He was terrible at playing games. He had relied entirely on his talent and combat instincts to become the leader of the future. Only now did he finally feel that he was better at gaming than these young people.","“Moreover, characters like this can equip items, which will raise their attributes even further. With your stats, you could completely overwhelm a level-60 mechanical monster.”","“As for the strength of the monsters in the Primordial-tier dungeon, we can go and investigate.”","“Fine! Then let’s start by making ten thousand copies!”","Long Zhantian threw his head back and laughed. “Come on, let’s put together a ten-billion-strong army!”","As long as one million players each created ten thousand copies, they could form an army of ten billion.","Once the decision was made, they acted immediately.","Longxiang Jiuzhou set up countless Copy Crystal towers in the four cities of Dragon Capital, as well as in the four guild headquarters belonging to Longxiang Jiuzhou.","However, only players with SSS-rank talents or hidden classes were allowed to create copies.","Otherwise, anyone who went there would merely become cannon fodder.","This finally put Chu Fu at ease.","No matter what dangers awaited them inside the Primordial-tier dungeon, Mechanical Star, what would it matter if the copies were killed?","Without another word, they charged in.","Chu Fu, Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and even Chu Feng joined in. Each of them created ten thousand copies, forming a massive team.","Shen Chi was especially formidable. His copies were equipped with mechs—one hundred thousand mechs in total. Their combat power was explosive.","Chu Fu refused to be outdone. She equipped her copies with gear, using the surplus equipment stored in the Thorn Guild’s warehouse to arm them all.","She also had a huge number of plants in her Spirit Plant Pouch. She had each copy contract with plants and transform them into Nature Spirits. Even if each copy could only contract with one hundred plant spirits after accounting for its equipment, that still amounted to an army of one million plant spirits.","The entire army set out!","At once, countless players streamed out of the four major cities and the cities established by Longxiang Jiuzhou. They converged into a force that looked like a beast tide.","Counterattack!","Counterattack!","The machines poured out of the rift, but they were gradually forced back and wiped out. In the end, they were driven all the way into the rift.","The copied players began entering the rift.","They crossed the hundred-meter-wide rift in no time.","Through the eyes of one of her copies, Chu Fu saw the world beyond the rift.","It was a city made entirely of metal. Countless machines rumbled and thundered as enormous machine platforms produced mechanical life-forms, which were then sent endlessly into the rift.","Even those enormous machine platforms were actually Primordial-tier monsters.","The Mechanical Race!","The moment Chu Fu saw this scene, she immediately ordered her copies to unleash a barrage of attacks.","At the same time...","The Mechanical God had finally received the prey he had been waiting for.","“They’re here!”","“Drain the elements and seal the rift. Trap them all in here!”","The next moment, an invisible wave erupted. It seemed to sweep across the entire world.","At that moment, none of the magic classes could cast spells.","A greatsword knight with the ID No Talking in Class shouted, “It’s an Anti-Magic Domain! Mages, be careful!”","Her own talent was Sealing Magic, and the environment around her was exactly the same as when she activated it.","As expected, the Mechanical Race had set a trap.","This move alone had rendered at least half of the players who came here useless.","If they had come in person, they would have been trapped after their magic was sealed. And once the spatial passage was shut down, they would have no choice but to die here.","But the ones who had come this time were all copies!"]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265: The Fearless Replica, Sequence Zero","paragraphs":["“So this is where you were waiting for me?”","Seeing this scene, Chu Fu immediately understood the purpose behind the trap set by the Mechanical God.","Chu Fu’s team was overwhelmingly composed of magic-class players. The only ones who specialized purely in physical damage were Xie Lin and Wu Yingchun.","Shen Chi and Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had also mastered metal and earth elemental abilities respectively.","So once their spells were sealed, the consequences would be severe.","Especially for Chu Fu.","At this moment, none of the clones could use magic.","What was more, the contracted plant spirits were themselves products of magic, and every one of them was a wood-element spirit.","As their magic was drained away, the spirits gradually became listless. In the end, they turned into withered corn, dandelions, and mile-a-minute vines.","Chu Fu’s plan to create a million contracted plants had been completely ruined.","...","The high-dimensional plane.","There was no smile on the Mechanical God’s mechanical face.","But the metallic voice clearly conveyed the joy of victory.","“Target: Who Wants to Be a Vegetable? Lock on to the target! Initiate extermination protocol!”","In an instant, countless machines received the order and concentrated their attacks on a girl wearing a green, court-style gown with an enormous skirt.","The next moment, she was blasted to death.","Dead.","The evil gods in the high-dimensional plane could not help crying out in surprise. Their intense emotions caused the entire plane to ripple and distort.","“It’s over already?” The Wolf God stared at the scene, doubting his own eyes.","Yet the image glimpsed through the crack had been transmitted with perfect clarity.","Who Wants to Be a Vegetable? had died just like that.","But in the next moment, the Titan God frowned. His terrifyingly massive body made the motion resemble a mountain rising from between his brows.","“No, that’s not right. How can there still be another one?”","The beautiful human girl appeared in another direction, raising her hand at the same time.","The Mechanical God’s data began racing through calculations.","“It must be a resurrection scroll. That isn’t something we can suppress, but it doesn’t matter. We’ll just keep killing her!”","It issued the final command.","Countless machines began frantically locking onto her facial features and giving chase.","...","In the game,","Chu Fu’s clones died in large numbers.","“Why are they all targeting me?”","“Plant Girl, come over here! I’ll protect you!”","Xie Lin spoke as he controlled his clone and focused on protecting Chu Fu’s clone.","He used swordsmanship—not metal manipulation, but pure swordplay: Grass Controlling the Sword with the Heart.","What did it matter that the surrounding elements had been drained?","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","His sword swept across the Origin-grade machines.","However, this was only one percent of Xie Lin’s true strength. His attacks benefited solely from the advantage of his skills, not from superior attributes, so he could basically only fight one-on-one.","Chu Fu’s clones continued to suffer devastating casualties.","“Damn it, I’ll show you what I’m made of! Sword Saint Brother, help me—cut open my palm!”","She controlled her clone and spread open its hand.","“Such a cruel thing, and you want me, your flower-protecting knight, to do it?”","Xie Lin glanced at Chu Fu.","Chu Fu was both amused and exasperated. How could Xie Lin be so handsome and such a fool at the same time?","“Stop fooling around. We’re fighting monsters here! Hurry!”","“All right, all right!”","Xie Lin simultaneously controlled his own clone and slashed open the palm of Chu Fu’s clone.","The clones seemed to operate according to a preset program. Although there were many of them, they all followed the same set of instructions.","Every clone sought out the nearby Xie Lin, opened its palm, and cut it.","A drop of blood flowed out.","This was no ordinary blood.","It contained the blood of the Calamity skill Poison Nation in the Palm.","The calamity spread, transforming into a vast expanse of black fog in the blink of an eye.","The machines had drained the surrounding elements, turning the area into a land without magic.","However, the blood in Chu Fu’s palm had long since stored wood elements and poison. Once it exploded, it naturally formed a calamity.","Even though the clones possessed very little spiritual power, their poison attacks were extremely powerful, and the range of Poison Nation in the Palm reached two hundred meters.","In an instant, the surrounding machines were engulfed, creating a scene of disaster.","“Zzzzzzzzz!”","Even metal was rapidly corroded. And with machines, once their circuits were damaged, they would completely break down, resulting in devastating casualties.","Large numbers of machines were destroyed by Chu Fu.","However, the other magic-class players faced the same problem and were also killed in large numbers by the machines.","Both sides suffered heavy losses.","Only the physical-combat players continued fighting furiously, even shining brilliantly on the battlefield.","Every one of Shen Chi’s clones was equipped with a mecha. The mechas were diamond-grade, and their performance was roughly comparable to that of Origin-grade mechas.","When the two sides clashed, both suffered damage.","As for Chu Feng, his attributes were simply overwhelming. He could practically kill an Origin-grade mecha with a single slash—and there were ten thousand copies of Chu Feng.","Countless members of the mechanical race were slaughtered. Of course, countless human player clones were also destroyed.","The mechas were endless.","But the clones had no more reinforcements.","...","Inside the city established by the Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces Guild,","Chu Fu watched the scene and shook her head helplessly.","“The rift has been closed, and the spatial elements have been sealed off. Neither my Forest Spirit Passage nor Shen Chi’s spatial teleportation can establish a spatial channel!”","This battle had exposed them and alerted the enemy.","Still, it had allowed them to avoid an enormous crisis.","Long Zhantian, however, was not worried in the slightest.","“Chairwoman Chu, don’t jump to conclusions yet. They may have sealed the spatial rift, but we can still reopen it! Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces has gathered more than a thousand spatial-class players from all across China to study teleportation arrays.”","“We originally did this to deal with the problem of distances expanding after the game invaded reality.”","“Who would have thought we’d make a new discovery? If they can open a rift, so can we!”","Long Zhantian directed the spatial mages as they constructed an array and aimed it at the spatial rift from earlier.","Silver spatial energy erupted, blasting open a gigantic crack.","The player clones entered once more.","The players also adjusted their strategy.","This time, they copied only physical-combat classes.","“Charge! If we take one of them down before we die, it’s a victory.”","“They’re only clones. Who’s afraid of dying?”","“Let them experience the true Fourth Calamity!”","Wave after wave of player clones charged forward.","“There must be machines and arrays sealing magic. Destroy them all!”","“Right! Destroy them!”","This time, there was no individual showing off their skills. There was only an endless stream of players throwing themselves into the battle.","Of course, charging the clone crystals was also a problem. This was a war of resources.","But Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces was an official organization. Money was the one thing it had in abundance.","Fight. Fight until they were dead.","Under the players’ relentless assault, the territory they occupied grew larger and larger.","At first, it covered an area within a one-kilometer radius.","Gradually, it expanded to ten kilometers.","At this moment, a gigantic machine entered their view.","It stood a full two hundred meters tall, resembling a towering structure. Energy surged from its ten arms as it continuously washed over the surrounding area.","[Mechanical Divine Envoy: Sequence Zero, Level: 70, Durability: 1.2 trillion]"]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266: The Fall of the Machine God's Envoy, Shen Chi and Chu Feng Become False Gods","paragraphs":["“So you’re the little punk who sealed my spells!”","Chu Fu had found the culprit.","Without a word, she ordered all her clones to charge.","But the moment they drew near, the electric fence beside the tower zapped them until they were blackened and charred. The clones died, turning into streaks of white light before vanishing.","Even so, countless players continued throwing themselves into the battle.","With magic unusable, everyone who came was powerless to deal any real damage. Their only ranged attacks were arrows.","Yet when those arrows struck the Tower Apostle, they could not even penetrate its defenses.","Its armor value was effectively its health bar, and it remained completely unscathed.","“Let me try!”","Xie Lin gathered every weapon and longsword he could find.","He had brought nearly all the weapons belonging to the Thorny Guild.","Not only that, whenever a player dropped a weapon, he would fish it out of the chaos and take control of it.","He even picked up metal fragments scattered across the battlefield, hammered them a few times, and quickly forged a crude sword.","As the Sword God, it didn’t matter what a weapon looked like. As long as it was a weapon, it could become a divine weapon in his hands.","After creating countless clones, he had also rapidly formed a new domain skill: Sword Formation.","A colossal sword, a full kilometer long, took shape.","“Come on! Have a taste of my Galaxy Sword—Slash the Galaxy!”","Xie Lin’s countless swords gathered together. Since high-quality weapons came with their own glowing visual effects, when they merged in the sky, they actually formed a radiance resembling countless stars, glittering across the heavens.","The galaxy turned, and the sword came crashing down.","As an experienced player, he knew better than anyone how to identify an enemy’s weaknesses.","This tower-shaped mecha was flawless and possessed astonishing defensive power, but its ten arms had been welded on.","When fighting mechanical creatures, dismantling them directly was much easier.","That sword strike was aimed at the mechanical arms.","“Clang, clang, clang...”","The Galaxy Sword swept across the mechanical arms.","Countless sparks of metal erupted from the collision. The longswords were knocked away, but even more swords continued striking the mechanical arms.","At last, the armor value above the enemy’s head moved.","[Armor remaining: 11.5 trillion]","They had taken away 500 billion health!","More importantly, one of the mecha’s arms had been damaged.","At once, it was as though a breach had been opened in that direction.","Elemental energy began to recover.","The clones controlled by Chu Fu finally seemed to have broken free.","They could once again draw on the energy within their bodies.","Her clones began manipulating the withered plant sprites, injecting them with energy once more, forcing them to mature, causing them to burst forth with more seeds, and then mutating them.","In an instant, the metallic Mechanical Star seemed to bloom everywhere.","Chu Fu enlarged the plants and fused them into herself.","She transformed into a plant-human combined with the Hulk.","This time, Chu Fu’s clones finally withstood the Mechanical Apostle’s electric fence!","Relying on her explosively enhanced physical strength, Chu Fu charged through the electric fence and reached the Mechanical Apostle’s feet.","She immediately slit open her palm and let the blood flow.","Then she smeared it fiercely across the base of the tower.","The poison rapidly spread, corroding the metal.","“We’ve found its weakness! Everyone, attack together!”","Feng Huimin marked one of the mechanical arms.","Countless players attacked it at once.","Chu Feng leaped onto the mechanical arm, aimed his dagger at a single point, and struck hundreds of times per second.","Most importantly, there was not just one Chu Feng.","There were countless Chu Fengs, all wearing cloaks. The only difference between them was their equipment and weapons.","The countless Chu Fengs gathered together like a flock of woodpeckers, their daggers flashing in unison. In less than five minutes, they severed the enormous mechanical arm.","Armor value: -500 billion.","“Woohoo!”","The magic-oriented players cheered. Another area of the magic seal had been broken.","Keep attacking!","...","Within the higher-dimensional plane.","Several evil gods were left in disarray.","Why were there so many [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?] players smearing poison everywhere?","Why were so many [Lu Xing] players acting as woodpeckers?","Why had so many [Who Are You Calling Blind?] players formed a sword formation?","As for Shen Chi...","It was better not to mention him. There were simply too many of him!","At last, the Goblin God blinked and said, “Clones. They’re using cloning technology!”","All the evil gods locked onto their opponent.","Cloning technology was not exclusive to the Goblin God.","But was this really how things were supposed to go?","They had originally been the ones invading humanity.","So why did it now feel as if humanity were invading them instead?","At this moment, the Mechanical God’s chances of victory had plummeted.","Probability of failure: 62.2%... 82.7%... 100%...","...","In the game.","The Tower Apostle had been reduced to a bare, stripped-down pillar.","Since everyone had been using clones, Chu Fu and the others had feared that the divine power fragments would not be awarded to clones. Thus, they had taken the risk of entering the Origin-level dungeon.","The final blow, naturally, had to be delivered by their true bodies.","Fortunately, there were no more hidden schemes!","Through everyone’s efforts, the Mechanical Apostle was finally killed.","[System Announcement: Under the leadership of player “Rocket on a Wheelchair,” humanity has defeated the evil god’s apostle and driven the evil god’s power out of the Primordial Gate. All participating players are rewarded with +100 to all attributes. This reward can stack.]","[System Announcement: Mechanical Apostle, Sequence Zero has been destroyed. The strength of mechanical monsters has decreased by 100%. The difficulty of mechanical-type dungeons has been reduced, and mechanical and technological blueprints are now more likely to drop.]","[System Announcement: The stolen divine power will be returned to all players. Please continue your efforts!]","[System Announcement: Congratulations to the players for clearing the Origin-level dungeon: Mechanical Star. +10 to all attributes.]","“Easy win!”","“That was awesome! Now this is what a real game should be—no fear of death and no fear of losing equipment. Even ants can bring down an elephant if there are enough of them.”","“From today onward, let’s show the evil gods just how terrifying the Fourth Calamity can be!”","Everyone erupted in cheers.","The ten players with the highest contribution in the battle each received a divine power fragment.","Chu Fu received one as well.","But someone received two!","That person was Shen Chi.","Ten thousand mecha had simply been too influential in the battle.","As for Chu Fu’s older brother, Chu Feng, he had only received one, but that was enough to complete his collection of divine power fragments.","Humanity now had two more demigods:","The Mechanical God and the God of Slaughter!","Not only that.","In the past, they had fought through Origin-level dungeons and then still needed to leave them afterward.","But this time, Long Zhantian and Chu Fu discussed the matter and reached the same decision: they would establish a base inside this Origin-level dungeon.","They would build a city here.","Just as monsters had invaded their world, humanity would now launch a counter-invasion.","Once the city was completed, they would use it as a base and begin invading Mechanical Star in reverse.","The dungeon’s name was Mechanical Star. If it was called a planet, then this world had to be at least as large as a planet. How could it possibly contain only one mechanical city?","This was the evil god’s lair.","They had to wipe it out completely.","Thus, large numbers of players remained behind and began constructing a city that belonged to humanity.","“By the way, Chairwoman Chu, the Goblin Apostle among the low-level monsters still hasn’t appeared. We’ve already located them. Shall we go hunt them together? We need more demigods.”","Long Zhantian never kept good opportunities to himself.","The high-level players of the Thorny Guild possessed the most divine power fragments. Only by allowing them to complete their divine godhood first could everyone’s safety be guaranteed.","Therefore, they had to bring Chu Fu along."]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267: Attack the Goblin Forest, Super God-level Talent Connects to Another Plane","paragraphs":["Chu Fu naturally agreed without hesitation.","Since goblins were the second batch of monsters to invade the Primordial Gate, the selection process of the Primordial Gate meant that they should be relatively weak.","So this time, no one used clones.","They entered in person.","All the clones remained on Mechanical Star, continuing to fight the mechanical race and preventing them from launching a counterattack.","Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Long Zhantian were the first to teleport to a city on the vast grasslands overseas.","This was the coordinate Long Zhantian had provided.","“This is the exact location we identified.”","Long Zhantian set up a spatial formation, and soon, a gigantic spatial rift appeared.","Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Long Zhantian entered it.","Shen Chi piloted the mecha, with Chu Fu and Long Zhantian inside, and then charged forward with a thunderous roar.","Before long, they saw a massive city.","Or rather, it should have been a royal capital!","The previous goblin city had been nowhere near this large.","In fact, the former goblin divine envoys had still been living in tents.","But palaces had already been built here.","Its level of civilization was clearly much higher.","There would definitely be a super Boss here.","Killing a divine envoy awarded 100 attribute points, while clearing an Origin-tier dungeon awarded another 10 attribute points.","Naturally, they could not afford to miss it.","Chu Fu opened the Spiritwood Passage.","All 1,000 servers and cities across the nation were connected.","Every player who had participated in the God-Making Project rushed over at top speed without even waiting for Chu Fu to issue an order.","Even those who had never taken part in the God-Making Project knew what this was!","“It’s the Plant God’s Spiritwood Passage! Hurry, get inside! They must be fighting a Boss! This is our chance to leech attribute points!”","“Charge!”","“Don’t miss it if you happen to pass by!”","The players frantically poured into the passage.","...","Higher-Dimensional Plane.","The Mechanical God had only just been defeated, and everyone was still reeling from the sudden surge in human strength when the Goblin God received even worse news.","“Why are they coming after me?”","He was merely one of the monsters from the second wave of invasions, with strength only slightly greater than the Wolf God’s. More importantly, his divine envoy was even weaker than Werewolf Tuge.","Why couldn’t these humans leave him alone?","Why weren’t they attacking the Titans or the Elementals? Why had they chosen him?","Wasn’t this just bullying a weaker god?","But he had no means of resisting.","Their invasion progress had not yet reached the point where they could descend in divine form. Unless he once again expended divine power to nurture a new divine envoy, there was nothing he could do.","Yet his divine power was even weaker than that of the Undead Reaper. Knowing that humanity was about to turn the tables, how could he invest more?","So he could only wait to be slaughtered.","The other gods also looked grim.","“We’ve lost!”","“Everyone, hide your divine envoys well! Don’t let the humans find them. The outcome has not yet been decided. Everything will have to wait until the Day of Descent. We still have a chance,” the Insect Mother said.","The other evil gods nodded.","But their plans conflicted with humanity’s.","Now, it was no longer the evil gods who were attacking.","Humanity had gone on the offensive.","Even if the evil gods wanted to hide their divine envoys, would humanity agree?","Of course not.","...","Inside the Goblin Royal Capital.","Chu Fu unleashed the Plague Catastrophe, and it instantly spread throughout the entire city.","The Goblin King, Gao Ge, wearing a crown adorned with multicolored gemstones, leaped out.","[Goblin King: Gao Ge. Level: 60. HP: 50 billion.]","What a weak divine envoy.","“Everyone, don’t attack yet. Wait one hour so everyone can share in the attribute points!”","Chu Fu gave the order, telling everyone not to attack. Otherwise, this divine envoy would be beaten to death in moments.","One hour was also enough time for all those who wanted to come—and who knew what was happening—to arrive.","Everyone stared at Gao Ge, the Goblin King, like hungry wolves eyeing a piece of meat while being forced to hold themselves back for some reason.","The Goblin King, Gao Ge, was filled with despair as well.","He had never imagined that one day he would die like this.","He even called out to his god, but received no response.","He knew that he had been abandoned.","One hour later.","Everyone who was coming had arrived. Those who had not made it would simply have to be left behind.","“Attack!”","With only 50 billion attributes, Gao Ge could be killed instantly by Chu Feng’s current stats.","However, Chu Feng held back.","He did not completely cut off every possible path forward.","He was merely a little more ruthless than the other players.","Even so, it took less than two minutes.","The terrifying divine envoy was slain by the assembled players.","The top ten contributors each received one Divine Envoy Fragment.","By now, the remaining fragments were distributed fairly evenly among the players.","Werewolf Tuge had one, Wale had one, Sun Jingya had one, Sequence Zero had one, and the Goblin King Gao Ge had one.","The rewarded fragment became two after being doubled.","Then there was another fragment obtained through contribution-point exchange.","They were now only two fragments short.","If they could kill the Titan Divine Envoy and the Elemental Divine Envoy, they would gain another batch of Pseudo-God-level players.","That would depend on whether Flower Nation could locate their spatial rifts.","However, no spatial rifts appeared anywhere in the game over the next several days.","Chu Fu guessed that the evil gods were hiding.","They no longer dared to engage in direct combat.","Otherwise, they would simply be offering themselves up.","They might have other methods available, but they had not used them yet.","Only seventy days remained until the monsters descended in full—less than two months.","“If they don’t show themselves, does that mean it’s over? Not a chance.” Chu Fu sneered. At this moment, she was completely in control of the situation.","“We can have all the players level up. If every city gathers one million players who reach Level 40, then there’s a high chance that a new major version event will be triggered.”","“The Titan Giant Siege!”","“This is how the game is designed. Our struggle against the evil gods has always worked this way.”","“When our strength increases, it triggers defensive wars ahead of schedule.”","“In the past, we thought this was because the evil gods noticed our growing strength and launched an early attack to wipe us out before the event spiraled out of control.”","“But now that I think about it, why couldn’t this also be a counterattack?”","Everyone agreed with Chu Fu’s assessment.","However, at present, an individual city was lucky if it gained forty or fifty thousand new players each day. Moreover, the talents and skills of players who joined later were becoming worse and worse. Many players were getting stuck at Level 20, let alone reaching the goal of gathering one million Level 40 players.","There was only one city capable of accomplishing this.","Thorn City!","By now, the Thorn Guild had already reached Level 6 and could accommodate 80,000 members.","Its four branch guilds had a total of 320,000 members, while Thorn City’s remaining players numbered a full two million.","With veteran players leading newcomers and everyone pushing themselves to the limit, they would strive to gather one million Level 40 players within ten days.","At the same time, Chu Fu was not idle either.","If she had no Divine Power Fragments, she would simply create them herself.","Previously, Chu Fu had asked Feng Huimin to build two temples: the Temple of Poison and the Temple of Nature.","Both temples had now been completed.","Chu Fu entered one of the temples, then activated her Super-God-level talent.","Once activated, her entire being seemed to transcend her physical body and drift toward a higher-dimensional world.","She entered a strange realm.","The world existed within the universe, and countless objects resembling enlarged mobile-phone screens floated before her, each displaying a series of passing images.","In an instant, Chu Fu gained a faint understanding.","[Alternate Planes]","Countless planes unfolded before her eyes.","As long as she released her divine power, she could influence the people of these other planes.","Of all the planes before her, the one closest to her—and therefore the easiest for her divine power to reach—was naturally the plane she inhabited.","However, her own plane was currently a low-level one. It had yet to be invaded, and there were too few special resources.","Suddenly, she spotted a plane overrun entirely by zombies."]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268: How Is This the God of Calamity This Is a Savior","paragraphs":["This plane was pretty good.","The zombie virus counted as poison too.","Chu Fu immediately developed divine power and transmitted the information over.","But as soon as she did, Chu Fu realized that her influence was far weaker than she had imagined.","How should she describe this feeling?","On her own plane, as long as she wished, her spiritual power could now envelop half of China. Without needing any game item, she could even activate a “server-wide announcement” function.","However, once her influence spread to other planes, her ability to interfere became extremely, extremely weak.","This was probably what legends called a plane barrier.","A realization surfaced in Chu Fu’s heart.","“So this is why those evil gods have no way to descend personally into our plane? They first send a batch of monsters to transform our planet into one suitable for their survival!","“Only then can their divine power gradually descend.","“They call this kind of behavior infiltration.","“We’re being invaded!”","What Chu Fu was doing now was also a form of infiltration.","The range she could affect was very limited.","So she needed to choose an existence similar to a “divine emissary.”","After observing for a while, she quickly discovered a woman.","At that moment, the woman was slaughtering her way through a horde of zombies.","She had already been bitten by a zombie, but even though she was about to turn into one herself, she still refused to give up.","“Even if this old lady dies, I’ll hack all you zombies into pieces! Killing one means I’ve earned one!”","“Die! All of you, just die!”","“In an apocalypse like this, I don’t even want to live anymore. After I turn into a zombie, I’ll still come back for revenge! Lin Wei and Su Nian, that scumbag and that shameless bitch—may you both die horribly!”","A powerful hatred blazed in the girl’s eyes.","She chopped off a zombie’s head, reached into its foul-smelling brain matter, pulled out a zombie crystal core, and stuffed it into her mouth.","An ordinary person without an awakened ability would explode and die after consuming a zombie crystal core.","She knew that, but she had no other choice.","Very soon, she felt intense pain spreading through her body. Her blood seemed to rush backward, and her stomach felt as though it had been burned through. She could not help but vomit up mouthfuls of blood.","Inside the divine temple, Chu Fu watched everything unfold and could not help sighing.","“What a ruthless woman!”","“You’re the one.”","Chu Fu’s mental power sent out a command.","The next moment, the girl in that small world heard a voice as beautiful as heavenly music.","[The God of Calamity has detected the fury in your heart. Would you like to sacrifice the zombie virus in exchange for attribute points?]","The girl froze in the middle of hacking at a zombie.","The area beneath her eyes had already turned a bluish-black color. The black virus was spreading, and even her pupils had grown somewhat cloudy.","On the brink of death, she heard the voice of salvation.","As for whether it was the God of Calamity or something else, she did not care. At a time like this, as long as it could keep her alive, she would gladly offer her soul to a demon.","“I agree! I agree! I agree!”","She roared loudly, as if afraid the other party would not hear her.","The next moment, she felt the virus within her transform into black mist, which was swept into the air and dispersed.","The more than twenty zombies she had killed earlier also began to change. Their hideous corpses, contaminated by the black virus, transformed into streams of black air, as if something had drawn the virus out of them.","Yet when the black virus was extracted, a warm current flowed back into her body.","The wounds on her body slowly healed, and the pain in her stomach vanished. Not only that, but she seemed to have learned an “ability.”","The ability was called Mire.","She immediately used Mire.","In an instant, an energy fluctuation spread out from her, forming gray-black ripples that made it seem as though the zombies had fallen into a swamp.","The zombies had already been slow-moving to begin with, but now their movements seemed to slow down tenfold.","The girl was overjoyed. She raised the weapon in her hand and viciously hacked the zombies to death.","“Sacrifice!”","“Sacrifice!”","“Sacrifice!”","Although sacrificing each zombie only granted her a tiny amount of energy, it made her grow more vigorous with every swing.","There were a full thousand zombies in the horde. She killed and sacrificed every last one of them. Afterward, she felt warm currents flowing throughout her body, and her physical strength had increased by roughly one-fifth.","That was because her Constitution had increased by 1 point.","And that was not all. There was another surprise.","“Does the God of Calamity not want these zombie crystal cores? The God only wants the viruses?”","“Is this really the God of Calamity? This is practically a savior!”","“Thank you, God of Calamity! Thank you, God of Calamity! You are my salvation. I, Su Qiannuan, will worship you faithfully for the rest of my life!”","Su Qiannuan fell to her knees and began kowtowing frantically.","...","Inside the divine temple, Chu Fu issued another command.","Naturally, it was to help collect poisonous substances and spread the doctrine, so that all humans would learn the name of the God of Calamity and offer sacrifices together.","Of course, Chu Fu could currently influence only Su Qiannuan. Whether Su Qiannuan would keep the sacrificial method to herself in order to increase her own strength, rather than pass it on to others, would depend on her.","There was nothing Chu Fu could do about that.","She would just have to let these humans develop on their own.","Chu Fu also had no intention of putting all her eggs in one basket.","She began exploring other planes and casually bestowed the sacrificial method there as well.","However, her divine power was limited. In the end, she could only form contracts with two divine emissaries.","Finally, she chose another world with an all-purpose shelter system—a world where people could chop down trees to build safe houses and hide from mutated beasts and other strange entities.","She gave the sacrificial method to a little girl.","As long as the girl submitted large quantities of wood and plants, she could obtain divine power.","“I hope they won’t disappoint me!”","...","Chu Fu left the divine temple.","This kind of sacrifice and reward process did not require her own involvement.","The collected toxins and wood-element energy would automatically be converted and added to her strength.","She could simply sit back and collect the profits.","No wonder everyone wanted to become a god!","And as long as she saved a small plane, she could obtain varying amounts of divine-power fragments.","That would depend on whether the two divine emissaries she had chosen were willing to work hard.","Afterward, Chu Fu returned to the game.","She began leading people to level up.","She intended to push all the players in Thorny City to Level 40.","Chu Fu simply brought along every player below Level 40 and headed to Mechanical Star to gather. Using Feng Huimin’s formation, they began sweeping through Mechanical Star.","There was no need for her clones. Her main body was more than enough.","One city after another began to be cleared.","Players starting at Level 0 reached Level 20 in a single day. It took three days to reach Level 30, and after ten days, everyone had reached Level 40.","There were simply too many players. Even when they massacred entire cities, having so many people share the experience still resulted in considerable losses.","However, once the number of players reached one million, the new version that Chu Fu had predicted finally arrived.","[System Announcement: The number of Level 40 players in Thorny City has exceeded one million. The Titan God has initiated all-out war. Thorny City will be attacked in one hour. All players above Level 40 may go to Thorny City to participate in the city defense battle!]","Chu Fu received the announcement as well and immediately returned to Thorny City.","Long Zhantian’s private message came through at the same time."]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269: Titan Siege, Reverse Invasion, The Overcrowded Thorn City","paragraphs":["“Chairwoman Chu!!! Our guess was right! I’ll organize a team immediately and head for Thorn City!”","“Come on!”","Chu Fu was excited too.","You puny Titans, prepare to die!","......","In the higher-dimensional plane.","The Titan God had been alarmed as well. After all, the deity had invested divine power into this plane and even dragged the plane under its control closer to this planet.","With a battle about to break out, the Titan God naturally had to appear.","But the deity’s expression was extremely ugly.","In truth, the Titan God had no desire to launch a siege at all, because it had already foreseen that it might lose a plane in the process.","This was a gamble, and humanity currently held the advantage.","They had lost.","‘Once we’re defeated, should I just leave immediately? The Insect Mother, the Dragon, and the Three Deep-Sea Gods may not be able to take them down. If these humans are allowed to grow, they might really be able to slaughter gods!’","The Titan God was already considering it.","As a Titan, the deity was enormous, but it was by no means stupid. Otherwise, how could it have evolved into a god?","But... there were only sixty days left until the day when divine descent would become possible.","Should it really leave?","What if they managed to turn the tables in the end?","The Titan God hesitated.","......","In the game.","Thorn City was packed with people.","“Everyone, move outside! Hurry up and make room for the people inside!”","“Move it! Get to the front of the rift ahead of time and wait there. This time, the rift is only ten kilometers away, so we won’t have far to walk.”","“Surround the rift, but don’t enter early! Go in during the ninth wave!”","Players from the Thorn Guild shouted themselves hoarse.","Ever since the cities around the world had gained the ability to teleport to one another, Thorn Town had already been overflowing with people.","It had the strongest guild and an excellent atmosphere. High-level players even brought low-level players along, so countless newcomers saved up their money just to teleport to Thorn City.","There were millions of players lining up every day, hoping to squeeze their way into Thorn City through the teleportation array.","This time, with Thorn City facing a siege, even more people had gathered.","Chu Fu had no choice but to restrict the teleportation array, setting it to close whenever the inner city reached three million people.","For this battle, Chu Fu simply shut down Thorn City’s teleportation array and continued using the Forest Spirit passages to send reinforcements from China.","Players from overseas were not needed.","Besides, most of the people coming through were actually official players. However, ordinary players had also memorized the locations of the open Forest Spirit passages and slipped in among them.","Following Thorn City as it conquered the world was simply too rewarding.","No one wanted to give that up.","But ordinary players had neither organization nor discipline, and were far more disorderly. This also led to the congestion in Thorn City.","Still, such a bustling scene was better than having no one there at all.","An hour passed quickly.","[System Notification: Titan giants are attacking! Thorn Town, prepare yourselves! The Contribution Ranking is now open. Current number of defenders: 92.83 million!]","At this moment, a vast sea of people secretly surrounded the area ten kilometers outside Thorn City.","A Titan squeezed out of the rift. It had not even steadied itself before being submerged by countless attacks and instantly killed.","Boom!","The Titan giant crashed to the ground, creating a huge crater. Several players were crushed to death beneath it.","One Titan after another emerged from the rift.","The first wave consisted of 250 Titans.","In other words, each of the four city walls would face 1,000 Titans in total.","In the previous two timelines, every Titan had been capable of dealing devastating damage to a city.","Now, none of them could even stand properly.","“Hey, people in front, move aside! I want to attack too!”","“Launch lots of flying projectiles! It’s easier to deal damage from up in the air!”","“What can this handful of Titans even do?”","[System Notification: The first wave of attacks has ended. In one hour, the Titan God will organize the second wave of attacks!]","“What? Can’t we enter immediately?”","“Hurry up! We’ve been waiting forever!”","“I wish we could charge in right now and see what the Titans inside look like!”","“These Titans are over twenty meters tall. Aren’t the ones inside going to be a hundred meters tall each?”","“We’ve fought hundred-meter-tall monsters before. Werewolf Tuge and Sequence Zero were both a hundred meters tall, and it didn’t matter. They’re just big, stupid brutes.”","Arrogant!","They were far too arrogant!","After going back in time, these humans had completely forgotten the despair that the evil gods and their races had brought them in the previous two timelines.","After all, humanity had no divine support, but it could rewind time infinitely—unless it became trapped in a dead-end timeline.","The evil gods, however, would be doomed to complete failure after losing even once.","And that was precisely the situation now.","Even the Titan giants could not stop them.","Nine hours later.","At Chu Fu’s command, countless players surged into the rifts.","All four rifts, located to the southeast, southwest, northeast, and northwest, were packed full.","Then they entered the Titans’ territory.","Titan Star.","The plants here were enormous, blotting out the sky and covering the earth. Every Titan was indeed a hundred meters tall.","What surprised everyone was that the number of Titans here was exactly the same as the number that had attacked the city in each wave.","There were 250 Origin-level Titans.","The crowd soon realized what was happening.","There were only twenty-five Origin-level Titans of each rank. Because of the nature of their abilities, when invading other planets, they used a “splitting” method rather than duplication.","Thus, a single Titan could split into ten Titans to attack Thorn City.","With twenty-five Titans of each rank, that made 250 Titans in total.","It was their first time encountering a situation where the number of Titans matched the number used in the siege. Although it was somewhat unexpected, the outcome remained unchanged.","Chu Fu immediately attacked, unleashing the Plague Calamity.","Against creatures with flesh and blood, the Plague Calamity was far more effective than the Black Death Calamity or the Soul-Annihilation Calamity.","Very soon, the Origin-level Titans collapsed one after another.","They were only Origin-level, not divine envoys, so dealing with them was naturally easy.","Furthermore, the Titans at the entrances of all four rifts were wiped out in mere dozens of seconds.","They had been killed far too quickly.","It was like a swarm of ants sweeping through the area, leaving not a single blade of grass behind.","Chu Fu and the others headed toward the center of the Titans’ territory. Before long, they encountered the leader of a Titan tribe.","Naturally, he was also a divine envoy.","“What a disappointment! A nameless divine envoy. I thought the Titan God would send one of its divine envoys to ambush us.”","Chu Fu sounded regretful, though there was also a hint of humblebragging in her tone.","“Are you sure it’s an ambush and not a delivery?”","Xie Lin grinned wickedly and severed the divine envoy’s head with a single stroke of his sword.","[System Announcement! Congratulations to the player “Who Are You Calling Blind?” for leading everyone to clear the Origin-level dungeon: Titan Tribe (Origin)! Reward: +100 to all attributes (first-clear reward), Level +1.]","They had conquered yet another dungeon.","Long Zhantian gave an order.","“We’ve obtained the coordinates. Establish a city here and activate the teleportation array!”","Now it was their turn to counter-invade the Titan giants’ planet.","At present, they had already secured counterattack locations in three planes: the Goblins, the Titan giants, and the Mechanical Star.","“Send out scouting teams and search the entire area for the Titan God’s divine envoy. Since it’s the Titan’s divine envoy, it must be enormous. There’s no way it can hide.”"]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270: Carpet Search for the Titan Envoy, Reverse Capture the Titan Star","paragraphs":["All the players shouted excitedly as they spread out in every direction.","Chu Fu was just as thrilled when she saw the planet.","There were so many plants!","And they were all enormous.","She immediately posted several missions within the guild: fell trees, gather plants, and offer them to the Temple of Nature.","The players of the Thorn Guild were naturally enthusiastic. Like lumberjacks, they began frantically harvesting trees from the Anti-Titan City they had built.","As for finding the Titans?","They could not even be bothered. They would just wait for the guild leader to pull them over!","Besides, gathering plants for Chu Fu and contributing enough would increase their attribute points.","Wasn't that the same as breaking through the restriction that only allowed them to gain attribute points by leveling up?","Submitting plants was obviously the better deal.","Unexpectedly, although this planet was inhabited by Titans, it was not very large—roughly the size of Mars.","Shen Chi dispatched one hundred thousand mechs, which located approximately ten thousand tribes. Each tribe had no more than a thousand Titans.","In other words, the entire Titan Star had a population of only about ten million Titans.","Under the flood of players descending upon them, not a single Titan survived.","Yet even after every Titan had been slaughtered, they still could not find the divine emissary.","Hundreds of millions of players searched every inch of the planet, but found nothing.","And then, at that very moment—","Fortunately, Li Weizheng played a decisive role at the critical juncture.","His talent, “Evil Radar,” could scan for enemies and followers of evil gods.","However, he was somewhat slow himself. During the first few days of searching, he found nothing. In the end, he contacted Shen Chi and used a mech to fly around the planet. That was how they finally located the Titan divine emissary.","The other party’s body was enormous, standing a full five hundred meters tall. It had disguised itself as a mountain peak and hidden within it.","Dense trees covered the outside, so it was no wonder the players had failed to notice it.","Fortunately, Li Weizheng’s Evil Radar detected a gigantic red dot, revealing the creature’s whereabouts.","Chu Fu arrived at the scene and activated the Forest Spirit Passage.","In no time, countless humans began gathering around the mountain peak.","They surrounded it from every direction, above and below, leaving nowhere to escape.","The enormous body of the Titan divine emissary finally began to tremble, sending shock waves through the earth. Trees toppled all around it.","The name above its head was exposed as well.","Titan Divine Emissary: Ju Kui.","His gigantic face displayed a pleading, terrified expression as his eyes locked onto Chu Fu.","“Queen of Humanity, could you spare me? I’m willing to sign a master-servant contract and serve you!”","“Then can you contribute your divine power?” Chu Fu asked.","Ju Kui’s face twisted into a bitter grimace. He looked terrifying even while making that expression. “That won’t do. Divine power is bestowed by the god. I have no way to extract it.”","Chu Fu let out a cold laugh. “So even if you sign a master-servant contract with me, you’ll still worship the Titan God in the end. What use would I have for someone like you? I might as well kill you and take your divine power fragment.”","Ju Kui realized that begging would not save him. His face immediately contorted with rage. He let out a roar like rolling thunder, and the sound waves alone caused the players’ health bars to drop.","He was simply too enormous, and far too powerful.","“You butchers! You lunatics! You bloodthirsty fiends! You didn’t even spare the children! You slaughtered the entire Titan race. The Titans will regard you as sworn enemies for generations!”","Chu Fu was completely unmoved.","“Get one thing straight: who exactly is the invader here? When you attacked us and captured our people, why didn’t you show them any mercy?”","“You’re pointing fingers and cursing us now only because you lost!”","“This is a war between races. If you insist on blaming someone, blame your god!”","Chu Fu had read the original novel’s plot.","In both the first and second timelines, humanity had possessed no power to fight back and had been forced to endure attack after attack.","After the game descended into reality, the Titans were the fourth faction to invade. Any one of them could destroy a city wall with ease.","Humans were nothing more than food to them.","They would tear down the walls, seize the people inside, shove them into their mouths, chew them a few times, and swallow them.","The scenes had been described in the novel with horrifying brutality.","Fortunately, Chu Fu had crossed into this world and completely changed the outcome.","“Everyone’s here, right? Attack!”","At Chu Fu’s command, the players began fighting with well-practiced efficiency.","By now, Chu Fu, Xie Lin, and Shen Chi had all become false gods. The three of them could defeat a divine emissary even in single combat.","They had brought the entire human race along purely to squeeze every last benefit from the battle.","They wanted every participating player to gain a share of the attributes and receive the blessing of divine power.","As a result, the battle was completely one-sided.","It was over in less than an hour.","This time, however, the system notification was strikingly different.","[System Announcement: Under the leadership of the player “Who Wants to Be a Plant Person,” humanity has defeated an evil god’s divine emissary and expelled the evil god’s power from the Primordial Gate. All participating players are rewarded with +100 to all attributes. This reward may stack.]","[System Announcement: Titan Divine Emissary · Giant Force has perished. The entire Titan race has been slaughtered. Humanity has achieved a Legendary-level Campaign Victory. The Titan race has withdrawn from the Primordial Gate, and all of humanity has gained one random talent from the Titan race!]","[System Notification: You have obtained the talent “Strong and Sturdy (D).”]","[System Announcement: Humanity has obtained the right to use and develop Titan Star.]","At that moment, it was not only the people present who were struck speechless by the pleasant surprise.","Countless overseas players in the game erupted in cheers as well.","“Oh my god! It was that Plant Person woman! She cleared the dungeon, and she can even grant us talents?”","“My talent is only F-rank. I thought I’d have to spend my whole life mining! With this D-rank talent, I can become a warrior!”","“Thank you, big shot! Thank you for fighting on the front lines and securing these benefits for us!”","At that moment, the entire human race celebrated.","On Titan Star, Chu Fu also received a personal notification.","[System Notification: You have obtained one Divine Power Fragment (Mythic).]","[System Notification: Esteemed Goddess of Misfortune and Goddess of Nature, you led all of humanity in occupying Titan Star and achieved a Legendary-level Campaign Victory. Because this planet is abundant in vegetation, you have received an additional reward of 10 Nature-type Divine Power Fragments (Mythic).]","This was completely unexpected.","“Hahahaha! I obtained five Earth-type Divine Power Fragments! I can become a false god too!” Proud Yet Not Spoiled shouted excitedly.","The others had gains of their own as well.","There were even more Strength-type Divine Power Fragments.","After a quick calculation, they discovered that occupying Titan Star had brought them a total of one hundred Divine Power Fragments.","Seeing this, a thought sprang into everyone’s mind.","“Does this mean that if we take Mechanical Star, we’ll be able to obtain Metal-type Divine Power Fragments?” Shen Chi analyzed.","Bitter Melon King grew excited as well. “If we occupy the Land of the Undead, will we get soul-type fragments?”","“What will we obtain if we occupy the place where the goblins live?”","“What a pity. We never got the werewolves’ planar coordinates. Even though we killed their divine emissary, we still missed out on a talent!”","Their ambitions grew wilder and wilder.","Meanwhile, the evil gods in the higher-dimensional planes trembled with fear.","They had lost.","They had truly lost."]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271: Racial Talent of Negative Status: Scavenger","paragraphs":["Truly, once you fall behind by a single step, you fall behind at every step!","The system’s notifications were clearly guiding humanity forward, one step at a time.","Killing a divine envoy was an epic-level campaign.","Capturing the opposing planet was a legendary-level campaign.","And the final step—slaying a god—would naturally be a mythical-level campaign.","They were progressing step by step toward the plotline predetermined by the Primordial Gate.","“Then let’s go. All we have to do is keep moving forward, one step at a time! First, we’ll kill the goblins, then head to the Land of Death, and finally take on Mechanical Star!”","Chu Fu declared.","At the same time, Long Zhantian found Chu Fu.","“Chairwoman Chu, although the Titan Giant has already been killed, the Analysis Bureau’s assessment is that it would be difficult for a single city to reach a population of ten million level-50 players.”","Thorn City was already enormous, but it could accommodate only three million players at most.","How could a single city possibly gather ten million level-50 players?","That meant the next “Siege Battle” might be based on statistics from the entire world.","“What does the Analysis Bureau suggest?”","Chu Fu waited for the answer.","In the original story, humanity had always been forced to take a beating.","When Brother Chu Feng appeared as the savior, he could only save a single city.","Most importantly, even if he saved that city, it might still be destroyed in the very next version.","That was why Chu Feng’s second life had still been filled with tragedy.","As for ending the version of the 5.0 Elemental Calamity ahead of schedule—","That was simply impossible.","The only way to accomplish it now was to rely on the Analysis Bureau of Flowerland.","Actually, the conclusion wasn’t difficult to reach.","Long Zhantian said, “The simplest and most straightforward goal is for the number of level-50 players worldwide to reach ten million. Based on the current situation, that won’t take very long!”","After all, Flowerland’s “God-Making Project” had created a full fifty million players.","After several campaigns, these players had reached an average level of over 40.","Following the annihilation of the Primordial Titan, the top players were already approaching level 50, with some even slightly surpassing it.","“Good. In that case, let’s continue leveling up. We were just discussing heading to the Goblin Forest to defeat the goblins and claim their territory!”","After comparing their information, the two sides decided to press their advantage and head for the Goblin Forest.","Even the level-11 Primordial Goblins still gave full experience, equivalent to that of level-50 monsters.","They were perfect targets for the players.","Chu Fu naturally went with them as well. Even though she was already level 63, she still wanted to personally oversee the operation for the nature-type fragments.","With her present, however, their efficiency was astonishingly high.","In just one week, every goblin in the Goblin Forest had been slaughtered.","[System Announcement: The Goblin race has been completely annihilated. Humanity has achieved victory in a legendary-level campaign. The Goblin race has withdrawn from the Primordial Gate. All of humanity has received one random talent from the Goblin race!]","Chu Fu looked at her new talent.","[System Notification: You have obtained the talent “Scavenger (F).”]","[Scavenger (F): You will instinctively collect junk.]","???","“Wait, why does this sound like a talent with a negative effect?”","Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled sounded utterly disgusted.","“No wonder goblins stink so much. It turns out they like collecting junk!”","“Ah! Can’t we just refuse this racial talent?”","Holy Healing Angel had no desire to collect junk.","“Huh? We really can discard it!”","Holy Healing Angel forgot the talent.","The others didn’t discard theirs. Although it was a useless talent, it was still an additional talent. Who knew—perhaps there might be a way to upgrade it in the future!","However, this wasn’t an individual talent but a racial talent, so it couldn’t be improved with Talent Enhancement Stones.","As for how it could be upgraded, the system offered no explanation.","Chu Fu didn’t pay it any attention either.","Instead, she looked at the other notification.","[System Notification: Esteemed “Goddess of Misfortune” and “Goddess of Nature,” you led all of humanity in occupying the Goblin Forest and achieved victory in a legendary-level campaign. Because the planet is covered in lush vegetation and you invested a large amount of Calamity in the occupation, you have received the additional rewards of three Mythical-grade Poison Divine Power Fragments and two Mythical-grade Nature Divine Power Fragments.]","What a poor goblin tribe.","However, Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled had obtained ten Divine Power Fragments this time—all of them Earth Divine Power Fragments. This allowed her to evolve the divine power of her demigod for the second time ahead of schedule.","Her combat power soared.","After that, Chu Fu led a group of people to the Land of Death.","While these high-level players continued working hard, countless low-level players were also struggling away in the Newbie Villages.","“Huh? There’s some grass here! I can collect it. Maybe the Plant Boss needs it?”","“Who killed this rabbit without butchering it? If nobody wants it, I’m taking it!”","“Hehe, who dropped these copper coins without picking them up? I’ll take them!”","The players began scavenging.","Before this, many players had been focused on leveling quickly and wouldn’t bother cleaning up the ground thoroughly.","Now, they were stripping the land bare. They wanted to collect anything and everything.","As their stockpiles grew, they had no choice but to return to the cities to sell the goods. This increased the time they spent traveling and reduced their monster-killing efficiency.","But every one of them had bulging wallets.","What was more, some people who had previously disliked gathering supplies now refused to let even weeds go. Whenever they saw something, they picked it up without a second thought. If they had no use for it themselves, they offered it to Chu Fu as a sacrifice.","Under these circumstances, Chu Fu’s power of nature actually began to surge, and her Spirit attribute rose rapidly.","She had never expected that the racial talent [Scavenger], now possessed by everyone, would bring her such an advantage.","Although the talent had some negative effects, increased spiritual power allowed one to restrain those impulses.","That was why most of the people scavenging were low-level players.","The high-level players continued leveling up.","Soon afterward, Chu Fu noticed that her attribute points were increasing rather quickly.","“What’s going on? Could my two divine envoys have started making progress?”","“Right, I can summon two more divine envoys now. I should go take a look!”","Chu Fu entered her divine temple state and first checked on her two divine envoys.","What she saw gave Chu Fu a pleasant surprise.","In just twenty days, Su Qiannuan had sacrificed a massive amount of zombie virus. Not only that, she had begun developing her own forces and recruiting new believers to help with the sacrifices.","Of course, it was obvious that many people didn’t believe Su Qiannuan’s claims. The name God of Calamity alone sounded frightening.","Her team, however, was carrying out sacrifices with great enthusiasm.","On the other side, the little girl from the shelter had taken the route of purchasing supplies. In this world, everyone possessed a personal trading house.","The little girl began purchasing plants and lumber in large quantities, using them as sacrifices to gain power. She also hunted animals and exchanged the meat for lumber.","For now, she showed no intention of developing believers, but she spared no expense when purchasing supplies. After all, she was doing it to increase her own strength.","The two apostles each had their own advantages.","Chu Fu explored a little further, then finally chose two new divine envoys."]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272: I chose two more divine envoys again, do I still need to pick the poison type","paragraphs":["One was on the Wasteland planet.","Because of a pollution source, every animal and plant on that planet had mutated. Almost no resources remained, and it was extremely difficult for humans to survive.","There were also large numbers of mutated beasts in the wild, making cultivation completely impossible.","Chu Fu observed the situation carefully, and a realization dawned on her.","The Wasteland planet and the Apocalypse planet had both already been completely invaded. The evil gods had won, most of the resources had been plundered, and humanity had become a weak, defeated race.","By comparison, the Shelter planet was still resisting, since its System’s trading channel remained operational.","However, the Shelter planet was simply too difficult. The tiny bit of power Chu Fu had granted could probably improve this apostle, but it would not be enough to help her clear the game.","After all, Chu Fu herself had not yet cleared the Primordial Gate.","As for the apostle she had just found on the Wasteland planet, Chu Fu granted her a wood-element skill: Rapid Plant Growth.","With it, the woman could find some seeds and survive.","And the more polluted the plants she collected were, the more poisonous they would be—which Chu Fu liked even more.","This was practically an apostle chosen by fate.","Chu Fu issued a task to her.","The girl, who had been on the verge of starving to death in the wilderness, suddenly woke up.","“The Goddess of Nature? You want me to collect these highly polluted plants so you can evolve and obtain divine power? Oh God, I’ve been chosen as an apostle?”","She forced herself up. Her body had been reddened by the sun, but she finally began cutting grass.","Regardless of the species, she cut down everything and piled it all together.","The people nearby merely thought she had gone mad when they saw her behavior.","“She must really be starving. She’s planning to eat one last full meal before the pollution tears her apart!”","“Ah, in times like these, death is a form of release.”","“Let’s go. Don’t bother with her!”","Even if the others felt pity, they would not meddle. In this era, there were far too few plants that could be eaten.","Only after everyone else had left did the woman cautiously offer the highly radioactive, polluted plants to Chu Fu as a sacrifice.","Sure enough, after the sacrifice, she immediately received boosts to her constitution and spirit, along with the Rapid Plant Growth skill.","“Thank you, Goddess of Nature! I will worship you forever and offer you more and more mutated plants.”","She burst into tears and resolved to sacrifice as many highly radioactive plants as possible to Chu Fu.","“You need to be careful, too. Your world is far too lacking in resources. It may very well become a world where people eat one another. Improve yourself first!”","Chu Fu felt that the survival rate in this world was even lower than in the apocalypse, so she deliberately comforted Apostle Number Three.","Most importantly, Chu Fu’s power was limited. Apart from the spiritual and physical boosts she received from her share of the offerings, she could only share a single skill. Her divine power was limited, and after being transmitted to that world, her influence was simply too weak.","Only one apostle remained.","Chu Fu searched for the nearest screen, but was suddenly drawn in by countless clouds of gray mist.","In this world, countless people were being driven forward by the gray mist, racing along the roads in all kinds of vehicles.","The gray mist actually gave her the feeling of a combination of the Soul-Annihilation Disaster and the Black Death Disaster.","Chu Fu’s eyes lit up instantly.","Interesting!","She quickly swept her gaze across the world and discovered that its people also had the System’s assistance. The System had opened up a road for the players, hoping they could escape from their original world.","Because the distance was simply too great and teleportation arrays could not be used, space had been extended infinitely, transforming the route into an endless road that they had to travel on their own.","They would probably need to flee for ten years before they could escape. However, the gray mist and the monsters within it were far too terrifying, so the survivors would have an extremely difficult time staying alive.","On top of that, they had to remain on the move for a long period, with no stable source of food. Their survival rate was even lower than in the apocalypse.","Chu Fu soon chose a female triathlete as Apostle Number Four.","She had only a bicycle and very few supplies, but her will was exceptionally strong.","The ability Chu Fu granted her was Poison Immunity.","Apostle Number Four was still racing forward when she received Chu Fu’s blessing. She froze for a moment, then erupted with joy.","“I’ve caught a god’s attention? Is this the God of Calamity? It wants me to reclaim the gray mist? Could this be a scam?”","“The System said that I absolutely must not enter the gray mist!”","“Who should I believe?”","“No, I can’t take the risk. What kind of good god is the God of Calamity? I absolutely cannot enter the gray mist!”","The apostle completely ignored Chu Fu and continued riding her bicycle down the road.","Chu Fu: “...”","This is bad! I chose the wrong apostle!","There was nothing Chu Fu could do. Once divine power had been sent out, it could not be taken back—just like with the other gods, who could no longer interfere after investing large numbers of monsters.","Chu Fu could only shake her head helplessly and withdraw from her divine state.","Never mind this for now. Continuing to level up was more practical.","During the time that followed, Chu Fu led the players of the Thorn Guild in sweeping through the Land of the Dead.","The Undead Reaper was already in a miserable state. Not only had he contributed two apostles, but his army of undead was also the largest in terms of numbers.","After all, when the Titans attacked, they had deployed only one thousand Origin-level Titans.","The Undead Reaper, on the other hand, had more than one hundred thousand.","Now that the Land of the Dead had been swept clean, there was no longer any possibility of a comeback.","In just over ten days, the planet where the Land of the Dead was located had been completely occupied by countless Chinese players.","[System Announcement: The entire undead race has been slaughtered. Humanity has achieved a Legendary-level Campaign Victory. The undead race has withdrawn from the Primordial Gate. All of humanity has gained one random talent from the undead race!]","[System Notification: You have obtained the talent “Undead Sight (D).”]","[Undead Sight (D): Ignores darkness and mist, allowing you to directly see wandering souls. Can distinguish between the auras of the living and the undead.]","[System Notification: Esteemed Goddess of Misfortune and Goddess of Nature, you led all of humanity in occupying the Land of the Dead and achieved victory in a Legendary-level Campaign. Although this planet is filled with deathly energy, a large amount of energy has been absorbed by the players. Due to your insufficient divine power, you have additionally been rewarded with five Mythic-grade Calamity Divine Power Fragments.]","At present, Chu Fu had used ten divine power fragments to become a Calamity demigod.","The Nature demigod had used ten nature-type fragments.","There were also two additional selectable divine power fragments remaining, obtained through System rewards and contribution-point purchases.","Three poison-type fragments from the Goblin divine power.","Two nature-type fragments from the Goblin divine power.","Five calamity-type fragments from the divine power of the Land of the Dead.","Could she piece together a new divine element again?","Should she choose the poison element and become a god of three elements?","This time, Chu Fu hesitated. She decided to ask the others what they thought.","“Help! Should I choose the poison element? I already have calamity and nature. Do I still need poison?”","Feng Huimin immediately replied, “Boss, please wait a moment. I’ll have the secretarial team prepare the most professional analysis for you.”","The chief secretary really knew how to get things done.","Shen Chi said, “Choose whatever you want. I’m not afraid of poison.”","Xie Lin sneered. “Who was asking you? Plant Girl, if it were me, I wouldn’t choose it.”"]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273: 10 Million Level 50 Players, Start the Global Catastrophe","paragraphs":["“Any thoughts, Sword God?” Shen Chi’s gaze swept toward Xie Lin, as if trying to see through his ulterior motives.","Xie Lin analyzed the situation with impressive precision. “The poison element is actually a branch of the nature element. Once mastered, it develops into the calamity element, which means both of them encompass poison.","“Finally, we have to consider our resources. At present, all we have left to fight are the divine power fragments and divine envoys from the elemental, mechanical, and future maps.","“With limited resources, rather than choosing poison, we should raise calamity and nature to Level 2 and increase our combat power.","“If our ultimate goal is to slay the gods, then naturally, the higher our divine power level, the stronger we’ll be—and the greater our chances of defeating a god.","“Three Level 1 demigod abilities might not necessarily be stronger than a single Level 2 demigod ability.”","Xie Lin had truly hit the nail on the head.","Chu Fu had actually been hesitating as well. After all, the calamity element had evolved from the poison element and was even more mysterious.","Moreover, when resources were limited, improving one element and becoming a true god was the most important thing.","Chu Fu agreed with this reasoning.","The secretary team on Feng Huimin’s side also provided a detailed analysis, including estimated calculations for the divine envoy fragments in the three future maps.","Just as everyone was enthusiastically discussing the matter, another announcement rang out.","[System Announcement: The number of Level 50 players worldwide has exceeded ten million. The Elemental God has launched an all-out war. In 24 hours, a global natural disaster will descend. All players, prepare yourselves!]","[System Announcement: Please note that players below Level 10 will be unable to survive the disaster and will die immediately. Please take precautions.]","This was effectively a death sentence for all Level 10 players and below.","Thinking of the situation in the real world, everyone felt fortunate that they had already grown powerful.","“This announcement seems to be saying that if the Elemental God’s forces descend, all players below Level 10 will probably die.”","“Not necessarily all of them. Don’t you remember those shelters built underground in the future maps? Maybe those will be the way forward.”","“There’s no need to worry about that. Perhaps by the time the game invasion truly arrives, we’ll have already driven the gods away!”","“That’s right. Prepare for battle! This is an all-out war. Every city needs to have personnel stationed there to prevent it from being wiped out.”","Chu Fu gave the order, and Feng Huimin once again began arranging the personnel roster.","Chu Fu stroked her chin as she studied the system announcement.","“A natural disaster? Does that mean earthquakes, extreme heat, and extreme cold? If those count as natural disasters, then can we...”","An idea immediately rose in her mind. She quickly communicated with Feng Huimin and issued instructions throughout the entire Thorn Guild.","This time, because they had been given twenty-four hours, they had ample time to prepare, and every player made thorough preparations.","The prices of all kinds of potions skyrocketed.","Many merchants saw a business opportunity and began hoarding goods, speculating in cold-resistant and heat-resistant medicines and equipment.","Only the Thorn Guild began mass-producing potions. The entire guild was busy mixing pills.","They put everything in the warehouse up for sale.","Of course, since everyone else had raised their prices, the Thorn Guild raised theirs as well—selling everything at double the usual price.","For a time, the Thorn Guild actually became known as a conscientious merchant.","Instead, the hoarding merchants were publicly condemned.","But those merchants and corporations did not care in the slightest.","This game was simply too profitable, and money directly translated into strength.","They had never had an opportunity before, but now that one had appeared, they had to make a huge profit. Otherwise, when would they ever have the chance to rise?","Even if it meant committing crimes, they would make money.","Chu Fu paid no attention to those people and continued making preparations.","A disaster that erupted across the entire server was the perfect opportunity to farm attribute points and earn contribution points.","Twenty-four hours passed in the blink of an eye.","Finally, as spatial rifts unfolded, monsters began to emerge.","Although the game had also been updated to Version 6.0, these monsters were all in high-level areas and had not yet attacked the main cities. The high-level players had also been active recently in the Goblin Forest and the Land of Death.","Players were not actually very familiar with the elemental spirit monsters from Version 5.0.","Now, they experienced firsthand just how terrifying these monsters were.","The first wave consisted of fire elemental spirits.","Their number: one million!","That might not sound like many, but every single one was a Level 50 monster, while the total number of Level 50 players worldwide had only reached ten million.","Distributed among the various cities, there were only about a thousand Level 50 players in each city. That meant they had to fight monsters outnumbering them by a thousand to one.","That wasn’t all.","The other players were facing monsters far beyond their level of strength.","These fire elemental spirits even possessed combination skills.","Moreover, they were all flying monsters. Once they gathered together, they formed a massive elemental domain, unleashing terrifying natural-disaster effects.","The fire elemental spirits were comparable to ten suns blazing in the sky!","The air temperature instantly soared to seventy degrees Celsius—and continued rising.","It was hot enough to roast a person alive.","Countless fire elemental spirits scorched the earth. As they gathered together, they actually formed a domain.","Orange-red clouds assembled in the sky, then descended in a rain of fire. Most terrifying of all, the ground was baked until it melted. The soil crystallized, and in the blink of an eye, the land became a sea of lava.","“Damn it, heat-resistance potions aren’t enough! We need cold-resistance potions too!”","“Are there any water mages or ice mages? Cover the ground with ice!”","“I should’ve bought mechanical wings. If I don’t fly, I’m going to be boiled alive!”","Just as everyone was screaming in panic, players bearing the words “Thorn Guild” above their heads leaped from the city walls in every city. Their feet landed directly on the lava as they arranged themselves into formations.","“Great Goddess of Misfortune, who wants to become a vegetable? I offer this natural disaster to you!”","Everyone else stared at the scene in stunned disbelief.","“Seriously? You’re this invested in the game? I’m getting secondhand embarrassment.”","“Wait, no way. We usually call your guild master a god, but you actually think you’re gods?”","“I have to hand it to you—their faith is incredible!”","These players were all low-level players. Although they knew that the game could be used to withdraw money, they had no idea how powerful the top players truly were.","Not to mention that there were at least six or seven billion players in the game, while there were fewer than ten god-level players.","The gap was simply beyond their comprehension.","The Thorn Guild players did not laugh at all.","They had to be kidding. Every day, they used this method to obtain Constitution and Spirit attributes from Chu Fu. Even if they could only exchange for one point a day, it was still a path completely beyond the understanding of other players.","And this time, they could clearly feel that something was different.","The lava flowed into the formation and was rapidly absorbed.","Even the fire elemental spirits simultaneously gained a negative status effect.","[Divine Power Absorption (Negative): Energy is being absorbed.]","All ten thousand cities across the world activated their formations, absorbing the natural disaster created by the fire elemental spirits.","In an instant, Chu Fu felt her body grow warmer.","[System Notification: You have comprehended the natural-disaster skill—Ashen Calamity.]"]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274: Natural Disasters Descend, All Taken for My Own Use","paragraphs":["Chu Fu was completely stunned.","Fragments of divine power representing calamity continued to condense around her.","As the heavenly fire disasters and magma disasters sweeping across the entire world were absorbed by Chu Fu, the number of her Calamity divine-power fragments skyrocketed tenfold.","The players defending the world also noticed something.","The fire-element monsters that had originally been so mighty had all become duds.","Before, they had been surrounded by flames, making it impossible for anyone to approach them. Now, they looked like nothing more than dim lumps of coal.","They could not even spit out the tiniest fireball.","These level-41 monsters had less combat power than level-30 skeleton soldiers.","The players immediately charged forward and hacked away at them.","The first wave of monsters was wiped out in less than half an hour.","What was most frightening was that Chu Fu had taken first place on the global leaderboard by an overwhelming margin.","Contribution: 40 billion!","Shen Chi came in second. Even with a 200,000-strong mecha corps, he had only earned 3.9 billion contribution points.","That was a tenfold difference.","Most importantly, no one had seen Chu Fu support any particular city, yet she had still obtained such a terrifying amount of contribution. Had she claimed all the elemental spirits in 1,000 cities for herself?","After all, during the first siege, there had been one million elemental spirits. The fire-element spirits were level 41 and worth 41 contribution points each.","While everyone was racking their brains trying to figure it out, the Thorn Guild had already exploded with excitement.","“Holy crap! I helped the guild leader sacrifice the disaster and extracted the monsters’ power. The system actually credited me with about half the contribution! Hahaha, I just earned 500,000 contribution points!”","“Same here, same here! If I’d tried to take them down myself, I definitely wouldn’t have gotten this much. The main problem is that there were too many people and not enough monsters—we couldn’t even compete!”","“Aren’t we getting rich from this wave?”","“When you follow the guild leader, how could you not get rich?”","“Loyal to the Thorn Guild!”","While everyone discussed the matter, Chu Fu was eating her fill.","She did not need to lift a finger.","She was earning contribution points just by lying around.","After calculating, she found that she had obtained roughly one-tenth of the contribution points for each monster.","Although she was the one extracting the monsters’ elemental power, the system classified this method as an assist.","It was similar to Little Sister Wu’s ability to lower a monster’s defense and combat power.","Furthermore, Chu Fu had not set up the formations herself, nor had she been present at the scene. Being awarded one-tenth of the contribution was already quite generous.","But the sheer number of monsters made up for it.","The players who had set up the sacrificial formations were present on-site, so they received roughly half of the contribution points. The remaining 40 percent was distributed among the players who had actually killed the monsters.","And because the monsters they faced were much weaker, the players who delivered the killing blows had also made a huge profit.","In the Thorn Guild’s management group, Chu Fu could not help but let out an excited scream.","“Everyone, we’re rich! We’re really rich! I just earned divine power equivalent to ten divine-power fragments! I even obtained a new skill!”","Chu Fu posted her new skill.","Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled: “Go! I now order you to slaughter all the evil gods!”","“Your divine sacrifice method is seriously incredible, but it seems like we can’t use it!” Suture Saint thought about it for a moment before realizing that he had no way to obtain divine-power fragments through sacrifice.","After all, Chu Fu’s method was, in essence, a form of material exchange.","Shen Chi, Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled, and Bitter Melon King could all use similar methods.","Shen Chi could have players sacrifice metal and grant them metal-element defensive power in return.","Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled could have players sacrifice soil to obtain the power of the earth, then return it to them in the form of increased constitution and defense.","Bitter Melon King, meanwhile, could have players sacrifice the power of the dead and grant them soul-based attack power.","It just so happened that this siege involved natural disasters!","This was genuine theft of the elemental gods’ divine power.","After all, if these elemental spirits died, their abilities would dissipate into the world, and their divine power would slowly return to the elemental gods.","Now, however, Chu Fu had perfectly converted it on a one-to-one basis.","[System Announcement: The first wave of global natural disasters has ended. A 24-hour repair period will now begin. It has been detected that the players possess sufficient combat power. Players may vote on whether to start the next wave of the siege ahead of schedule. This vote will apply globally.]","“Wow! The system is becoming more and more considerate!”","After seeing the notification, Chu Fu sent a private message to Long Zhantian.","“Guild Leader Long, have you obtained the coordinates of the Elemental Lands?”","Long Zhantian immediately replied, “I have! Chairwoman Chu, did you see the system notification just now? What do you think? Should we use the downtime to tackle the Primordial-tier dungeon, or should we clear it on our own?”","Clearing it on their own naturally meant activating the god-making plan once again, with only the remaining players slowly clearing it out.","Although they would lose out on a lot of attribute points, the divine power stolen from inside a Primordial-tier dungeon would still be enough to make up for it. It simply would not be announced across the world.","Chu Fu immediately made her decision.","“We’ll do it ourselves!”","“Alright! I’ll notify everyone to vote yes.”","Soon, the global vote was held, and 90 percent of the players voted to end the repair period immediately.","After all, the cities had not suffered too much damage.","Chu Fu thought about this scene from the original storyline.","The fire-element spirits had scorched the earth, and cities had been submerged in magma. Countless players had died in the battle, while priests had been escorted away in a panicked retreat, all so they could return later and resurrect the players.","But the cities had still suffered unprecedented devastation, and a massive number of NPCs had died.","Afterward, the class-advancement temples and future map teleporters had disappeared. As a result, players in many cities could no longer advance and had no choice but to travel for a long time, hoping to reach Longxiang Jiuzhou.","From that moment onward, the game officially entered an era of disaster survival.","Reality was even worse.","The game gave players advance warning.","Five years later, the elemental disasters would descend upon the real world. The first wave of extreme heat alone would kill every player below level 10.","The elderly, infants, and children would all die.","The survivors would have to build underground shelters to withstand the disaster.","But now, these disasters had become nourishment for Chu Fu.","The Calamity path was awesome!","After the global vote ended, the system issued an announcement.","[System Announcement: It has been detected that the players wish to begin the global natural disasters ahead of schedule. The second wave of disasters will descend in 10 minutes!]","[System Announcement: If the natural disasters are repelled within 24 hours, the achievement “Strike Fast, Finish Fast” can be completed.]","[Strike Fast, Finish Fast (Epic): Face the evil gods’ attack ahead of schedule during a global-scale siege. Achievement reward: All attributes +100, Morale +100.]","Morale was a special attribute.","It might seem useless, but during certain large-scale wars, a morale bonus could prevent players from becoming deserters and abandoning their homes. It could even make them grow braver the longer they fought.","This unexpected reward was quite worthwhile.","With this carrot dangling in front of them, all the cities fought even harder.","The ten minutes passed quickly.","The second wave of monsters arrived.","Dark clouds billowed overhead, followed by torrential rain.","It was as if someone were pouring water from the heavens rather than letting it fall as rain.","The cities rapidly flooded, forming enormous deluges.","Furthermore, the water spirits’ attacks were hidden within the downpour, making them impossible to see clearly.","This time, even more players were caught off guard and struck.","Only the players of the Thorn Guild were bursting with excitement.","“They’re here! They’re here again!”","“Quick, activate the formation and siphon off the water—oh, no, I mean, sacrifice the Heavenly Calamity!”"]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275: With Ten Natural Disasters in Hand, the God of Elements Is Stomping with Rage","paragraphs":["Chu Fu once again absorbed a massive wave of calamity.","[System Notification: You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Flood Calamity.]","The terrifying flood and thick clouds were completely absorbed by the formation. The water spirits floating in the air looked like clouds, but after the players bombarded them relentlessly, their withered bodies burst into countless bubbles.","The second battle was over!","[System Announcement: The second wave of global calamities has ended. The third wave of global calamities will descend in 10 minutes.]","After that, Chu Fu continued absorbing each wave one after another.","The third wave brought an extreme cold calamity.","If Chu Fu had not absorbed the flood, one could only imagine what the world would have become when faced with the extreme cold calamity.","First came the flood, then the extreme cold. The players were given no chance to survive.","The entire world was destined to freeze over.","[System Notification: You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Extreme Cold Calamity.]","Monsters resembling snowmen emerged one after another amid the blizzard, only to be chopped into pieces by the players.","The fourth wave began.","Violent winds swept across the battlefield. Players with less than 100 points in Constitution or Strength were blown straight into the air, carried away by tornadoes for who knew how many kilometers.","The winds were terrifying.","But every member of the Thorn Guild was a hardened warrior with more than ten thousand points in every attribute.","“We are willing to offer this wind calamity as a sacrifice to the God of Calamity!”","Their voices carried far even through the howling gale.","Before long, the formation lit up, and the raging winds began drilling into it bit by bit.","The gale gradually weakened.","At the same time, Chu Fu received another system notification.","[You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Hurricane Calamity.]","Another one acquired.","Next came the fifth wave. Enormous rock giants emerged from the cracks, wielding terrifying earth magic: Quicksand Transformation.","The city walls and earth beneath the players’ feet suddenly softened, turning into quicksand.","The entire city was about to be swallowed up.","However, thanks to the efforts of Chu Fu’s believers, this crisis was soon resolved as well.","During the sixth wave, tree giant monsters appeared. The grass in the city instantly grew into towering trees, their branches whipping at the players.","The seventh wave brought forth lumps of metal with extremely high defense, along with an ultra-high-gravity magnetic field.","During the eighth wave, clouds once again appeared in the sky, followed by countless bolts of lightning crashing down.","Disaster after disaster appeared, only to be offered up as sacrifices.","On Chu Fu’s side, the skills were practically flooding her screen.","[You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Quicksand Calamity.]","[You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Wildwood Calamity.]","[You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Gravity Calamity.]","[You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Thunderstorm Calamity.]","Soon, the ninth wave of monsters arrived.","The sky went dark.","It seemed as if night had fallen in an instant, plunging everything into pitch-black darkness.","Before this, if the people of the world had been trapped in such darkness, they would certainly have been filled with despair.","They would have been unable to perceive their surroundings, much less find resources. Even obtaining food would have been a problem.","But now, they had gained a racial talent from the undead race.","Undead Vision.","They could see everything within the darkness.","Several tall, shadowy dark elemental elves appeared, each wielding a curved black blade shaped like a crescent moon. They slashed toward the players’ necks.","The next moment, light exploded.","“Heh heh, I pretended to be an idiot and baited you into making a move. And you actually fell for it!”","“Kill!!!”","The players launched their counterattack.","The members of the Thorn Guild also began setting up the formation. By this point, it was not just them—some of the other players had figured out what was going on as well and began imitating them.","“Great Thorn Queen, great God of Calamity, who wants to become a vegetable, my lord? Please accept the calamities we offer as sacrifices! I sincerely believe in you! You are truly humanity’s greatest god!”","They showered her with shameless flattery.","Earlier, they had laughed at those people for becoming so obsessed with the game that they treated a player as a god.","Now they realized that they were the real clowns.","They joined in as well.","And it felt fantastic.","More and more people began offering sacrifices.","The darkness was gradually absorbed by the formation.","...","Above Thorn City.","Chu Fu comprehended a new skill.","[You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Endless Night Calamity.]","At that moment, Chu Fu had gathered one hundred fragments of divine power from the Calamity element.","[Your false-god level has reached Level 10. You have become a true god.]","Ten fragments of divine power were required to become a false god.","Every additional ten fragments increased her level by one.","This time, the global calamities had raised Chu Fu’s level by a full nine levels.","An incredible profit!","Opportunities like this were extremely rare.","And soon, another ten fragments of divine power would be waiting for Chu Fu.","Before long—","With the players giving it everything they had,","the ninth wave ended.","At this time, quite a few overseas players began growing restless.","“Is China about to enter the rift? Let’s follow them in and get a share of the rewards!”","“My talent is still only E-rank. I need this opportunity! Please give me a chance!”","“Why haven’t we seen anyone from China?”","“They’re not fighting this time?”","“Maybe the monsters this time are too powerful. After all, the highest level is already 60. The Origin-level monsters must be even stronger!”","“I can’t believe even China got scared!”","When the members of the Thorn Guild saw the faces of those overseas players, they merely sneered.","Scared?","They simply had no intention of bringing those people along. Soon, only their own people would be allowed inside.","They would see how anxious those overseas players became then.","Before long, the tenth wave of monsters arrived.","Huge babies with pure white wings appeared one after another.","These babies radiated holy light so dazzling that the players could not look directly at them. The moment they opened their eyes, tears began streaming down their faces.","That was not all. Their skin also began to sting faintly.","At first, the pain was not very strong, but soon their skin became swollen and red.","Large patches of burns appeared across their bodies. Their skin blackened and reddened, and some even developed skin cancer.","The damage appeared mild, but in reality it seeped into every possible weakness, making it nearly impossible for the players to resist.","However, the members of the Thorn Guild could activate the formation with their eyes closed by now.","The formation appeared, and another sacrifice was offered.","On Chu Fu’s side, she received new divine power from the calamity.","[You have comprehended the Calamity Skill: Radiance Calamity.]","The power of the calamity was gradually absorbed by Chu Fu. The monsters lost their radiance, and the players could finally open their eyes.","They immediately took their revenge, hacking every monster to death.","At last—","In less than seven hours,","the global disaster had come to a complete end.","...","On the higher-dimensional plane,","only seven evil gods remained.","The Wolf God, Goblin God, and Titan God had already withdrawn.","An evil god that resembled a peacock, with the ten elements of metal, wood, water, fire, earth, wind, thunder, ice, light, and darkness burning across its tail, ground its teeth in fury.","“My divine power was stolen. I lost everything!”","The Undead Reaper did not comfort it. Instead, the ghost flames in its eyes flickered wildly, revealing a hint of schadenfreude.","“Then, when the divine descent arrives, we’ll simply take back everything we lost!”","It was unwilling to accept this outcome. It intended to remain here and personally descend as a god to kill Chu Fu.","Once it killed her, it would flee immediately. It would not give the primordial humans any chance to capture it!"]},{"number":276,"title":"Chapter 276: Some Know-It-All Held Back All of Humanity's Development, and Bro Got Pushed Out of the Top Three","paragraphs":["Even the Elemental God was persuaded.","The losses had simply been too great. At this point, He was like a gambler who had lost his entire fortune and wanted to win back everything that belonged to Him at the gaming table.","He gritted His teeth, His voice filled with barely restrained fury. “Fine. I’ll join forces with you. I refuse to believe we can’t kill her.","“When the time comes, I want all the divine power that belongs to me back.","“As for the rest of the divine power, we’ll split it evenly.”","Before Chu Fu had even been killed, the two evil gods had already begun discussing how to divide the divine power within her.","“Agreed.”","The Undead Reaper readily accepted.","The Undead Reaper had lost roughly twenty fragments of divine power, but He knew that Chu Fu must also have received divine power fragments as a reward from the Primordial Gate.","He simply had no idea how many.","As evil gods, the Undead Reaper and the others could not know what rewards the system had given the players.","Unless one of the players happened to be their follower and could report the information to them.","The problem was that neither He nor the Elemental God had any followers left.","And that idiot Elemental God had actually been robbed of a full one hundred divine power fragments. The strength of Who Wants to Be a Vegetable? had already risen to the level of a True God.","Although he was not strong enough to stand as their equal, he was still someone they could not afford to underestimate.","Bringing the Elemental God along would give them a better chance.","That way, when the Human God arrived with reinforcements from the Primordial Gate, they would also have someone to use as a shield.","As for who would ultimately get those one hundred divine power fragments, that would depend on their own abilities.","...","In the game, as the final Light Elemental Spirit was slain, a series of system announcements rang out.","[Global Announcement: The Elemental God’s invasion of this plane has ended. The human players are victorious.]","[Global Announcement: The global catastrophe has ended. All players worldwide have obtained the “Swift Victory (Epic)” achievement. All attributes +100. Morale +100.]","[Global Announcement: Buildings in major cities suffered varying degrees of damage during the catastrophe. Players, please work hard to rebuild your homes.]","Although members of the Thorn Guild had begun making sacrifices during this disaster siege, every city had inevitably suffered some damage.","Unless a city had an exceptionally powerful protective barrier or highly leveled walls and buildings, it was very likely to be flattened by the catastrophe.","Fortunately, although the cities had sustained some damage, none of them had been completely destroyed.","There would likely be plenty of quests for players to complete afterward.","However, everyone at the scene was somewhat puzzled.","Jiao Jiao was the first to speak up. “What’s going on? Was there no ‘Not a Single City Lost’ achievement this time? Or can we only obtain that achievement once?”","“The system never shortchanges its players. This requirement was so difficult to fulfill that surely it should have given us a reward for a perfect defense, right?” Chu Fu was puzzled as well.","The Flower-Growing Kingdom had sent people to assist at nearly every server—while also claiming the contribution points. How could any city possibly have fallen?","“Maybe a city was damaged somewhere we don’t know about. Wait a moment. I’ll ask around for information.”","Feng Huimin immediately contacted the spies stationed around the world.","The information quickly reached Feng Huimin, leaving her completely speechless.","“We found out what happened. It was a large guild in the Prairie Province. They exchanged for a City-Building Token and established a city. Since that city wasn’t part of the system’s servers, we didn’t send anyone to support it.”","“They even shut down the teleportation array because they wanted to claim the reward for themselves.","“Who would have thought that such a large guild wouldn’t be able to hold out against this disaster siege?”","Everyone present was rendered speechless!","An increase of one point to every attribute might not seem like much.","But it would benefit not only veteran players. New players would gain the increase as well.","Looking at the bigger picture, countless future players—and even human babies—would eventually receive one extra point in every attribute.","This was an improvement to the overall quality of the entire human race.","Combined with the effect of the previous “Not a Single City Lost” achievement, newly arrived players would now be able to start the game with two extra points in every attribute.","At present, the only people who had yet to join the game were the elderly, the disabled, patients on the verge of death, and children.","With those two extra attribute points, they would have a much easier time getting started in the game.","That guild had truly dragged down all of humanity.","Besides, how many opportunities would humanity have to resist a global disaster together?","Chu Fu didn’t even need to imagine how the players of that guild were being cursed at on the forums.","“All right, all right. Let’s check the contribution rankings first.”","Chu Fu opened the contribution leaderboard.","[First Place: Who Wants to Be a Vegetable? Contribution: 405.2 billion]","[Second Place: Rocket on a Wheelchair. Contribution: 50.2 billion]","[Third Place: Who You Calling Blind. Contribution: 20.5 billion]","[Fourth Place: Lu Xing. Contribution: 17.9 billion]","[Fifth Place: Shafu Liangu. Contribution: 16.5 billion]","[Sixth Place: Long Zhantian. Contribution: 15.1 billion]","[Seventh Place: Suture Saint. Contribution: 14.8 billion]","[Eighth Place: Jiao Jiao. Contribution: 4.5 billion]","[Ninth Place: No Talking in Class. Contribution: 14.3 billion]","[Tenth Place: Zhimengzhe. Contribution: 14.1 billion]","The top ten were still completely dominated by players from the Flower-Growing Kingdom. Eight of them were core members of the Thorn Guild.","Compared with last time, however, the Holy Healing Angel and the Bitter Melon King had dropped out of the rankings.","After all, their appearances on the previous leaderboard had absolutely benefited from their advantage against the undead army.","This time, they had not enjoyed such a significant advantage when fighting the elemental spirits.","By contrast, the independent player No Talking in Class had gained a tremendous advantage.","And Zhimengzhe had made it onto the leaderboard as well.","Chu Fu was surprised. “Wow, Dreamweaver, your contribution is really high this time!”","Zhimengzhe’s face flushed bright red from the praise, but she still said in a soft voice tinged with pride, “My level-60 skill has a Dreamscape Domain that can make enemies attack one another! Killing them still counts as my contribution. I just traveled to a few more cities, and that’s how I got so many contribution points.”","“That’s amazing, Dreamweaver. You’re finally making a name for yourself!”","“Ah, it’s nothing special! Stop praising me. Your contribution is the truly outrageous one.”","Indeed, who wouldn’t be shocked after seeing Chu Fu’s contribution?","Just how many hands did she have?","How else could she have claimed so many contribution points?","Chu Fu: Ha-ha, I don’t have that many hands. I just have quite a few people working under me.","Her reputation was what had allowed her to rack up so many contribution points.","It was all thanks to her fame.","She also did not hesitate to share her experience of becoming a god with everyone.","That way, if they encountered situations suited to them in the future, they could use the same methods.","Shen Chi pondered this. He could have the players sacrifice the corpses of all the mechanical monsters on the Mechanical Star!","The others also began discussing how to develop followers and what types of abilities they should have their followers collect.","Chu Fu, meanwhile, looked at the system’s rewards.","[System Notification: Player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?”, you ranked first in contribution during this global city defense event, the Elemental Catastrophe. Contribution: 405.2 billion.","You have received: Divine Power Fragment ×3, Super-God-Tier Talent Enhancement Stone ×3, Epic Treasure Chest ×1.]","There was no double reward. That was a significant loss.","However, her contribution this time was still enormous. Although her contribution during the Undead Catastrophe had reached thirty trillion, that was because there had been far more monsters, resulting in a much higher total contribution.","And this time, the 405.2 billion was even more valuable!","Surely the System Shop wouldn’t shortchange Chu Fu.","As expected, godhood fragments, transcendent god-tier talent enhancement stones, transcendent god-tier skill enhancement stones, and the like required only 10 billion to exchange.","Suddenly, Chu Fu thought of something and glanced over at the rankings.","OMG—what a shock! How did Big Brother get pushed out of the top three?"]},{"number":277,"title":"Chapter 277: Sister Will Support You, Flying Floating City","paragraphs":["Chu Fu glanced around, but naturally, she didn’t see her brother anywhere.","Little Mother Hen is here!","Chu Fu opened the private chat and sent him a message: “Cluck cluck cluck cluck. Where are you? How much Contribution do you still need? I have some extra on hand!”","After a busy day, Chu Feng saw the message Chu Fu had deliberately sent him and couldn’t help laughing.","This time, he hadn’t made the rankings. His Assassin class didn’t have any large-scale area-of-effect attacks, and that had cost him.","As a result, he hadn’t obtained a Divine Power Fragment.","But it didn’t matter. Divine Power Fragments could be obtained by killing divine envoys. He believed there would be other opportunities in the future.","“No need for you to give me any. I can just buy them directly! Keep yours and sell them for money!” Chu Feng didn’t want to take anything from Chu Fu. He had been the one taking care of her ever since they were children. When had he ever needed his little sister to take care of him?","“Now I’m angry, Brother! Do you even consider me family? What’s yours and what’s mine? You even bought me half a manor! And the equipment too—all of it was obtained through your hard work.","“You can’t be the only one making sacrifices while I’m not allowed to contribute or make something of myself. Don’t I want to give my brother something too?”","Chu Feng knew these were all excuses his little sister had come up with.","But she was also sincere.","Fine. He admitted that his little sister was better at gaming than he was. There was nothing wrong with that.","It was just a little irritating that those guys secretly in love with his sister were actually slightly stronger than he was. That really stung.","He was genuinely afraid that some blond punk would sweep his sister away.","But his sister really was impressive. She had carved out a path completely different from the game’s usual progression—a path Chu Feng had never imagined before.","The power of the masses.","Sacrifice to become a god.","As for him, a lone wolf, his path was growing narrower and narrower.","So, had he been reborn in order to save his little sister?","“All right, all right. Then I’ll leech off my little sister!”","“Haha, then I’ll wait for you at the City Lord’s Residence.”","Afterward, Chu Feng returned to Thorn City.","Now that the global disaster was over, Thorn City was packed with people once again. Fortunately, Chu Feng held an official position in the city and could return directly without waiting in line.","He also had access to Chu Fu’s City Lord’s Residence. When he returned there, he found that everyone happened to be present, busy exchanging items and discussing the direction of their future skill development.","With a grand wave of her hand, Chu Fu gave half of her Contribution to Chu Feng and told him to exchange it for whatever he wanted.","The others were also trading resources among themselves.","This round of exchanges would produce another batch of False Gods.","They also discussed where they would level up next.","At present, Chu Fu had reached Level 67 and was only a little short of Level 70.","Feng Huimin pushed up her glasses and began reporting to Chu Fu.","“Boss, Guild Leader Long has sent word as well. He’s invited us to explore the Elemental Land together.”","“Considering that the sixth wave of global disasters may require one hundred million Level 60 players to trigger ahead of schedule, Guild Leader Long has decided not to open the Elemental Land to the public. We’ll clear it with our own people.","“I suggest that all the players from Thorn Workshop go to Elemental City together instead of competing with ordinary players for the Mechanical Star.","“Of course, if Mechanical Boss also wants to follow the sacrifice route now, it may delay him somewhat.”","Shen Chi said, “That’s fine. I can open up quests and let other players help with the sacrifices, not to mention the assistance we’ll get from the clones.","“Besides, players used to think only about selling mechanical corpses for money. After seeing Plant Girl’s defense of the city this time, I believe many of them will be willing to make sacrifices in exchange for attribute points.”","Feng Huimin quickly said, “I’ll have someone spread the word!”","Seeing that everyone had made their arrangements, Chu Fu immediately gave the order. “All right! Let’s head to the Elemental Land now! Squeeze every last bit of value out of them and take down the divine envoy!”","With Chu Fu’s command, the entire Thorn Guild mobilized.","The Thorn Guild now had millions of players, and they all headed toward Dragon City.","Chu Fu also met up with Long Zhantian.","Standing beside Long Zhantian was a familiar face.","It was none other than No Talking in Class.","The name of a guild affiliated with Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces appeared above his head, clearly showing that he had joined the official faction.","“This time, the Demon-Sealing Knight will lead the expedition into the dungeon. Without your sacrifice method, it would have been extremely difficult to withstand this wave of disasters, so it’s better to be cautious.”","Chu Fu nodded.","“Send in the clones first!”","“Let’s do it!”","A large number of clones were then created.","This time, the spatial rift opened directly above the headquarters of Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces. A spatial defensive barrier had also been activated, preventing any players not authorized by the guild from entering.","Long Zhantian arranged for people to enter in batches, with Chu Fu’s Thorn Guild naturally being among the first.","Soon, roughly four million players entered the rift.","Chu Fu had now reached the True God level and had further enhanced both her talents and skills. Even her clones were frighteningly powerful.","After all, sacrificing the disasters had given Chu Fu far more than just one skill.","It had also granted her attributes!","With each wave of sacrifices, Chu Fu could increase her Spirit and Constitution by at least ten points. Ten waves would mean one hundred points, and with ten thousand cities...","A million attribute points had all fallen into Chu Fu’s hands alone.","The result was astonishing.","Even at only one-tenth of her full strength, Chu Fu was already a formidable player with more than ten thousand points in both Constitution and Spirit.","With the enhancement of her various skills, Chu Fu’s current strength was in no way inferior to that of a False God.","Led by Feng Huimin, with the clone of No Talking in Class at the vanguard, a large number of clones quickly entered the Origin-level dungeon: the Elemental Land.","The moment they entered, everyone was stunned by the world before them.","The Elemental Land was truly made entirely of elements.","Hurricanes filled the air. Beneath their feet was either lava or quicksand. Even the trees did not grow from the ground; they grew automatically in midair.","Everyone who had come was a Level 60 player, and every one of them could fly. Even so, they felt as if there was nowhere to set foot.","Humans needed solid ground beneath them.","“Nullify Magic!”","No Talking in Class immediately activated his skill, bringing all the elements to a halt.","The surrounding Origin-level monsters noticed them and prepared to attack, but once their magic was nullified, they lost control over the elements.","The players struck one after another, killing the surrounding elementals.","But even so, the area was still being battered by violent winds, and there was nowhere to stand beneath them.","Shen Chi quickly came up with a solution.","“Build a Sky City. We’ll move and fight from there!”","For Shen Chi, who had already become a god, this was not difficult.","He only needed a massive amount of materials.","And materials were the one thing Shen Chi had in abundance.","Long Zhantian also opened up Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces’ inventory.","With the two sides working together, they built a floating city in the Elemental Land.","Shen Chi constructed the city, and it was eventually named Flying City.","Afterward, Long Zhantian had the spatial mages build an interworld teleportation array within Flying City.","The official faction’s technology had undeniably improved once again.","This way, they no longer needed to keep the spatial rift open and waste resources.","While Chu Fu led her people in sweeping through the Elemental Land, the game forums were abuzz.","The discussions had started with summaries of the global disaster, then shifted to criticism of the guilds that had held everyone back. In the end, however, the hottest topic had become a battle over the faith of the gods.","[Brothers, sacrificing disasters doesn’t mean there’ll be disasters every time. Trust me—go hunt monsters on Mechanical Star and sacrifice them to the Mechanical God!]"]},{"number":278,"title":"Chapter 278: The Battle for Divine Faith: The Mechanical Race Collapses Without Attack","paragraphs":["[Who says you can only offer disasters to the Plant Master? You can offer plants and toxins too!]","[Actually, it’s better to make offerings to Queen Jiaojiao. All she needs is dirt. I dig for ore every day, offer the stones to Queen Jiaojiao, and she gives me gold coins directly.]","[Queen Jiaojiao is definitely the most practical!]","[Is the person above an idiot? Gold coins are the least valuable thing. Attribute points are the true way to go!]","[The big shots in this game have such absurd stats that newcomers will never catch up. It’ll go under sooner or later, and you’re still willing to work like oxen for them?]","[666. If you still think this is just a game, then you’ve already gotten your money’s worth out of this life.]","The argument had begun.","As the thread grew more heated, its popularity naturally soared as well.","On the surface, it seemed as though several people were fighting over the Divine War, but in reality, it was all a form of publicity.","Chu Fu even suspected that the whole thing had been orchestrated by Feng Huimin, but she couldn’t tell which accounts were paid shills.","Fortunately, Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Jiaojiao were friends.","If they had been unrelated deities, they might have actually fought over their followers.","This was no joke. There were only so many followers. If someone went logging today, they couldn’t go mining as well.","That was why so many deities fought over followers and divine authority.","As the thread continued to spread, everyone gradually discovered that the materials being offered to them were increasing in number. They could improve their strength simply by lying around and doing nothing.","Sure enough, there was strength in numbers.","There were ten billion people across the globe. Even if only half of them were playing the game, and only one percent of those players worked for them, the rate of growth would still be terrifying.","...","At the same time.","Within the Land of Elements.","After Feichi City was built, the players finally had a place to settle down. One after another, they teleported there, their main bodies following soon after.","Only their main bodies could receive experience.","A single mechanical city could not accommodate too many players, so Shen Chi established Feichi City No. 1 through Feichi City No. 30.","Each city held roughly 3.3 million players, for a total of one hundred million.","Half of them were players involved in the “God-Making Project.”","The other half consisted of newly recruited players who had been carefully selected for their high aptitude and attributes.","They leveled up here in secret.","Players from outside also went to the Mechanical Star to hunt monsters.","However, Origin-level monsters did not respawn.","The monsters on the Mechanical Star grew fewer and fewer until they were eventually wiped out completely.","[System Announcement: The entire Mechanical race has been slaughtered. Humanity has achieved a Legendary-tier victory in the campaign. The Mechanical race has withdrawn from the Primordial Gate. All human players have acquired one random talent from the Mechanical race!]","[System Notification: You have obtained the talent Mechanical Mastery (D).]","What a great talent!","This talent had no class restrictions whatsoever. Whether someone was a magic-based or physical-class player, they could use it.","When a player awakened a terrible talent, they could at least become a gunslinger.","It was a boon for all humanity.","However, after losing the Mechanical Star, the major monster-spawning area, the players began returning to the cities and exploring the wilderness from there.","The farther they traveled from the cities, the higher the monsters’ levels became.","Moreover, these monsters were merely projections. Their strength was weak, but the experience they gave was pitifully low.","At this rate, raising one level would take months.","How could players who had already fought Origin-level monsters tolerate that?","Especially when they saw that the rankings were filled with players from China, they were consumed by jealousy.","But China would not allow them to enter the Land of Elements.","After all, resources were limited.","A single Land of Elements could support one hundred million players as they leveled to Level 60. That was already its absolute limit.","What no one expected was that the system would make its move first—and that it would be completely different from what China had predicted.","[System Announcement: The number of Level 60 players worldwide has exceeded one million. The Mechanical God has launched an all-out war. In twenty-four hours, a global calamity will descend. All mechanical units will be corrupted and attack players. Everyone, prepare yourselves!]","Then, as if the system had momentarily malfunctioned, a series of announcements suddenly followed.","[System Announcement: The Mechanical God has detected that the invasion of the Primordial Gate has failed. Humanity’s players have achieved a resounding victory!]","[System Announcement: The levels of all players worldwide have increased by 1.]","[System Announcement: Congratulations to all players worldwide for achieving the achievement “Not a Single City Lost.”]","[System Announcement: Congratulations to all players worldwide for achieving the achievement “Blitz Victory.”]","[System Announcement: Congratulations to all players worldwide for achieving the achievement “Pioneer of the Counterattack.”]","The players had already obtained the first two achievements before.","But the final achievement was new.","[Pioneer of the Counterattack (Legendary-tier Achievement): Destroy an invading force poised to attack the Primordial Gate before the evil god can organize an assault.","All attributes +1,000. Attack power +20%.]","The entire world erupted in celebration.","Chu Fu and the others received the news in the Land of Elements as well. After connecting the dots, they quickly understood what had happened.","“We were wrong. The next wave of attacks won’t require one hundred million Level 60 players. The number will be much smaller.","“The farther the game progresses, the stronger the high-level monsters become. Players without sufficient talents or strength won’t have the ability to advance. Many class advancement quests will be impossible for them to complete.","“If this wave required one hundred million players to reach Level 60, how many players would there be at Levels 70, 80, and 90?","“That means the number of high-level players will only continue to shrink. But one person can command an entire army—one person can save an entire city!","“The trigger for the next global disaster will probably be one hundred thousand Level 70 players!”","At present, Chu Feng was still ranked first on the leaderboard, at Level 73.","Players in the first tier, such as Chu Fu and the others, had just reached Level 70.","There were no more than a hundred of them.","And the farther they advanced, the harder it became to level up.","Xie Lin raised an eyebrow. “If we rely solely on the Land of Elements to level up, then we’ll have to reduce the number of players inside.”","Chu Fu understood as well, but who should be removed? That was not an easy question.","In terms of strength and level, the players from their Thorn Guild alone could easily provide one hundred thousand candidates.","However, the official organization had a much larger player base. In fact, ninety-nine percent of the one hundred million players belonged to the official side.","Even if the available one hundred thousand slots were split evenly, the officials would still be at a disadvantage.","Chu Fu frowned, then relaxed.","There was no need to overthink it.","They might as well use the most direct method.","This time, Chu Fu herself contacted Long Zhantian.","“Guild Leader Long, continuously exploring the game’s progression is about finding a path to survival for all of humanity. It’s about ensuring that, when the game descends into reality in the future, there will be people capable of standing at the very front.","“So I suggest that, for this selection, we choose the strongest one hundred thousand players without showing any favoritism.","“Everyone should submit their full character panels for big-data simulation.","“Everything must be included down to the last attribute point: talents, skills, equipment, and everything else.","“I know that the players in our Thorn Guild have slightly higher attributes than other players.","“But across China, every starting village is bound to have at least one S-rank class holder, and perhaps even an SS-rank class holder.","“After being nourished by divine power, these people will awaken even stronger talents—their second talents, their third talents.","“In that regard, our Thorn Guild may not have an advantage.","“That’s why a major selection like this will be fair to everyone.","“The selection must be conducted openly, impartially, and transparently. That is the most appropriate approach!”"]},{"number":279,"title":"Chapter 279: Nationwide Great Screening, 100,000 God Slayers","paragraphs":["Over at Long Zhantian’s side, the discussion was indeed heated.","But after hearing what Chu Fu had said, he suddenly felt a sense of relief.","Chu Fu had a broad perspective.","Even he had a bit of selfishness at this moment, hoping to let more players from the Dragon Soaring Across the Nine Provinces guild stay.","But Chu Fu was right.","She wasn’t speaking from her own standpoint.","She was speaking from the standpoint of China—and of all humanity.","She was absolutely right. The Thorn Guild’s players had an advantage in terms of attributes, but when it came to talents, there were plenty of players across the country whose foundations were already at the SS rank or higher.","Everyone had their own strengths.","Who could become one of the 100,000 chosen players would depend entirely on ability.","“Very well. I agree with Chairwoman Chu’s proposal. Have the Analysis Bureau establish a database and conduct a thorough statistical review.”","Seeing that Long Zhantian agreed, Chu Fu continued, “We should also set an entry threshold. Otherwise, the Analysis Bureau won’t be able to handle the workload!”","This was a massive screening process involving 100 million people.","Long Zhantian nodded with a smile and immediately issued the order.","The Analysis Bureau soon established an official website, using gameplay videos to verify each player’s strength.","Before long, an announcement was posted on the site.","【The nationwide “God-Slaying Plan” has officially begun. The God-Slaying Legion is recruiting elite players.","Screening requirements:","Base attributes of more than 20,000 in every category.","A talent above the SSS rank.","Possession of a second talent or second class.","Equipment no lower than Level 60 Diamond-grade gear.","Players who meet the above requirements may submit their applications using official data.","Registration closes in 24 hours.","Rankings will be updated in real time.】","The moment overseas players saw the announcement, they exploded.","“Twenty thousand? In every attribute? I’d just started feeling invincible after earning an achievement, and now you’re telling me that you need at least 20,000 in every attribute to slay a god?”","“Oh my God! Are we really playing the same game?”","“They have to be bluffing. There’s no way. Absolutely no way!”","But it didn’t take long for the official ranking list to appear.","A large number of players from the Thorn Guild surged onto the rankings.","Requiring more than 20,000 in every attribute had already eliminated roughly half of the 100 million players.","Only those who had participated in the first wave of the “God-Making Plan” possessed attributes exceeding 10,000, and they had continued gaining more attributes afterward.","Even so, there was still a considerable gap.","The only way to make up for that gap was through talents and classes that could break through the game’s attribute limits.","In other words, their talents had to increase their attributes.","Moreover, among these people were believers of Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Jiaojiao Bu Jiao.","They could gain attributes by offering items as sacrifices.","Only through such methods could they barely meet the requirements.","After this round of screening, the players of China revealed results that left the entire world speechless.","Everyone had SSS-rank talents.","Their second talents were also SSS-rank.","Before long, players with third talents began to appear as well.","There were even players with unique god-tier classes.","Having a unique god-tier class alone would have been astonishing enough, yet some of them even possessed a second class.","Were these people insane?","No wonder they wanted to slay gods!","At the same time, players who had failed to make the rankings began frantically improving themselves, desperately trying to get on the list.","The competition was fierce.","With ten minutes remaining before the deadline, the player ranked 100,000th stared fixedly at the leaderboard.","“I should be safe now, right? Surely no one else can overtake me?”","Just as he was thinking this, the leaderboard refreshed.","He instantly vanished from the list.","“Who was it?”","He hurriedly looked toward the player currently ranked 100,000th.","But ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌​‍in the next moment, the name in 100,000th place changed again.","He had been pushed down once more.","Just then, an astonished shout came from one of his friends.","“Holy crap! Look at the leaderboard! Those attributes are terrifying!”","Everyone looked toward the player in first place.","【Who Are You Calling Blind?","Class: God-tier class.","Talents: SSS-rank ×3.","Attributes: Constitution 180,000; Agility 1,280,000; Strength 1,190,000; Spirit 360,000.】","For the sake of confidentiality, players’ talents and classes were displayed only by rank, not by their specific names.","Even so, these numbers were enough to shock everyone.","Xie Lin’s third talent was One with the Sword.","Whatever attributes the swords he controlled possessed, he possessed as well.","His second talent, Myriad Swords Return to the Origin, allowed him to control ten thousand swords.","Xie Lin was the poorest member of the Thorn Guild’s management team, because he had spent all his money forging weapons. All ten thousand swords were Diamond-grade, and sword-type weapons generally increased Agility and Strength.","His Spirit attribute was also far from low, naturally because of the boost from his first talent.","These attributes were simply terrifying.","“Wait—the person in first place has changed again.”","【Rocket on a Wheelchair","Class: God-tier class ×2.","Talents: SSS-rank ×3.","Attributes: Constitution 890,000; Agility 920,000; Strength 960,000; Spirit 40,000.】","Shen Chi’s total attributes were 200,000 lower than Xie Lin’s, but he had one additional god-tier class.","No one was surprised by this.","They had always believed that Shen Chi was somewhat stronger.","What surprised them instead was Xie Lin’s strength.","Now, they began looking forward to seeing someone even more powerful.","That person was, naturally, the player known as Who Wants to Be a Vegetable.","The leaderboard soon refreshed again.","【Who Wants to Be a Vegetable","Class: God-tier class ×2.","Talents: Z-rank ×3.","Attributes: Constitution 1,420,000; Agility 100,000; Strength 100,000; Spirit 1,800,000.】","What rank was Z?","How could there be such a special rank?","While the players were still stunned and bewildered, the leaderboard refreshed once again.","They couldn’t believe it.","There was still another expert?","Soon, a name appeared—one that was practically a nightmare to every overseas player who had made it to the future map.","【Lu Xing","Class: God-tier class ×2.","Talents: Z-rank ×1, SSS-rank ×9,","SS-rank ×7, S-rank ×5, A-rank and below.","Attributes: Constitution 1,010,000; Agility 1,030,000; Strength 1,070,000; Spirit 1,000,000.】","Many people rubbed their eyes.","They stared at the screen in disbelief.","“These talents... Is this even right? Something’s wrong here, isn’t it?”","Inside the Thorn Guild, however, Chu Fu wasn’t surprised in the slightest.","She knew that her brother’s talent was Plunder.","He could plunder the talents of any monster.","When he plundered the same talent again, that talent would advance to a higher rank.","The Origin-level dungeons allowed him to plunder divine power as well, which naturally caused his talents to increase without limit.","However, none of these talents were summoning-type talents, and they could not create infinite clones.","That was why her brother, Chu Feng, had been pushed out of the top three during the “Disaster Version.”","Chu Fu had always known that the strongest person in this world would definitely be Chu Feng.","After all, he was the protagonist.","At last, the leaderboard closed.","Those who had been pushed off the list could only lament their bad luck, feeling as though they had missed out on a heaven-defying opportunity.","Meanwhile, the players who had made the rankings cheered wildly.","But immediately afterward, a sense of urgency settled over them.","Every player on the leaderboard received an official email.","The first thing included was the familiar confidentiality agreement.","Next came the news that although the 100,000 players selected through the screening would be raised to Level 70 in the future, only the top 10,000 players would continue receiving China’s support and further improvements.","In simple terms, this leaderboard was an elimination system.","Whoever is stronger stays."]},{"number":280,"title":"Chapter 280: Countdown 30 Days Until the Game Descends Upon Reality","paragraphs":["This time, 100,000 players had been selected.","Next time, only 10,000 would remain.","The competition was fierce.","Those who slacked off and failed to improve themselves would be eliminated, unable to keep pace with the players on the front line.","So, as soon as the rankings were released, they were more eager than anyone else to go out and hunt monsters, leveling up as quickly as possible.","At ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌​‍the same time, Long Zhantian issued an announcement, ordering the 99.9 million players inside the Land of Elements to leave.","Most of the players were affiliated with the official forces, so they followed the order without question.","In an instant, the Land of Elements was practically emptied.","As for those who refused to leave, once they found themselves alone, they were unable to withstand the terrifying environment of the Land of Elements.","Moreover, they did not dare offend either the official forces or the Thorn Guild. Naturally, they left as well.","As for anyone who stubbornly refused to comply, Long Zhantian had made himself clear.","The moment one was discovered, they would be killed immediately—and permanently barred from resurrection.","No one dared take that risk.","The remaining 100,000 players were filled with excitement. They were the chosen ones, the darlings of fate.","From now on, they would not only be able to slay gods; they might even become gods themselves.","Of the 100,000 players, 60 percent were members of the Thorn Guild, while the remaining 40 percent belonged to the official forces.","Regardless of which side they represented, there was no doubt that they were the 100,000 strongest players in the world.","The SSS-rank talent holders from other countries had long since fallen far behind them.","Soon afterward, everyone gathered together, with Feng Huimin taking command.","She had organized campaigns involving millions of people before. To Feng Huimin, these 100,000 players were nothing more than a single squad.","With Chu Fu leading the charge, the combat power of 100,000 people was no weaker than that of a million.","They rampaged through the Land of Elements, while also beginning to search for traces of the Divine Envoys.","Killing a Divine Envoy guaranteed at least one level gained, along with ten Divine Power Fragments.","This was something they absolutely had to do.","Meanwhile, overseas players were still reeling from the impact of the “God Rankings.” No one even paid attention to the latest version update.","[System Announcement: The Mechanical Descent version has ended. Game Version 7.0, “Zerg Invasion,” is now live.]","[Zerg creatures across the world are mutating, their strength increasing dramatically. Large numbers of Zerg have appeared in the wilderness and are expanding at an alarming rate. Players, find the Zerg Hives as soon as possible and destroy the conspiracy the Zerg are plotting!]","[Level 60 dungeon “Zerg Disaster,” Level 65 dungeon “Alien Zerg Warrior,” and Level 70 dungeon “Zerg Queen’s Nest” are now open.]","The Huaxia players who had left the Land of Elements threw themselves into the new dungeons.","In reality, only Huaxia’s players had reached Level 60 and were qualified to enter the new dungeons. The overseas players were still far from meeting the requirements.","“Plant Boss and the others are leveling up in the Land of Elements. They definitely won’t come back to compete with us for the first dungeon clears or the speedrun rankings. Brothers, let’s charge!”","“Level 60 Water Healer looking for a party.”","“Level 60 Lich King looking for a party.”","“Forming a group! Need AoE classes. Assassins not wanted—unless you’re Lu Xing.”","The leveling frenzy was in full swing.","The overseas players, however, found themselves in an entirely different situation.","“Holy crap! Why are bugs invading the cities? Those tiny bugs from before are already Level 11?”","“There’s a massive bug here—a Level 40 boss! Anyone want to team up and take it down?”","“Bug swarm incoming! Help!”","“I’ve stirred up a hornet’s nest! What do I do? They’re camping my corpse!”","“That’s nothing. I’m being attacked by a swarm of ants, and they’re carrying my corpse back to their nest! Offering a high reward for rescue!”","...","Inside the Land of Elements.","The 100,000-strong army monopolized all the resources, and their experience climbed at an astonishing speed.","Even so, once they reached Level 60 and above, gaining a single level still required three days.","Chu Fu knew that the higher one’s level, the slower the rate of advancement.","According to the original storyline, the players’ strength should not have been able to keep up with the speed at which the monsters descended upon the world.","But now, the situation had been reversed.","The players were leveling too quickly. Not only had they forced the monsters to descend ahead of schedule, they had even compelled them to launch their invasion prematurely.","They had no choice but to invade.","This was a rule the evil gods had to obey after invading the Primordial Gate.","Or perhaps it was the divine power contained within the Primordial Gate that was restraining them.","What a marvelous gate.","“There are only thirty days left until the game invades reality. We have to do our best to get all 100,000 players to Level 70 before then, so we can overcome the Zerg crisis in advance within the game.”","More importantly, once the monsters invaded reality, the time available to log in through the Primordial Gate would be reduced.","By then, there would be less and less time to level up.","While they still had the time, they had to level as hard as they could.","When Feng Huimin reached Level 60, her commander class gained the ability to include an unlimited number of players in a War Legion.","All 100,000 players were placed in the same legion.","Experience was divided equally, while all resources were handed over and distributed between the Thorn Guild and Longxiang Jiuzhou afterward.","And more often than not, only one person needed to make a move.","That person was Chu Fu.","The party crossed a land of molten lava.","Chu Fu immediately unleashed her Flood Disaster.","But that was not all. Her Flood Disaster was poisonous as well.","Dark clouds gathered in the sky, filled with corrosive liquid. The rain that fell from them turned black, pouring down like ink splashed across the heavens.","In moments, every elemental monster in the lava region was killed.","The most terrifying part was that the poison released by the skill could be offered up by the players in the party as sacrifices, allowing Chu Fu to absorb it in reverse.","The poisonous flood, fused with the lava, transformed into a new substance: toxic sludge.","Chu Fu absorbed it back into herself, further increasing her strength.","A self-sustaining cycle had formed, turning the skill into a perpetual-motion machine.","Even the players who offered themselves as sacrifices received attribute bonuses.","It was simply absurdly overpowered.","The group quickly cleared an entire region of the Land of Elements and continued toward the next area.","The next region was a vast expanse of shifting sand.","“I’ll handle this one! Leave it to me!”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao shouted.","She did not need believers to offer sacrifices. Transforming herself into a stone giant, she began greedily absorbing the sand in front of her and converting it into her own strength.","Gradually, the ground was stripped bare, revealing the rocky crust beneath. The earth spirits were all killed by Jiaojiao Bu Jiao alone.","The experience was divided among the entire legion, so it did not matter who dealt the killing blow. But when it came to obtaining the benefits of the elements, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao had made an enormous profit.","Next, the metal-element magnetic force was absorbed by Shen Chi.","The light element was absorbed by the Holy Healing Angel.","The wood element continued to be absorbed by Chu Fu.","The dark element was absorbed by the Bitter Melon King.","The water, lightning, ice, and wind elements were absorbed by the players under Giant Dragon Zhantian’s command.","Viewed from a higher-dimensional perspective, the entire planet had developed a patchy bald spot.","The Elemental God, observing its own Land of Elements, was practically gnashing its teeth in fury.","But it knew that this was precisely the time when it could not act on impulse.","These humans had already gained overwhelming momentum.","If it sent Divine Envoys to kill them now, they would only be counter-killed.","Thus, the Elemental God issued a divine decree.","“All members of the elemental races: if you see humans, flee immediately. Do not allow yourselves to be killed.”","It had only one strategy.","Drag it out.","Drag things out until the game invaded reality. Drag things out for thirty days.","It could not allow these humans to grow any stronger."]},{"number":281,"title":"Chapter 281: Game Invades Reality, If the Apocalypse Ends","paragraphs":["As the divine oracle descended, Chu Fu also noticed that the elemental spirits had begun to flee the moment they spotted her.","So the spirits ran, Chu Fu’s party chased them, and they spent all day grinding out their step count across the Elemental Lands.","There was no doubt that this method had drastically slowed the leveling speed of Chu Fu’s group of players.","And so, as time passed, the final deadline of six months drew closer and closer.","......","In the real world.","The tenth wave of monsters had fully awakened, and countless felines had mutated.","However, with the Thorn Printing Factory mass-producing contracts, players who owned cats contracted their own pets.","Some people even raised tigers—and contracted their tigers as well.","Every tiger in the zoos was contracted to its keeper.","As for tigers in the wild, those that could be subdued were tamed. Those that couldn’t had to be killed, however painful it was.","Of course, most mutated felines were far too numerous to kill.","At last, the day arrived when the time predicted by the Analysis Bureau drew near.","Even Chu Fu had no choice but to suspend her leveling plans and return to Thorn City.","After half a year of construction, Thorn City had become practically impregnable.","Not only that, but three enormous mechanical cities were even flying above it.","They were cities built by Shen Chi.","Everyone returned to the real world.","The upper echelons and shareholders of the Thorn Guild all gathered at Chu Fu’s estate.","Shen Chi suddenly asked, “Fufu, what will you do after we put an end to the apocalypse?”","Chu Fu froze, a hint of confusion in her eyes.","She didn’t know either.","Ever since arriving in this world, she had been far too busy.","All she had ever thought about was playing the game properly.","As for the kind of longing many transmigrators felt—the desire to return to their original world—she had never experienced it.","It seemed that this was where she truly belonged.","But what about the future?","After becoming a god, what would she do if she no longer had games to play?","Chu Fu suddenly smiled.","“I’ll be able to bring the attributes and strength from the game into the real world. My lifespan will definitely be very long.”","“There are so many things I’ve never done before. I can do them all and go see the world!”","“I want to travel, wear beautiful clothes, and eat delicious food.”","Shen Chi’s eyes darkened. At last, he murmured, “Have you never thought about falling in love?”","Chu Fu turned her head toward Shen Chi.","He stood beside her, his head slightly lowered as he looked at her. His eyes held a faint, scattered glimmer of expectation, carefully concealed beneath a layer of caution.","Chu Fu really hadn’t thought about it.","But if it were Brother Shen...","“Of course I have! Why wouldn’t I? If I’m going to date anyone, it’ll be someone like Fufu. Sorry, I’m not here to break you two up—I’m here to squeeze into the relationship. Don’t you dare start dating behind my back, got it?”","Xie Lin walked to Chu Fu’s other side, hugging his sword as he gazed up at the sky. Yet beneath his healthy complexion, the tips of his ears and the back of his neck had turned slightly red.","Chu Fu let out a giggle, and the romantic atmosphere vanished in an instant.","As expected of Brother Xie Lin—the undisputed champion of ruining the mood.","But Xie Lin, holding his sword, really was incredibly handsome.","Perhaps feeling a little embarrassed to keep staring at Xie Lin, Chu Fu raised her head and looked at the sky.","“As for dating, we can talk about it later! We haven’t reached Level 100 yet, we still don’t know the answer hidden within the Primordial Gate, and we haven’t driven away the evil gods.”","“They’re here!”","Everyone immediately grew solemn.","All ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌​‍the humans who had become false gods instinctively looked toward the sky.","At that moment, they were all under the enhancement of divine power.","Chu Fu’s perception spread across the entire world.","She suddenly realized that the whole world was trembling.","The planet itself seemed to be having something injected into it.","From her divine perspective, Chu Fu “saw” it.","A continent was being forcibly injected into this world.","It was a continent Chu Fu had never seen before, yet it contained countless wild beasts.","The entire landmass seemed to exist within the void—or perhaps in another dimension.","As the continent forced its way in, the entire planet began to expand.","In an instant, Chu Fu understood.","This was the Wolf God’s continent.","The fusion of the Wolf God’s continent with Blue Star was causing Blue Star to expand.","At the same time, silver light appeared around Thorn City.","That silver light was made up of spatial elements.","Only under the protection of this light was Thorn City spared from being torn apart.","This was the safe zone—and one of the rules of the Primordial Gate.","No monsters spawned inside the safe zone. Only the wilderness was dangerous.","The distance between Thorn City and the nearest district, Fengdu District, was pulled apart to ten times its original length.","The signal towers and power stations in the wilderness were all destroyed.","Those residential buildings and skyscrapers outside the safe zone instantly became ruins as the land split apart beneath them.","Fortunately, China had begun preparing for a full evacuation several months ago.","Because of Thorn City’s high costs, it was actually far less crowded than the game. Even so, it was still home to a population of three million—the employees of Thorn Studio and their families.","They had moved there from every corner of the country, entire households relocating together.","Now, everyone stared at the scene in shock.","Among them, no one felt the impact more deeply than Chu Feng.","Chu Feng had once been a regressor and had witnessed the moment when the game invaded reality.","Only now, viewing everything from a “god’s perspective,” did he discover the truth.","It was the fusion of the Wolf God’s continent with the planet that had caused the land to expand.","Back then, he had desperately rushed to the hospital, hoping to find Chu Fu, who was in a vegetative state.","At the time, his life had been extremely difficult. After selling his house, he could only live in the suburbs, and Chu Fu’s hospital had also been a convalescent facility in a suburban area.","Neither of them had been inside a safe zone.","Chu Feng had run through the wilderness, but vehicles were completely useless. There were no roads, and monsters were everywhere.","Chu Feng had been utterly desperate.","He had searched through the surrounding ruins again and again, fighting wild beasts along the way, but in the end, he still hadn’t found Chu Fu.","The apocalypse had arrived. How could a person in a vegetative state possibly survive?","Fortunately, he had been given a second chance.","In this life, his sister had become the One True God.","She could slay the werewolves.","At that moment, the system’s voice rang out across the real world.","[System Announcement: Congratulations to all human players. You have automatically obtained the Primordial System. Players who have not entered the game may bind to it as well.]","[System Announcement: Game Version 1.0—Beast Tide Invasion—is now active. The attributes of all Level 10 players will be synchronized. Players below Level 10, as well as those who have not entered the game, may explore and grow stronger on their own.]","[System Announcement: The first beast tide is about to arrive. Death in the real world will be true death, and you will be unable to create another character. Human players, proceed with caution.]","[System Announcement: ...... ]","Wave after wave of announcements struck everyone’s hearts.","The game had truly descended into reality!","Real-world currencies collapsed in an instant, while the old social hierarchy had already been reshuffled within the Primordial Gate.","The Thorn Guild had become the greatest dark horse.","At the same time—","China’s Analysis Bureau.","“The magic network has been activated and connected to the atmosphere! All network signals have been restored.”","“The teleportation arrays are active. All 1,008 cities in China are now connected.”","“The nuclear warheads are in position. The locations of the beast tide have been locked. We can attack at any time!”","“Prepare to launch!”"]},{"number":282,"title":"Chapter 282: Settling Old Grudges Today","paragraphs":["At that moment, countless white trails streaked across the azure sky.","Tens of thousands of missiles erupted into the air.","There would be no need to use them in the future anyway. It was better to use their limited resources now and clear away the obstacles that might stand in their way later.","“Boom!”","“Boom!”","“Boom!”","Violent tremors rang out.","Just then, Xie Lin’s phone began to ring. He glanced at it, and his expression immediately changed as though he had seen something amusing.","A cold smile tugged at the corner of his lips. His eyes held both mockery and intense killing intent.","“You stay here. I’m going out to take care of something.”","Chu Fu looked at Xie Lin in confusion.","“What is it?”","“Something that’ll put my mind at ease.”","Xie Lin summoned his flying sword, stepped onto it, and shot into the sky.","In the blink of an eye, he vanished.","Chu Fu’s spiritual power was now incredibly formidable, and Xie Lin’s killing intent was far too obvious to escape her notice.","At a time like this, whatever could make Xie Lin leave with such murderous intent, Chu Fu could more or less guess what it was.","Still, she did not stop him.","That was fine, too.","Everyone needed to vent the anger in their hearts.","...","Within Shepherd Village, the area represented by Novice Village 087.","A safe zone had already been established there, consisting entirely of densely packed high-rise residences.","At a time like this, no one cared about blocking sunlight or maintaining vegetation density.","As long as there was somewhere to live, that was enough.","Everyone who had not entered the game, as well as players with F- and E-rank talents, was gathered there.","Inside one of the dormitory rooms were a disheveled young man, a seemingly refined woman whose face was filled with hostility, a middle-aged woman, and four elderly people. They were crammed into the room together.","All eight beds were occupied.","They were Wang Silu’s family: Wang Rongxun, Wang Silu’s parents, and her grandparents on both sides.","All of them had extremely poor gaming talents—only F-rank.","But after Wang Rongxun went bankrupt, the gaming system devastated the Wang family’s real-world businesses.","In a mere six months, they had fallen so far that everyone despised them.","After logging into the game a few times, Wang Silu had been killed every time. In a fit of anger, she stopped logging in altogether.","Wang Rongxun was even more afraid to go online, terrified that his creditors would chase him down and kill him.","After Wang Rongxun’s parents and grandparents were exposed, the people he owed money to hounded them from place to place. They had no time to play the game—and they did not know how to play it anyway.","Now, they could only remain in the safe zone and wait for relief supplies.","Unfortunately, the supplies consisted only of compressed biscuits and bottled water, so the entire family had to scrimp and save.","Wang Silu simply could not tolerate such a life.","Her phone chimed.","“Who’s messaging you at a time like this?” Wang Rongxun asked irritably.","A smug smile appeared on Wang Silu’s lips.","“One of my simps. He’s just a poor loser who used to have a crush on me. He’s level thirty now, and he says he can take me to live in the urban district of Linjiang City!”","The others immediately pricked up their ears.","Wang Silu’s father hurriedly said, “Sweetheart, don’t abandon the rest of us. If you’re going there, take the whole family with you. Your grandparents are getting old, and they still have to live in a dormitory without even a smart toilet.”","“That’s right, Luer. Men can’t be trusted,” Wang Silu’s mother added. “So what if he’s level thirty? He’s not level sixty. My daughter is so beautiful—she’s definitely worthy of one of those people who have reached godhood. Just keep him hanging on. Have him give us some equipment or food. Don’t be foolish enough to actually run off with him.”","More than anything, they were afraid that Wang Silu would really leave them behind.","The family was now a complete mess. They could not rely on Wang Rongxun, and Wang Silu showed signs of being able to rise above their circumstances. There was no way they would let her break free and leave on her own.","Wang Silu frowned and said impatiently, “I know, I know. Enough already. I’m going out to meet him. Don’t worry about it!”","She changed into one of the designer dresses she had once worn and walked out.","Wang Rongxun suddenly sat upright.","“We’re following her. I’m worried she’ll run off on her own.”","His parents exchanged a glance and nodded. The three of them left together.","Only the four elderly people remained in the apartment.","They soon began to fidget uneasily.","“Perhaps we should go out and take a look too? I’m afraid they’ll abandon us. We’re old and useless now. It’s not like before, when we could clean up after Silu and still had the ability to do something!”","Each of the four elderly people had their own thoughts. In the end, they quietly followed after the others.","The safe zone was only one thousand by one thousand meters. Before long, Wang Silu reached its edge.","At the entrance to the village, people came and went. On closer inspection, every one of them was killing rabbits.","They were level-one monsters: red-eyed rabbits.","Rabbit meat could be eaten, while their fur could be made into winter clothing.","The safe zone had even issued missions.","Players were to collect rabbit meat, which would then be processed into food and distributed as relief supplies.","In short, the people inside the safe zone needed to find work all over again. For low-level players, killing rabbits at least meant they would not starve to death.","Wang Silu looked at those people with disdain. These miserable wretches had failed to seize their opportunities even after the game descended upon the world. All they could do was scrape by.","They had never enjoyed a luxurious life in all their years.","Wang Silu could never accept living like this.","She had been the center of attention ever since she was young, doing whatever she pleased, with her parents always cleaning up her messes.","She had no intention of spending the rest of her life living in a dormitory.","Besides, the world had already ended. Surely no one would hold her past mistakes against her anymore. At worst, she could change her name and start over.","With that thought in mind, she walked out of the village.","Once outside, her phone signal became noticeably weaker.","“Where are you?” Wang Silu sent a message.","Just then, a man dressed in level-thirty goblin equipment stepped out. His skin was fair and lustrous, and he was rather handsome.","Wang Silu’s eyes lit up at once.","Not bad. He’s pretty good-looking!","But in the next moment, the man smiled as well.","Wang Silu assumed that he was pleased to see her.","Then, in the very next instant, a flash of white light streaked past her eyes.","It looked like sword light!","A moment later, everything went black.","Her head had been cleanly severed from her body.","With a cold smile, Xie Lin stepped forward and stored Wang Silu’s corpse in his spatial inventory.","Just then, Wang Rongxun arrived in a hurry with his parents.","“They came here, but where did they go? Could she really have run off to live the good life with someone else?”","“I was targeted by Plantman and the others because of Wang Silu in the first place. She really is an ungrateful wretch, running off to enjoy herself!”","As they spoke, they spotted Xie Lin.","“Brother, did you just see a girl wearing revealing clothes?”","“I did.”","Wang Rongxun’s eyes lit up.","“Brother, you’re a player, right? Did you happen to see the other person’s ID?”","Since ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌​‍the System had also synchronized with the real world, the IDs of many players now appeared above their heads.","As long as they had an ID, they could contact one another.","There was no way they would let anyone take their daughter away for free.","A smile spread across Xie Lin’s lips.","“I’ll take you to see her.”","Then he swung his sword again.","Three heads fell to the ground.","“Ah!”","A cry of shock came from the distance.","The four elderly people stood there, their eyes wide with terror.","Xie Lin narrowed his eyes.","“If you’re a family, you should stay together to the very end!”"]},{"number":283,"title":"Chapter 283: Six Continents Merge, Evil God Descends","paragraphs":["Xie Lin knew that the Shun Muyuan Group was Wang Rongxun's grandfather's company. He had been the one who protected his granddaughter back then.","Let’s travel together!","Soon, another sword strike followed.","The entire family lay neatly together inside Xie Lin’s spatial backpack.","Xie Lin mounted his flying sword and hurried toward Thorn City. On the way, he passed the spawn point of a Level 10 tiger and threw the bodies down.","The fierce tigers below immediately rushed forward, tore the bodies apart, and swallowed them whole.","When someone died in the real world, they would not enter a soul state and wait twenty-four hours to be revived.","Their only hope was to get lucky and have a priest pass by at just the right moment and happen to see the body.","Otherwise, how could the dead possibly speak?","What was more, their skulls had been shattered. Once they died, they were truly dead.","...","Meanwhile.","Inside Thorn City.","No one noticed that another person had quietly vanished.","It was Xu Can.","She had appeared in a beginner village overseas.","There were no shelters or skyscrapers here, so the place was extremely crowded. Everyone was panicking as they stared at the mutated beasts that had suddenly appeared in the wilderness.","Fortunately, there were still plenty of Level 10 players here who could clear out the beast tide.","One person was currently hiding in fear inside an underground shelter.","“They shouldn’t come after me, right? I deleted my account and started over. She shouldn’t be able to track me down.”","That was what Guan Youlong thought.","What he didn’t know was that, although Xu Can truly had no way to deal with him in the game—after all, he had actually deleted his account and started over—he had also gone and gotten plastic surgery so that no one would recognize him.","As the steward of a medical company, a starving camel was still bigger than a horse. This sort of thing was still easy for him to arrange.","However, after starting over, even though he had worked hard to level up, he had only reached Level 20.","The first synchronization was at Level 10. Even a Level 20 player could only synchronize their Level 10 abilities in the real world.","Only ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​​‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‍after reaching Level 30 could Guan Youlong spend coins to extract more attributes.","Clearly, he had failed to do so.","Not only that, Guan Youlong had also underestimated the power of a divine class.","Once Xu Can’s talent manifested in the real world, what it tracked was naturally the target’s true body.","A shadow suddenly appeared right in front of Guan Youlong’s eyes.","“Ah!”","Guan Youlong let out a terrified scream and hurriedly backed away.","Strangely, his shadow did not retreat with him. Instead, it remained where it was. Gradually, a figure emerged from it.","It was Xu Can.","When Guan Youlong saw her, the last sliver of hope in his heart shattered.","“Oh, so you got plastic surgery. I was wondering why all those huge bounties never led anyone to you!”","Xu Can smiled faintly.","Guan Youlong scrambled to his knees and began begging for mercy.","“Sis, Sis, I was wrong! I really was wrong! Please, I’m begging you, can you let me go?","“I can work like a beast for you. I can even be your dog. Look at me—do I look handsome now?","“I’ll be your dog, okay? Woof! Woof woof woof!”","Guan Youlong began barking.","His words made Xu Can pause.","She carefully examined his face, then suddenly flew into a rage.","“You really think I’m some lovesick idiot?”","Guan Youlong had actually altered his appearance to look like the scumbag who had deceived her in the past.","His intentions were obvious.","Damn him.","Xu Can abruptly swung her dagger. Black-and-red flames instantly cleaved him in two.","The next moment, the flames spread across his body and began to burn.","In the blink of an eye, he was reduced to ashes.","He vanished completely.","Xu Can then took out a City Return Scroll and used it to return to the city.","No one else knew that she had left.","Only Shen Chi, whose senses were exceptionally sharp, caught a faint trace of blood in the air and turned to look at her.","“Aunt?”","He only called out once.","Xu Can nodded.","The two of them understood each other without words and knew what had happened.","At the same time.","Chu Fu, who had been observing the planes, suddenly felt her heart tighten.","She had been “watching” the entire world.","After the Wolf God Continent fused with Earth, the next region to merge was the Goblin Forest.","At that moment, many forests and all kinds of monsters appeared across the expanded planet.","The only thing missing was goblins.","That was because the goblins had already been slaughtered to the last.","Next came the Land of the Dead.","Vast regions filled with the aura of death appeared, completely devoid of life. At the same time, there were no undead creatures.","That was because the undead had also been killed.","After that came the Land of the Titans, the Elemental Realm, and the Mechanical Star.","All six versions had actually fused into Blue Star, causing it to expand even further—perhaps making it even larger than it had been in the original storyline.","An epiphany rose in Chu Fu’s heart.","Because they had successfully counterattacked, the continents from all six versions had fused into the planet.","However, due to the system’s restrictions, although these regions had merged, a layer of barrier still separated them.","Chu Feng had encountered this kind of barrier in his first life as well.","It was called a forbidden zone.","So that was what these forbidden zones truly were. Their time simply had not yet come.","Soon, the seventh plane fused with the world.","The Insectoid Plane!","At that moment, countless insects merged into the world.","One enormous hive after another emerged.","Countless insectoids waited within the forbidden zones. Once the time came, they would devour the entire world.","Next came the Dragon Continent.","Then the Ocean Planet.","The final plane did not merge.","Instead, it was a future map that even Chu Feng had never visited.","That plane was actually a stretch of starry space.","This caused the planet’s atmosphere to expand as well, and humanity’s perception of the universe grew broader.","Chu Fu even learned the name of that plane.","The Starry Sky Behemoth race.","The fusion of the planes was complete.","The planet’s area expanded a hundredfold.","Just as Chu Fu thought that everything was over, a crack suddenly appeared directly above the Thorn Guild.","The crack looked extremely similar to the rift leading to an Origin-level dungeon.","The next moment, a terrifying skeleton radiating an aura of death revealed a hollow, pitch-black eye socket.","The skeleton was simply too frightening!","Its eye socket alone occupied a crack nearly a kilometer wide. One could only imagine how enormous this being was.","The skeleton’s two hands gripped the edges of the crack and pulled with tremendous force.","The spatial rift was torn wide open.","Its enormous head forced its way through.","The Undead Reaper!","As it descended, endless black energy poured out of the rift. The terrifying aura instantly infected everyone.","“What do we do? Is that a god? A god is here? I don’t want to die! I’m going to die! I’m going to die!”","The players screamed in despair.","Some of them even raised their weapons and prepared to turn them on themselves.","This was the oppressive might of an evil god.","“Holy Domain!”","The Holy Healing Angel suddenly shouted. A shield of holy light erupted from her body, cleansing everyone. It even enveloped the entire city and drove away the dark elements.","The Undead Reaper climbed out. However, as more of its body entered the planet, its enormous form suddenly shrank considerably.","Clearly, the system’s power was temporarily restraining it.","But before everyone could catch their breath, another multicolored figure appeared within the rift."]}]);
